	(12, '0009', 'Blastoise', 530, 79, 83, 100, 85, 105, 78, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/blastoise', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/9.png', 'The jets of water it spouts from the rocket cannons on its shell can punch through thick steel.', '거북왕', '무거운 몸으로 상대를 덮쳐서 기절시킨다. 위기에 처하면 등껍질에 숨는다.', 'Water', NULL, '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/12.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/9.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/12.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/12.png', '껍질포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, 67, NULL, 44),
