	(46, '0034', 'Nidoking', 505, 81, 102, 77, 85, 75, 85, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/nidoking', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/34.png', 'One swing of its mighty tail can snap a telephone pole as if it were a matchstick.', '니드킹', '돌처럼 딱딱한 피부와 길게 뻗은 뿔이 특징이다. 뿔에는 독이 있으니 주의해야 한다.', 'Poison', 'Ground', '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/46.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/34.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/46.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/46.png', '드릴포켓몬', '190', 0, NULL, 38, 79, 125),
	(47, '0035', 'Clefairy', 323, 70, 45, 48, 60, 65, 35, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/clefairy', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/35.png', 'It can be found in quiet mountain areas on a full moon’s night. Its dancing and its tiny, faintly glowing wings confer upon it a lovely fairylike quality.', '삐삐', '보름달 밤에 삐삐가 모여 춤을 추는 모습을 보면 행복해진다고 전해진다.', 'Fairy', NULL, '2', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/47.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/35.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/47.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/47.png', '요정포켓몬', '75', 0, NULL, 56, 98, 132),
	(48, '0036', 'Clefable', 483, 95, 70, 73, 95, 90, 60, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/clefable', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/36.png', 'Legend says that on clear, quiet nights, it listens for the voices of its kin living on the moon. I, too, often think of my homeland, so far away.', '픽시', '1km 전방에 떨어진 바늘 소리도 분간할 수 있는 우수한 귀를 가지고 있다. 조용한 산속에 살고 있다.', 'Fairy', NULL, '2', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/48.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/36.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/48.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/48.png', '요정포켓몬', '190', 0, NULL, 56, 98, 109),
	(49, '0037', 'Vulpix', 299, 38, 41, 40, 50, 65, 65, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/vulpix', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/37.png', 'In its belly burns a fire, which Vulpix spits out in the form of fireballs. When young, this Pokémon has but one white tail. As the Pokémon matures, this single tail splits into six.', '식스테일', '태어났을 때는 꼬리가 새하얗고 하나밖에 없다. 성장하면 끝이 갈라지며 꼬리 수가 늘어난다.', 'Fire', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/49.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/37.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/49.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/49.png', '여우포켓몬', '75', 0, NULL, 18, NULL, 70),
	(50, '0037', 'Vulpix (Alolan Vulpix)', 299, 38, 41, 40, 50, 65, 65, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/vulpix', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/37.png', 'In its belly burns a fire, which Vulpix spits out in the form of fireballs. When young, this Pokémon has but one white tail. As the Pokémon matures, this single tail splits into six.', '알로라 식스테일', '태어났을 때는 꼬리가 새하얗고 하나밖에 없다. 성장하면 끝이 갈라지며 꼬리 수가 늘어난다.', 'Fire', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/50.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/37.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/50.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/50.png', '여우포켓몬', '255', 0, NULL, 18, NULL, 70),
	(51, '0038', 'Ninetales', 505, 73, 76, 75, 81, 100, 100, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/ninetales', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/38.png', 'The coat of gleaming golden fur is quite magnificent. This species is said to store sacred power in its nine long tails and to live for a millennium.', '나인테일', '황금빛으로 빛나는 털과 9개의 긴 꼬리를 지녔다. 1000년을 산다고 한다.', 'Fire', NULL, '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/51.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/38.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/51.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/51.png', '여우포켓몬', '50', 0, NULL, 18, NULL, 70),
	(52, '0038', 'Ninetales (Alolan Ninetales)', 505, 73, 67, 75, 81, 100, 109, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/ninetales', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/38.png', 'The coat of gleaming golden fur is quite magnificent. This species is said to store sacred power in its nine long tails and to live for a millennium.', '알로라 나인테일', '황금빛으로 빛나는 털과 9개의 긴 꼬리를 지녔다. 1000년을 산다고 한다.', 'Ice', 'Fairy', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/52.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/38.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/52.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/52.png', '여우포켓몬', '255', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(53, '0039', 'Jigglypuff', 270, 115, 45, 20, 45, 25, 20, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/jigglypuff', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/39.png', 'If it inflates to sing a lullaby, it can perform longer and cause sure drowsiness in its audience.', '푸린', '동그랗고 커다란 눈동자로 유인하고 기분 좋은 노래를 불러 상대방을 잠들게 한다.', 'Normal', 'Fairy', '2', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/53.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/39.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/53.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/53.png', '풍선포켓몬', '90', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(54, '0040', 'Wigglytuff', 435, 140, 70, 45, 85, 50, 45, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/wigglytuff', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/40.png', 'The rich, fluffy fur that covers its body feels so good that anyone who feels it can’t stop touching it.', '푸크린', '2마리가 바싹 붙어 있으면 서로의 털이 너무 기분 좋아서 떨어지지 않게 되어버린다.', 'Normal', 'Fairy', '2', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/54.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/40.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/54.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/54.png', '풍선포켓몬', '190', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(55, '0041', 'Zubat', 245, 40, 45, 35, 30, 40, 55, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/zubat', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/41.png', 'Makes its home in gloomy caves. Atrophied eyes have left this Pokémon blind, so it scans its surroundings via sound waves that it emits from its mouth as it flies.', '주뱃', '입에서 내는 초음파로 두 눈이 없어도 주위의 장애물을 탐색할 수 있다.', 'Poison', 'Flying', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/55.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/41.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/55.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/55.png', '박쥐포켓몬', '75', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(56, '0042', 'Golbat', 455, 75, 80, 70, 65, 75, 90, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/golbat', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/42.png', 'It sinks its sharp fangs into other creatures and slurps up their blood. A closer look at the fangs reveals that they are hollow and akin to straws.', '골뱃', '물리면 끝이다. 죽을 정도로 피를 빨아들이기 때문에 무거워져서 날 수 없게 될 때도 있다.', 'Poison', 'Flying', '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/56.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/42.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/56.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/56.png', '박쥐포켓몬', '190', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(57, '0043', 'Oddish', 320, 45, 50, 55, 75, 65, 30, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/oddish', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/43.png', 'It often plants its root feet in the ground during the day and sows seeds as it walks about at night.', '뚜벅쵸', '낮에는 태양을 피하려고 차가운 땅속에 들어가 있다. 달빛을 쬐어 성장한다.', 'Grass', 'Poison', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/57.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/43.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/57.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/57.png', '잡초포켓몬', '75', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(58, '0044', 'Gloom', 395, 60, 65, 70, 85, 75, 40, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/gloom', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/44.png', 'The nectar it drools from its mouth smells so atrocious that it can make noses curl from more than a mile away.', '냄새꼬', '강렬한 악취가 난다! 그럼에도 불구하고 1000명에 한 명 정도 이 냄새를 즐겨 맡는 사람이 있다.', 'Grass', 'Poison', '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/58.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/44.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/58.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/58.png', '잡초포켓몬', '190', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(59, '0045', 'Vileplume', 490, 75, 80, 85, 110, 90, 50, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/vileplume', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/45.png', 'Its petals are the largest in the world. As it walks, it scatters extremely allergenic pollen.', '라플레시아', '꽃잎이 클수록 많은 꽃가루를 만들어 내지만 머리가 무거워서 지쳐버린다고 한다.', 'Grass', 'Poison', '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/59.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/45.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/59.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/59.png', '꽃포켓몬', '75', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(60, '0046', 'Paras', 285, 35, 70, 55, 45, 55, 25, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/paras', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/46.png', 'Sometimes seen at the foot of trees in humid forests. The mushrooms on its back—called tochukaso—are not present on infant specimens and instead emerge as Paras matures.', '파라스', '벌레의 등에 돋아나 있는 것은 동충하초라는 버섯이다. 성장하면 버섯도 커진다.', 'Bug', 'Grass', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/60.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/46.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/60.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/60.png', '버섯포켓몬', '255', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(61, '0047', 'Parasect', 405, 60, 95, 80, 60, 80, 30, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/parasect', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/47.png', 'Mushroom-lacking specimens of this Pokémon lie unmoving in the forest, lending credence to the hypothesis that the large mushroom is in control of Parasect’s actions.', '파라섹트', '몸보다 큰 버섯이 파라섹트를 조종하고 있다. 독 포자를 여기저기 뿌린다.', 'Bug', 'Grass', '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/61.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/47.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/61.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/61.png', '버섯포켓몬', '120', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(62, '0048', 'Venonat', 305, 60, 55, 50, 40, 55, 45, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/venonat', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/48.png', 'Its eyes act as radar, enabling it to be active in darkness. The eyes can also shoot powerful beams.', '콘팡', '작은 눈이 많이 모여 큰 눈을 이루고 있다. 밤이 되면 불빛을 향해 모여든다.', 'Bug', 'Poison', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/62.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/48.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/62.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/62.png', '곤충포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(63, '0049', 'Venomoth', 450, 70, 65, 60, 90, 75, 90, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/venomoth', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/49.png', 'When it attacks, it flaps its large wings violently to scatter its poisonous powder all around.', '도나리', '흩뿌려진 날개 가루에 닿으면 몸의 감각이 이상해져서 똑바로 서 있을 수 없게 된다.', 'Bug', 'Poison', '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/63.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/49.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/63.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/63.png', '독나방포켓몬', '200', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(64, '0050', 'Diglett', 265, 10, 55, 25, 35, 45, 95, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/diglett', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/50.png', 'Its skin is very thin. If it is exposed to light, its blood heats up, causing it to grow weak.', '디그다', '피부가 매우 얇아서 빛을 쪼이게 되면 혈액이 데워져 약해진다.', 'Ground', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/64.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/50.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/64.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/64.png', '두더지포켓몬', '100', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(65, '0050', 'Diglett (Alolan Diglett)', 265, 10, 55, 30, 35, 45, 90, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/diglett', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/50.png', 'Its skin is very thin. If it is exposed to light, its blood heats up, causing it to grow weak.', '알로라 디그다', '피부가 매우 얇아서 빛을 쪼이게 되면 혈액이 데워져 약해진다.', 'Ground', 'Steel', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/65.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/50.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/65.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/65.png', '두더지포켓몬', '50', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(66, '0051', 'Dugtrio', 425, 35, 100, 50, 50, 70, 120, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/dugtrio', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/51.png', 'In battle, it digs through the ground and strikes the unsuspecting foe from an unexpected direction.', '닥트리오', '땅속을 파고들어 가 상대가 방심하고 있을 때 다른 곳에서 공격한다.', 'Ground', NULL, '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/66.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/51.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/66.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/66.png', '두더지포켓몬', '180', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
