	(71, '0053', 'Persian', 440, 65, 70, 60, 65, 65, 115, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/persian', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/53.png', 'It has a vicious temperament. Beware if it raises its tail straight up. This is a signal that it is about to pounce and bite.', '페르시온', '털의 결이 아름다워 애완용으로 기르려는 사람이 많지만, 곧잘 할퀴려 들기 때문에 쉽지 않다.', 'Normal', NULL, '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/71.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/53.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/71.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/71.png', '샴고양이포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(72, '0053', 'Persian (Alolan Persian)', 440, 65, 60, 60, 75, 65, 115, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/persian', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/53.png', 'It has a vicious temperament. Beware if it raises its tail straight up. This is a signal that it is about to pounce and bite.', '알로라 페르시온', '털의 결이 아름다워 애완용으로 기르려는 사람이 많지만, 곧잘 할퀴려 들기 때문에 쉽지 않다.', 'Dark', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/72.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/53.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/72.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/72.png', '샴고양이포켓몬', '190', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(73, '0054', 'Psyduck', 320, 50, 52, 48, 65, 50, 55, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/psyduck', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/54.png', 'If its chronic headache peaks, it may exhibit odd powers. It seems unable to recall such an episode.', '고라파덕', '항상 두통에 시달리고 있다. 이 두통이 심해지면 이상한 힘을 쓰기 시작한다.', 'Water', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/73.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/54.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/73.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/73.png', '오리포켓몬', '60', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(74, '0055', 'Golduck', 500, 80, 82, 78, 95, 80, 85, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/golduck', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/55.png', 'It swims gracefully along on the quiet, slow-moving rivers and lakes of which it is so fond.', '골덕', '해 질 무렵 강가에 모습을 나타낸다. 이마가 이상하게 빛날 때 신통력을 발휘한다고 전해진다.', 'Water', NULL, '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/74.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/55.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/74.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/74.png', '오리포켓몬', '255', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(75, '0056', 'Mankey', 305, 40, 80, 35, 35, 45, 70, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/mankey', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/56.png', 'It is extremely quick to anger. It could be docile one moment, then thrashing away the next instant.', '망키', '이유 없이 화내고 날뛰기 시작하면 동료도 구별하지 못하기 때문에 가까이 가는 것은 매우 위험하다.', 'Fighting', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/75.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/56.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/75.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/75.png', '돈숭이포켓몬', '120', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(76, '0057', 'Primeape', 455, 65, 105, 60, 60, 70, 95, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/primeape', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/57.png', 'Some researchers theorize that Primeape remains angry even when inside a Poké Ball.', '성원숭', '주위에 아무도 없을 때만은 화를 내지 않고 있다. 그러나 그 모습을 보기가 어렵다.', 'Fighting', NULL, '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/76.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/57.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/76.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/76.png', '돈숭이포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(77, '0058', 'Growlithe', 350, 55, 70, 45, 70, 50, 60, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/growlithe', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/58.png', 'It’s very friendly and faithful to people. It will try to repel enemies by barking and biting.', '가디', '사람을 잘 따르는 충실한 성격이다. 적에게는 짖거나 물며 쫓아내려고 한다.', 'Fire', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/77.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/58.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/77.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/77.png', '강아지포켓몬', '190', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
