	(81, '0060', 'Poliwag', 300, 40, 50, 40, 40, 40, 90, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/poliwag', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/60.png', 'Its skin is so thin, its internal organs are visible. It has trouble walking on its newly grown feet.', '발챙이', '매끄럽고 검은 피부는 얇고 축축하다. 내장 일부가 비쳐서 소용돌이 모양으로 보인다.', 'Water', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/81.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/60.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/81.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/81.png', '올챙이포켓몬', '190', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(82, '0061', 'Poliwhirl', 385, 65, 65, 65, 50, 50, 90, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/poliwhirl', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/61.png', 'The spiral pattern on its belly subtly undulates. Staring at it gradually causes drowsiness.', '슈륙챙이', '육지에서도 수중에서도 살 수 있다. 지상에서는 항상 땀을 흘려서 피부를 미끌미끌하게 하고 있다.', 'Water', NULL, '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/82.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/61.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/82.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/82.png', '올챙이포켓몬', '60', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(83, '0062', 'Poliwrath', 510, 90, 95, 95, 70, 90, 70, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/poliwrath', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/62.png', 'With its extremely tough muscles, it could keep swimming in the Pacific Ocean without resting.', '강챙이', '강인한 근육을 가지고 있다. 태평양을 쉬지 않고 계속 헤엄칠 수 있다.', 'Water', 'Fighting', '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/83.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/62.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/83.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/83.png', '올챙이포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(84, '0063', 'Abra', 310, 25, 20, 15, 105, 55, 90, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/abra', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/63.png', 'Spends 18 hours of the day sleeping. Even while asleep, Abra can control its psychic powers—should danger approach, the Pokémon will simply teleport away.', '캐이시', '하루에 18시간은 자고 있다. 자는 동안에도 다양한 초능력을 사용한다.', 'Psychic', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/84.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/63.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/84.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/84.png', '초능력포켓몬', '190', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(85, '0064', 'Kadabra', 400, 40, 35, 30, 120, 70, 105, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/kadabra', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/64.png', 'There are rumors that a child with mystical powers became a Kadabra; however, this remains unverified. I suspect that the spoon Kadabra holds enhances its brain waves.', '윤겔라', '초능력을 발휘하면 강한 알파파를 내어 정밀 기계를 고장 내 버린다.', 'Psychic', NULL, '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/85.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/64.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/85.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/85.png', '초능력포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(86, '0065', 'Alakazam', 500, 55, 50, 45, 135, 95, 120, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/alakazam', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/65.png', 'The longer Alakazam lives, the larger and heavier its head becomes. Our tests have shown that the strength of its psychic powers correlates positively to the weight of its head.', '후딘', '뇌세포는 항상 분열해서 죽을 때까지 늘어나기 때문에 모든 것을 기억해 놓을 수 있다.', 'Psychic', NULL, '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/86.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/65.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/86.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/86.png', '초능력포켓몬', '190', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(87, '0065', 'Alakazam (Mega Alakazam)', 600, 55, 50, 65, 175, 105, 150, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/alakazam', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/65.png', 'The longer Alakazam lives, the larger and heavier its head becomes. Our tests have shown that the strength of its psychic powers correlates positively to the weight of its head.', '메가후딘', '뇌세포는 항상 분열해서 죽을 때까지 늘어나기 때문에 모든 것을 기억해 놓을 수 있다.', 'Psychic', NULL, '9', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/87.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/65.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/87.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/87.png', '초능력포켓몬', '75', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(88, '0066', 'Machop', 305, 70, 80, 50, 35, 35, 35, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/machop', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/66.png', 'Though as small as a child, it has strength enough to easily throw a well-built adult. Striving to become ever stronger, Machop trains by carrying a Graveler on its shoulders.', '알통몬', '데구리를 수없이 들었다 놨다 하며 전신의 근육을 단련한다. 모든 격투기를 사용한다.', 'Fighting', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/88.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/66.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/88.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/88.png', '괴력포켓몬', '190', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(89, '0067', 'Machoke', 405, 80, 100, 70, 50, 60, 45, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/machoke', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/67.png', 'A sturdy creature boasting a robust physique and boundless stamina. Loves training above all else and voluntarily assists with tasks such as construction and clearing land.', '근육몬', '엄청나게 강한 육체를 지녔기 때문에 파워 세이브 벨트를 차서 힘을 제어하고 있다.', 'Fighting', NULL, '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/89.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/67.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/89.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/89.png', '괴력포켓몬', '75', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(90, '0068', 'Machamp', 505, 90, 130, 80, 65, 85, 55, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/machamp', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/68.png', 'In close combat, its four arms afford it offensive and defensive supremacy. In but a blink, this valiant Pokémon can overwhelm its foes with more than 1,000 blows from its fists.', '괴력몬', '발달한 4개의 팔은 2초 동안 1000번의 펀치를 날릴 수 있다.', 'Fighting', NULL, '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/90.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/68.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/90.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/90.png', '괴력포켓몬', '190', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(91, '0069', 'Bellsprout', 300, 50, 75, 35, 70, 30, 40, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/bellsprout', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/69.png', 'It prefers hot and humid environments. It is quick at capturing prey with its vines.', '모다피', '홀쭉한 체격이지만 먹이를 잡을 때의 움직임은 눈에 보이지 않을 정도로 빠르다.', 'Grass', 'Poison', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/91.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/69.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/91.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/91.png', '꽃포켓몬', '60', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(92, '0070', 'Weepinbell', 390, 65, 90, 50, 85, 45, 55, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/weepinbell', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/70.png', 'This Pokémon has the appearance of a plant. It captures unwary prey by dousing them with a toxic powder.', '우츠동', '잎사귀 부분은 칼날이 되어 상대를 베어버린다. 입에서는 무엇이든 녹이는 액체를 뿜어낸다.', 'Grass', 'Poison', '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/92.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/70.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/92.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/92.png', '파리잡이포켓몬', '190', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(93, '0071', 'Victreebel', 490, 80, 105, 65, 100, 70, 70, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/victreebel', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/71.png', 'In its mouth, it pools a fragrant nectar-like fluid. The fluid is really an acid that dissolves anything.', '우츠보트', '정글의 안쪽에 우츠보트만 있는 지대가 있어서 한 번 가면 두 번 다시 돌아올 수 없다.', 'Grass', 'Poison', '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/93.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/71.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/93.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/93.png', '파리잡이포켓몬', '90', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(94, '0071', 'Victreebel (Mega Victreebel)', 590, 80, 125, 85, 135, 95, 70, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/victreebel', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/71.png', 'In its mouth, it pools a fragrant nectar-like fluid. The fluid is really an acid that dissolves anything.', '메가우츠보트', '정글의 안쪽에 우츠보트만 있는 지대가 있어서 한 번 가면 두 번 다시 돌아올 수 없다.', 'Grass', 'Poison', '9', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/94.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/71.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/94.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/94.png', '파리잡이포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(95, '0072', 'Tentacool', 335, 40, 40, 35, 50, 100, 70, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/tentacool', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/72.png', 'They fire beams from the glassy, magenta orbs that resemble eyes atop their heads, and they drift in shallow seas. During low tide, they can sometimes be found on beaches, desiccated.', '왕눈해', '몸 대부분이 수분이다. 수정 같은 눈에서 이상한 빔을 발사한다.', 'Water', 'Poison', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/95.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/72.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/95.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/95.png', '해파리포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(96, '0073', 'Tentacruel', 515, 80, 70, 65, 80, 120, 100, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/tentacruel', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/73.png', 'It has 80 tentacles, each with a venomous tip. These tentacles are also extendible, lengthening when Tentacruel attempts to catch prey. Use caution.', '독파리', '촉수는 평소에는 짧고 먹이를 찌를 때 길게 늘어나 휘감는다.', 'Water', 'Poison', '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/96.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/73.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/96.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/96.png', '해파리포켓몬', '190', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(97, '0074', 'Geodude', 300, 40, 80, 100, 30, 30, 20, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/geodude', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/74.png', 'Makes its home in mountainous regions, using its arms to climb along harsh mountain roads. Can be troublesome—carelessly kicking one will cause it to fly into a rage and chase after you.', '꼬마돌', '초원이나 산에 서식한다. 돌멩이와 닮은 탓에 알아채지 못하고 밟거나 발이 걸려 넘어지기도 한다.', 'Rock', 'Ground', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/97.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/74.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/97.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/97.png', '암석포켓몬', '75', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(98, '0074', 'Geodude (Alolan Geodude)', 300, 40, 80, 100, 30, 30, 20, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/geodude', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/74.png', 'Makes its home in mountainous regions, using its arms to climb along harsh mountain roads. Can be troublesome—carelessly kicking one will cause it to fly into a rage and chase after you.', '알로라 꼬마돌', '초원이나 산에 서식한다. 돌멩이와 닮은 탓에 알아채지 못하고 밟거나 발이 걸려 넘어지기도 한다.', 'Rock', 'Electric', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/98.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/74.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/98.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/98.png', '암석포켓몬', '225', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(99, '0075', 'Graveler', 390, 55, 95, 115, 45, 45, 35, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/graveler', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/75.png', 'Dwells in holes dug into sheer walls of stone. It enjoys rolling down slopes as though it were a boulder during a rockfall, so keep an eye upward while traversing mountain roads.', '데구리', '산에서 굴러 떨어질 때 몸의 여기저기가 부서져도 신경 쓰지 않는 호쾌한 성격이다.', 'Rock', 'Ground', '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/99.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/75.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/99.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/99.png', '암석포켓몬', '60', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(100, '0075', 'Graveler (Alolan Graveler)', 390, 55, 95, 115, 45, 45, 35, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/graveler', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/75.png', 'Dwells in holes dug into sheer walls of stone. It enjoys rolling down slopes as though it were a boulder during a rockfall, so keep an eye upward while traversing mountain roads.', '알로라 데구리', '산에서 굴러 떨어질 때 몸의 여기저기가 부서져도 신경 쓰지 않는 호쾌한 성격이다.', 'Rock', 'Electric', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/100.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/75.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/100.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/100.png', '암석포켓몬', '190', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(101, '0076', 'Golem', 495, 80, 120, 130, 55, 65, 45, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/golem', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/76.png', 'The rocklike shell is shed each year. The cast-off shell then crumbles, reverting to a mass of soil, which can be spread across fields to promote crop growth.', '딱구리', '산 정상에서 산기슭까지 이어지는 움푹 패인 홈은 딱구리가 굴러 다니는 길이므로 주의가 필요하다.', 'Rock', 'Ground', '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/101.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/76.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/101.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/101.png', '메가톤포켓몬', '60', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(102, '0076', 'Golem (Alolan Golem)', 495, 80, 120, 130, 55, 65, 45, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/golem', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/76.png', 'The rocklike shell is shed each year. The cast-off shell then crumbles, reverting to a mass of soil, which can be spread across fields to promote crop growth.', '알로라 딱구리', '산 정상에서 산기슭까지 이어지는 움푹 패인 홈은 딱구리가 굴러 다니는 길이므로 주의가 필요하다.', 'Rock', 'Electric', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/102.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/76.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/102.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/102.png', '메가톤포켓몬', '90', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(103, '0077', 'Ponyta', 410, 50, 85, 55, 65, 65, 90, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/ponyta', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/77.png', 'These Pokémon live in herds out in the grassland. Newborn foals lack their fiery manes, which will develop about an hour after birth.', '포니타', '막 태어나서는 겨우 일어설 수 있을 정도이지만 많이 달리면 하반신이 단련되어 달리는 속도가 빨라진다.', 'Fire', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/103.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/77.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/103.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/103.png', '불의말포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(104, '0077', 'Ponyta (Galarian Ponyta)', 410, 50, 85, 55, 65, 65, 90, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/ponyta', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/77.png', 'These Pokémon live in herds out in the grassland. Newborn foals lack their fiery manes, which will develop about an hour after birth.', '가라르 포니타', '막 태어나서는 겨우 일어설 수 있을 정도이지만 많이 달리면 하반신이 단련되어 달리는 속도가 빨라진다.', 'Psychic', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/104.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/77.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/104.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/104.png', '불의말포켓몬', '190', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(105, '0078', 'Rapidash', 500, 65, 100, 70, 80, 80, 105, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/rapidash', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/78.png', 'Fiery mane aglow, Rapidash darts like an arrow across the land. This prodigiously swift creature can traverse the vast region of Hisui in a day and a half.', '날쌩마', '빠르게 움직이는 물체를 보면 경주를 하고 싶어져서 맹렬한 스피드로 쫓아가기 시작한다.', 'Fire', NULL, '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/105.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/78.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/105.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/105.png', '불의말포켓몬', '75', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(106, '0078', 'Rapidash (Galarian Rapidash)', 500, 65, 100, 70, 80, 80, 105, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/rapidash', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/78.png', 'Fiery mane aglow, Rapidash darts like an arrow across the land. This prodigiously swift creature can traverse the vast region of Hisui in a day and a half.', '가라르 날쌩마', '빠르게 움직이는 물체를 보면 경주를 하고 싶어져서 맹렬한 스피드로 쫓아가기 시작한다.', 'Psychic', 'Fairy', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/106.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/78.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/106.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/106.png', '불의말포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(107, '0079', 'Slowpoke', 315, 90, 65, 65, 40, 40, 15, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/slowpoke', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/79.png', 'It is always vacantly lost in thought, but no one knows what it is thinking about. It is good at fishing with its tail.', '야돈', '항상 멍하니 있으므로 무슨 생각을 하고 있는지 알 수 없다. 꼬리로 먹이를 낚는 것이 특기다.', 'Water', 'Psychic', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/107.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/79.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/107.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/107.png', '얼간이포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
