	(112, '0081', 'Magnemite', 325, 25, 35, 70, 95, 55, 45, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/magnemite', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/81.png', 'It moves while constantly hovering. It discharges electromagnetic waves and so on from the units at its sides.', '코일', '좌우의 유닛에서 중력을 차단하는 힘을 발휘하기에 공중에 뜰 수 있다.', 'Electric', 'Steel', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/112.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/81.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/112.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/112.png', '자석포켓몬', '60', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(113, '0082', 'Magneton', 465, 50, 60, 95, 120, 70, 70, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/magneton', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/82.png', 'They’re formed by several Magnemite linked together. They frequently appear when sunspots flare up.', '레어코일', '다수의 코일이 연결되어 강력한 자기장과 높은 전압을 방사한다.', 'Electric', 'Steel', '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/113.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/82.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/113.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/113.png', '자석포켓몬', '30', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(114, '0083', 'Farfetch\'d', 377, 52, 90, 55, 58, 62, 60, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/farfetchd', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/83.png', 'It can’t live without the stalk it holds. That’s why it defends the stalk from attackers with its life.', '파오리', '수많은 움직이는 덩굴에 둘러싸여 정체불명이다. 파란 덩굴은 평생 자란다.', 'Normal', 'Flying', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/114.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/83.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/114.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/114.png', '청둥오리포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(115, '0083', 'Farfetch\'d (Galarian Farfetch\'d)', 377, 52, 95, 55, 58, 62, 55, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/farfetchd', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/10166.png', 'It can’t live without the stalk it holds. That’s why it defends the stalk from attackers with its life.', '가라르 파오리', '배의 주머니에서 새끼를 키운다. 안전할 때만 새끼를 주머니에서 꺼내어 놀게 한다.', 'Fighting', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/115.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/10166.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/115.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/115.png', '가족포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, 80, NULL, 113),
	(116, '0084', 'Doduo', 310, 35, 85, 45, 35, 35, 75, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/doduo', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/84.png', 'The brains in its two heads appear to communicate emotions to each other with a telepathic power.', '두두', '돌연변이로 발견된 두 개의 머리를 지닌 포켓몬이다. 시속 100km로 달린다.', 'Normal', 'Flying', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/116.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/84.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/116.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/116.png', '쌍둥이새포켓몬', '225', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(117, '0085', 'Dodrio', 470, 60, 110, 70, 60, 60, 110, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/dodrio', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/85.png', 'When Doduo evolves into this odd breed, one of its heads splits into two. This Pokémon runs at nearly 40 mph.', '두트리오', '3개의 머리가 보고 있는 앞에서 조금이라도 빈틈을 보이면 부리로 격렬하게 쪼아댄다.', 'Normal', 'Flying', '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/117.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/85.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/117.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/117.png', '세쌍둥이새포켓몬', '75', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(118, '0086', 'Seel', 325, 65, 45, 55, 45, 70, 45, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/seel', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/86.png', 'This Pokémon lives on icebergs. It uses the sharp point on its head to break up ice as it swims in the sea.', '쥬쥬', '빙산에 사는 포켓몬이다. 머리의 뾰족하게 돌출된 부분으로 얼음을 깨고 바다를 헤엄친다.', 'Water', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/118.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/86.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/118.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/118.png', '강치포켓몬', '225', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(119, '0087', 'Dewgong', 475, 90, 70, 80, 70, 95, 70, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/dewgong', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/87.png', 'In snow, the pure white coat covering its body obscures it from predators.', '쥬레곤', '전신이 새하얀 털로 뒤덮여 있다. 추위에 강해서 오히려 추울수록 힘이 넘쳐 난다.', 'Water', 'Ice', '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/119.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/87.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/119.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/119.png', '강치포켓몬', '60', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(120, '0088', 'Grimer', 325, 80, 80, 50, 40, 50, 25, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/grimer', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/88.png', 'When two of these Pokémon’s bodies are combined together, new poisons are created.', '질퍽이', '달로부터의 X선을 쬔 오물이 질퍽이로 변화했다. 더러운 것을 좋아한다.', 'Poison', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/120.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/88.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/120.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/120.png', '진흙포켓몬', '225', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(121, '0088', 'Grimer (Alolan Grimer)', 325, 80, 80, 50, 40, 50, 25, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/grimer', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/88.png', 'When two of these Pokémon’s bodies are combined together, new poisons are created.', '알로라 질퍽이', '달로부터의 X선을 쬔 오물이 질퍽이로 변화했다. 더러운 것을 좋아한다.', 'Poison', 'Dark', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/121.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/88.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/121.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/121.png', '진흙포켓몬', '60', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(122, '0089', 'Muk', 500, 105, 105, 75, 65, 100, 50, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/muk', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/89.png', 'It’s so stinky! Muk’s body contains toxic elements, and any plant will wilt when it passes by.', '질뻐기', '진흙이 쌓여 악취가 나는 장소를 좋아해서 모여들기 때문에 주변은 더욱 악취가 난다.', 'Poison', NULL, '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/122.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/89.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/122.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/122.png', '진흙포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
