	(144, '0105', 'Marowak (Alolan Marowak)', 425, 60, 80, 110, 50, 80, 45, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/marowak', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/105.png', 'The bones it uses have been in its possession since it was born. It has a ferocious nature.', '알로라 텅구리', '몸집도 작으며 원래는 약했다. 뼈를 쓰기 시작하면서 성격이 흉포해졌다.', 'Fire', 'Ghost', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/144.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/105.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/144.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/144.png', '뼈다귀포켓몬', '3', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(145, '0106', 'Hitmonlee', 455, 50, 120, 53, 35, 110, 87, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/hitmonlee', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/106.png', 'Its legs can stretch to double their length. First-time foes are startled by Hitmonlee’s extensible reach.', '시라소몬', '다리를 자유자재로 늘였다 줄였다 한다. 멀리 떨어져 있을 때도 상대를 차올릴 수 있다.', 'Fighting', NULL, '2', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/145.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/106.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/145.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/145.png', '킥포켓몬', '3', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(146, '0107', 'Hitmonchan', 455, 50, 105, 79, 35, 110, 76, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/hitmonchan', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/107.png', 'When Hitmonchan twists its arm while throwing a punch, the blow will pulverize even concrete. The Pokémon rests after three minutes of fighting.', '홍수몬', '팔을 비틀며 날리는 펀치는 콘크리트도 부스러뜨린다. 3분 싸우면 잠시 쉰다.', 'Fighting', NULL, '2', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/146.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/107.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/146.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/146.png', '펀치포켓몬', '3', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(147, '0108', 'Lickitung', 385, 90, 55, 75, 60, 75, 30, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/lickitung', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/108.png', 'Wields its long tongue deftly, as though it were an arm. The Pokémon’s viscous saliva, once it has been collected and boiled down, yields a strong and highly useful adhesive.', '내루미', '긴 혀는 끈적끈적한 침으로 덮여 있다. 어떤 것이든 달라붙어서 매우 편리하다.', 'Normal', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/147.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/108.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/147.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/147.png', '핥기포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(148, '0109', 'Koffing', 340, 40, 65, 95, 60, 45, 35, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/koffing', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/109.png', 'Lighter-than-air gases in its body keep it aloft. The gases not only smell; they are also explosive.', '또가스', '얇고 풍선 같은 몸에 맹독 가스가 차있다. 가까이 오면 역겨운 냄새가 난다.', 'Poison', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/148.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/109.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/148.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/148.png', '독가스포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(149, '0110', 'Weezing', 490, 65, 90, 120, 85, 70, 60, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/weezing', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/110.png', 'It grows by feeding on gases released by garbage. Though very rare, triplets have been found.', '또도가스', '한쪽이 부풀어 오르면 다른 한쪽은 오그라드는 쌍둥이 또가스. 항상 체내의 독가스를 섞고 있다.', 'Poison', NULL, '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/149.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/110.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/149.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/149.png', '독가스포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(150, '0110', 'Weezing (Galarian Weezing)', 490, 65, 90, 120, 85, 70, 60, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/weezing', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/110.png', 'It grows by feeding on gases released by garbage. Though very rare, triplets have been found.', '가라르 또도가스', '한쪽이 부풀어 오르면 다른 한쪽은 오그라드는 쌍둥이 또가스. 항상 체내의 독가스를 섞고 있다.', 'Poison', 'Fairy', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/150.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/110.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/150.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/150.png', '독가스포켓몬', '3', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(151, '0111', 'Rhyhorn', 345, 80, 85, 95, 30, 30, 25, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/rhyhorn', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/111.png', 'Ludicrously strong—when it butts heads with a mountain, it is the mountain that shatters. But its short legs struggle with turns, and it is incapable of stopping unless it collides with something.', '뿔카노', '머리는 나쁘지만 힘이 세서 고층 빌딩도 몸통박치기로 산산조각 낸다.', 'Ground', 'Rock', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/151.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/111.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/151.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/151.png', '뿔포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(152, '0112', 'Rhydon', 485, 105, 130, 120, 45, 45, 40, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/rhydon', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/112.png', 'Rapidly rotates its horn to bore through bedrock. It swaggers around volcanic regions, protected from the lava’s heat by its tough, armorlike hide.', '코뿌리', '전신을 갑옷 같은 피부로 보호하고 있다. 2000도의 마그마 속에서도 살 수 있다.', 'Ground', 'Rock', '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/152.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/112.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/152.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/152.png', '드릴포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(153, '0113', 'Chansey', 450, 250, 5, 5, 35, 105, 50, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/chansey', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/113.png', 'It walks carefully to prevent its egg from breaking. However, it is extremely fast at running away.', '럭키', '행복을 가져다준다고 전해진다. 상처 입은 사람에게 알을 나눠주는 상냥한 포켓몬이다.', 'Normal', NULL, '2', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/153.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/113.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/153.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/153.png', '알포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(154, '0114', 'Tangela', 435, 65, 55, 115, 100, 40, 60, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/tangela', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/114.png', 'It is cloaked entirely in blue vines, preventing any glimpse of its true identity. The vines impart a refreshing sensation when chewed—they’re useful as a spice.', '덩쿠리', '수많은 움직이는 덩굴에 둘러싸여 정체불명이다. 파란 덩굴은 평생 자란다.', 'Grass', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/154.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/114.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/154.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/154.png', '넝쿨포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(155, '0115', 'Kangaskhan', 490, 105, 95, 80, 40, 80, 90, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/kangaskhan', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/115.png', 'It raises its offspring in its belly pouch. It lets its baby out to play only when it feels safe to do so.', '캥카', '배의 주머니에서 새끼를 키운다. 안전할 때만 새끼를 주머니에서 꺼내어 놀게 한다.', 'Normal', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/155.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/115.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/155.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/155.png', '가족포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(156, '0115', 'Kangaskhan (Mega Kangaskhan)', 590, 105, 125, 100, 60, 100, 100, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/kangaskhan', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/115.png', 'It raises its offspring in its belly pouch. It lets its baby out to play only when it feels safe to do so.', '메가캥카', '배의 주머니에서 새끼를 키운다. 안전할 때만 새끼를 주머니에서 꺼내어 놀게 한다.', 'Normal', NULL, '9', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/156.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/115.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/156.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/156.png', '가족포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(157, '0116', 'Horsea', 295, 30, 40, 70, 70, 25, 60, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/horsea', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/116.png', 'It makes its nest in the shade of corals. If it senses danger, it spits black ink and flees.', '쏘드라', '수면에서 힘차게 먹물을 발사해서 날고 있는 벌레를 맞춰서 떨어뜨릴 때가 있다고 한다.', 'Water', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/157.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/116.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/157.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/157.png', '드래곤포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(158, '0117', 'Seadra', 440, 55, 65, 95, 95, 45, 85, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/seadra', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/117.png', 'Its spines provide protection. Its fins and bones are prized as traditional medicine ingredients.', '시드라', '섣불리 만지려고 하면 몸 전체에서 돋아나는 가시에 찔려 기절할 수도 있다.', 'Water', NULL, '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/158.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/117.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/158.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/158.png', '드래곤포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(159, '0118', 'Goldeen', 320, 45, 67, 60, 35, 50, 63, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/goldeen', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/118.png', 'It swims at a steady five knots. If it senses danger, it will strike back with its sharp horn.', '콘치', '5노트의 스피드로 헤엄친다. 몸에 위험을 느끼면 날카로운 뿔로 반격한다.', 'Water', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/159.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/118.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/159.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/159.png', '금붕어포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(160, '0119', 'Seaking', 450, 80, 92, 65, 65, 80, 68, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/seaking', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/119.png', 'To protect its family, it will fight with its drill-sharp horn. It lives in hollowed rocks in streams.', '왕콘치', '가을이 오면 산란을 위해 힘차게 강물을 거슬러 올라가며 헤엄치는 모습을 볼 수 있다.', 'Water', NULL, '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/160.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/119.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/160.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/160.png', '금붕어포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(161, '0120', 'Staryu', 340, 30, 45, 55, 70, 55, 85, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/staryu', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/120.png', 'If Staryu’s body is damaged, it will regenerate as long as the red core remains. The core flashes at midnight.', '별가사리', '몸의 중심에서 빛나는 핵이 있는 한 몸이 찢겨나가도 재생할 수 있다.', 'Water', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/161.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/120.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/161.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/161.png', '별포켓몬', '255', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(162, '0121', 'Starmie', 520, 60, 75, 85, 100, 85, 115, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/starmie', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/121.png', 'At the center of its body is a red core that sends mysterious radio signals into the night sky.', '아쿠스타', '코어라고 불리는 중심 부분은 일곱 빛깔로 빛난다. 이것을 보석으로 삼는 사람도 있다고 한다.', 'Water', 'Psychic', '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/162.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/121.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/162.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/162.png', '수수께끼포켓몬', '90', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(163, '0122', 'Mr. Mime', 460, 40, 45, 65, 100, 120, 90, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/mr-mime', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/122.png', 'The behavior of this clown-like Pokémon reminds one of pantomime. It creates invisible walls using a force emitted from its fingertips.', '마임맨', '체내의 시간 감각은 어느 때든 정확해서 규칙적인 리듬으로 목을 기울인다.', 'Psychic', 'Fairy', '2', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/163.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/122.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/163.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/163.png', '배리어포켓몬', '255', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(164, '0122', 'Mr. Mime (Galarian Mr. Mime)', 460, 50, 65, 65, 90, 90, 100, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/mr-mime', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/10168.png', 'The behavior of this clown-like Pokémon reminds one of pantomime. It creates invisible walls using a force emitted from its fingertips.', '가라르 마임맨', '양쪽 눈이 특수한 구조다. 적은 양의 빛이라도 잘 모아 어둠 속에서도 주위를 분별한다.', 'Ice', 'Psychic', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/164.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/10168.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/164.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/164.png', '부엉이포켓몬', '90', 0, NULL, 72, 251, 115),
	(165, '0123', 'Scyther', 500, 70, 110, 80, 55, 80, 105, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/scyther', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/123.png', 'The sharp scythes on its forearms become increasingly sharp by cutting through hard objects.', '스라크', '풀숲에서 갑자기 튀어나와 예리한 낫으로 베어 가르는 모습은 마치 닌자 같다.', 'Bug', 'Flying', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/165.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/123.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/165.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/165.png', '버마재비포켓몬', '255', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(166, '0124', 'Jynx', 455, 65, 50, 35, 115, 95, 95, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/jynx', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/124.png', 'Its cries sound like human speech. However, it is impossible to tell what it is trying to say.', '루주라', '허리를 흔드는 듯이 걷고 있다. 방심하면 엉겁결에 따라서 춤춰버린다고 한다.', 'Ice', 'Psychic', '2', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/166.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/124.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/166.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/166.png', '인간형태포켓몬', '90', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(167, '0125', 'Electabuzz', 490, 65, 83, 57, 95, 85, 105, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/electabuzz', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/125.png', 'Feeds on electrical energy. During sudden showers beneath looming thunderclouds, one can observe Electabuzz scaling tall trees, where the Pokémon will then wait for lightning to strike.', '에레브', '몸의 표면에는 전기가 흐르고 있다. 주변이 어두우면 전신이 푸르스름하게 빛난다.', 'Electric', NULL, '2', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/167.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/125.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/167.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/167.png', '전기포켓몬', '255', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(168, '0126', 'Magmar', 495, 65, 95, 57, 100, 85, 93, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/magmar', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/126.png', 'Legend has it that this Pokémon was born from the crater of a volcano. When wounded, it bathes in lava to heal its body, much as one would soak in a hot spring.', '마그마', '화산의 분화구 근처에서 발견되었다. 입에서 불꽃을 뿜어낸다. 체온은 1200도나 된다.', 'Fire', NULL, '2', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/168.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/126.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/168.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/168.png', '불뿜기포켓몬', '90', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(169, '0127', 'Pinsir', 500, 65, 125, 100, 55, 70, 85, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/pinsir', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/127.png', 'It grips prey with its pincers until the prey is torn apart. What it can’t tear, it tosses far away.', '쁘사이저', '2개의 뿔 사이에 먹이를 끼우고 조각날 때까지 놓지 않는다. 조각나지 않으면 저편으로 세게 내던진다.', 'Bug', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/169.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/127.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/169.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/169.png', '뿔집게포켓몬', '90', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(170, '0127', 'Pinsir (Mega Pinsir)', 600, 65, 155, 120, 65, 90, 105, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/pinsir', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/127.png', 'It grips prey with its pincers until the prey is torn apart. What it can’t tear, it tosses far away.', '메가쁘사이저', '2개의 뿔 사이에 먹이를 끼우고 조각날 때까지 놓지 않는다. 조각나지 않으면 저편으로 세게 내던진다.', 'Bug', 'Flying', '9', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/170.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/127.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/170.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/170.png', '뿔집게포켓몬', '190', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(171, '0128', 'Tauros', 490, 75, 100, 95, 40, 70, 110, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/tauros', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/128.png', 'They fight each other by locking horns. The herd’s protector takes pride in its battle-scarred horns.', '켄타로스', '3개의 꼬리로 자신을 때려서 투지가 끓어오르면 전속력으로 돌진해온다.', 'Normal', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/171.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/128.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/171.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/171.png', '성난소포켓몬', '75', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
