	(175, '0129', 'Magikarp', 200, 20, 10, 55, 15, 20, 80, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/magikarp', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/129.png', 'In the distant past, it was somewhat stronger than the horribly weak descendants that exist today.', '잉어킹', '힘도 스피드도 거의 없다. 세상에서 가장 약하고 한심한 포켓몬이다.', 'Water', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/175.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/129.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/175.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/175.png', '물고기포켓몬', '190', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
