	(177, '0130', 'Gyarados (Mega Gyarados)', 640, 95, 155, 109, 70, 130, 81, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/gyarados', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/130.png', 'It appears whenever there is world conflict, burning down any place it travels through.', '메가갸라도스', '분쟁이 일어난 마을을 다 태워버렸다는 기록이 고문서에 남아 있다.', 'Water', 'Dark', '9', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/177.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/130.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/177.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/177.png', '흉악포켓몬', '190', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(178, '0131', 'Lapras', 535, 130, 85, 80, 85, 95, 60, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/lapras', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/131.png', 'It loves crossing the sea with people and Pokémon on its back. It understands human speech.', '라프라스', '부드러운 마음의 소유자다. 좀처럼 다투지 않아 많이 잡혔기 때문에 수가 줄었다.', 'Water', 'Ice', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/178.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/131.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/178.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/178.png', '탈것포켓몬', '75', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(179, '0132', 'Ditto', 288, 48, 48, 48, 48, 48, 48, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/ditto', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/132.png', 'It can freely recombine its own cellular structure to transform into other life-forms.', '메타몽', '전신의 세포를 재구성해서 본 것의 모양과 똑 닮게 변신하는 능력을 가지고 있다.', 'Normal', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/179.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/132.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/179.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/179.png', '변신포켓몬', '235', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(180, '0133', 'Eevee', 325, 55, 55, 50, 45, 65, 55, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/eevee', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/133.png', 'Its genetic code is irregular. It may mutate if it is exposed to radiation from element stones.', '이브이', '진화할 때 모습과 능력이 바뀜으로써 혹독한 환경에 적응하는 희귀한 포켓몬이다.', 'Normal', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/180.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/133.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/180.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/180.png', '진화포켓몬', '120', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(181, '0133', 'Eevee (Partner Eevee)', 435, 65, 75, 70, 65, 85, 75, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/eevee', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/133.png', 'Its genetic code is irregular. It may mutate if it is exposed to radiation from element stones.', '이브이', '진화할 때 모습과 능력이 바뀜으로써 혹독한 환경에 적응하는 희귀한 포켓몬이다.', 'Normal', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/181.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/133.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/181.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/181.png', '진화포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(182, '0134', 'Vaporeon', 525, 130, 65, 60, 110, 95, 65, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/vaporeon', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/134.png', 'Its cell composition is similar to water molecules. As a result, it can’t be seen when it melts away into water.', '샤미드', '아름다운 물가를 좋아한다. 세포가 물의 분자구조와 닮아서 물에 녹는 것도 가능하다.', 'Water', NULL, '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/182.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/134.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/182.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/182.png', '거품뿜기포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(183, '0135', 'Jolteon', 525, 65, 65, 60, 110, 95, 130, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/jolteon', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/135.png', 'If agitated, it uses electricity to straighten out its fur and launch it in small bunches.', '쥬피썬더', '체내에 전기가 모이면 전신의 털이 모두 날카롭게 곤두서기 시작한다.', 'Electric', NULL, '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/183.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/135.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/183.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/183.png', '번개포켓몬', '190', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(184, '0136', 'Flareon', 525, 65, 130, 60, 95, 110, 65, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/flareon', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/136.png', 'It fluffs out its fur collar to cool down its body temperature, which can reach 1,650 degrees Fahrenheit.', '부스터', '체내에 불꽃 주머니를 가지고 있다. 싸움이 시작되기 직전에는 체온이 900도까지 올라간다.', 'Fire', NULL, '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/184.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/136.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/184.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/184.png', '불꽃포켓몬', '75', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(185, '0137', 'Porygon', 395, 65, 60, 70, 85, 75, 40, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/porygon', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/137.png', 'It has no discernible heartbeat and does not seem to draw breath, and yet it appears to function without issue. I cannot even begin to explain this utterly bizarre anomaly.', '폴리곤', '연구 끝에 태어난 인공 포켓몬이다. 기본적인 동작만 프로그램되어 있다.', 'Normal', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/185.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/137.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/185.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/185.png', '가상포켓몬', '65', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(186, '0138', 'Omanyte', 355, 35, 40, 100, 90, 55, 35, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/omanyte', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/138.png', 'It’s a Pokémon that was resurrected from a fossil using modern science. It swam in ancient seas.', '암나이트', '먼 옛날 바다에서 살고 있던 고대 포켓몬. 10개의 다리를 구불거리며 헤엄친다.', 'Rock', 'Water', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/186.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/138.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/186.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/186.png', '소용돌이포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(187, '0139', 'Omastar', 495, 70, 60, 125, 115, 70, 55, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/omastar', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/139.png', 'It is thought that this Pokémon became extinct because its spiral shell grew too large.', '암스타', '촉수가 팔다리처럼 발달해 있다. 달라붙자마자 문다.', 'Rock', 'Water', '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/187.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/139.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/187.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/187.png', '소용돌이포켓몬', '255', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(188, '0140', 'Kabuto', 355, 30, 80, 90, 55, 45, 55, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/kabuto', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/140.png', 'It is thought to have inhabited beaches 300 million years ago. It is protected by a sturdy shell.', '투구', '3억 년 전에 모래 해변에서 살고 있었던 것으로 추측된다. 단단한 껍질이 몸을 보호한다.', 'Rock', 'Water', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/188.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/140.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/188.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/188.png', '껍질포켓몬', '120', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(189, '0141', 'Kabutops', 495, 60, 115, 105, 65, 70, 80, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/kabutops', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/141.png', 'It is thought that this Pokémon came onto land because its prey adapted to life on land.', '투구푸스', '수중을 이동할 때 손발을 작게 접고 등껍질을 구부려 빠르게 헤엄친다.', 'Rock', 'Water', '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/189.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/141.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/189.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/189.png', '껍질포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(190, '0142', 'Aerodactyl', 515, 80, 105, 65, 60, 75, 130, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/aerodactyl', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/142.png', 'It’s a Pokémon that roamed the skies in the dinosaur era. Its teeth are like saw blades.', '프테라', '호박에 남아 있던 공룡의 유전자에서 부활시켰다. 높은 소리로 울며 난다.', 'Rock', 'Flying', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/190.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/142.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/190.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/190.png', '화석포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
