	(209, '0154', 'Meganium', 525, 80, 82, 100, 83, 100, 80, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/meganium', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/154.png', 'Its breath has the fantastic ability to revive dead plants and flowers.', '메가니움', '꽃잎에서 발산되는 향기에는 다투는 마음을 가라앉게 하는 성분이 담겨 있다.', 'Grass', NULL, '9', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/209.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/154.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/209.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/209.png', '허브포켓몬', '190', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(210, '0155', 'Cyndaquil', 309, 39, 52, 43, 60, 50, 65, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/cyndaquil', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/155.png', 'Hails from the Johto region. Though usually curled into a ball due to its timid disposition, it harbors tremendous firepower.', '브케인', '겁이 많아서 늘 몸을 웅크리고 있다. 습격당하면 등의 불꽃을 타오르게 해서 몸을 보호한다.', 'Fire', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/210.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/155.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/210.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/210.png', '불쥐포켓몬', '75', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(211, '0156', 'Quilava', 405, 58, 64, 58, 80, 65, 80, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/quilava', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/156.png', 'This creature’s fur is most mysterious—it is wholly impervious to the burning touch of flame. Should Quilava turn its back to you, take heed! Such a posture indicates a forthcoming attack.', '마그케인', '싸우기 전에 등을 보이며 자신의 불꽃이 얼마나 대단한지 상대에게 일부러 보여준다.', 'Fire', NULL, '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/211.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/156.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/211.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/211.png', '화산포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(212, '0157', 'Typhlosion', 534, 78, 84, 78, 109, 85, 100, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/typhlosion', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/157.png', 'It attacks using blasts of fire. It creates heat shimmers with intense fire to hide itself.', '블레이범', '분노가 정점에 달했을 때 건드린 자를 모두 순식간에 불태워버릴 정도로 뜨겁다.', 'Fire', NULL, '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/212.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/157.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/212.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/212.png', '화산포켓몬', '25', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(213, '0157', 'Typhlosion (Hisuian Typhlosion)', 534, 73, 84, 78, 119, 85, 95, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/typhlosion', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/157.png', 'It attacks using blasts of fire. It creates heat shimmers with intense fire to hide itself.', '히스이 블레이범', '분노가 정점에 달했을 때 건드린 자를 모두 순식간에 불태워버릴 정도로 뜨겁다.', 'Fire', 'Ghost', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/213.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/157.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/213.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/213.png', '화산포켓몬', '190', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(214, '0158', 'Totodile', 314, 50, 65, 64, 44, 48, 43, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/totodile', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/158.png', 'It has a habit of biting everything with its well-developed jaws. Even its Trainer needs to be careful.', '리아코', '작아도 성격은 아주 거칠다. 눈앞에서 움직이는 것이 있으면 무조건 물어버린다.', 'Water', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/214.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/158.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/214.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/214.png', '큰턱포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(215, '0159', 'Croconaw', 405, 65, 80, 80, 59, 63, 58, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/croconaw', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/159.png', 'Once it bites down, it won’t let go until it loses its fangs. New fangs quickly grow into place.', '엘리게이', '이빨이 빠져도 계속해서 자란다. 항상 입안에는 48개의 이빨이 나 있다.', 'Water', NULL, '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/215.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/159.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/215.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/215.png', '큰턱포켓몬', '60', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(216, '0160', 'Feraligatr', 530, 85, 105, 100, 79, 83, 78, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/feraligatr', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/160.png', 'It usually moves slowly, but it goes at blinding speed when it attacks and bites prey.', '장크로다일', '평소에는 느긋하게 움직이지만 먹이를 물 때에는 눈에 보이지 않는 엄청난 스피드를 낸다.', 'Water', NULL, '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/216.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/160.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/216.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/216.png', '큰턱포켓몬', '120', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(217, '0161', 'Sentret', 215, 35, 46, 34, 35, 45, 20, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/sentret', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/161.png', 'It has a very nervous nature. It stands up high on its tail so it can scan wide areas.', '꼬리선', '망보기 역은 날카롭게 울거나 꼬리로 땅을 쳐서 동료에게 위험을 알린다.', 'Normal', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/217.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/161.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/217.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/217.png', '망보기포켓몬', '60', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(218, '0162', 'Furret', 415, 85, 76, 64, 45, 55, 90, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/furret', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/162.png', 'The mother puts its offspring to sleep by curling up around them. It corners foes with speed.', '다꼬리', '엄마 포켓몬이 가늘고 긴 몸으로 새끼를 감싸 안아 재운다. 빠른 움직임으로 상대를 몰아붙인다.', 'Normal', NULL, '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/218.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/162.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/218.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/218.png', '긴몸통포켓몬', '190', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(219, '0163', 'Hoothoot', 262, 60, 30, 30, 36, 56, 50, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/hoothoot', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/163.png', 'It switches its standing foot so quickly that the switch can’t be seen. It cries at the same time every day.', '부우부', '체내의 시간 감각은 어느 때든 정확해서 규칙적인 리듬으로 목을 기울인다.', 'Normal', 'Flying', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/219.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/163.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/219.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/219.png', '부엉이포켓몬', '75', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(220, '0164', 'Noctowl', 452, 100, 50, 50, 86, 96, 70, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/noctowl', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/164.png', 'If it flips its head upside down, it’s a sign that it is engaged in very complex thinking.', '야부엉', '양쪽 눈이 특수한 구조다. 적은 양의 빛이라도 잘 모아 어둠 속에서도 주위를 분별한다.', 'Normal', 'Flying', '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/220.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/164.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/220.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/220.png', '부엉이포켓몬', '225', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(221, '0165', 'Ledyba', 265, 40, 20, 30, 40, 80, 55, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/ledyba', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/165.png', 'It’s so timid that it can’t move unless it’s with a swarm. It conveys its feelings through scent.', '레디바', '추워지면 여기저기로부터 레디바가 많이 모여들어 바싹 붙어 서로 따뜻하게 해준다.', 'Bug', 'Flying', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/221.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/165.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/221.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/221.png', '별다섯포켓몬', '75', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(222, '0166', 'Ledian', 390, 55, 35, 50, 55, 110, 85, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/ledian', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/166.png', 'It uses starlight as energy. When more stars appear at night, the patterns on its back grow larger.', '레디안', '밤하늘의 별이 깜빡일 때 반짝이는 가루를 흩뿌리며 훨훨 날아간다.', 'Bug', 'Flying', '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/222.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/166.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/222.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/222.png', '별다섯포켓몬', '60', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(223, '0167', 'Spinarak', 250, 40, 60, 40, 40, 40, 30, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/spinarak', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/167.png', 'It sets a trap by spinning a web with thin but strong thread. It waits motionlessly for prey to arrive.', '페이검', '가늘고 튼튼한 실을 뿜어 엮어서 덫을 만들고 먹이가 걸리기만을 기다린다.', 'Bug', 'Poison', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/223.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/167.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/223.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/223.png', '실뿜기포켓몬', '190', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(224, '0168', 'Ariados', 400, 70, 90, 70, 60, 70, 40, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/ariados', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/168.png', 'It attaches silk to its prey and sets it free. Later, it tracks the silk to the prey and its friends.', '아리아도스', '엉덩이뿐 아니라 입에서도 실을 내기 때문에 봐서는 어느 쪽이 머리인지 모른다.', 'Bug', 'Poison', '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/224.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/168.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/224.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/224.png', '롱다리포켓몬', '75', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(225, '0169', 'Crobat', 535, 85, 90, 80, 70, 80, 130, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/crobat', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/169.png', 'Its hind limbs have become another set of wings. Crobat expertly maneuvers its four wings to dart in exquisite fashion through even the most confined caves without losing any speed.', '크로뱃', '4장으로 수가 늘어난 날개로 어둠 속을 조용히 날아간다. 주위를 지나쳐도 눈치채지 못한다.', 'Poison', 'Flying', '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/225.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/169.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/225.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/225.png', '박쥐포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(226, '0170', 'Chinchou', 330, 75, 38, 38, 56, 56, 67, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/chinchou', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/170.png', 'It discharges positive and negative electricity from the tips of its antennae to shock its foes.', '초라기', '어두운 해저에서는 항상 깜빡거리고 있는 촉수의 빛만이 통신수단이다.', 'Water', 'Electric', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/226.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/170.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/226.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/226.png', '아귀포켓몬', '25', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(227, '0171', 'Lanturn', 460, 125, 58, 58, 76, 76, 67, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/lanturn', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/171.png', 'Lanturn’s light can shine up from great depths. It is nicknamed the Deep-Sea Star.', '랜턴', '심해를 헤엄치는 랜턴의 불빛은 수면까지 다다른다. 심해의 별이라고 불리고 있다.', 'Water', 'Electric', '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/227.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/171.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/227.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/227.png', '라이트포켓몬', '25', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(228, '0172', 'Pichu', 205, 20, 40, 15, 35, 35, 60, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/pichu', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/172.png', 'Despite this Pokémon’s cute appearance, those who want to live with one should prepare to be on the receiving end of its electric jolts.', '피츄', '동료와 꼬리의 끝을 맞추면서 불티를 튀기는 놀이를 한다. 담력 시험을 하고 있는 듯하다.', 'Electric', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/228.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/172.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/228.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/228.png', '아기쥐포켓몬', '120', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(229, '0173', 'Cleffa', 218, 50, 25, 28, 45, 55, 15, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/cleffa', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/173.png', 'In silhouette, they resemble twinkling starlight. When shooting stars rain from the night sky, Cleffa gather in numbers and dance as though they are indeed incarnations of the stars.', '삐', '별님 같은 실루엣이다. 그 모습 때문에 별똥별을 타고 온다고 여겨진다.', 'Fairy', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/229.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/173.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/229.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/229.png', '별포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(230, '0174', 'Igglybuff', 210, 90, 30, 15, 40, 20, 15, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/igglybuff', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/174.png', 'It likes to sing but is not yet good at it. With praise and encouragement, it will get better little by little.', '푸푸린', '짧은 다리로 걷는 것보다는 부드러운 몸으로 튀어 오르며 돌아다닌다.', 'Normal', 'Fairy', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/230.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/174.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/230.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/230.png', '풍선포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(231, '0175', 'Togepi', 245, 35, 20, 65, 40, 65, 20, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/togepi', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/175.png', 'This ovate creature is frequently mistaken for a moving egg when encountered out in the fields or in the mountains. Its guileless smile soothes the soul.', '토게피', '껍질 안에 행복이 가득 차 있어서 상냥하게 대하면 행운을 나누어 준다고 한다.', 'Fairy', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/231.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/175.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/231.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/231.png', '바늘알포켓몬', '120', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(232, '0176', 'Togetic', 405, 55, 40, 85, 80, 105, 40, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/togetic', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/176.png', 'No records exist of Togetic being seen in the wilds. Rumors abound that it evolves under the loving care of a trusted human companion, upon whom the Pokémon then bestows great joy.', '토게틱', '상냥한 사람 곁에 있지 않으면 기운이 나지 않게 되어버린다. 날개를 움직이지 않고 뜰 수 있다.', 'Fairy', 'Flying', '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/232.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/176.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/232.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/232.png', '행복포켓몬', '60', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(233, '0177', 'Natu', 320, 40, 50, 45, 70, 45, 70, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/natu', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/177.png', 'It picks food from cactus plants, deftly avoiding buds and spines. It seems to skip about to move.', '네이티', '날개가 아직 잘 발달하지 못해서 뛰어오르는 것처럼 이동한다. 항상 뭔가를 바라보고 있다.', 'Psychic', 'Flying', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/233.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/177.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/233.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/233.png', '아기새포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(234, '0178', 'Xatu', 470, 65, 75, 70, 95, 70, 95, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/xatu', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/178.png', 'This odd Pokémon can see both the past and the future. It eyes the sun’s movement all day.', '네이티오', '선명하게 떠오르는 태양을 조용히 바라보며 기도를 올리면 거의 움직이지 않고 하루가 간다.', 'Psychic', 'Flying', '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/234.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/178.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/234.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/234.png', '정령포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(235, '0179', 'Mareep', 280, 55, 40, 40, 65, 45, 35, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/mareep', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/179.png', 'Its fleece grows continually. In the summer, the fleece is fully shed, but it grows back in a week.', '메리프', '푹신푹신한 털은 정전기가 쌓이면 2배로 부풀어 오른다. 만지면 감전되어 버린다.', 'Electric', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/235.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/179.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/235.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/235.png', '솜털포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(236, '0180', 'Flaaffy', 365, 70, 55, 55, 80, 60, 45, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/flaaffy', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/180.png', 'Because of its rubbery, electricity-resistant skin, it can store lots of electricity in its fur.', '보송송', '푹신푹신한 털은 전기를 모으기 쉽지만 고무 같은 피부 덕분에 자신은 마비되지 않는다.', 'Electric', NULL, '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/236.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/180.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/236.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/236.png', '솜털포켓몬', '75', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(237, '0181', 'Ampharos', 510, 90, 75, 85, 115, 90, 55, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/ampharos', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/181.png', 'When it gets dark, the light from its bright, shiny tail can be seen from far away on the ocean’s surface.', '전룡', '꼬리 끝이 빛나며 반짝인다. 빛이 아득히 먼 곳까지 닿아서 길 잃은 자들의 이정표가 된다.', 'Electric', NULL, '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/237.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/181.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/237.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/237.png', '라이트포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(238, '0181', 'Ampharos (Mega Ampharos)', 610, 90, 95, 105, 165, 110, 45, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/ampharos', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/181.png', 'When it gets dark, the light from its bright, shiny tail can be seen from far away on the ocean’s surface.', '메가전룡', '꼬리 끝이 빛나며 반짝인다. 빛이 아득히 먼 곳까지 닿아서 길 잃은 자들의 이정표가 된다.', 'Electric', 'Dragon', '9', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/238.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/181.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/238.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/238.png', '라이트포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(239, '0182', 'Bellossom', 490, 75, 80, 95, 90, 100, 50, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/bellossom', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/182.png', 'When the heavy rainfall season ends, it is drawn out by warm sunlight to dance in the open.', '아르코', '가끔 아르코가 모여서 춤을 추는 듯한 동작을 보인다. 태양을 부르는 의식이라 전해진다.', 'Grass', NULL, '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/239.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/182.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/239.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/239.png', '꽃포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(240, '0183', 'Marill', 250, 70, 20, 50, 20, 50, 40, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/marill', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/183.png', 'The oil-filled tail functions as a buoy, so it’s fine even in rivers with strong currents.', '마릴', '전신의 털은 물을 튕겨내는 성질을 지녀 물을 끼얹어도 말라 있다.', 'Water', 'Fairy', '2', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/240.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/183.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/240.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/240.png', '물쥐포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(241, '0184', 'Azumarill', 420, 100, 50, 80, 60, 80, 50, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/azumarill', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/184.png', 'By keeping still and listening intently, it can tell what is in even wild, fast-moving rivers.', '마릴리', '긴 귀는 우수한 센서다. 강바닥에서 움직이는 생명체의 소리를 분간할 수 있다.', 'Water', 'Fairy', '2', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/241.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/184.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/241.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/241.png', '물토끼포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(242, '0185', 'Sudowoodo', 410, 70, 100, 115, 30, 65, 30, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/sudowoodo', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/185.png', 'To avoid being attacked, it does nothing but mimic a tree. It hates water and flees from rain.', '꼬지모', '항상 나무인 척하고 있다. 몸의 구조는 식물보다 돌이나 바위에 가까운 듯하다.', 'Rock', NULL, '2', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/242.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/185.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/242.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/242.png', '흉내포켓몬', '30', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(243, '0186', 'Politoed', 500, 90, 75, 75, 90, 100, 70, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/politoed', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/186.png', 'A group of Poliwag and Poliwhirl will form with a Politoed as the leader. Politoed’s cries make the Pokémon of the group obey.', '왕구리', '3마리 이상 왕구리가 모이면 반드시 고함치는 듯한 울음소리로 합창하기 시작한다.', 'Water', NULL, '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/243.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/186.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/243.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/243.png', '개구리포켓몬', '3', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(244, '0187', 'Hoppip', 250, 35, 35, 40, 35, 55, 50, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/hoppip', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/187.png', 'Outside of cold regions, Hoppip can be found practically everywhere. This is because the wind carries this species all over the world.', '통통코', '매우 가벼운 몸을 가졌다. 바람에 날아가지 않도록 단단히 지면을 밟아 지탱하고 있다.', 'Grass', 'Flying', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/244.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/187.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/244.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/244.png', '솜풀포켓몬', '3', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(245, '0188', 'Skiploom', 340, 55, 45, 50, 45, 65, 80, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/skiploom', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/188.png', 'When the weather grows cold, Skiploom’s flower closes and the Pokémon cannot photosynthesize, so it flies away to warmer regions.', '두코', '머리 위에 핀 꽃은 기온에 따라 펴지거나 오므라드는 성질을 가졌다.', 'Grass', 'Flying', '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/245.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/188.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/245.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/245.png', '솜풀포켓몬', '3', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(246, '0189', 'Jumpluff', 460, 75, 55, 70, 55, 95, 110, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/jumpluff', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/189.png', 'Beware its cotton spores. If you accidentally breathe them in, you’ll be racked with coughs and itchiness.', '솜솜코', '계절풍에 날려서 세계 일주를 해 버린다. 도중에 솜 포자를 흩뿌린다.', 'Grass', 'Flying', '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/246.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/189.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/246.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/246.png', '솜풀포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(247, '0190', 'Aipom', 360, 55, 70, 55, 40, 55, 85, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/aipom', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/190.png', 'This treetop dweller possesses a tail as dexterous as a hand. Ancient writings describe this Pokémon as a one-armed oddity.', '에이팜', '높은 나무 위에서 살고 있다. 나뭇가지에서 가지로 건너뛸 때 꼬리로 능숙하게 밸런스를 잡는다.', 'Normal', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/247.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/190.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/247.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/247.png', '긴꼬리포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(248, '0191', 'Sunkern', 180, 30, 30, 30, 30, 30, 30, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/sunkern', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/191.png', 'It is very weak. Its only means of defense is to shake its leaves desperately at its attacker.', '해너츠', '어느 날 아침 갑자기 떨어진다. 깨비참에게 습격당하면 잎사귀를 세차게 흔들어서 쫓아 버린다.', 'Grass', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/248.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/191.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/248.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/248.png', '씨앗포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(249, '0192', 'Sunflora', 425, 75, 75, 55, 105, 85, 30, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/sunflora', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/192.png', 'Since it converts sunlight into energy, it is always looking in the direction of the sun.', '해루미', '더운 계절이 다가오면 얼굴의 꽃잎이 선명해지고 활발하게 움직이게 된다.', 'Grass', NULL, '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/249.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/192.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/249.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/249.png', '태양포켓몬', '3', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(250, '0193', 'Yanma', 390, 65, 65, 45, 75, 45, 95, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/yanma', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/193.png', 'Its frail wings are so thin that one can see clear through them. However, during flight these wings exhibit the power to churn air with force enough to launch a house skyward.', '왕자리', '얼굴을 움직이지 않고 360도 전부 볼 수 있는 눈을 가지고 있어서 바로 뒤의 먹이도 놓치지 않는다.', 'Bug', 'Flying', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/250.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/193.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/250.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/250.png', '얇은날개포켓몬', '3', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(251, '0194', 'Wooper', 210, 55, 45, 45, 25, 25, 15, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/wooper', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/194.png', 'When the temperature cools in the evening, they emerge from water to seek food along the shore.', '우파', '차가운 물속에서 생활한다. 근처가 선선해지면 먹이를 찾으러 지상에도 나타난다.', 'Water', 'Ground', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/251.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/194.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/251.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/251.png', '수어포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(252, '0194', 'Wooper (Paldean Wooper)', 210, 55, 45, 45, 25, 25, 15, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/wooper', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/194.png', 'When the temperature cools in the evening, they emerge from water to seek food along the shore.', '팔데아 우파', '차가운 물속에서 생활한다. 근처가 선선해지면 먹이를 찾으러 지상에도 나타난다.', 'Poison', 'Ground', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/252.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/194.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/252.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/252.png', '수어포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(253, '0195', 'Quagsire', 430, 95, 85, 85, 65, 65, 35, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/quagsire', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/195.png', 'A dim-witted Pokémon. It doesn’t care if it bumps its head into boats or rocks while swimming.', '누오', '느긋한 성격이다. 강바닥에서 입을 벌려 먹이가 들어오는 것을 한결같이 기다린다.', 'Water', 'Ground', '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/253.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/195.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/253.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/253.png', '수어포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(254, '0196', 'Espeon', 525, 65, 65, 60, 130, 95, 110, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/espeon', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/196.png', 'It uses the fine hair that covers its body to sense air currents and predict its enemy’s actions.', '에브이', '상대의 움직임을 예지할 때 두 갈래로 갈라져 있는 꼬리의 끝이 미세하게 떨리고 있다.', 'Psychic', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/254.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/196.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/254.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/254.png', '태양포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(255, '0197', 'Umbreon', 525, 95, 65, 110, 60, 130, 65, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/umbreon', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/197.png', 'When darkness falls, the rings on the body begin to glow, striking fear in the hearts of anyone nearby.', '블래키', '달빛이 이브이의 유전자를 변화시켰다. 어둠에 숨어 먹이를 기다린다.', 'Dark', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/255.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/197.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/255.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/255.png', '달빛포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(256, '0198', 'Murkrow', 405, 60, 85, 42, 85, 42, 91, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/murkrow', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/198.png', 'If spotted, it will lure an unwary person into chasing it, then lose the pursuer on mountain trails.', '니로우', '반짝이는 물건을 주워 비밀 장소에 숨겨 둔다. 나옹과 자주 쟁탈전을 벌인다.', 'Dark', 'Flying', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/256.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/198.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/256.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/256.png', '어둠포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(257, '0199', 'Slowking', 490, 95, 75, 80, 100, 110, 30, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/slowking', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/199.png', 'It has incredible intellect and intuition. Whatever the situation, it remains calm and collected.', '야도킹', '대단한 지성과 번뜩이는 재치를 가지고 있다. 어떤 때라도 당황하거나 소란 피우지 않고 느긋하게 있다.', 'Water', 'Psychic', '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/257.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/199.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/257.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/257.png', '임금포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(258, '0199', 'Slowking (Galarian Slowking)', 490, 95, 65, 80, 110, 110, 30, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/slowking', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/199.png', 'It has incredible intellect and intuition. Whatever the situation, it remains calm and collected.', '가라르 야도킹', '대단한 지성과 번뜩이는 재치를 가지고 있다. 어떤 때라도 당황하거나 소란 피우지 않고 느긋하게 있다.', 'Poison', 'Psychic', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/258.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/199.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/258.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/258.png', '임금포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(259, '0200', 'Misdreavus', 435, 60, 60, 60, 85, 85, 85, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/misdreavus', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/200.png', 'It loves to bite and yank people’s hair from behind without warning, just to see their shocked reactions.', '무우마', '무서워하는 마음을 빨간 구슬로 흡수해 영양분으로 만든다. 낮에는 어두운 곳에서 잠자고 있다.', 'Ghost', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/259.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/200.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/259.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/259.png', '야명포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(260, '0201', 'Unown', 336, 48, 72, 48, 72, 48, 48, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/unown', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/201.png', 'It is hard to believe these strangely shaped Pokémon are truly living creatures. I’ve pointed out that the species’ many forms resemble writing from other lands; no one will take me seriously.', '안농', '몸 자체는 굉장히 얇고 항상 벽에 들러붙어 있다. 모습에는 뭔가 의미가 있는 듯하다.', 'Psychic', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/260.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/201.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/260.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/260.png', '심볼포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(261, '0202', 'Wobbuffet', 405, 190, 33, 58, 33, 58, 33, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/wobbuffet', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/202.png', 'It desperately tries to keep its black tail hidden. This behavior is said to be proof that its tail hides a secret.', '마자용', '빛과 쇼크를 싫어한다. 공격받으면 몸이 부풀어 올라 반격이 강력해진다.', 'Psychic', NULL, '2', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/261.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/202.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/261.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/261.png', '참기포켓몬', '255', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(262, '0203', 'Girafarig', 455, 70, 80, 65, 90, 65, 85, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/girafarig', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/203.png', 'Girafarig’s tail has a small head. It instinctively bites at any foe that approaches the Pokémon from behind.', '키링키', '잠자는 동안 꼬리의 머리가 주위를 망보고 있다. 꼬리는 잠을 잘 필요가 없다.', 'Normal', 'Psychic', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/262.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/203.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/262.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/262.png', '긴목포켓몬', '127', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(263, '0204', 'Pineco', 290, 50, 65, 90, 35, 35, 15, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/pineco', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/204.png', 'It spits out a fluid that it uses to glue tree bark to its body. The fluid hardens when it touches air.', '피콘', '나무껍질을 짜 맞춰서 껍질을 두껍게 하는 것을 좋아한다. 무거워져도 신경 쓰지 않는다.', 'Bug', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/263.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/204.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/263.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/263.png', '도롱이벌레포켓몬', '255', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(264, '0205', 'Forretress', 465, 75, 90, 140, 60, 60, 40, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/forretress', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/205.png', 'Its entire body is shielded by a steel-hard shell. What lurks inside this shell is a total mystery.', '쏘콘', '강철 껍질이 몸을 보호하고 있다. 틈새에서 엿보고 있는 눈이 있지만 내용물의 정체는 수수께끼다.', 'Bug', 'Steel', '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/264.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/205.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/264.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/264.png', '도롱이벌레포켓몬', '90', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(265, '0206', 'Dunsparce', 415, 100, 70, 70, 65, 65, 45, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/dunsparce', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/206.png', 'If spotted, it escapes by burrowing with its tail. It can float just slightly using its wings.', '노고치', '누군가에게 들키면 꼬리로 땅을 파서 뒤쪽으로 도망친다.', 'Normal', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/265.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/206.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/265.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/265.png', '땅뱀포켓몬', '255', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(266, '0207', 'Gligar', 430, 65, 75, 105, 35, 65, 85, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/gligar', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/207.png', 'Its tail is tipped by a thick, horrible stinger. To bring down prey, it will first obscure their vision by covering their faces with its body, and then it will use the stinger to inject them with venom.', '글라이거', '보통은 벼랑에 붙어 있다. 먹이를 발견하면 날개를 펼쳐 바람을 타고 날아 덮친다.', 'Ground', 'Flying', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/266.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/207.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/266.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/266.png', '날전갈포켓몬', '120', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(267, '0208', 'Steelix', 510, 75, 85, 200, 55, 65, 30, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/steelix', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/208.png', 'This Pokémon evolved through use of a strange item. Its body is coated with steel powder and notably hard—not even diamond can leave so much as a scratch.', '강철톤', '땅속의 높은 압력과 열로 단련된 몸은 어떠한 금속보다도 단단하다.', 'Steel', 'Ground', '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/267.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/208.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/267.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/267.png', '철뱀포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(268, '0208', 'Steelix (Mega Steelix)', 610, 75, 125, 230, 55, 95, 30, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/steelix', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/208.png', 'This Pokémon evolved through use of a strange item. Its body is coated with steel powder and notably hard—not even diamond can leave so much as a scratch.', '메가강철톤', '땅속의 높은 압력과 열로 단련된 몸은 어떠한 금속보다도 단단하다.', 'Steel', 'Ground', '9', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/268.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/208.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/268.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/268.png', '철뱀포켓몬', '120', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(269, '0209', 'Snubbull', 300, 60, 80, 50, 40, 40, 30, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/snubbull', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/209.png', 'Small Pokémon flee from its scary face. It is, however, considered by many people to be cute.', '블루', '활발하고 노는 것을 좋아하는 성격. 잘 따르기 때문에 함께 놀고 싶어 하는 여성들이 많다.', 'Fairy', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/269.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/209.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/269.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/269.png', '요정포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(270, '0210', 'Granbull', 450, 90, 120, 75, 60, 60, 45, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/granbull', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/210.png', 'It is timid in spite of its looks. If it becomes enraged, however, it will strike with its huge fangs.', '그랑블루', '얼굴에 어울리지 않게 겁이 많다. 그러나 한번 화내기 시작하면 큰 이빨로 반격한다.', 'Fairy', NULL, '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/270.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/210.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/270.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/270.png', '요정포켓몬', '255', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(271, '0211', 'Qwilfish', 440, 65, 95, 85, 55, 55, 85, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/qwilfish', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/211.png', 'Experienced fishers say they try to catch Qwilfish in the brief moment that these Pokémon become defenseless just after launching poisonous spikes.', '침바루', '전신의 독침을 날리기 위해 10리터의 물을 단번에 마시고 몸을 부풀린다.', 'Water', 'Poison', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/271.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/211.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/271.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/271.png', '풍선포켓몬', '120', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(272, '0211', 'Qwilfish (Hisuian Qwilfish)', 440, 65, 95, 85, 55, 55, 85, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/qwilfish', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/211.png', 'Experienced fishers say they try to catch Qwilfish in the brief moment that these Pokémon become defenseless just after launching poisonous spikes.', '히스이 침바루', '전신의 독침을 날리기 위해 10리터의 물을 단번에 마시고 몸을 부풀린다.', 'Dark', 'Poison', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/272.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/211.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/272.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/272.png', '풍선포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(273, '0212', 'Scizor', 500, 70, 130, 100, 55, 80, 65, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/scizor', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/212.png', 'It swings its eye-patterned pincers up to scare its foes. This makes it look like it has three heads.', '핫삼', '강철이 함유된 집게로 잡은 것은 아무리 딱딱해도 산산조각이 난다.', 'Bug', 'Steel', '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/273.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/212.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/273.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/273.png', '집게포켓몬', '255', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
