	(278, '0215', 'Sneasel', 430, 55, 95, 55, 35, 75, 115, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/sneasel', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/215.png', 'This is a smart and sneaky Pokémon. A pair may work together to steal eggs by having one lure the parents away.', '포푸니', '거처에서 알을 가로채어 먹어 버린다. 날카로운 갈고리 손톱이 상대의 급소를 베어 가른다.', 'Dark', 'Ice', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/278.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/215.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/278.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/278.png', '갈고리손톱포켓몬', '190', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
