	(280, '0216', 'Teddiursa', 330, 60, 80, 50, 50, 50, 40, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/teddiursa', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/216.png', 'Its paws are soaked in oodles of honey. When nervous, Teddiursa will lick its paws and soon have a smile back on its face.', '깜지곰', '꿀을 발견하면 초승달 모양이 빛난다. 달콤한꿀이 배어든 손바닥을 항상 핥고 있다.', 'Normal', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/280.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/216.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/280.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/280.png', '아기곰포켓몬', '235', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(281, '0217', 'Ursaring', 500, 90, 130, 75, 75, 75, 55, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/ursaring', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/217.png', 'It is quite skilled at climbing trees. If it comes across a Primeape while searching for berries in the treetops, trouble will surely ensue.', '링곰', '어떠한 냄새라도 구별할 수 있다. 땅속 깊이 파묻혀 있는 먹이도 남김없이 찾아낸다.', 'Normal', NULL, '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/281.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/217.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/281.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/281.png', '동면포켓몬', '120', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(282, '0218', 'Slugma', 250, 40, 40, 40, 70, 40, 20, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/slugma', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/218.png', 'Its body is made of magma. If it doesn’t keep moving, its body will cool and harden.', '마그마그', '화산 지대에 많이 나타난다. 따뜻한 곳을 찾아서 느릿느릿 기어 다니고 있다.', 'Fire', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/282.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/218.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/282.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/282.png', '용암포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(283, '0219', 'Magcargo', 430, 60, 50, 120, 90, 80, 30, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/magcargo', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/219.png', 'Its body temperature is roughly 18,000 degrees Fahrenheit. Flames burst from gaps in its shell made of hardened magma.', '마그카르고', '등껍질은 깨어지기 쉬우며 가끔 체내를 순환하고 있는 고열의 불꽃을 뿜어낸다.', 'Fire', 'Rock', '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/283.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/219.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/283.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/283.png', '용암포켓몬', '200', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(284, '0220', 'Swinub', 250, 50, 50, 40, 30, 30, 50, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/swinub', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/220.png', 'Swinub excels at sniffing out mushrooms buried beneath grass or snow. Since ancient times, the people of Hisui have often relied upon this skill.', '꾸꾸리', '먹이를 찾기 위해 코를 바닥에 비벼 땅을 파고 있다. 가끔 온천을 찾아낸다.', 'Ice', 'Ground', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/284.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/220.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/284.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/284.png', '산돼지포켓몬', '75', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(285, '0221', 'Piloswine', 450, 100, 100, 80, 60, 60, 50, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/piloswine', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/221.png', 'The long fur of this Pokémon covers its eyes, ears, and even limbs, allowing Piloswine to resist harshly frigid conditions. The Pokémon’s white tusks can be used to defeat its enemies.', '메꾸리', '4개의 다리는 짧지만 발굽이 넓고 거칠거칠하므로 눈 위도 미끄러지지 않고 걸을 수 있다.', 'Ice', 'Ground', '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/285.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/221.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/285.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/285.png', '멧돼지포켓몬', '255', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(286, '0222', 'Corsola', 410, 65, 55, 95, 65, 95, 35, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/corsola', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/222.png', 'Many live in the clean seas of the south. They apparently can’t live in polluted waters.', '코산호', '점점 자라면서 다시 돋아나는 머리의 끝이 아름다워 보물로서 인기가 많다.', 'Water', 'Rock', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/286.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/222.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/286.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/286.png', '산호포켓몬', '90', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(287, '0222', 'Corsola (Galarian Corsola)', 410, 60, 55, 100, 65, 100, 30, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/corsola', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/222.png', 'Many live in the clean seas of the south. They apparently can’t live in polluted waters.', '가라르 코산호', '점점 자라면서 다시 돋아나는 머리의 끝이 아름다워 보물로서 인기가 많다.', 'Ghost', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/287.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/222.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/287.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/287.png', '산호포켓몬', '255', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(288, '0223', 'Remoraid', 300, 35, 65, 35, 65, 35, 65, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/remoraid', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/223.png', 'Spits water from its mouth with incredible accuracy. It captures Burmy by shooting them down off the branches from which they dangle.', '총어', '조준이 정확하다. 뿜어낸 물은 100m 앞에서 움직이는 먹이를 반드시 명중시킨다.', 'Water', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/288.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/223.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/288.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/288.png', '분사포켓몬', '120', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(289, '0224', 'Octillery', 480, 75, 105, 75, 105, 75, 45, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/octillery', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/224.png', 'While Octillery still shoots water from its mouth, the drastic anatomical difference between it and Remoraid meant that for a long time, no one believed the former evolved from the latter.', '대포무노', '구멍에 들어가고 싶어 하는 성질로 바위굴이나 항아리를 좋아해 거기서 먹물을 뿜어내 공격한다.', 'Water', NULL, '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/289.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/224.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/289.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/289.png', '분사포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(290, '0225', 'Delibird', 330, 45, 55, 45, 65, 45, 75, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/delibird', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/225.png', 'It always carries its food with it, wherever it goes. If attacked, it throws its food at the opponent.', '딜리버드', '꼬리로 먹이를 싸서 운반한다. 산에서 조난당한 사람에게 먹이를 나눠주는 습성이 있다.', 'Ice', 'Flying', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/290.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/225.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/290.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/290.png', '배달포켓몬', '255', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(291, '0226', 'Mantine', 485, 85, 40, 70, 80, 140, 70, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/mantine', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/226.png', 'This calm and gentle Pokémon swims gracefully through the sea. After building speed, it can leap out of the water. It is often misidentified as a bird Pokémon due to this behavior.', '만타인', '헤엄쳐서 스피드가 빨라지면 파도 위에 뛰어올라 그대로 100m나 활공한다.', 'Water', 'Flying', '2', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/291.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/226.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/291.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/291.png', '연포켓몬', '120', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(292, '0227', 'Skarmory', 465, 65, 80, 140, 40, 70, 70, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/skarmory', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/227.png', 'Skarmory is clad entirely in ironhard armor. It flies at speeds over 180 mph.', '무장조', '가시나무 안에 둥지를 만든다. 가시에 상처를 입어가며 자라난 새끼들의 날개는 단단해진다.', 'Steel', 'Flying', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/292.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/227.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/292.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/292.png', '갑옷새포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(293, '0228', 'Houndour', 330, 45, 60, 30, 80, 50, 65, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/houndour', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/228.png', 'It uses different kinds of cries for communicating with others of its kind and for pursuing its prey.', '델빌', '새벽녘에 주변 일대에 울려 퍼지는 기분 나쁜 울음소리로 자신들의 영역을 어필한다.', 'Dark', 'Fire', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/293.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/228.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/293.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/293.png', '다크포켓몬', '190', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(294, '0229', 'Houndoom', 500, 75, 90, 50, 110, 80, 95, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/houndoom', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/229.png', 'Upon hearing its eerie howls, other Pokémon get the shivers and head straight back to their nests.', '헬가', '헬가가 으스스하게 멀리서 짖으면 지옥에서 사신이 부르는 소리라고 옛날 사람들은 상상하고 있었다.', 'Dark', 'Fire', '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/294.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/229.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/294.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/294.png', '다크포켓몬', '120', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(295, '0229', 'Houndoom (Mega Houndoom)', 600, 75, 90, 90, 140, 90, 115, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/houndoom', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/229.png', 'Upon hearing its eerie howls, other Pokémon get the shivers and head straight back to their nests.', '메가헬가', '헬가가 으스스하게 멀리서 짖으면 지옥에서 사신이 부르는 소리라고 옛날 사람들은 상상하고 있었다.', 'Dark', 'Fire', '9', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/295.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/229.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/295.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/295.png', '다크포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(296, '0230', 'Kingdra', 540, 75, 95, 95, 95, 95, 85, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/kingdra', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/230.png', 'It lives in caves on the seafloor and creates giant whirlpools every time it moves.', '킹드라', '평소에는 해저동굴에 몸을 숨기고 있는 것 같다. 하품으로 소용돌이를 발생시킨다.', 'Water', 'Dragon', '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/296.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/230.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/296.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/296.png', '드래곤포켓몬', '180', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(297, '0231', 'Phanpy', 330, 90, 60, 60, 40, 40, 40, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/phanpy', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/231.png', 'It is far stronger than it appears. If a Phanpy is swinging its trunk around and your arm gets hit by it, your arm bone will shatter.', '코코리', '애정 표현으로 코를 부딪쳐 오지만 힘이 있기 때문에 조심하지 않으면 날아가 버린다.', 'Ground', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/297.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/231.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/297.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/297.png', '긴코포켓몬', '200', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(298, '0232', 'Donphan', 500, 90, 120, 120, 60, 60, 50, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/donphan', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/232.png', 'Donphan is normally a calm Pokémon, but once it is enraged, it will curl its body into a ball and charge at you while rolling.', '코리갑', '예리하고 단단한 이빨과 더욱 튼튼한 피부의 몸통박치기는 집도 부술 정도다.', 'Ground', NULL, '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/298.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/232.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/298.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/298.png', '갑옷포켓몬', '150', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(299, '0233', 'Porygon2', 515, 85, 80, 90, 105, 95, 60, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/porygon2', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/233.png', 'A bizarre item caused this Pokémon to evolve. While it now exhibits many new gestures and expressions, its biology remains inscrutable.', '폴리곤2', '더욱 연구가 진행되어 능력이 올라갔다. 가끔 프로그램에 없는 행동을 보인다.', 'Normal', NULL, '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/299.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/233.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/299.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/299.png', '가상포켓몬', '255', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(300, '0234', 'Stantler', 465, 73, 95, 62, 85, 65, 85, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/stantler', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/234.png', 'It’s said that this Pokémon used to be stronger long ago when it had many enemies, and that it was even able to evolve under its own power.', '노라키', '뿔을 응시하고 있으면 원의 중심에 빨려 들어가는 것 같은 이상한 기분이 든다.', 'Normal', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/300.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/234.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/300.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/300.png', '큰뿔포켓몬', '255', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(301, '0235', 'Smeargle', 250, 55, 20, 35, 20, 45, 75, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/smeargle', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/235.png', 'It marks its territory by using its tail like a paintbrush. There are more than 5,000 different marks.', '루브도', '꼬리를 붓처럼 써서 영역에 마크를 그린다. 그 종류는 5000개 이상이다.', 'Normal', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/301.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/235.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/301.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/301.png', '그림장이포켓몬', '60', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(302, '0236', 'Tyrogue', 210, 35, 35, 35, 35, 35, 35, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/tyrogue', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/236.png', 'It is famous for its eagerness to fight and always nurses injuries from challenging larger foes.', '배루키', '항상 기운이 넘친다. 강해지기 위해 계속 져도 상대에게 맞선다.', 'Fighting', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/302.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/236.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/302.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/302.png', '싸움포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(303, '0237', 'Hitmontop', 455, 50, 95, 95, 35, 110, 70, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/hitmontop', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/237.png', 'It fights while spinning like a top. The centrifugal force boosts its destructive power by a factor of 10.', '카포에라', '팽이처럼 회전하면서 싸운다. 원심력의 파워로 파괴력은 10배다.', 'Fighting', NULL, '2', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/303.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/237.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/303.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/303.png', '물구나무포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(304, '0238', 'Smoochum', 305, 45, 30, 15, 85, 65, 65, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/smoochum', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/238.png', 'It tests everything by touching with its lips, which remember what it likes and dislikes.', '뽀뽀라', '입술이 제일 민감하다. 뭐든지 먼저 입술로 건드려서 어떤 것인지 확인한다.', 'Ice', 'Psychic', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/304.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/238.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/304.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/304.png', '뽀뽀포켓몬', '180', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(305, '0239', 'Elekid', 360, 45, 63, 37, 65, 55, 95, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/elekid', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/239.png', 'They generate electricity by spinning their arms. During a thunderstorm, if one hears the lively voices of children out in the wilderness, what one is actually hearing are the voices of Elekid.', '에레키드', '양팔을 빙글빙글 휘둘러서 전기를 발생시킨다. 그러나 만들어낸 전기는 모아둘 수 없다.', 'Electric', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/305.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/239.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/305.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/305.png', '전류포켓몬', '90', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(306, '0240', 'Magby', 365, 45, 75, 37, 70, 55, 83, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/magby', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/240.png', 'This Pokémon lives in volcanic areas. With each breath, sparks spurt from its mouth and nose. When Magby is in good health, its flames gain a yellow tint.', '마그비', '작은 몸이지만 체온은 600도다. 숨을 들이쉬고 내쉴 때마다 입과 코에서 불꽃이 샌다.', 'Fire', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/306.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/240.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/306.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/306.png', '불씨포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(307, '0241', 'Miltank', 490, 95, 80, 105, 40, 70, 100, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/miltank', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/241.png', 'It is said that kids who drink Miltank’s milk grow up to become hearty, healthy adults.', '밀탱크', '새끼가 태어났을 때에 짜낸 우유는 평상시보다 영양이 듬뿍 담겨 있다.', 'Normal', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/307.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/241.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/307.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/307.png', '젖소포켓몬', '180', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(308, '0242', 'Blissey', 540, 255, 10, 10, 75, 135, 55, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/blissey', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/242.png', 'The eggs it lays are filled with happiness. Eating even one bite will bring a smile to anyone.', '해피너스', '해피너스가 낳은 알에는 행복이 담겨 있어서 한 입 먹으면 누구든지 웃음 띤 얼굴이 된다.', 'Normal', NULL, '2', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/308.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/242.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/308.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/308.png', '행복포켓몬', '90', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(309, '0243', 'Raikou', 580, 90, 85, 75, 115, 100, 115, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/raikou', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/243.png', 'It is said to have fallen with lightning. It can fire thunderbolts from the rain clouds on its back.', '라이코', '비구름을 짊어지고 있어서 어떤 때라도 번개를 칠 수 있다. 번개와 함께 떨어졌다고 한다.', 'Electric', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/309.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/243.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/309.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/309.png', '우뢰포켓몬', '120', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(310, '0244', 'Entei', 580, 115, 115, 85, 90, 75, 100, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/entei', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/244.png', 'It is said that when it roars, a volcano erupts somewhere around the globe.', '앤테이', '새로운 화산이 생길 때마다 태어난다고 전해지는 대지를 달리는 포켓몬이다.', 'Fire', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/310.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/244.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/310.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/310.png', '화산포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(311, '0245', 'Suicune', 580, 100, 75, 115, 90, 115, 85, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/suicune', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/245.png', 'It races around the world to purify fouled water. It dashes away with the north wind.', '스이쿤', '세계 곳곳을 뛰어다니며 오염된 물을 정화시킨다. 북풍과 함께 달려나간다.', 'Water', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/311.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/245.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/311.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/311.png', '오로라포켓몬', '200', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
