	(316, '0249', 'Lugia', 680, 106, 90, 130, 90, 154, 110, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/lugia', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/249.png', 'It sleeps in a deep-sea trench. If it flaps its wings, it is said to cause a 40-day storm.', '루기아', '깊은 해구의 밑바닥에서 잠잔다. 루기아가 날개를 치면 40일 동안 폭풍우가 계속된다고 전해진다.', 'Psychic', 'Flying', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/316.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/249.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/316.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/316.png', '잠수포켓몬', '225', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
