	(331, '0261', 'Poochyena', 220, 35, 55, 35, 30, 30, 35, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/poochyena', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/261.png', 'A Pokémon with a persistent nature, it chases its chosen prey until the prey becomes exhausted.', '포챠나', '집요한 성격의 포켓몬이다. 점찍은 먹이가 기진맥진 지칠 때까지 뒤쫓아간다.', 'Dark', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/331.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/261.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/331.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/331.png', '물어뜯기포켓몬', '190', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(332, '0262', 'Mightyena', 420, 70, 90, 70, 60, 60, 70, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/mightyena', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/262.png', 'It chases down prey in a pack. It will never disobey the commands of a skilled Trainer.', '그라에나', '우수한 트레이너의 명령에는 절대복종한다. 먼 옛날 무리를 지어 행동했던 영향이다.', 'Dark', NULL, '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/332.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/262.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/332.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/332.png', '물어뜯기포켓몬', '60', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(333, '0263', 'Zigzagoon', 240, 38, 30, 41, 30, 41, 60, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/zigzagoon', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/263.png', 'It walks in zigzag fashion. It’s good at finding items in the grass and even in the ground.', '지그제구리', '지그재그로 걸어서 풀숲이나 땅에 묻혀 있는 보물을 찾아내는 것이 특기인 포켓몬이다.', 'Normal', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/333.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/263.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/333.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/333.png', '앙증너구리포켓몬', '255', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(334, '0263', 'Zigzagoon (Galarian Zigzagoon)', 240, 38, 30, 41, 30, 41, 60, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/zigzagoon', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/263.png', 'It walks in zigzag fashion. It’s good at finding items in the grass and even in the ground.', '가라르 지그제구리', '지그재그로 걸어서 풀숲이나 땅에 묻혀 있는 보물을 찾아내는 것이 특기인 포켓몬이다.', 'Dark', 'Normal', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/334.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/263.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/334.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/334.png', '앙증너구리포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(335, '0264', 'Linoone', 420, 78, 70, 61, 50, 61, 100, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/linoone', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/264.png', 'It charges prey at speeds over 60 mph. However, because it can only run straight, it often fails.', '직구리', '똑바로 달리는 스피드는 시속 100km를 가볍게 넘는다. 휘어진 길은 매우 서툴다.', 'Normal', NULL, '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/335.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/264.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/335.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/335.png', '돌진포켓몬', '90', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(336, '0264', 'Linoone (Galarian Linoone)', 420, 78, 70, 61, 50, 61, 100, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/linoone', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/264.png', 'It charges prey at speeds over 60 mph. However, because it can only run straight, it often fails.', '가라르 직구리', '똑바로 달리는 스피드는 시속 100km를 가볍게 넘는다. 휘어진 길은 매우 서툴다.', 'Dark', 'Normal', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/336.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/264.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/336.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/336.png', '돌진포켓몬', '90', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(337, '0265', 'Wurmple', 195, 45, 45, 35, 20, 30, 20, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/wurmple', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/265.png', 'Likes sap and is abundant in the wild. Why it evolves into various different forms is unknown. One cannot tell from a Wurmple’s appearance which form it will take when it evolves.', '개무소', '잎사귀를 매우 좋아한다. 찌르꼬에게 습격당했을 때는 엉덩이의 가시로 물리친다.', 'Bug', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/337.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/265.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/337.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/337.png', '애벌레포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(338, '0266', 'Silcoon', 205, 50, 35, 55, 25, 25, 15, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/silcoon', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/266.png', 'Wraps itself in thin strings of silk while it stores energy for evolution. It can’t extend its limbs and its movement is slow, but its eyes keep a sharp lookout—Silcoon is always on guard.', '실쿤', '실을 나뭇가지에 휘감고 있다. 실에 묻은 빗물을 마시며 진화할 때를 기다리고 있다.', 'Bug', NULL, '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/338.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/266.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/338.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/338.png', '번데기포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(339, '0267', 'Beautifly', 395, 60, 70, 50, 100, 50, 65, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/beautifly', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/267.png', 'A colorful and incredibly beautiful but also greedy Pokémon. In an effort to keep its favorite food all to itself, it will chase away Combee as they try to gather nectar.', '뷰티플라이', '색이 선명한 날개의 무늬가 특징이다. 가는 입을 뻗어 꽃의 달콤한 꿀을 흡수한다.', 'Bug', 'Flying', '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/339.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/267.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/339.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/339.png', '나비포켓몬', '190', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(340, '0268', 'Cascoon', 205, 50, 35, 55, 25, 25, 15, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/cascoon', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/268.png', 'The silk coating its body is thin but sufficiently strong. Cascoon’s silk has a luster and texture superior to that of Silcoon’s, and clothes made using Cascoon silk are regarded as top-notch.', '카스쿤', '부드러운 실로 된 몸은 시간이 지나면서 단단해진다. 진화가 임박하면 갈라지기 시작한다.', 'Bug', NULL, '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/340.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/268.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/340.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/340.png', '번데기포켓몬', '75', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(341, '0269', 'Dustox', 385, 60, 50, 70, 50, 90, 65, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/dustox', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/269.png', 'Tends to be drawn to bonfires on dark nights. Difficult to chase away from settlements because of the way it scatters highly toxic scales.', '독케일', '야행성 포켓몬이다. 불빛에 이끌려나온 독케일이 가로수의 잎을 헤적거리며 먹어댄다.', 'Bug', 'Poison', '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/341.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/269.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/341.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/341.png', '독나방포켓몬', '205', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(342, '0270', 'Lotad', 220, 40, 30, 30, 40, 50, 30, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/lotad', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/270.png', 'It looks like an aquatic plant and serves as a ferry for Pokémon that can’t swim.', '연꽃몬', '수초를 똑 닮은 포켓몬이다. 헤엄을 못 치는 포켓몬을 잎사귀에 태워 건너편 물가까지 운반한다.', 'Water', 'Grass', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/342.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/270.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/342.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/342.png', '개구리밥포켓몬', '155', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(343, '0271', 'Lombre', 340, 60, 50, 50, 60, 70, 50, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/lombre', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/271.png', 'It has a mischievous spirit. If it spots an angler, it will tug on the fishing line to interfere.', '로토스', '햇볕이 잘 드는 물가에 산다. 낮에는 수초로 된 침대에서 자고 해가 지면 활동하기 시작한다.', 'Water', 'Grass', '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/343.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/271.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/343.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/343.png', '명랑함포켓몬', '255', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(344, '0272', 'Ludicolo', 480, 80, 70, 70, 90, 100, 70, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/ludicolo', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/272.png', 'If it hears festive music, all its muscles fill with energy. It can’t help breaking out into a dance.', '로파파', '경쾌한 음악을 들으면 몸속의 힘이 넘쳐흘러 춤추지 않고는 견딜 수 없게 된다.', 'Water', 'Grass', '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/344.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/272.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/344.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/344.png', '행복하기포켓몬', '90', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(345, '0273', 'Seedot', 220, 40, 40, 50, 30, 30, 30, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/seedot', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/273.png', 'When it dangles from a tree branch, it looks just like an acorn. It enjoys scaring other Pokémon that try to peck at it.', '도토링', '머리끝을 가지에 붙여 매달린다. 강풍이 불어 떨어지기도 한다.', 'Grass', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/345.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/273.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/345.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/345.png', '도토리포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(346, '0274', 'Nuzleaf', 340, 70, 70, 40, 60, 40, 60, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/nuzleaf', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/274.png', 'The sound of its grass flute makes its listeners uneasy. It lives deep in the forest.', '잎새코', '잎새코가 연주하는 풀피리의 음색은 사람을 불안하게 만든다. 숲 속에서 살고 있다.', 'Grass', 'Dark', '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/346.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/274.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/346.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/346.png', '꾀부리기포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(347, '0275', 'Shiftry', 480, 90, 100, 60, 90, 60, 80, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/shiftry', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/275.png', 'By flapping its leafy fans, it can whip up gusts of 100 feet per second that can level houses.', '다탱구', '숲의 신이라고 여겨져 두려움의 대상이 되고 있던 포켓몬. 상대의 생각을 읽고 앞지르는 능력을 지녔다.', 'Grass', 'Dark', '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/347.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/275.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/347.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/347.png', '부정하기포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(348, '0276', 'Taillow', 270, 40, 55, 30, 30, 30, 85, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/taillow', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/276.png', 'It has a gutsy spirit that makes it bravely take on tough foes. It flies in search of warm climates.', '테일로', '강한 상대에게도 용감히 맞서는 근성의 소유자다. 따뜻한 땅을 찾아서 난다.', 'Normal', 'Flying', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/348.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/276.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/348.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/348.png', '아기제비포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(349, '0277', 'Swellow', 455, 60, 85, 60, 75, 50, 125, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/swellow', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/277.png', 'It circles the sky in search of prey and dives sharply to catch its target.', '스왈로', '2개의 꼬리날개가 꼿꼿하게 서 있으면 건강하다는 증거다. 우아하게 넓은 하늘을 날아다닌다.', 'Normal', 'Flying', '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/349.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/277.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/349.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/349.png', '제비포켓몬', '255', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(350, '0278', 'Wingull', 270, 40, 30, 30, 55, 30, 85, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/wingull', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/278.png', 'It rides upon ocean winds as if it were a glider. In the winter, it hides food around its nest.', '갈모매', '긴 날개로 바닷바람을 받아서 글라이더처럼 활공한다. 쉴 때는 날개를 접는다.', 'Water', 'Flying', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/350.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/278.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/350.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/350.png', '괭이갈매기포켓몬', '60', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(351, '0279', 'Pelipper', 440, 60, 50, 100, 95, 70, 65, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/pelipper', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/279.png', 'It protects its young in its beak. It bobs on waves, resting on them on days when the waters are calm.', '패리퍼', '큰 부리를 바다에 넣고 먹이를 한 번에 많이 건져 올리려는 속셈이다.', 'Water', 'Flying', '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/351.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/279.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/351.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/351.png', '물새포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(352, '0280', 'Ralts', 198, 28, 25, 25, 45, 35, 40, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/ralts', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/280.png', 'It is highly attuned to the emotions of people and Pokémon. It hides if it senses hostility.', '랄토스', '빨간 뿔로 사람이나 포켓몬의 따뜻한 마음을 캐치하면 전신이 미약하게 뜨거워진다.', 'Psychic', 'Fairy', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/352.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/280.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/352.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/352.png', '느낌포켓몬', '200', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(353, '0281', 'Kirlia', 278, 38, 35, 35, 65, 55, 50, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/kirlia', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/281.png', 'The cheerful spirit of its Trainer gives it energy for its psychokinetic power. It spins and dances when happy.', '킬리아', '트레이너의 밝은 마음이 사이코 파워의 근원이다. 즐거워지면 빙글빙글 춤춘다.', 'Psychic', 'Fairy', '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/353.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/281.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/353.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/353.png', '감정포켓몬', '225', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(354, '0282', 'Gardevoir', 518, 68, 65, 65, 125, 115, 80, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/gardevoir', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/282.png', 'It unleashes psychokinetic energy at full power when protecting a Trainer it has bonded closely with.', '가디안', '트레이너를 지키기 위해서라면 사이코 파워를 모두 써서 작은 블랙홀을 만들어 낸다.', 'Psychic', 'Fairy', '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/354.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/282.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/354.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/354.png', '포용포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(355, '0282', 'Gardevoir (Mega Gardevoir)', 618, 68, 85, 65, 165, 135, 100, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/gardevoir', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/282.png', 'It unleashes psychokinetic energy at full power when protecting a Trainer it has bonded closely with.', '메가가디안', '트레이너를 지키기 위해서라면 사이코 파워를 모두 써서 작은 블랙홀을 만들어 낸다.', 'Psychic', 'Fairy', '9', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/355.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/282.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/355.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/355.png', '포용포켓몬', '190', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(356, '0283', 'Surskit', 269, 40, 30, 32, 50, 52, 65, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/surskit', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/283.png', 'It secretes a thick, sweet-scented syrup from the tip of its head. It lives on weed-choked ponds.', '비구술', '보통은 연못에서 살고 있지만 소나기가 온 뒤에는 마을 안의 물웅덩이에 모습을 드러낸다.', 'Bug', 'Water', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/356.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/283.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/356.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/356.png', '소금쟁이포켓몬', '90', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(357, '0284', 'Masquerain', 454, 70, 60, 62, 100, 82, 80, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/masquerain', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/284.png', 'The antennae have distinctive patterns that look like eyes. When it rains, they grow heavy, making flight impossible.', '비나방', '눈알 모양의 더듬이를 가지고 있다. 4장의 날개로 떠올라 전후좌우로 움직일 수 있다.', 'Bug', 'Flying', '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/357.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/284.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/357.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/357.png', '안구포켓몬', '200', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(358, '0285', 'Shroomish', 295, 60, 40, 60, 40, 60, 35, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/shroomish', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/285.png', 'If it senses danger, it scatters spores from the top of its head to protect itself.', '버섯꼬', '습한 장소를 좋아해서 낮에는 숲의 그늘에서 가만히 있다. 머리에서 독가루를 뿌린다.', 'Grass', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/358.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/285.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/358.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/358.png', '버섯포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(359, '0286', 'Breloom', 460, 60, 130, 80, 60, 60, 70, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/breloom', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/286.png', 'The seeds on its tail are made of toxic spores. It knocks out foes with quick, virtually invisible punches.', '버섯모', '짧은 팔은 펀치를 날릴 때 쑤-욱 늘어난다. 프로 복서를 압도하는 기술을 가지고 있다.', 'Grass', 'Fighting', '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/359.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/286.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/359.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/359.png', '버섯포켓몬', '30', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(360, '0287', 'Slakoth', 280, 60, 60, 60, 35, 35, 30, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/slakoth', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/287.png', 'The way Slakoth lolls around makes anyone who watches it feel like doing the same.', '게을로', '게을로의 게으른 모습은 보고 있는 사람의 게으른 마음을 충분히 자극한다.', 'Normal', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/360.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/287.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/360.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/360.png', '게으름뱅이포켓몬', '125', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(361, '0288', 'Vigoroth', 440, 80, 80, 80, 55, 55, 90, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/vigoroth', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/288.png', 'It is always hungry because it won’t stop rampaging. Even while it is eating, it can’t keep still.', '발바로', '심장 박동이 빨라 전신의 피가 끓어오르고 있기 때문에 1초도 가만히 있지 못한다.', 'Normal', NULL, '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/361.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/288.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/361.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/361.png', '성난원숭이포켓몬', '190', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(362, '0289', 'Slaking', 670, 150, 160, 100, 95, 65, 100, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/slaking', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/289.png', 'This Pokémon lives lying on its side. It only rolls over and moves when there is no more grass to eat.', '게을킹', '세계에서 제일 게으른 포켓몬이다. 손이 닿는 범위의 먹이를 다 먹으면 있는 거처를 바꾼다.', 'Normal', NULL, '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/362.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/289.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/362.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/362.png', '나태함포켓몬', '75', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(363, '0290', 'Nincada', 266, 31, 45, 90, 30, 30, 40, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/nincada', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/290.png', 'It grows underground, sensing its surroundings using antennae instead of its virtually blind eyes.', '토중몬', '긴 시간 동안 땅속에서 살고 있었기 때문에 눈은 거의 보이지 않는다. 더듬이로 주변 상황을 살핀다.', 'Bug', 'Ground', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/363.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/290.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/363.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/363.png', '신참포켓몬', '255', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(364, '0291', 'Ninjask', 456, 61, 90, 45, 50, 50, 160, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/ninjask', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/291.png', 'Because they move so quickly, they sometimes become unseeable. They congregate around tree sap.', '아이스크', '울음소리를 계속 들으면 두통이 낫지 않게 된다. 안 보일 정도의 스피드로 움직인다.', 'Bug', 'Flying', '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/364.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/291.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/364.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/364.png', '시노비포켓몬', '120', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(365, '0292', 'Shedinja', 236, 1, 90, 45, 30, 30, 40, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/shedinja', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/292.png', 'It is a discarded bug shell that came to life. Peering into the crack on its back is said to steal one’s spirit.', '껍질몬', '허물 속으로 영혼이 들어갔다. 등에 난 틈새로 들여다보면 영혼을 빼앗겨버린다고 한다.', 'Bug', 'Ghost', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/365.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/292.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/365.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/365.png', '허물포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(366, '0293', 'Whismur', 240, 64, 51, 23, 51, 23, 28, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/whismur', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/293.png', 'Usually, its cries are like quiet murmurs. If frightened, it shrieks at the same volume as a jet plane.', '소곤룡', '평소에는 속삭이는 듯한 목소리다. 위험을 감지하면 큰 소리로 울기 시작한다. 귀의 덮개를 닫으면 울음을 멈춘다.', 'Normal', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/366.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/293.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/366.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/366.png', '속삭임포켓몬', '255', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(367, '0294', 'Loudred', 360, 84, 71, 43, 71, 43, 48, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/loudred', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/294.png', 'The shock waves from its cries can tip over trucks. It stamps its feet to power up.', '노공룡', '마음껏 들이마신 공기를 발달한 복근을 써서 토해내 큰 소리를 낸다.', 'Normal', NULL, '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/367.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/294.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/367.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/367.png', '큰목소리포켓몬', '60', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(368, '0295', 'Exploud', 490, 104, 91, 63, 91, 73, 68, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/exploud', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/295.png', 'Its howls can be heard over six miles away. It emits all sorts of noises from the ports on its body.', '폭음룡', '폭음룡이 짖는 소리는 10km 전방까지 닿는다. 몸 곳곳의 구멍에서 갖가지 소리를 낸다.', 'Normal', NULL, '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/368.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/295.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/368.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/368.png', '소음포켓몬', '60', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(369, '0296', 'Makuhita', 237, 72, 60, 30, 20, 30, 25, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/makuhita', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/296.png', 'It toughens up by slamming into thick trees over and over. It gains a sturdy body and dauntless spirit.', '마크탕', '큰 나무에 몇 번이나 몸통박치기를 하며 강인한 몸과 굴하지 않는 마음을 단련한다.', 'Fighting', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/369.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/296.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/369.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/369.png', '근성포켓몬', '25', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(370, '0297', 'Hariyama', 474, 144, 120, 60, 40, 60, 50, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/hariyama', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/297.png', 'It stomps on the ground to build power. It can send a 10-ton truck flying with a straight-arm punch.', '하리뭉', '두 다리로 땅을 힘껏 밟아서 파워를 모은다. 손바닥 치기 한 방으로 10톤 트럭을 날려버린다.', 'Fighting', NULL, '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/370.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/297.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/370.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/370.png', '손바닥치기포켓몬', '225', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(371, '0298', 'Azurill', 190, 50, 20, 40, 20, 40, 20, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/azurill', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/298.png', 'Its tail is packed full of the nutrients it needs to grow.', '루리리', '큰 꼬리에 타고 튀면 지상에서 빨리 이동할 수 있다. 물가에서 사는 포켓몬이다.', 'Normal', 'Fairy', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/371.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/298.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/371.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/371.png', '물방울포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(372, '0299', 'Nosepass', 375, 30, 45, 135, 45, 90, 30, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/nosepass', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/299.png', 'Once the people of Hisui discovered that its red nose always points north, they grew to rely on it greatly when traveling afar. The nose seems to work in a similar way to ancient compasses.', '코코파스', '항상 북쪽을 향한다. 자석의 코로 주변의 철을 끌어당겨 방어를 굳힌다.', 'Rock', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/372.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/299.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/372.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/372.png', '콤파스포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(373, '0300', 'Skitty', 260, 50, 45, 45, 35, 35, 50, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/skitty', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/300.png', 'It can’t stop itself from chasing moving things, and it runs in circles, chasing its own tail.', '에나비', '움직이는 것을 무심코 쫓아간다. 자신의 꼬리를 쫓아서 똑같은 장소를 빙글빙글 돈다.', 'Normal', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/373.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/300.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/373.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/373.png', '작은고양이포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(374, '0301', 'Delcatty', 400, 70, 65, 65, 55, 55, 90, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/delcatty', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/301.png', 'It is highly popular among Trainers for its sublime fur. It does not keep a nest.', '델케티', '더러운 곳을 아주 싫어한다. 편안한 곳에서 늘 털을 다듬고 있다.', 'Normal', NULL, '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/374.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/301.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/374.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/374.png', '새침떼기포켓몬', '3', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(375, '0302', 'Sableye', 380, 50, 75, 75, 65, 65, 50, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/sableye', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/302.png', 'Materials from gems it has eaten float to the surface of its body and can form an infinite number of patterns among individuals.', '깜까미', '동굴의 어둠에 숨는다. 보석을 먹는 사이에 눈이 보석이 되어 버렸다.', 'Dark', 'Ghost', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/375.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/302.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/375.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/375.png', '어둠포켓몬', '3', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(376, '0302', 'Sableye (Mega Sableye)', 480, 50, 85, 125, 85, 115, 20, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/sableye', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/302.png', 'Materials from gems it has eaten float to the surface of its body and can form an infinite number of patterns among individuals.', '메가깜까미', '동굴의 어둠에 숨는다. 보석을 먹는 사이에 눈이 보석이 되어 버렸다.', 'Dark', 'Ghost', '9', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/376.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/302.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/376.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/376.png', '어둠포켓몬', '3', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(377, '0303', 'Mawile', 380, 50, 85, 85, 55, 55, 50, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/mawile', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/303.png', 'Attached to its head is a huge set of jaws formed by horns. It can chew through iron beams.', '입치트', '얌전한 얼굴로 상대를 방심하게 만들고 큰 턱으로 덥석 문다. 한번 물면 절대로 놓지 않는다.', 'Steel', 'Fairy', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/377.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/303.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/377.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/377.png', '배반포켓몬', '3', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(378, '0303', 'Mawile (Mega Mawile)', 480, 50, 105, 125, 55, 95, 50, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/mawile', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/303.png', 'Attached to its head is a huge set of jaws formed by horns. It can chew through iron beams.', '메가입치트', '얌전한 얼굴로 상대를 방심하게 만들고 큰 턱으로 덥석 문다. 한번 물면 절대로 놓지 않는다.', 'Steel', 'Fairy', '9', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/378.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/303.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/378.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/378.png', '배반포켓몬', '3', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(379, '0304', 'Aron', 330, 50, 70, 100, 40, 40, 30, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/aron', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/304.png', 'It usually lives deep in mountains. But when it’s hungry, it shows up at the foot of the mountains and eats railroad tracks and cars.', '가보리', '평소에는 산속에서 살고 있지만 배가 고프면 산기슭에 나타나 선로나 차를 먹어 버린다.', 'Steel', 'Rock', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/379.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/304.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/379.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/379.png', '철갑옷포켓몬', '3', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(380, '0305', 'Lairon', 430, 60, 90, 140, 50, 50, 40, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/lairon', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/305.png', 'For food, it digs up iron ore. It smashes its steely body against others to fight over territory.', '갱도라', '철광석을 매우 좋아한다. 강철의 몸을 서로 부딪치며 영역 싸움을 한다.', 'Steel', 'Rock', '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/380.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/305.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/380.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/380.png', '철갑옷포켓몬', '3', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(381, '0306', 'Aggron', 530, 70, 110, 180, 60, 60, 50, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/aggron', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/306.png', 'While seeking iron for food, it digs tunnels by breaking through bedrock with its steel horns.', '보스로라', '산을 통째로 영역으로 한다. 상처가 많은 보스로라일수록 많이 싸웠다는 것이므로 얕볼 수 없다.', 'Steel', 'Rock', '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/381.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/306.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/381.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/381.png', '철갑옷포켓몬', '3', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
