	(383, '0307', 'Meditite', 280, 30, 40, 55, 40, 55, 60, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/meditite', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/307.png', 'It meditates to heighten its inner energy and to float in the air. It eats one berry a day.', '요가랑', '평상시는 깊은 산속에서 수행한다. 명상을 하고 정신력을 높이면 몸이 떠오른다.', 'Fighting', 'Psychic', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/383.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/307.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/383.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/383.png', '명상포켓몬', '3', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(384, '0308', 'Medicham', 410, 60, 60, 75, 60, 75, 80, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/medicham', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/308.png', 'It elegantly avoids attacks with dance-like steps, then launches a devastating blow in the same motion.', '요가램', '춤추는 듯한 우아한 움직임으로 공격을 피하며 상대에게 강력한 일격을 선사한다.', 'Fighting', 'Psychic', '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/384.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/308.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/384.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/384.png', '명상포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(385, '0308', 'Medicham (Mega Medicham)', 510, 60, 100, 85, 80, 85, 100, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/medicham', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/308.png', 'It elegantly avoids attacks with dance-like steps, then launches a devastating blow in the same motion.', '메가요가램', '춤추는 듯한 우아한 움직임으로 공격을 피하며 상대에게 강력한 일격을 선사한다.', 'Fighting', 'Psychic', '9', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/385.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/308.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/385.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/385.png', '명상포켓몬', '3', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(386, '0309', 'Electrike', 295, 40, 45, 40, 65, 40, 65, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/electrike', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/309.png', 'Using electricity stored in its fur, it stimulates its muscles to heighten its reaction speed.', '썬더라이', '긴 털이 마찰하는 과정에서 전신에 정전기가 모인다. 스피드가 특기인 포켓몬이다.', 'Electric', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/386.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/309.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/386.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/386.png', '천둥번개포켓몬', '3', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
