	(391, '0313', 'Volbeat', 430, 65, 73, 75, 47, 85, 85, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/volbeat', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/313.png', 'It communicates with others by lighting up its rear at night. It loves Illumise’s sweet aroma.', '볼비트', '밤이 되면 엉덩이를 빛나게 해 동료와 대화한다. 네오비트가 내는 달콤한 향기를 매우 좋아한다.', 'Bug', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/391.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/313.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/391.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/391.png', '반딧불포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
