	(401, '0322', 'Numel', 305, 60, 60, 40, 65, 45, 35, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/numel', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/322.png', 'The flaming magma it stores in the hump on its back is the source of its tremendous power.', '둔타', '이글거리는 마그마를 등의 혹에 모으고 있다. 비를 맞으면 마그마가 식어 움직임이 둔해진다.', 'Fire', 'Ground', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/401.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/322.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/401.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/401.png', '둔감포켓몬', '255', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
