	(405, '0325', 'Spoink', 330, 60, 25, 35, 70, 80, 60, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/spoink', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/325.png', 'Using its tail like a spring, it keeps its heart beating by bouncing constantly. If it stops, it dies.', '피그점프', '꼬리를 용수철 대용으로 써서 항상 뛰어오르고 있다. 뛰는 반동으로 심장을 고동시키고 있는 것이다.', 'Psychic', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/405.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/325.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/405.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/405.png', '튀다포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
