	(407, '0327', 'Spinda', 360, 60, 60, 60, 60, 60, 60, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/spinda', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/327.png', 'No two Spinda have the same pattern of spots. Their tottering steps hinder the aim of foes.', '얼루기', '똑같은 얼룩무늬의 얼루기는 없다. 휘청휘청거리는 걸음걸이로 상대의 노림수를 피한다.', 'Normal', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/407.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/327.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/407.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/407.png', '얼룩팬더포켓몬', '75', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
