	(409, '0329', 'Vibrava', 340, 50, 70, 50, 50, 50, 70, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/vibrava', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/329.png', 'It violently shudders its wings, generating ultrasonic waves to induce headaches in people.', '비브라바', '2장의 날개를 고속으로 진동시켜서 내는 초음파는 격렬한 두통을 불러일으킨다.', 'Ground', 'Dragon', '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/409.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/329.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/409.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/409.png', '진동포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
