	(411, '0331', 'Cacnea', 335, 50, 85, 40, 85, 40, 35, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/cacnea', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/331.png', 'It lives in arid locations. Its yellow flowers bloom once a year.', '선인왕', '비가 적은 건조한 지역에 서식한다. 1년에 1번 노랑 꽃을 피운다.', 'Grass', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/411.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/331.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/411.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/411.png', '선인장포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(412, '0332', 'Cacturne', 475, 70, 115, 60, 115, 60, 55, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/cacturne', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/332.png', 'It lives in deserts. It becomes active at night when it hunts for prey exhausted from the desert’s heat.', '밤선인', '밤이 되면 활동을 시작한다. 사막의 뜨거움에 몹시 지친 먹이를 찾아내어 붙잡는다.', 'Grass', 'Dark', '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/412.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/332.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/412.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/412.png', '허수아비포켓몬', '120', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(413, '0333', 'Swablu', 310, 45, 40, 60, 40, 75, 50, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/swablu', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/333.png', 'It can’t relax if it or its surroundings are not clean. It wipes off dirt with its wings.', '파비코', '사람의 머리 위에 살짝 앉아 모자처럼 구는 것을 왠지 좋아한다.', 'Normal', 'Flying', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/413.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/333.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/413.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/413.png', '솜새포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(414, '0334', 'Altaria', 490, 75, 70, 90, 70, 105, 80, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/altaria', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/334.png', 'On sunny days, it flies freely through the sky and blends into the clouds. It sings in a beautiful soprano.', '파비코리', '넓은 하늘을 느긋하게 난다. 파비코리의 아름다운 콧노래를 들으면 황홀한 꿈을 꾸는 기분이다.', 'Dragon', 'Flying', '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/414.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/334.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/414.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/414.png', '허밍포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(415, '0334', 'Altaria (Mega Altaria)', 590, 75, 110, 110, 110, 105, 80, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/altaria', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/334.png', 'On sunny days, it flies freely through the sky and blends into the clouds. It sings in a beautiful soprano.', '메가파비코리', '넓은 하늘을 느긋하게 난다. 파비코리의 아름다운 콧노래를 들으면 황홀한 꿈을 꾸는 기분이다.', 'Dragon', 'Fairy', '9', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/415.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/334.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/415.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/415.png', '허밍포켓몬', '120', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(416, '0335', 'Zangoose', 458, 73, 115, 60, 60, 60, 90, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/zangoose', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/335.png', 'If it comes across a Seviper, its fur bristles and it assumes its battle pose. Its sharp claws are its best weapon.', '쟝고', '몇 대에 걸쳐서 세비퍼와 싸워왔다. 날카로운 발톱이 최대의 무기다.', 'Normal', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/416.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/335.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/416.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/416.png', '고양이족제비포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(417, '0336', 'Seviper', 458, 73, 100, 60, 100, 60, 65, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/seviper', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/336.png', 'Constant polishing makes the edge of the blade on its tail extremely sharp. It’s Zangoose’s archrival.', '세비퍼', '맹독이 배어 나오는 예리하고 잘 드는 꼬리로 재빠른 쟝고에게 맞선다.', 'Poison', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/417.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/336.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/417.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/417.png', '송곳뱀포켓몬', '200', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(418, '0337', 'Lunatone', 460, 90, 55, 65, 95, 85, 70, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/lunatone', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/337.png', 'It becomes active on nights with a full moon, so it is said to have some link to the lunar phases.', '루나톤', '보름달의 밤이 되면 활발하게 활동하기 때문에 달의 변화와 관계 있다고 전해진다.', 'Rock', 'Psychic', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/418.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/337.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/418.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/418.png', '별똥별포켓몬', '190', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(419, '0338', 'Solrock', 460, 90, 95, 85, 55, 65, 70, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/solrock', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/338.png', 'This new Pokémon species is rumored to be an avatar of the sun. The Pokémon gives off light while spinning.', '솔록', '태양 에너지가 파워의 근원이라서 낮에는 강하다. 회전하면 몸이 빛난다.', 'Rock', 'Psychic', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/419.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/338.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/419.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/419.png', '별똥별포켓몬', '75', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(420, '0339', 'Barboach', 288, 50, 48, 43, 46, 41, 60, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/barboach', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/339.png', 'It probes muddy riverbeds with its two long whiskers. A slimy film protects its body.', '미꾸리', '전신이 미끈미끈한 체액으로 덮여있기 때문에 잡아도 미끈하게 빠져나갈 수 있다.', 'Water', 'Ground', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/420.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/339.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/420.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/420.png', '수염물고기포켓몬', '190', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(421, '0340', 'Whiscash', 468, 110, 78, 73, 76, 71, 60, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/whiscash', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/340.png', 'Sighting Whiscash leaping from the water is believed to herald an earthquake.', '메깅', '큰 늪을 영역으로 한다. 적이 가까이 오면 크게 난동 부려서 큰 지진을 일으킨다.', 'Water', 'Ground', '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/421.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/340.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/421.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/421.png', '수염물고기포켓몬', '75', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(422, '0341', 'Corphish', 308, 43, 80, 65, 50, 35, 35, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/corphish', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/341.png', 'Its hardy vitality enables it to adapt to any environment. Its pincers will never release prey.', '가재군', '아무리 물이 더러운 강이라도 적응해서 번식하는 터프한 생명력의 소유자.', 'Water', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/422.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/341.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/422.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/422.png', '건달포켓몬', '190', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
