	(424, '0343', 'Baltoy', 300, 40, 40, 55, 40, 70, 55, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/baltoy', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/343.png', 'It moves by spinning on its foot. It is a rare Pokémon that was discovered in ancient ruins.', '오뚝군', '한 다리로 회전하면서 이동한다. 거꾸로 회전하는 오뚝군도 발견된다.', 'Ground', 'Psychic', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/424.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/343.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/424.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/424.png', '토우포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
