	(426, '0345', 'Lileep', 355, 66, 41, 77, 61, 87, 23, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/lileep', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/345.png', 'It lived on the seafloor 100 million years ago and was reanimated scientifically.', '릴링', '촉수를 꽃잎으로 보이게 하여 가까이 온 먹이를 잡는다. 1억 년 전에 멸종했다.', 'Rock', 'Grass', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/426.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/345.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/426.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/426.png', '바다나리포켓몬', '60', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(427, '0346', 'Cradily', 495, 86, 81, 97, 81, 107, 43, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/cradily', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/346.png', 'It lives in the shallows of warm seas. When the tide goes out, it digs up prey from beaches.', '릴리요', '따뜻한 바다의 얕은 곳에 있다. 바닷물이 빠지면 모래 해변에 숨어 있는 먹이를 파내어 먹는다.', 'Rock', 'Grass', '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/427.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/346.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/427.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/427.png', '바위단지포켓몬', '190', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(428, '0347', 'Anorith', 355, 45, 95, 50, 40, 50, 75, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/anorith', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/347.png', 'This Pokémon ancestor was reanimated from a fossil. It lived in the sea and hunted with its claws.', '아노딥스', '포켓몬의 조상 중 하나다. 해저의 바위 지대에 숨어 있는 먹잇감을 늘어나는 발톱으로 잡는다.', 'Rock', 'Bug', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/428.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/347.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/428.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/428.png', '고대새우포켓몬', '60', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(429, '0348', 'Armaldo', 495, 75, 125, 100, 70, 80, 45, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/armaldo', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/348.png', 'It went ashore after evolving. Its entire body is clad in a sturdy armor.', '아말도', '늘었다 줄었다 하는 거대한 손톱으로 먹이를 찔러서 잡는다. 튼튼한 갑옷을 몸에 두르고 있다.', 'Rock', 'Bug', '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/429.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/348.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/429.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/429.png', '갑주포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(430, '0349', 'Feebas', 200, 20, 15, 20, 10, 55, 80, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/feebas', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/349.png', 'It eats anything, so it can even live in polluted streams and lakes. No one pays any attention to it.', '빈티나', '무엇이든 먹기 때문에 더러운 강이나 호수에서도 살 수 있다. 누구도 주목하지 않는 포켓몬이다.', 'Water', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/430.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/349.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/430.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/430.png', '물고기포켓몬', '30', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
