	(437, '0353', 'Shuppet', 295, 44, 75, 35, 63, 33, 45, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/shuppet', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/353.png', 'It feeds on the dark emotions of sadness and hatred, which make it grow steadily stronger.', '어둠대신', '머리의 뿔로 원한과 질투의 감정을 먹는다고 전해진다. 한밤중에 활발하게 활동한다.', 'Ghost', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/437.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/353.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/437.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/437.png', '인형포켓몬', '90', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(438, '0354', 'Banette', 455, 64, 115, 65, 83, 63, 65, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/banette', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/354.png', 'Strong feelings of hatred turned a puppet into a Pokémon. If it opens its mouth, its cursed energy escapes.', '다크펫', '버려진 인형에 원념이 깃들어 포켓몬이 되었다. 자신을 버린 아이를 찾고 있다.', 'Ghost', NULL, '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/438.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/354.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/438.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/438.png', '봉제인형포켓몬', '255', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(439, '0354', 'Banette (Mega Banette)', 555, 64, 165, 75, 93, 83, 75, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/banette', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/354.png', 'Strong feelings of hatred turned a puppet into a Pokémon. If it opens its mouth, its cursed energy escapes.', '메가다크펫', '버려진 인형에 원념이 깃들어 포켓몬이 되었다. 자신을 버린 아이를 찾고 있다.', 'Ghost', NULL, '9', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/439.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/354.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/439.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/439.png', '봉제인형포켓몬', '145', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(440, '0355', 'Duskull', 295, 20, 40, 90, 30, 90, 25, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/duskull', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/355.png', 'I’ve heard that the children of Hisui all begin to behave once they’ve been told the story of how this Pokémon roams about before the witching hour to spirit away misbehaving children.', '해골몽 황혼의', '어디까지라도 먹이를 쫓아가는 집념이 강한 성격이지만 아침 해가 떠오르면 포기한다.', 'Ghost', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/440.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/355.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/440.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/440.png', '마중포켓몬', '130', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(441, '0356', 'Dusclops', 455, 40, 70, 130, 60, 130, 25, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/dusclops', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/356.png', 'There are rumors that peeking inside its bandage-wrapped body will cause one to get pulled in through the gaps between the bandages, never to return. I’ve been too scared to verify.', '미라몽', '몸 안에서 불타고 있는 도깨비불을 들여다보면 영혼을 빼앗겨버린다.', 'Ghost', NULL, '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/441.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/356.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/441.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/441.png', '손짓포켓몬', '30', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(442, '0357', 'Tropius', 460, 99, 68, 83, 72, 87, 51, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/tropius', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/357.png', 'Delicious fruits grew out from around its neck because it always ate the same kind of fruit.', '트로피우스', '커다란 잎으로 하늘을 날며 아이들에게 인기가 많은 목에 생기는 달콤한 과일을 나눠준다.', 'Grass', 'Flying', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/442.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/357.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/442.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/442.png', '후르츠포켓몬', '100', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(443, '0358', 'Chimecho', 455, 75, 50, 80, 95, 90, 65, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/chimecho', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/358.png', 'Can emit waves of air powerful enough to knock out prey taller than itself. I hypothesize that it amplifies the faint sound of wind within its body.', '치렁', '머리의 빨판으로 나뭇가지나 집의 처마 밑에 매달린다. 7종류의 음색을 나누어 쓴다.', 'Psychic', NULL, '2', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/443.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/358.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/443.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/443.png', '풍경포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(444, '0359', 'Absol', 465, 65, 130, 60, 75, 60, 75, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/absol', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/359.png', 'It senses coming disasters and appears before people only to warn them of impending danger.', '앱솔', '재해의 위험을 감지한다. 위험을 알리는 때에만 사람 앞에 나타난다고 한다.', 'Dark', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/444.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/359.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/444.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/444.png', '재난포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
