	(450, '0363', 'Spheal', 290, 70, 40, 50, 55, 50, 25, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/spheal', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/363.png', 'During the season when drift ice approaches the shore, Spheal prefers living on the ice—where fewer predators lurk—rather than the land. Its fur retains heat superbly and resists harsh cold.', '대굴레오', '아직 능숙하게 헤엄치지 못하고 구르는 쪽이 빨리 움직일 수 있다. 기쁘면 다 같이 손뼉을 친다.', 'Ice', 'Water', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/450.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/363.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/450.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/450.png', '손뼉포켓몬', '60', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(451, '0364', 'Sealeo', 410, 90, 60, 70, 75, 70, 45, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/sealeo', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/364.png', 'Its white whiskers are very sensitive. Sealeo will balance Spheal on the tip of its nose, checking its scent and its feel to be sure the Spheal is healthy.', '씨레오', '코의 신경이 민감하다. 처음 보는 것은 코로 문질러서 기억한다.', 'Ice', 'Water', '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/451.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/364.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/451.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/451.png', '공돌리기포켓몬', '120', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(452, '0365', 'Walrein', 530, 110, 80, 90, 95, 90, 65, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/walrein', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/365.png', 'Its thick tusks are strong enough to shatter drift ice. They have been known to break, but they will grow back by the next year. The Hisui region is well known for these broken tusks.', '씨카이저', '큰 얼음을 이빨로 부순다. 두꺼운 지방은 추위뿐만 아니라 상대의 공격도 이겨낸다.', 'Ice', 'Water', '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/452.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/365.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/452.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/452.png', '얼음깨기포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(453, '0366', 'Clamperl', 345, 35, 64, 85, 74, 55, 32, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/clamperl', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/366.png', 'It makes a single pearl during its lifetime. The pearl is said to amplify psychic power.', '진주몽', '일생에 한 번 진화할 때 사이코 파워를 증폭시키는 이상한 진주를 만든다.', 'Water', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/453.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/366.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/453.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/453.png', '두조개포켓몬', '140', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(454, '0367', 'Huntail', 485, 55, 104, 105, 94, 75, 52, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/huntail', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/367.png', 'It lives deep in the sea. With a tail shaped like a small fish, it attracts unsuspecting prey.', '헌테일', '빛이 닿지 않는 심해에 서식한다. 작은 생선처럼 생긴 꼬리를 빛내어 먹잇감을 유인한다.', 'Water', NULL, '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/454.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/367.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/454.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/454.png', '깊은바다포켓몬', '75', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(455, '0368', 'Gorebyss', 485, 55, 84, 105, 114, 75, 52, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/gorebyss', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/368.png', 'It lives at the bottom of the sea. In the springtime, its pink body turns more vivid for some reason.', '분홍장이', '헤엄치는 모습이 굉장히 우아하다. 가는 입으로 바위 틈새에 나 있는 해초를 먹는다.', 'Water', NULL, '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/455.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/368.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/455.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/455.png', '남해포켓몬', '200', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(456, '0369', 'Relicanth', 485, 100, 90, 130, 45, 65, 55, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/relicanth', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/369.png', 'This rare Pokémon was discovered during a deep-sea exploration. It has not changed in over 100 million years.', '시라칸', '1억 년 전부터 모습이 바뀌지 않은 포켓몬이다. 심해를 조사하던 중 발견되었다.', 'Water', 'Rock', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/456.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/369.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/456.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/456.png', '장수포켓몬', '190', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(457, '0370', 'Luvdisc', 330, 43, 30, 55, 40, 65, 97, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/luvdisc', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/370.png', 'During the spawning season, countless Luvdisc congregate at coral reefs, turning the waters pink.', '사랑동이', '따뜻한 바다에서 서식한다. 사랑동이를 발견한 커플은 영원한 사랑이 지속된다고 한다.', 'Water', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/457.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/370.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/457.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/457.png', '랑데부포켓몬', '75', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(458, '0371', 'Bagon', 300, 45, 75, 60, 40, 30, 50, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/bagon', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/371.png', 'Its belief that it will be able to fly one day is apparently the influence of information carried in its genes.', '아공이', '단련된 목 근육과 철과 같이 단단한 머리로 커다란 바위를 조각조각으로 부순다.', 'Dragon', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/458.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/371.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/458.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/458.png', '돌머리포켓몬', '25', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(459, '0372', 'Shelgon', 420, 65, 95, 100, 60, 50, 50, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/shelgon', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/372.png', 'Its armored body makes all attacks bounce off. The armor is too tough, however, making it heavy and somewhat sluggish.', '쉘곤', '단단한 껍질 안은 세포가 변화를 시작하고 있다. 진화하는 순간에 껍질이 벗겨져 떨어진다.', 'Dragon', NULL, '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/459.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/372.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/459.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/459.png', '인내포켓몬', '120', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(460, '0373', 'Salamence', 600, 95, 135, 80, 110, 80, 100, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/salamence', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/373.png', 'It becomes uncontrollable if it is enraged. It destroys everything with shredding claws and fire.', '보만다', '화나게 하면 어쩔 도리가 없다. 모든 것을 발톱으로 갈기갈기 찢고 불꽃으로 태워서 파괴한다.', 'Dragon', 'Flying', '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/460.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/373.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/460.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/460.png', '드래곤포켓몬', '60', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(461, '0373', 'Salamence (Mega Salamence)', 700, 95, 145, 130, 120, 90, 120, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/salamence', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/373.png', 'It becomes uncontrollable if it is enraged. It destroys everything with shredding claws and fire.', '메가보만다', '화나게 하면 어쩔 도리가 없다. 모든 것을 발톱으로 갈기갈기 찢고 불꽃으로 태워서 파괴한다.', 'Dragon', 'Flying', '9', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/461.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/373.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/461.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/461.png', '드래곤포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(462, '0374', 'Beldum', 300, 40, 55, 80, 35, 60, 30, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/beldum', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/374.png', 'They converse with one another by using magnetic pulses. In a swarm, they move in perfect unison.', '메탕', '몸에서 나오는 자력과 지상의 자력을 충돌시켜 하늘에 떠오른다.', 'Steel', 'Psychic', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/462.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/374.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/462.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/462.png', '철공포켓몬', '30', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(463, '0375', 'Metang', 420, 60, 75, 100, 55, 80, 50, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/metang', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/375.png', 'It is formed by two Beldum joining together. Its steel body won’t be scratched if it collides with a jet.', '메탕구', '2마리의 메탕이 합체했다. 강철의 몸은 제트기와 충돌해도 상처 입지 않는다.', 'Steel', 'Psychic', '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/463.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/375.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/463.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/463.png', '철발톱포켓몬', '30', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(464, '0376', 'Metagross', 600, 80, 135, 130, 95, 90, 70, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/metagross', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/376.png', 'Metang combined to form it. With four brains, it has the intelligence of a supercomputer.', '메타그로스', '4개의 뇌가 연결되어 슈퍼컴퓨터보다 대단한 계산으로 상대를 분석한다.', 'Steel', 'Psychic', '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/464.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/376.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/464.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/464.png', '무쇠다리포켓몬', '30', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
