	(466, '0377', 'Regirock', 580, 80, 100, 200, 50, 100, 50, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/regirock', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/377.png', 'Its entire body is made of rock. If any part chips off in battle, Regirock attaches rocks to repair itself.', '레지락', '전신이 바위로 되어 있다. 싸움으로 몸이 깨어져도 바위를 붙여서 치료해 버린다.', 'Rock', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/466.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/377.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/466.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/466.png', '바위산포켓몬', '30', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(467, '0378', 'Regice', 580, 80, 50, 100, 100, 200, 50, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/regice', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/378.png', 'Its body is made of ice from the ice age. It controls frigid air of −328 degrees Fahrenheit.', '레지아이스', '빙하 안에서 몇천 년이나 잠들어 있었다고 전해진다. 마그마로도 몸이 녹지 않는다.', 'Ice', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/467.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/378.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/467.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/467.png', '빙산포켓몬', '30', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(468, '0379', 'Registeel', 580, 80, 75, 150, 75, 150, 50, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/registeel', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/379.png', 'Tempered by pressure underground over tens of thousands of years, its body cannot be scratched.', '레지스틸', '몇만 년 동안 지하의 압력에 의해서 단련된 금속의 몸은 상처 하나 입지 않는다.', 'Steel', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/468.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/379.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/468.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/468.png', '쇠철포켓몬', '30', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
