	(479, '0385', 'Jirachi', 600, 100, 100, 100, 100, 100, 100, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/jirachi', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/385.png', 'It is said to wake up for just seven days every 1,000 years and use its power to grant any wish.', '지라치', '깨어났을 때 머리의 종이에 쓴 소원을 이루어준다고 먼 옛날부터 구전되었다.', 'Steel', 'Psychic', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/479.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/385.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/479.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/479.png', '희망사항포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
