	(481, '0386', 'Deoxys (Attack Forme)', 600, 50, 180, 20, 180, 20, 150, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/deoxys', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/10001.png', 'An alien virus that fell to earth on a meteorite underwent a DNA mutation to become this Pokémon.', '테오키스 어택폼', '슬픔의 괴로움과 즐거움의 소중함을 사람들에게 가르쳐 주었다. 감정의 신이라 불리고 있다.', 'Psychic', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/481.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/386-attack.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/481.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/481.png', '감정포켓몬', '3', 0, NULL, 46, NULL, NULL),
