	(484, '0387', 'Turtwig', 318, 55, 68, 64, 45, 55, 31, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/turtwig', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/387.png', 'This Pokémon becomes more energetic the more sunlight there is. The part resembling a shell is similar to silt and is slightly damp and warm to the touch.', '모부기', '태양의 빛을 쬐어 전신으로 광합성을 한다. 등껍질은 흙이 딱딱해진 것이다.', 'Grass', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/484.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/387.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/484.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/484.png', '어린잎포켓몬', '3', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(485, '0388', 'Grotle', 405, 75, 89, 85, 55, 65, 36, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/grotle', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/388.png', 'Appears where there is clean spring water. The fruit that grows on the shrubs on its shell is sweet, nutritious, and truly delicious.', '수풀부기', '숲 속의 물가에서 산다. 낮에는 숲 밖으로 나와서 등껍질의 나무에 빛을 쬔다.', 'Grass', NULL, '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/485.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/388.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/485.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/485.png', '나무숲포켓몬', '3', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(486, '0389', 'Torterra', 525, 95, 109, 105, 75, 85, 56, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/torterra', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/389.png', 'This remarkable, large-bodied Pokémon would serve beautifully as borrowed scenery for a garden, and its strength is peerless. Torterra roams the wilderness in search of clean water.', '토대부기', '오랜 옛날 사람들은 대지 밑에 거대한 토대부기가 있다고 공상했었다.', 'Grass', 'Ground', '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/486.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/389.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/486.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/486.png', '대륙포켓몬', '3', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(487, '0390', 'Chimchar', 309, 44, 58, 44, 58, 44, 61, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/chimchar', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/390.png', 'Full of vigor and always in high spirits. It was once known by the name “Lantern-Tail” and feared as some kind of apparition.', '불꽃숭이', '엉덩이의 불꽃은 배에서 만들어진 가스가 연료다. 비에 젖어도 꺼지지 않는다.', 'Fire', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/487.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/390.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/487.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/487.png', '꼬마원숭이포켓몬', '3', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(488, '0391', 'Monferno', 405, 64, 78, 52, 78, 52, 81, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/monferno', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/391.png', 'The deeper the blue on its face, the more powerful it will grow to become. It leaps about every which way and lands powerful blows against its opponents with the flame on its tail.', '파이숭이', '꼬리의 불꽃 세기를 잘 컨트롤하여 자신에게 맞는 거리를 두고 싸운다.', 'Fire', 'Fighting', '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/488.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/391.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/488.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/488.png', '개구쟁이포켓몬', '3', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(489, '0392', 'Infernape', 534, 76, 104, 71, 104, 71, 108, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/infernape', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/392.png', 'A tall, hardy Pokémon with a dazzling appearance. It shrouds itself in flame and battles as if engaged in dance—truly a sight to behold.', '초염몽', '머리에서 타오르는 불꽃처럼 과격한 성격의 포켓몬이다. 스피드는 누구에게도 지지 않는다.', 'Fire', 'Fighting', '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/489.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/392.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/489.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/489.png', '화염포켓몬', '30', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(490, '0393', 'Piplup', 314, 53, 51, 53, 61, 56, 40, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/piplup', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/393.png', 'Prefers cold climes and appears along coasts. It’s an adorable little thing—as cute as any child—but it’s also prideful, unwilling to accept handouts from people.', '팽도리', '신세를 지는 것을 싫어한다. 트레이너의 지시를 듣지 않아 친해지기 어렵다.', 'Water', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/490.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/393.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/490.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/490.png', '펭귄포켓몬', '3', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(491, '0394', 'Prinplup', 405, 64, 66, 68, 81, 76, 50, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/prinplup', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/394.png', 'It swims gracefully through the frigid sea and sings with a voice like the roaring tide. It has powerful, sturdy wings and dignity to match.', '팽태자', '무리를 만들지 않고 혼자 생활한다. 어떤 팽태자라도 자신이 제일 훌륭하다고 생각하는 듯하다.', 'Water', NULL, '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/491.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/394.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/491.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/491.png', '펭귄포켓몬', '3', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(492, '0395', 'Empoleon', 530, 84, 86, 88, 111, 101, 60, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/empoleon', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/395.png', 'Since ancient times, it has been revered by the people of Hisui, who call it the Master of the Waves. Its wings are a match for even master-crafted blades.', '엠페르트', '제트스키와 맞먹는 속도로 헤엄친다. 날개 가장자리는 날카롭게 유빙을 절단한다.', 'Water', 'Steel', '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/492.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/395.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/492.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/492.png', '황제포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(493, '0396', 'Starly', 245, 40, 55, 30, 30, 30, 60, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/starly', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/396.png', 'Because they are weak individually, they form groups. However, they bicker if the group grows too big.', '찌르꼬', '많은 수가 무리를 이루어 행동한다. 몸은 작지만 날개 치는 힘은 매우 강하다.', 'Normal', 'Flying', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/493.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/396.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/493.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/493.png', '찌르레기포켓몬', '3', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(494, '0397', 'Staravia', 340, 55, 75, 50, 40, 40, 80, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/staravia', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/397.png', 'They maintain huge flocks, although fierce scuffles break out between various flocks.', '찌르버드', '큰 그룹을 만들어 행동하는 습성이 있다. 그룹 간의 분쟁이 격하다.', 'Normal', 'Flying', '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/494.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/397.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/494.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/494.png', '찌르레기포켓몬', '3', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(495, '0398', 'Staraptor', 485, 85, 120, 70, 50, 60, 100, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/staraptor', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/398.png', 'It never stops attacking even if it is injured. It fusses over the shape of its comb.', '찌르호크', '날개와 발의 근육이 강해 작은 포켓몬을 붙잡은 채로 너끈히 날 수 있다.', 'Normal', 'Flying', '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/495.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/398.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/495.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/495.png', '맹금포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(496, '0399', 'Bidoof', 250, 59, 45, 40, 35, 40, 31, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/bidoof', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/399.png', 'Bidoof has an unsophisticated face and is rarely flustered by anything. There have been incidents involving Bidoof sauntering into villages and gnawing on the houses without a single care.', '비버니', '어떤 것에도 동요하지 않는 대담한 신경의 소유자다. 보기보다는 기민하게 활동한다.', 'Normal', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/496.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/399.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/496.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/496.png', '둥글쥐포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(497, '0400', 'Bibarel', 410, 79, 85, 60, 55, 60, 71, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/bibarel', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/400.png', 'Bibarel fur repels water and is also a fantastic material for heat retention. These Pokémon create dams on rivers to live in.', '비버통', '예리한 앞니로 갉아 얻은 나뭇가지나 뿌리를 쌓아 물가에 부지런히 보금자리를 만든다.', 'Normal', 'Water', '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/497.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/400.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/497.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/497.png', '비버포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(498, '0401', 'Kricketot', 194, 37, 25, 41, 25, 41, 25, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/kricketot', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/401.png', 'When its antennae hit each other, it sounds like the music of a xylophone.', '귀뚤뚜기', '더듬이를 서로 부딪쳐 내는 소리로 동료와 대화한다. 음색은 가을밤의 정취를 잘 나타낸다.', 'Bug', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/498.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/401.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/498.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/498.png', '귀뚜라미포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(499, '0402', 'Kricketune', 384, 77, 85, 51, 55, 51, 65, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/kricketune', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/402.png', 'There is a village that hosts a contest based on the amazingly variable cries of this Pokémon.', '귀뚤톡크', '울 때는 나이프 같은 팔을 가슴 앞에서 교차시킨다. 즉흥으로 멜로디를 만든다.', 'Bug', NULL, '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/499.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/402.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/499.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/499.png', '귀뚜라미포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(500, '0403', 'Shinx', 263, 45, 65, 34, 40, 34, 45, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/shinx', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/403.png', 'The extension and contraction of its muscles generates electricity. Its fur glows when it’s in trouble.', '꼬링크', '몸을 움직일 때마다 근육이 늘어났다 줄어들었다 하여 전기가 발생한다. 궁지에 몰리면 몸이 빛난다.', 'Electric', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/500.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/403.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/500.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/500.png', '섬광포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(501, '0404', 'Luxio', 363, 60, 85, 49, 60, 49, 60, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/luxio', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/404.png', 'By gathering their tails together, they collectively generate powerful electricity from their claws.', '럭시오', '발톱에서는 한 방에 적을 기절시킬 정도로 강한 전류가 흐른다. 여러 마리가 그룹을 이루어 산다.', 'Electric', NULL, '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/501.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/404.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/501.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/501.png', '전광포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(502, '0405', 'Luxray', 523, 80, 120, 79, 95, 79, 70, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/luxray', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/405.png', 'Luxray’s ability to see through objects comes in handy when it’s scouting for danger.', '렌트라', '눈동자가 금색으로 빛날 때 벽의 저편에 숨어 있는 먹이를 찾아낼 수 있다.', 'Electric', NULL, '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/502.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/405.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/502.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/502.png', '안광포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(503, '0406', 'Budew', 280, 40, 30, 35, 50, 70, 55, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/budew', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/406.png', 'When the sun’s light strengthens, the bud atop this Pokémon’s head opens. This is a sign to the people that the harsh winter is over, and the season of budding has begun.', '꼬몽울', '따뜻한 햇볕을 쬐면 봉오리를 펴서 꽃가루를 날린다. 깨끗한 물 가까이에 거처가 있다.', 'Grass', 'Poison', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/503.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/406.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/503.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/503.png', '꽃봉오리포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(504, '0407', 'Roserade', 515, 60, 70, 65, 125, 105, 90, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/roserade', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/407.png', 'Hidden within the bouquet on each hand are thorned whips loaded with virulent poison. Roserade moves gracefully as it corners its prey and mercilessly lashes them with its whips.', '로즈레이드', '달콤한 향기로 먹이를 유인해 양팔의 독 채찍을 사용하여 찌르거나 조여서 꼼짝 못하게 한다.', 'Grass', 'Poison', '2', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/504.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/407.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/504.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/504.png', '부케포켓몬', '255', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(505, '0408', 'Cranidos', 350, 67, 125, 40, 30, 30, 58, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/cranidos', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/408.png', 'An incredibly rare sight. They duel each other by ramming their heads together, and the resulting sound echoes throughout the area like the pealing of a bell.', '두개도스', '철구 같은 화석에서 부활한 고대 포켓몬이다. 박치기로 먹이를 꼼짝 못하게 한다.', 'Rock', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/505.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/408.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/505.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/505.png', '박치기포켓몬', '255', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(506, '0409', 'Rampardos', 495, 97, 165, 60, 65, 50, 58, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/rampardos', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/409.png', 'Very little is known about its biology. Can knock down massive trees by smashing its beautiful, pearl-like crown against them.', '램펄드', '어떤 충격에도 견딜 수 있는 두꺼운 두개골에 눌려 뇌가 자라지 않았다.', 'Rock', NULL, '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/506.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/409.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/506.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/506.png', '박치기포켓몬', '255', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(507, '0410', 'Shieldon', 350, 30, 42, 118, 42, 88, 30, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/shieldon', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/410.png', 'Much remains unknown about this Pokémon, as few have ever seen it. However, we know that it is calm and dislikes conflict, and it enjoys polishing its face against trees and rocks.', '방패톱스', '큰 나무의 줄기에 비벼서 단단한 얼굴을 닦는 습성이 있다. 뒤로부터의 공격에 약하다.', 'Rock', 'Steel', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/507.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/410.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/507.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/507.png', '실드포켓몬', '120', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(508, '0411', 'Bastiodon', 495, 60, 52, 168, 47, 138, 30, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/bastiodon', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/411.png', 'Its face is sturdy—as strong as diamond—and this hardness offers a very stable defense. Much about this species is still unknown, such as its natural habitat.', '바리톱스', '옆에 한 줄로 세우면 어떤 포켓몬이라도 돌파하지 못한다. 그렇게 하여 아기를 지켜냈다.', 'Rock', 'Steel', '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/508.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/411.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/508.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/508.png', '실드포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(509, '0412', 'Burmy (Plant Cloak)', 224, 40, 29, 45, 29, 45, 36, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/burmy', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/412.png', 'If its cloak is even slightly damaged, Burmy will immediately repair it with whatever is close at hand. The Pokémon within the cloak is scrawny and vulnerable to the cold.', '도롱충이 초목도롱', '차가운 초겨울 바람을 막으려고 작은 가지나 낙엽을 재료로 도롱이를 만들어 몸을 감싼다.', 'Bug', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/509.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/412.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/509.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/509.png', '도롱이벌레포켓몬', '255', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(510, '0412', 'Burmy (Sandy Cloak)', 224, 40, 29, 45, 29, 45, 36, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/burmy', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/412.png', 'If its cloak is even slightly damaged, Burmy will immediately repair it with whatever is close at hand. The Pokémon within the cloak is scrawny and vulnerable to the cold.', '도롱충이 모래땅도롱', '차가운 초겨울 바람을 막으려고 작은 가지나 낙엽을 재료로 도롱이를 만들어 몸을 감싼다.', 'Bug', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/510.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/412.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/510.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/510.png', '도롱이벌레포켓몬', '90', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(511, '0412', 'Burmy (Trash Cloak)', 224, 40, 29, 45, 29, 45, 36, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/burmy', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/412.png', 'If its cloak is even slightly damaged, Burmy will immediately repair it with whatever is close at hand. The Pokémon within the cloak is scrawny and vulnerable to the cold.', '도롱충이 슈레기도롱', '차가운 초겨울 바람을 막으려고 작은 가지나 낙엽을 재료로 도롱이를 만들어 몸을 감싼다.', 'Bug', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/511.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/412.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/511.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/511.png', '도롱이벌레포켓몬', '190', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(512, '0413', 'Wormadam (Plant Cloak)', 424, 60, 59, 85, 79, 105, 36, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/wormadam', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/413.png', 'The cloak—fashioned from plant matter—has merged with the Pokémon and is now part of the body, like fur or skin. I suspect this fusion is an effect of the energy involved in evolution.', '도롱마담 초목도롱', '가시가 잔뜩 박힌 꼬리를 상대에게 힘껏 쳐서 공격한다. 기질이 격한 포켓몬이다.', 'Bug', 'Grass', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/512.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/413.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/512.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/512.png', '가시원숭이포켓몬', '75', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(513, '0413', 'Wormadam (Sandy Cloak)', 424, 60, 79, 105, 59, 85, 36, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/wormadam', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/10004.png', 'The cloak—fashioned from plant matter—has merged with the Pokémon and is now part of the body, like fur or skin. I suspect this fusion is an effect of the energy involved in evolution.', '도롱마담 모래땅도롱', '지능이 높고 나무열매는 구운 뒤 먹는 습성이 있다. 사람 도와주기를 좋아한다.', 'Bug', 'Ground', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/513.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/413-sandy.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/513.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/513.png', '고온포켓몬', '190', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(514, '0413', 'Wormadam (Trash Cloak)', 424, 60, 69, 95, 69, 95, 36, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/wormadam', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/10005.png', 'The cloak—fashioned from plant matter—has merged with the Pokémon and is now part of the body, like fur or skin. I suspect this fusion is an effect of the energy involved in evolution.', '도롱마담 슈레기도롱', '몸속에서 태운 불꽃을 머리나 꼬리로 흩뿌려서 상대를 태운다.', 'Bug', 'Steel', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/514.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/413-trash.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/514.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/514.png', '불티포켓몬', '75', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(515, '0414', 'Mothim', 424, 70, 94, 50, 94, 50, 66, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/mothim', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/414.png', 'Scatters steel-colored scales as it flaps its wings. Despite being observed feeding primarily on the nectar of flowers, Mothim is not often seen around flower gardens.', '나메일', '꽃의 꿀을 매우 좋아한다. 세꿀버리가 모아둔 꿀을 가로채어 먹어 버린다.', 'Bug', 'Flying', '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/515.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/414.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/515.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/515.png', '나방포켓몬', '190', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(516, '0415', 'Combee', 244, 30, 30, 42, 30, 42, 70, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/combee', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/415.png', 'The trio is together from birth. It constantly gathers nectar from flowers to please Vespiquen.', '세꿀버리', '태어났을 때부터 3마리가 함께한다. 비퀸을 기쁘게 하기 위해 항상 꽃의 꿀을 모으고 있다.', 'Bug', 'Flying', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/516.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/415.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/516.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/516.png', '꼬마벌포켓몬', '75', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(517, '0416', 'Vespiquen', 474, 70, 80, 102, 80, 102, 40, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/vespiquen', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/416.png', 'It raises grubs in the holes in its body. It secretes pheromones to control Combee.', '비퀸', '몸통은 아기들의 둥지다. 여러 페로몬을 내어 새끼들을 자유롭게 조종한다.', 'Bug', 'Flying', '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/517.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/416.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/517.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/517.png', '벌집포켓몬', '190', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(518, '0417', 'Pachirisu', 405, 60, 45, 70, 45, 90, 95, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/pachirisu', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/417.png', 'A pair may be seen rubbing their cheek pouches together in an effort to share stored electricity.', '파치리스', '정전기가 모여 톡톡 튀는 솜털을 자신이 좋아하는 나무열매와 함께 나무줄기의 구멍에 숨긴다.', 'Electric', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/518.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/417.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/518.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/518.png', '전기다람쥐포켓몬', '75', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(519, '0418', 'Buizel', 330, 55, 65, 35, 60, 30, 85, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/buizel', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/418.png', 'It inflates its flotation sac, keeping its face above water in order to watch for prey movement.', '브이젤', '2개의 꼬리를 스크루처럼 돌려서 헤엄친다. 잠수할 때는 공기주머니가 오그라든다.', 'Water', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/519.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/418.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/519.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/519.png', '바다족제비포켓몬', '255', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(520, '0419', 'Floatzel', 495, 85, 105, 55, 85, 50, 115, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/floatzel', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/419.png', 'It is a common sight around fishing ports. It is known to rescue people and help fishers carry what they caught.', '플로젤', '발달한 부낭으로 뜬다. 물에 빠진 사람을 구조하는 것을 돕는 포켓몬이다.', 'Water', NULL, '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/520.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/419.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/520.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/520.png', '바다족제비포켓몬', '120', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(521, '0420', 'Cherubi', 275, 45, 35, 45, 62, 53, 35, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/cherubi', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/420.png', 'Once the fruit growing alongside the main body is large and plump, Cherubi will use the nutrients within to evolve. The fruit then detaches, becoming nourishment for other creatures.', '체리버', '햇빛으로 빨갛게 물들었다. 영양분이 흡수되어 작은 구슬이 시들면 곧 진화한다는 뜻이다.', 'Grass', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/521.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/420.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/521.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/521.png', '버찌포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(522, '0421', 'Cherrim', 450, 70, 60, 70, 87, 78, 85, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/cherrim', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/421.png', 'Motionless, save for the occasional quiver. A rich array of Pokémon can be found gathered around it, drawn by the scent exuded from Cherrim’s folded petals.', '체리꼬', '봉오리가 태양의 빛을 쬐어 꽃잎이 피면 활발하게 움직일 수 있게 된다.', 'Grass', NULL, '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/522.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/421.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/522.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/522.png', '벚꽃포켓몬', '190', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(523, '0422', 'Shellos', 325, 76, 48, 48, 57, 62, 34, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/shellos', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/422.png', 'Found in abundance on seashores bordering warm waters. Shellos are unexpectedly friendly and will crawl toward any person they see. Take care not to get coated in mucus!', '깝질무', '부드러운 몸을 강하게 누르면 보랏빛이 나는 정체불명의 액체가 배어 나오므로 주의가 필요하다.', 'Water', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/523.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/422.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/523.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/523.png', '갯민숭달팽이포켓몬', '75', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(524, '0423', 'Gastrodon', 475, 111, 83, 68, 92, 82, 39, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/gastrodon', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/423.png', 'Eats beach sand for nourishment. Should one Gastrodon encounter another of a different color, a fierce battle will inevitably ensue.', '트리토돈', '천적에게 습격당했을 때는 보라색 액체를 몸에서 내어 도망간다.', 'Water', 'Ground', '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/524.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/423.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/524.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/524.png', '갯민숭달팽이포켓몬', '255', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(525, '0424', 'Ambipom', 482, 75, 100, 66, 60, 66, 115, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/ambipom', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/424.png', 'To affirm their kinship, members of this species will form a ring by linking their newly doubled tails together. On rare occasions, humans have been accepted into such rings.', '겟핸보숭', '많은 무리로 행동한다. 꼬리를 맞잡아 원을 만든다. 우정의 표시인 듯하다.', 'Normal', NULL, '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/525.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/424.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/525.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/525.png', '긴꼬리포켓몬', '120', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(526, '0425', 'Drifloon', 348, 90, 50, 34, 60, 44, 70, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/drifloon', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/425.png', 'Because of the way it floats aimlessly, an old folktale calls it a “signpost for wandering spirits.”', '흔들풍손', '사람이나 포켓몬의 영혼이 한데 모여 태어난 포켓몬이다. 습기 많은 계절을 매우 좋아한다.', 'Ghost', 'Flying', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/526.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/425.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/526.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/526.png', '풍선포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(527, '0426', 'Drifblim', 498, 150, 80, 44, 90, 54, 80, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/drifblim', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/426.png', 'They carry people and Pokémon, but the wind can catch them, so there can’t be a fixed destination.', '둥실라이드', '사람이나 포켓몬을 태우고 날지만 바람에 떠밀려 다닐 뿐이므로 어디로 날아갈지 모른다.', 'Ghost', 'Flying', '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/527.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/426.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/527.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/527.png', '기구포켓몬', '190', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(528, '0427', 'Buneary', 350, 55, 66, 44, 44, 56, 85, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/buneary', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/427.png', 'My hypothesis as to why Buneary rolls up its ears is that its hearing is far too keen. I surmise that the Pokémon protects its hearing by limiting the sound that may enter its ears.', '이어롤', '항상 말고 있는 귀를 힘껏 늘리면 커다란 바위도 간단히 부순다.', 'Normal', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/528.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/427.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/528.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/528.png', '토끼포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(529, '0428', 'Lopunny', 480, 65, 76, 84, 54, 96, 105, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/lopunny', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/428.png', 'Its fur is warm and yet remarkably light. This Pokémon kicks as though it were a master of karate, driving back its opponents with ease.', '이어롭', '경계심이 아주 강하다. 위험을 감지하면 가뿐하게 뛰어올라 달아난다.', 'Normal', NULL, '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/529.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/428.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/529.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/529.png', '토끼포켓몬', '120', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(530, '0428', 'Lopunny (Mega Lopunny)', 580, 65, 136, 94, 54, 96, 135, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/lopunny', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/428.png', 'Its fur is warm and yet remarkably light. This Pokémon kicks as though it were a master of karate, driving back its opponents with ease.', '메가이어롭', '경계심이 아주 강하다. 위험을 감지하면 가뿐하게 뛰어올라 달아난다.', 'Normal', 'Fighting', '9', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/530.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/428.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/530.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/530.png', '토끼포켓몬', '60', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(531, '0429', 'Mismagius', 495, 60, 60, 60, 105, 105, 105, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/mismagius', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/429.png', 'Its cries sound like incantations to torment the foe. It appears where you least expect it.', '무우마직', '주문을 외는 포켓몬이다. 상대를 고통스럽게 하는 것뿐만 아니라 행복하게 하는 주문도 있다.', 'Ghost', NULL, '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/531.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/429.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/531.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/531.png', '매지컬포켓몬', '255', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(532, '0430', 'Honchkrow', 505, 100, 125, 52, 105, 52, 71, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/honchkrow', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/430.png', 'A single cry from this nocturnal Pokémon, and more than 100 of its Murkrow cronies will assemble.', '돈크로우', '돈크로우가 낮은 목소리로 울면 즉시 니로우가 모여들기에 밤을 부르는 자라고도 전해진다.', 'Dark', 'Flying', '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/532.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/430.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/532.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/532.png', '큰형님포켓몬', '180', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(533, '0431', 'Glameow', 310, 49, 55, 42, 42, 37, 85, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/glameow', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/431.png', 'Bewitches humans with its helical tail and piercing gaze. Its hidden claws are quite sharp as well, making this Pokémon an exceedingly tricky opponent if antagonized.', '나옹마', '마음에 안 들면 발톱을 세우지만 가끔 울음소리로 응석을 부리는 성격이 일부에게 매우 인기가 있다.', 'Normal', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/533.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/431.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/533.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/533.png', '내숭포켓몬', '90', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(534, '0432', 'Purugly', 452, 71, 82, 64, 64, 59, 112, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/purugly', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/432.png', 'Though impudent and difficult to tame, Purugly enjoys great popularity due to its fur, the beauty of which surpasses even velveteen.', '몬냥이', '다른 포켓몬의 거처라 할지라도 편안하면 눌러앉아 자신의 거처로 삼아버린다.', 'Normal', NULL, '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/534.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/432.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/534.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/534.png', '얼룩고양이포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(535, '0433', 'Chingling', 285, 45, 30, 50, 65, 50, 45, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/chingling', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/433.png', 'This Pokémon gave me an excruciating headache when it seemingly cried out without making a sound. Perhaps there are some sounds that the human ear is simply incapable of hearing.', '랑딸랑', '뛸 때마다 딸랑딸랑 소리를 낸다. 높은 주파수의 울음소리로 상대의 귀를 들리지 않게 한다.', 'Psychic', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/535.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/433.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/535.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/535.png', '방울포켓몬', '255', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(536, '0434', 'Stunky', 329, 63, 63, 47, 41, 41, 74, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/stunky', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/434.png', 'The foul fluid from its rear is so revolting that it can make people feel queasy up to a mile and a quarter away.', '스컹뿡', '엉덩이에서 뿜어지는 역한 분비액의 냄새는 범위 2km까지 멀리 퍼져 주변의 포켓몬이 자리를 뜨게 한다.', 'Poison', 'Dark', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/536.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/434.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/536.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/536.png', '스컹크포켓몬', '120', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(537, '0435', 'Skuntank', 479, 103, 93, 67, 71, 61, 84, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/skuntank', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/435.png', 'It attacks by spraying a repugnant fluid from its tail, but the stench dulls after a few squirts.', '스컹탱크', '꼬리 끝에서 심한 냄새가 나는 액체를 뿌려 공격한다. 사정거리는 50m 이상이다.', 'Poison', 'Dark', '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/537.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/435.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/537.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/537.png', '스컹크포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(538, '0436', 'Bronzor', 300, 57, 24, 86, 24, 86, 23, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/bronzor', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/436.png', 'They are found in ancient tombs. The patterns on their backs are said to be imbued with mysterious power.', '동미러', '동미러의 등 모양에는 신비한 힘이 깃들어 있다고 옛날 사람들은 믿고 있었다.', 'Steel', 'Psychic', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/538.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/436.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/538.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/538.png', '청동포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(539, '0437', 'Bronzong', 500, 67, 89, 116, 79, 116, 33, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/bronzong', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/437.png', 'It brought rains by opening portals to another world. It was revered as a bringer of plentiful harvests.', '동탁군', '비구름을 부르는 포켓몬으로 아주 옛날부터 떠받들어졌다. 가끔 땅에 묻혀 있다.', 'Steel', 'Psychic', '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/539.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/437.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/539.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/539.png', '동탁포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(540, '0438', 'Bonsly', 290, 50, 80, 95, 10, 45, 10, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/bonsly', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/438.png', 'From its eyes, it can expel excess moisture from its body. This liquid is similar in composition to human sweat.', '꼬지지', '건조한 장소를 좋아한다. 눈에서 물을 내어 몸의 수분을 조절한다.', 'Rock', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/540.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/438.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/540.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/540.png', '분재포켓몬', '255', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(541, '0439', 'Mime Jr.', 310, 20, 25, 45, 70, 90, 60, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/mime-jr', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/439.png', 'Known to turn up in bustling marketplaces now and again. It mimics people much as a child would, then watches how they react, eyes sparkling.', '흉내내', '두르쿤이 사는 숲은 초목이 잘 자란다. 두르쿤이 낙엽을 영양분으로 바꾸기 때문이다.', 'Psychic', 'Fairy', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/541.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/439.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/541.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/541.png', '따라하기포켓몬', '120', 0, NULL, 43, 111, 101),
	(542, '0440', 'Happiny', 220, 100, 5, 5, 15, 65, 30, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/happiny', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/440.png', 'It carefully carries a round, white rock that it thinks is an egg. It’s bothered by how curly its hair looks.', '핑복', '알을 닮은 둥근 돌을 배의 주머니에 넣고 있다. 좋아하는 상대에게 돌을 준다.', 'Normal', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/542.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/440.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/542.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/542.png', '소꿉놀이포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(543, '0441', 'Chatot', 411, 76, 65, 45, 92, 42, 91, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/chatot', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/441.png', 'A versatile performer skilled in the imitation of human speech. It is said that older, more experienced Chatot can even understand the meaning of the words they mimic.', '페라페', '상대와 같은 울음소리를 내서 동료라고 굳게 믿게 하여 습격당하지 않도록 하고 있다.', 'Normal', 'Flying', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/543.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/441.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/543.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/543.png', '음표포켓몬', '255', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(544, '0442', 'Spiritomb', 485, 50, 92, 108, 92, 108, 35, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/spiritomb', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/442.png', 'It was formed by uniting 108 spirits. It has been bound to the Odd Keystone to keep it from doing any mischief.', '화강돌', '108개의 영혼이 모여서 태어난 포켓몬이다. 쐐기돌의 균열과 연결되어 있다.', 'Ghost', 'Dark', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/544.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/442.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/544.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/544.png', '봉인포켓몬', '120', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(545, '0443', 'Gible', 300, 58, 70, 45, 40, 45, 42, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/gible', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/443.png', 'It nests in horizontal holes warmed by geothermal heat. Foes who get too close can expect to be pounced on and bitten.', '딥상어동', '지열로 데워진 구멍에서 지낸다. 적이 가까이 오면 구멍에서 뛰쳐나와 커다란 입으로 물어버린다.', 'Dragon', 'Ground', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/545.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/443.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/545.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/545.png', '육지상어포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(546, '0444', 'Gabite', 410, 68, 90, 65, 50, 55, 82, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/gabite', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/444.png', 'It loves sparkly things. It seeks treasures in caves and hoards the loot in its nest.', '한바이트', '반짝반짝 빛나는 것을 아주 좋아하기에 동굴 안에서 발견한 보물을 자신의 둥지에 모아둔다.', 'Dragon', 'Ground', '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/546.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/444.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/546.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/546.png', '동굴포켓몬', '190', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(547, '0445', 'Garchomp', 600, 108, 130, 95, 80, 85, 102, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/garchomp', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/445.png', 'The protuberances on its head serve as sensors. It can even detect distant prey.', '한카리아스', '몸을 접고 날개를 펼치면 마치 제트기 같다. 음속으로 날 수 있다.', 'Dragon', 'Ground', '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/547.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/445.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/547.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/547.png', '마하포켓몬', '75', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(548, '0445', 'Garchomp (Mega Garchomp)', 700, 108, 170, 115, 120, 95, 92, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/garchomp', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/445.png', 'The protuberances on its head serve as sensors. It can even detect distant prey.', '메가한카리아스', '몸을 접고 날개를 펼치면 마치 제트기 같다. 음속으로 날 수 있다.', 'Dragon', 'Ground', '9', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/548.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/445.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/548.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/548.png', '마하포켓몬', '190', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(549, '0446', 'Munchlax', 390, 135, 85, 40, 40, 85, 5, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/munchlax', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/446.png', 'Its robust stomach allows it to nonchalantly devour even rotted matter. It pays frequent visits to villages, seeking out food scraps intended for compost.', '먹고자', '몸의 긴 털 안쪽에 먹이를 숨기는 습성이 있다. 숨긴 것을 잊어버린다.', 'Normal', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/549.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/446.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/549.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/549.png', '대식가포켓몬', '75', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(550, '0447', 'Riolu', 285, 40, 70, 40, 35, 40, 60, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/riolu', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/447.png', 'It has the peculiar power of being able to see emotions, such as joy and rage, in the form of waves.', '리오르', '감정에 따라 모양이 변하는 파동을 서로 내어 동료끼리 커뮤니케이션을 취하고 있다.', 'Fighting', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/550.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/447.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/550.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/550.png', '파문포켓몬', '25', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(551, '0448', 'Lucario', 525, 70, 110, 70, 115, 70, 90, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/lucario', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/448.png', 'A well-trained one can use its aura to identify and take in the feelings of creatures over half a mile away.', '루카리오', '상대가 발하는 파동을 감지하여 생각이나 움직임을 간파할 수 있다.', 'Fighting', 'Steel', '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/551.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/448.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/551.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/551.png', '파동포켓몬', '180', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(552, '0448', 'Lucario (Mega Lucario)', 625, 70, 145, 88, 140, 70, 112, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/lucario', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/448.png', 'A well-trained one can use its aura to identify and take in the feelings of creatures over half a mile away.', '메가루카리오', '상대가 발하는 파동을 감지하여 생각이나 움직임을 간파할 수 있다.', 'Fighting', 'Steel', '9', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/552.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/448.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/552.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/552.png', '파동포켓몬', '90', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(553, '0449', 'Hippopotas', 330, 68, 72, 78, 38, 42, 32, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/hippopotas', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/449.png', 'It shrouds itself in sand to ward off germs. It travels easily through the sands of the desert.', '히포포타스', '건조한 땅에서 산다. 땀 대신 모래알을 몸에서 분비하는 포켓몬이다.', 'Ground', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/553.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/449.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/553.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/553.png', '하마포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(554, '0450', 'Hippowdon', 525, 108, 112, 118, 68, 72, 47, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/hippowdon', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/450.png', 'It brandishes its gaping mouth in a display of fearsome strength. It raises vast quantities of sand while attacking.', '하마돈', '크게 입을 벌려 자신의 강함을 어필한다. 대량의 모래를 일으켜 공격한다.', 'Ground', NULL, '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/554.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/450.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/554.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/554.png', '중량포켓몬', '120', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(555, '0451', 'Skorupi', 330, 40, 50, 90, 30, 55, 65, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/skorupi', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/451.png', 'Its claws are not only razor-sharp but poisonous, making Skorupi a highly dangerous Pokémon. It seems to be weakened by cold temperatures, however.', '스콜피', '꼬리의 발톱으로 먹이를 집어 독을 주입한다. 독이 퍼질 때까지 절대 놓치지 않는 집념이 있다.', 'Poison', 'Bug', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/555.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/451.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/555.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/555.png', '전갈포켓몬', '60', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(556, '0452', 'Drapion', 500, 70, 90, 110, 60, 75, 95, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/drapion', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/452.png', 'Has a brutish, ferocious temperament. With immense strength and a sturdy shell off which swords will bounce, it rampages about and wreaks havoc.', '드래피온', '자랑거리인 파워로 상대를 조각조각 낼 수 있으며 게다가 맹독으로 마무리한다.', 'Poison', 'Dark', '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/556.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/452.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/556.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/556.png', '요괴전갈포켓몬', '255', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(557, '0453', 'Croagunk', 300, 48, 61, 40, 61, 40, 50, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/croagunk', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/453.png', 'It rarely fights fairly, but that is strictly to ensure survival. It is popular as a mascot.', '삐딱구리', '볼에 독주머니를 가지고 있다. 상대의 틈을 노려 맹독이 배인 손가락을 꿰찌른다.', 'Poison', 'Fighting', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/557.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/453.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/557.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/557.png', '독설포켓몬', '190', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(558, '0454', 'Toxicroak', 490, 83, 106, 65, 86, 65, 85, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/toxicroak', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/454.png', 'It has a poison sac at its throat. When it croaks, the stored poison is churned for greater potency.', '독개굴', '목 주변에 독주머니를 지녔다. 목을 울리면 모여진 독이 잘 섞여져서 강력해진다.', 'Poison', 'Fighting', '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/558.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/454.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/558.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/558.png', '독설포켓몬', '75', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(559, '0455', 'Carnivine', 454, 74, 100, 72, 90, 72, 46, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/carnivine', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/455.png', 'Though this is a plant Pokémon, it has a gluttonous and unruly temperament. Carnivine attacks its prey with its cavernous maw wide open.', '무스틈니', '달콤한 냄새의 타액으로 먹이를 끌어들여 큰 턱으로 꿀꺽한다. 하루에 걸쳐 먹이를 먹는다.', 'Grass', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/559.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/455.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/559.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/559.png', '벌레잡이포켓몬', '180', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(560, '0456', 'Finneon', 330, 49, 49, 56, 49, 61, 66, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/finneon', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/456.png', 'It absorbs sunlight with the pink areas of its skin, which then shine. This appears to be a form of camouflage.', '형광어', '몸의 옆쪽에 있는 줄에 태양의 빛을 모아둘 수 있다. 밤이 되면 아름답게 빛난다.', 'Water', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/560.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/456.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/560.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/560.png', '비어포켓몬', '90', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(561, '0457', 'Lumineon', 460, 69, 69, 76, 69, 86, 91, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/lumineon', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/457.png', 'Lumineon swimming in the darkness of the deep sea look like stars shining in the night sky.', '네오라이트', '깊은 바다의 밑바닥에서 산다. 4개의 지느러미 무늬를 반짝거려 먹이를 끌어들인다.', 'Water', NULL, '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/561.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/457.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/561.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/561.png', '네온포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(562, '0458', 'Mantyke', 345, 45, 20, 50, 60, 120, 50, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/mantyke', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/458.png', 'Though ball-like in shape, this Pokémon is a proficient swimmer. I have discovered that if a Mantyke spends much time with schools of Remoraid, it will eventually achieve evolution.', '타만타', '등의 무늬는 지역에 따라 달라진다. 총어 무리에 섞여 헤엄치는 일이 많다.', 'Water', 'Flying', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/562.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/458.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/562.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/562.png', '연포켓몬', '190', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(563, '0459', 'Snover', 334, 60, 62, 50, 62, 60, 40, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/snover', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/459.png', 'Seemingly curious about people, they gather around footsteps they find on snowy mountains.', '눈쓰개', '추운 계절에는 산기슭까지 내려오지만 봄이 되면 눈이 남아 있는 산 정상으로 돌아간다.', 'Grass', 'Ice', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/563.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/459.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/563.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/563.png', '얼음나무포켓몬', '90', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(564, '0460', 'Abomasnow', 494, 90, 92, 75, 92, 85, 60, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/abomasnow', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/460.png', 'They appear when the snow flowers bloom. When the petals fall, they retreat to places unknown again.', '눈설왕', '블리자드를 발생시켜 주변 일대를 새하얗게 만든다. 별명은 아이스 몬스터다.', 'Grass', 'Ice', '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/564.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/460.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/564.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/564.png', '얼음나무포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(565, '0460', 'Abomasnow (Mega Abomasnow)', 594, 90, 132, 105, 132, 105, 30, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/abomasnow', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/460.png', 'They appear when the snow flowers bloom. When the petals fall, they retreat to places unknown again.', '메가눈설왕', '블리자드를 발생시켜 주변 일대를 새하얗게 만든다. 별명은 아이스 몬스터다.', 'Grass', 'Ice', '9', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/565.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/460.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/565.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/565.png', '얼음나무포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(566, '0461', 'Weavile', 510, 70, 120, 65, 45, 85, 125, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/weavile', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/461.png', 'They travel in groups of four or five, leaving signs for one another on trees and rocks. They bring down their prey with coordinated attacks.', '포푸니라', '눈이 많은 지방에 서식한다. 수목에 발톱으로 사인을 그려 동료에게 신호를 보낸다.', 'Dark', 'Ice', '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/566.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/461.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/566.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/566.png', '갈고리손톱포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(567, '0462', 'Magnezone', 535, 70, 70, 115, 130, 90, 60, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/magnezone', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/462.png', 'Exposure to a special magnetic field changed Magneton’s molecular structure, turning it into Magnezone.', '자포코일', '너무 강한 자력을 내어 자포코일끼리 끌어당겨 전혀 못 움직이기도 한다.', 'Electric', 'Steel', '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/567.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/462.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/567.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/567.png', '자기장포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(568, '0463', 'Lickilicky', 515, 110, 85, 95, 80, 95, 50, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/lickilicky', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/463.png', 'Its tongue can extend and contract freely, and it is capable of reaching lengths over 10 times Lickilicky’s height. Beware of the saliva, as it contains corrosive elements.', '내룸벨트', '타액에는 어떤 것도 녹이는 성분이 충분히 포함되어 있어 핥으면 언제까지나 마비된다.', 'Normal', NULL, '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/568.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/463.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/568.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/568.png', '핥기포켓몬', '190', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(569, '0464', 'Rhyperior', 535, 115, 140, 130, 55, 55, 40, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/rhyperior', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/464.png', 'This Pokémon evolved through use of a curious item. Its rocklike hide is composed of a mysterious substance and can withstand a blow from a masterwork sword with nary a scratch.', '거대코뿌리', '손바닥의 구멍에서 꼬마돌을 발사한다. 전신의 프로텍터는 화산의 분화도 견뎌낸다.', 'Ground', 'Rock', '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/569.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/464.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/569.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/569.png', '드릴포켓몬', '60', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(570, '0465', 'Tangrowth', 535, 100, 100, 125, 110, 50, 50, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/tangrowth', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/465.png', 'Draped with long vines, it resembles a shrub in appearance. It swings bundles of vines as though they were arms, wrapping them around prey to ensnare them.', '덩쿠림보', '식물의 덩굴로 이루어진 팔을 늘여서 먹이를 포박한다. 팔을 먹혀도 아무렇지도 않다.', 'Grass', NULL, '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/570.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/465.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/570.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/570.png', '넝쿨포켓몬', '75', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(571, '0466', 'Electivire', 540, 75, 123, 67, 95, 85, 95, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/electivire', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/466.png', 'Its evolution was induced by an unusual item, and its electrical output rises along with its heart rate. From its tails, it can unleash an electric current measuring 20,000 volts.', '에레키블', '전기를 가득 모으면 2개의 뿔 사이에서 세차게 푸르스름한 불티를 뿌린다.', 'Electric', NULL, '2', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/571.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/466.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/571.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/571.png', '뇌전포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(572, '0467', 'Magmortar', 540, 75, 95, 67, 125, 95, 83, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/magmortar', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/467.png', 'Use of a strange item caused this Pokémon to evolve. Fireballs launched from the ends of its tubelike arms are hot enough to melt an iron pot in an instant.', '마그마번', '팔 끝에서 섭씨 2000도의 불구슬을 발사한다. 화산의 분화구를 거처로 삼는다.', 'Fire', NULL, '2', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/572.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/467.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/572.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/572.png', '폭염포켓몬', '255', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(573, '0468', 'Togekiss', 545, 85, 50, 95, 120, 115, 80, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/togekiss', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/468.png', 'Scant few have ever sighted this Pokémon. After studying what literature remains, I am certain Togekiss will reveal itself when peace reigns in the land.', '토게키스', '다툼이 없는 평화로운 땅에 토게키스가 나타나 여러 가지 은총을 나눠줬다고 전해진다.', 'Fairy', 'Flying', '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/573.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/468.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/573.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/573.png', '축복포켓몬', '60', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(574, '0469', 'Yanmega', 515, 86, 76, 86, 116, 56, 95, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/yanmega', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/469.png', 'Extremely violent. When hunting, it wastes none of its energy, aiming only for prey’s most vulnerable spots. Any who manage to tame this Pokémon must be of incredible bravery.', '메가자리', '고속으로 날아서 스친 상대의 목을 한순간에 물어뜯는 싸움법을 선호한다.', 'Bug', 'Flying', '9', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/574.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/469.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/574.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/574.png', '깨비잠자리포켓몬', '200', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(575, '0470', 'Leafeon', 525, 65, 110, 130, 60, 65, 95, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/leafeon', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/470.png', 'The younger they are, the more they smell like fresh grass. With age, their fragrance takes on the odor of fallen leaves.', '리피아', '맑은 날에 잠든 리피아는 광합성을 해서 깨끗한 공기를 만들고 있다.', 'Grass', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/575.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/470.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/575.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/575.png', '심록포켓몬', '100', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(576, '0471', 'Glaceon', 525, 65, 60, 110, 130, 95, 65, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/glaceon', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/471.png', 'It lowers its body heat to freeze its fur. The hairs then become like needles it can fire.', '글레이시아', '체온을 컨트롤하는 것으로 주위의 공기를 얼려서 다이아몬드 더스트를 날린다.', 'Ice', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/576.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/471.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/576.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/576.png', '신설포켓몬', '50', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(577, '0472', 'Gliscor', 510, 75, 95, 125, 45, 75, 95, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/gliscor', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/472.png', 'It glides soundlessly on pitch-black wings and sinks sharp fangs into the throat of its prey. It takes on a look of satisfaction once it has entirely drained its prey of blood.', '글라이온', '꼬리로 나뭇가지에 매달려 먹이를 관찰한다. 틈을 봐서 상공에서 덮친다.', 'Ground', 'Flying', '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/577.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/472.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/577.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/577.png', '송곳니전갈포켓몬', '200', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(578, '0473', 'Mamoswine', 530, 110, 130, 80, 70, 60, 80, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/mamoswine', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/473.png', 'This species reached its zenith during the period known as the ice age. I suspect that Hisui’s frigid climate is in harmony with Mamoswine’s constitution, thus awakening hidden potential.', '맘모꾸리', '1만 년 전의 얼음 밑에서 발견된 적이 있을 정도로 오랜 옛날부터 있었던 포켓몬이다.', 'Ice', 'Ground', '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/578.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/473.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/578.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/578.png', '2개송곳니포켓몬', '100', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(579, '0474', 'Porygon-Z', 535, 85, 80, 70, 135, 75, 90, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/porygon-z', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/474.png', 'A curious item induced this evolution. The Pokémon’s offensive capabilities have greatly increased, but the strangeness of its behavior has magnified in equal measure. This worries me.', '폴리곤Z', '더욱 우수한 포켓몬으로 만들고자 프로그램을 추가했지만 어쩐지 괴상하게 행동하기 시작했다.', 'Normal', NULL, '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/579.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/474.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/579.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/579.png', '가상포켓몬', '50', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(580, '0475', 'Gallade', 518, 68, 125, 65, 65, 115, 80, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/gallade', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/475.png', 'Because it can sense what its foe is thinking, its attacks burst out first, fast, and fierce.', '엘레이드', '상대의 생각을 민감하게 포착하는 능력을 가졌기 때문에 먼저 공격할 수 있다.', 'Psychic', 'Fighting', '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/580.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/475.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/580.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/580.png', '검포켓몬', '190', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(581, '0475', 'Gallade (Mega Gallade)', 618, 68, 165, 95, 65, 115, 110, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/gallade', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/475.png', 'Because it can sense what its foe is thinking, its attacks burst out first, fast, and fierce.', '메가엘레이드', '상대의 생각을 민감하게 포착하는 능력을 가졌기 때문에 먼저 공격할 수 있다.', 'Psychic', 'Fighting', '9', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/581.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/475.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/581.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/581.png', '검포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(582, '0476', 'Probopass', 525, 60, 55, 145, 75, 150, 40, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/probopass', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/476.png', 'It is able to emit powerful magnetism, allowing it control over the iron sand that forms its luscious mustache. Using this iron sand, Probopass forms hard stones with which it smites its prey.', '대코파스', '전신에서 강한 자력을 발산하고 있다. 꼬마코파스라고 불리는 3개의 유닛을 조종한다.', 'Rock', 'Steel', '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/582.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/476.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/582.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/582.png', '콤파스포켓몬', '255', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(583, '0477', 'Dusknoir', 525, 45, 100, 135, 65, 135, 45, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/dusknoir', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/477.png', 'Comes to those whose lives have come to an end and escorts their souls to the afterlife. Known to mistakenly take the souls of those who yet have life left in them, albeit rarely.', '야느와르몽 황혼의', '탄력 있는 몸 안에 갈 곳 없는 영혼을 가두어 저승으로 데려간다고 전해진다.', 'Ghost', NULL, '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/583.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/477.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/583.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/583.png', '움켜쥠포켓몬', '120', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(584, '0478', 'Froslass', 480, 70, 80, 70, 80, 70, 110, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/froslass', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/478.png', 'It freezes prey by blowing its −58 degree Fahrenheit breath. It is said to then secretly display its prey.', '눈여아', '마이너스 50도의 냉기를 뿜어 상대를 얼려 버린다. 몸통 같은 부분은 실제로는 빈 공간이다.', 'Ice', 'Ghost', '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/584.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/478.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/584.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/584.png', '설국포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(585, '0479', 'Rotom', 440, 50, 50, 77, 95, 77, 91, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/rotom', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/479.png', 'Research continues on this Pokémon, which could be the power source of a unique motor.', '로토무', '특수한 모터를 움직이는 동력원으로서 긴 시간 동안 연구되었던 포켓몬이다.', 'Electric', 'Ghost', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/585.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/479.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/585.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/585.png', '플라스마포켓몬', '190', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(586, '0479', 'Rotom (Heat Rotom)', 520, 50, 65, 107, 105, 107, 86, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/rotom', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/479.png', 'Research continues on this Pokémon, which could be the power source of a unique motor.', '로토무', '특수한 모터를 움직이는 동력원으로서 긴 시간 동안 연구되었던 포켓몬이다.', 'Electric', 'Fire', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/586.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/479.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/586.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/586.png', '플라스마포켓몬', '75', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
