	(590, '0479', 'Rotom (Mow Rotom)', 520, 50, 65, 107, 105, 107, 86, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/rotom', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/479.png', 'Research continues on this Pokémon, which could be the power source of a unique motor.', '로토무', '특수한 모터를 움직이는 동력원으로서 긴 시간 동안 연구되었던 포켓몬이다.', 'Electric', 'Grass', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/590.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/479.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/590.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/590.png', '플라스마포켓몬', '190', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(591, '0480', 'Uxie', 580, 75, 75, 130, 75, 130, 95, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/uxie', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/480.png', 'A Pokémon feared but also respected for stealing away the memories of evildoers. I have found records that suggest Uxie holds dominion over knowledge.', '유크시', '지식의 신이라 불리고 있다. 눈을 마주친 사람의 기억을 지워 버리는 힘을 가지고 있다고 한다.', 'Psychic', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/591.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/480.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/591.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/591.png', '지식포켓몬', '75', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(592, '0481', 'Mesprit', 580, 80, 105, 105, 105, 105, 80, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/mesprit', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/481.png', 'Known as the Being of Emotion. In legend, this Pokémon was feared, as any who showed disrespect would have their emotions thrown into disarray.', '엠라이트', '슬픔의 괴로움과 즐거움의 소중함을 사람들에게 가르쳐 주었다. 감정의 신이라 불리고 있다.', 'Psychic', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/592.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/481.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/592.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/592.png', '감정포켓몬', '190', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(593, '0482', 'Azelf', 580, 75, 125, 70, 125, 70, 115, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/azelf', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/482.png', 'The dreaded Being of Willpower. Legends tell of this Pokémon manipulating the will of its adversaries and turning them into puppets of its own.', '아그놈', '의지의 신이라 불리고 있다. 호수의 밑바닥에서 계속 잠을 자며 세계의 균형을 지키고 있다.', 'Psychic', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/593.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/482.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/593.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/593.png', '의지포켓몬', '60', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(594, '0483', 'Dialga', 680, 100, 120, 120, 150, 100, 90, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/dialga', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/483.png', 'This Pokémon is revered as a deity in Hisuian legend. The birth of Dialga was what caused the vast river of time to begin flowing in our world.', '디아루가', '디아루가가 태어남으로써 시간이 움직이기 시작했다는 전설이 내려오는 포켓몬이다.', 'Steel', 'Dragon', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/594.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/483.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/594.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/594.png', '시간포켓몬', '75', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(595, '0483', 'Dialga (Origin Forme)', 680, 100, 100, 120, 150, 120, 90, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/dialga', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/483.png', 'This Pokémon is revered as a deity in Hisuian legend. The birth of Dialga was what caused the vast river of time to begin flowing in our world.', '디아루가 오리진폼', '디아루가가 태어남으로써 시간이 움직이기 시작했다는 전설이 내려오는 포켓몬이다.', 'Steel', 'Dragon', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/595.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/483.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/595.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/595.png', '시간포켓몬', '190', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(596, '0484', 'Palkia', 680, 90, 120, 100, 150, 120, 100, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/palkia', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/484.png', 'This Pokémon is feared as a deity in Hisuian legend. The birth of Palkia was what caused the walls of our world to disappear, creating a sky that spans for infinity.', '펄기아', '평행으로 늘어선 공간의 틈새에 산다고 전해진다. 신화에 등장하는 포켓몬이다.', 'Water', 'Dragon', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/596.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/484.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/596.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/596.png', '공간포켓몬', '75', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(597, '0484', 'Palkia (Origin Forme)', 680, 90, 100, 100, 150, 120, 120, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/palkia', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/484.png', 'This Pokémon is feared as a deity in Hisuian legend. The birth of Palkia was what caused the walls of our world to disappear, creating a sky that spans for infinity.', '펄기아 오리진폼', '평행으로 늘어선 공간의 틈새에 산다고 전해진다. 신화에 등장하는 포켓몬이다.', 'Water', 'Dragon', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/597.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/484.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/597.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/597.png', '공간포켓몬', '255', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(598, '0485', 'Heatran', 600, 91, 90, 106, 130, 106, 77, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/heatran', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/485.png', 'Stories tell of this Pokémon being birthed from the boiling magma within Mount Coronet. Its molten-steel body holds many mysteries.', '히드런', '화산의 동굴에서 서식한다. 십자형의 발톱을 박아서 벽이나 천장을 돌아다닌다.', 'Fire', 'Steel', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/598.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/485.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/598.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/598.png', '화구포켓몬', '90', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(599, '0486', 'Regigigas', 670, 110, 160, 110, 80, 110, 100, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/regigigas', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/486.png', 'According to legend, Regigigas pulled landmasses together and bound them with rope to create the continent of Hisui. Though I have my doubts, the story could well contain a shred of truth.', '레지기가스', '특수한 빙산이나 암석, 마그마에서 자신의 모습과 닮은 포켓몬을 만들었다고 전해진다.', 'Normal', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/599.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/486.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/599.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/599.png', '거대포켓몬', '130', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(600, '0487', 'Giratina (Altered Forme)', 680, 150, 100, 120, 100, 120, 90, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/giratina', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/487.png', 'There is one Hisuian verse that tells of a powerful light creating a deep shadow. I imagine that this deep shadow is Giratina.', '기라티나 어나더폼', '회전 방향을 바꿔서 동료에게 감정을 전한다. 화가 나면 회전이 빨라진다.', 'Ghost', 'Dragon', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/600.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/487.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/600.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/600.png', '톱니바퀴포켓몬', '60', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(601, '0487', 'Giratina (Origin Forme)', 680, 150, 120, 100, 120, 100, 90, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/giratina', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/10007.png', 'There is one Hisuian verse that tells of a powerful light creating a deep shadow. I imagine that this deep shadow is Giratina.', '기라티나 오리진폼', '빨간 코어가 달린 기어를 고속 회전시켜서 에너지를 급속 충전한다.', 'Ghost', 'Dragon', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/601.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/487-origin.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/601.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/601.png', '톱니바퀴포켓몬', '30', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(602, '0488', 'Cresselia', 580, 120, 70, 110, 75, 120, 85, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/cresselia', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/488.png', 'Cresselia is reminiscent of the crescent moon. It leaves a brilliant line of light in its wake as it flies across the night sky. I daresay it resembles the heavenly maiden who created the Milky Way.', '크레세리아', '비행할 때는 베일 같은 날개에서 빛나는 입자를 낸다. 초승달의 화신으로 불리고 있다.', 'Psychic', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/602.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/488.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/602.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/602.png', '초승달포켓몬', '190', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(603, '0489', 'Phione', 480, 80, 80, 80, 80, 80, 80, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/phione', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/489.png', 'Can be seen floating offshore during seasons when the seas are warm. Its azure body blends in with the ocean waters—logic suggests this is a defense mechanism against natural predators.', '피오네', '바다 온도가 높아지면 머리의 부낭을 부풀려서 해수면을 집단으로 떠돈다.', 'Water', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/603.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/489.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/603.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/603.png', '해양포켓몬', '60', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(604, '0490', 'Manaphy', 600, 100, 100, 100, 100, 100, 100, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/manaphy', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/490.png', 'Rumored to migrate across the oceans and visit Hisui’s coastal waters only rarely. Although Manaphy resembles Phione, it is also quite different. The relation between the two is unclear.', '마나피', '태어났을 때부터 가지고 있는 이상한 힘을 쓰면 어떤 포켓몬과도 마음이 서로 통하게 된다.', 'Water', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/604.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/490.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/604.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/604.png', '회유포켓몬', '30', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(605, '0491', 'Darkrai', 600, 70, 90, 90, 135, 90, 125, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/darkrai', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/491.png', 'On a moonless night, a strange incident occurred in which every one of a village’s inhabitants suffered nightmares. The villagers attested that Darkrai appeared before them in these nightmares.', '다크라이', '깊은 잠으로 끌어들이는 힘으로 사람과 포켓몬에게 악몽을 꾸게 해 자신의 영역에서 쫓아낸다.', 'Dark', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/605.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/491.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/605.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/605.png', '암흑포켓몬', '255', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(606, '0492', 'Shaymin (Land Forme)', 600, 100, 100, 100, 100, 100, 100, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/shaymin', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/492.png', 'When the turning of seasons brings the cruel winter to its end and the joyous people give thanks to the heavens, Shaymin appears and covers the withered land with flowers.', '쉐이미 랜드폼', '손끝을 점멸시켜서 대화하는 듯하나 그 패턴은 아직 해독하지 못했다.', 'Grass', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/606.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/492.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/606.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/606.png', '브레인포켓몬', '90', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(607, '0492', 'Shaymin (Sky Forme)', 600, 100, 103, 75, 120, 75, 127, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/shaymin', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/10006.png', 'When the turning of seasons brings the cruel winter to its end and the joyous people give thanks to the heavens, Shaymin appears and covers the withered land with flowers.', '쉐이미 스카이폼', '빛을 밝혀 길 안내를 하는 것처럼 가장하여 생명력을 빨아들이고 있다.', 'Grass', 'Flying', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/607.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/492-sky.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/607.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/607.png', '양초포켓몬', '190', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(608, '0493', 'Arceus', 720, 120, 120, 120, 120, 120, 120, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/arceus', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/493.png', 'It is the heavenly fount from which pours the light that shines across Hisui. Its luminance guides and protects all Pokémon. Hisuian mythology states that Arceus is the creator of all things.', '아르세우스', '알에서 모습을 나타내 모든 세계를 창조했다고 신오신화에서 묘사된다.', 'Normal', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/608.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/493.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/608.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/608.png', '창조포켓몬', '90', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(609, '0494', 'Victini', 600, 100, 100, 100, 100, 100, 100, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/victini', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/494.png', 'When it shares the infinite energy it creates, that being’s entire body will be overflowing with power.', '비크티니', '승리를 부르는 포켓몬이다. 비크티니와 함께하는 트레이너는 그 어떤 승부에서도 승리한다고 한다.', 'Psychic', 'Fire', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/609.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/494.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/609.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/609.png', '승리포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(610, '0495', 'Snivy', 308, 45, 45, 55, 45, 55, 63, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/snivy', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/495.png', 'They photosynthesize by bathing their tails in sunlight. When they are not feeling well, their tails droop.', '주리비얀', '태양의 빛을 받으면 평소보다 빨리 움직일 수 있다. 손보다 덩굴을 잘 사용한다.', 'Grass', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/610.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/495.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/610.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/610.png', '풀뱀포켓몬', '75', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(611, '0496', 'Servine', 413, 60, 60, 75, 60, 75, 83, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/servine', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/496.png', 'When it gets dirty, its leaves can’t be used in photosynthesis, so it always keeps itself clean.', '샤비', '땅을 미끄러지듯 달린다. 빠른 움직임으로 상대를 혼란시키고 덩굴채찍으로 꼼짝 못하게 한다.', 'Grass', NULL, '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/611.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/496.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/611.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/611.png', '풀뱀포켓몬', '60', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(612, '0497', 'Serperior', 528, 75, 75, 95, 75, 95, 113, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/serperior', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/497.png', 'It can stop its opponents’ movements with just a glare. It takes in solar energy and boosts it internally.', '샤로다', '샤로다의 고상한 눈동자로 쏘아보아도 태연할 정도로 강한 상대에게만 진정한 실력을 발휘한다.', 'Grass', NULL, '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/612.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/497.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/612.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/612.png', '로열포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(613, '0498', 'Tepig', 308, 65, 63, 45, 45, 45, 45, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/tepig', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/498.png', 'It loves to eat roasted berries, but sometimes it gets too excited and burns them to a crisp.', '뚜꾸리', '적의 공격을 가볍게 피하고 코로 불구슬을 쏘아댄다. 불꽃으로 나무열매를 구워 먹는다.', 'Fire', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/613.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/498.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/613.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/613.png', '불돼지포켓몬', '120', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(614, '0499', 'Pignite', 418, 90, 93, 55, 70, 55, 55, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/pignite', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/499.png', 'When its internal fire flares up, its movements grow sharper and faster. When in trouble, it emits smoke.', '차오꿀', '먹을수록 태울 것이 많아져 위 속의 불꽃이 강해지고 파워도 점점 넘치게 된다.', 'Fire', 'Fighting', '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/614.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/499.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/614.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/614.png', '불돼지포켓몬', '60', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(615, '0500', 'Emboar', 528, 110, 123, 65, 100, 65, 65, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/emboar', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/500.png', 'It has mastered fast and powerful fighting moves. It grows a beard of fire.', '염무왕', '턱의 화염으로 주먹을 불태워 불꽃펀치를 날린다. 동료애가 깊은 포켓몬이다.', 'Fire', 'Fighting', '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/615.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/500.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/615.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/615.png', '큰불돼지포켓몬', '25', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(616, '0501', 'Oshawott', 308, 55, 55, 45, 63, 45, 45, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/oshawott', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/501.png', 'This Pokémon from the Unova region uses the shell on its belly as a weapon to cut down its foes. Thus, I’ve conferred upon this shell the name “scalchop.”', '수댕이', '배에 생기는 가리비칼은 싸울 때뿐 아니라 딱딱한 나무열매를 쪼갤 때도 사용한다.', 'Water', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/616.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/501.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/616.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/616.png', '해달포켓몬', '200', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(617, '0502', 'Dewott', 413, 75, 75, 60, 83, 60, 60, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/dewott', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/502.png', 'Its exquisite double-scalchop technique is likely the result of daily training, and it can send even masters of the blade fleeing in defeat.', '쌍검자비', '물 흐르는 듯한 칼솜씨로 2개의 가리비칼을 사용하는 기술은 엄격한 수련을 통해 익힌 것이다.', 'Water', NULL, '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/617.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/502.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/617.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/617.png', '수행포켓몬', '75', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(618, '0503', 'Samurott', 528, 95, 100, 85, 108, 70, 70, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/samurott', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/503.png', 'One swing of the sword incorporated in its armor can fell an opponent. A simple glare from one of them quiets everybody.', '대검귀', '상대가 눈을 깜빡이는 동안에 앞다리에 붙어 있는 각검으로 상대를 베고 원래대로 되돌린다.', 'Water', NULL, '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/618.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/503.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/618.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/618.png', '관록포켓몬', '75', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(619, '0503', 'Samurott (Hisuian Samurott)', 528, 90, 108, 80, 100, 65, 85, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/samurott', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/503.png', 'One swing of the sword incorporated in its armor can fell an opponent. A simple glare from one of them quiets everybody.', '히스이 대검귀', '상대가 눈을 깜빡이는 동안에 앞다리에 붙어 있는 각검으로 상대를 베고 원래대로 되돌린다.', 'Water', 'Dark', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/619.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/503.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/619.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/619.png', '관록포켓몬', '180', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(620, '0504', 'Patrat', 255, 45, 55, 39, 35, 39, 42, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/patrat', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/504.png', 'Extremely cautious, one of them will always be on the lookout, but it won’t notice a foe coming from behind.', '보르쥐', '볼의 주머니에 먹이를 모아두고 며칠이고 망보기를 계속한다. 꼬리로 동료에게 신호한다.', 'Normal', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/620.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/504.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/620.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/620.png', '망보기포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(621, '0505', 'Watchog', 420, 60, 85, 69, 60, 69, 77, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/watchog', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/505.png', 'When they see an enemy, their tails stand high, and they spit the seeds of berries stored in their cheek pouches.', '보르그', '체내의 발광물질로 눈이나 몸을 빛나게 하여 습격해 온 상대를 풀이 죽게 만든다.', 'Normal', NULL, '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/621.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/505.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/621.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/621.png', '경계포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(622, '0506', 'Lillipup', 275, 45, 60, 45, 25, 45, 55, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/lillipup', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/506.png', 'This Pokémon is far brighter than the average child, and Lillipup won’t forget the love it receives or any abuse it suffers.', '요테리', '얼굴을 둘러싼 긴 털은 우수한 레이더다. 주위 상황을 민감히 살핀다.', 'Normal', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/622.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/506.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/622.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/622.png', '강아지포켓몬', '190', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(623, '0507', 'Herdier', 370, 65, 80, 65, 35, 65, 60, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/herdier', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/507.png', 'The black fur that covers this Pokémon’s body is dense and springy. Even sharp fangs bounce right off.', '하데리어', '트레이너를 도와주면서 다른 포켓몬을 돌보기도 하는 매우 충실한 포켓몬.', 'Normal', NULL, '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/623.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/507.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/623.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/623.png', '충견포켓몬', '90', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(624, '0508', 'Stoutland', 500, 85, 110, 90, 45, 90, 80, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/stoutland', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/508.png', 'Stoutland is immensely proud of its impressive moustache. It’s said that moustache length is what determines social standing among this species.', '바랜드 랜드폼', '눈보라로 길이 막힌 산에 들어가 조난된 사람을 구해준다. 긴 털이 추위를 막는다.', 'Normal', NULL, '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/624.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/508.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/624.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/624.png', '관대포켓몬', '120', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(625, '0509', 'Purrloin', 281, 41, 50, 37, 50, 37, 66, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/purrloin', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/509.png', 'Opponents that get drawn in by its adorable behavior come away with stinging scratches from its claws and stinging pride from its laughter.', '쌔비냥', '귀여운 행동으로 방심하게 한 후 그 틈에 지닌 물건을 빼앗아 간다. 화가 나면 손톱을 세워서 반격한다.', 'Dark', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/625.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/509.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/625.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/625.png', '성악포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(626, '0510', 'Liepard', 446, 64, 88, 50, 88, 50, 106, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/liepard', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/510.png', 'This stealthy Pokémon sneaks up behind prey without making any sound at all. It competes with Thievul for territory.', '레파르다스', '아름다운 스타일은 전신의 발달한 근육 덕분이다. 소리도 내지 않고 밤을 달린다.', 'Dark', NULL, '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/626.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/510.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/626.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/626.png', '냉혹포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(627, '0511', 'Pansage', 316, 50, 53, 48, 53, 48, 64, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/pansage', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/511.png', 'It’s good at finding berries and gathers them from all over. It’s kind enough to share them with friends.', '야나프', '기운이 없는 포켓몬에게 머리의 잎사귀를 나눠준다. 피로를 풀어주는 효과가 있다.', 'Grass', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/627.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/511.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/627.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/627.png', '풀원숭이포켓몬', '190', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(628, '0512', 'Simisage', 498, 75, 98, 63, 98, 63, 101, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/simisage', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/512.png', 'Ill tempered, it fights by swinging its barbed tail around wildly. The leaf growing on its head is very bitter.', '야나키', '가시가 잔뜩 박힌 꼬리를 상대에게 힘껏 쳐서 공격한다. 기질이 격한 포켓몬이다.', 'Grass', NULL, '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/628.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/512.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/628.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/628.png', '가시원숭이포켓몬', '60', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(629, '0513', 'Pansear', 316, 50, 53, 48, 53, 48, 64, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/pansear', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/513.png', 'This Pokémon lives in caves in volcanoes. The fire within the tuft on its head can reach 600 degrees Fahrenheit.', '바오프', '지능이 높고 나무열매는 구운 뒤 먹는 습성이 있다. 사람 도와주기를 좋아한다.', 'Fire', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/629.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/513.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/629.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/629.png', '고온포켓몬', '190', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(630, '0514', 'Simisear', 498, 75, 98, 63, 98, 63, 101, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/simisear', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/514.png', 'When it gets excited, embers rise from its head and tail and it gets hot. For some reason, it loves sweets.', '바오키', '몸속에서 태운 불꽃을 머리나 꼬리로 흩뿌려서 상대를 태운다.', 'Fire', NULL, '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/630.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/514.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/630.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/630.png', '불티포켓몬', '60', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(631, '0515', 'Panpour', 316, 50, 53, 48, 53, 48, 64, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/panpour', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/515.png', 'The water stored inside the tuft on its head is full of nutrients. Plants that receive its water grow large.', '앗차프', '머리 송아리에 모은 물은 영양 듬뿍. 꼬리를 사용해서 그 물을 초목에 뿌린다.', 'Water', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/631.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/515.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/631.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/631.png', '물뿌리기포켓몬', '90', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(632, '0516', 'Simipour', 498, 75, 98, 63, 98, 63, 101, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/simipour', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/516.png', 'It prefers places with clean water. When its tuft runs low, it replenishes it by siphoning up water with its tail.', '앗차키', '꼬리에서 발사하는 고압의 물은 콘크리트 벽도 파괴할 수 있는 위력을 지녔다.', 'Water', NULL, '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/632.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/516.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/632.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/632.png', '방수포켓몬', '90', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(633, '0517', 'Munna', 292, 76, 25, 45, 67, 55, 24, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/munna', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/517.png', 'It eats dreams and releases mist. The mist is pink when it’s eating a good dream, and black when it’s eating a nightmare.', '몽나', '나쁜 꿈에 시달리고 있는 포켓몬이나 사람 앞에 나타나 그 꿈을 먹어버리는 포켓몬.', 'Psychic', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/633.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/517.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/633.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/633.png', '꿈먹기포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(634, '0518', 'Musharna', 487, 116, 55, 85, 107, 95, 29, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/musharna', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/518.png', 'It drowses and dreams all the time. It’s best to leave it be if it’s just woken up, as it’s a terrible grump when freshly roused from sleep.', '몽얌나', '이마에서 나오는 연기 속에는 사람이나 포켓몬이 꾼 꿈이 많이 모여 있다.', 'Psychic', NULL, '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/634.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/518.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/634.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/634.png', '꿈결포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(635, '0519', 'Pidove', 264, 50, 55, 50, 36, 30, 43, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/pidove', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/519.png', 'It’s forgetful and not very bright, but many Trainers love it anyway for its friendliness and sincerity.', '콩둘기', '매우 건망증이 심한 포켓몬으로 트레이너에게 명령을 받았어도 새로운 명령을 기다리고 있다.', 'Normal', 'Flying', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/635.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/519.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/635.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/635.png', '아기비둘기포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(636, '0520', 'Tranquill', 358, 62, 77, 62, 50, 42, 65, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/tranquill', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/520.png', 'These bright Pokémon have acute memories. Apparently delivery workers often choose them as their partners.', '유토브', '유토브가 사는 숲 속에는 싸움이 없는 평화로운 나라가 있다고 믿어진다.', 'Normal', 'Flying', '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/636.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/520.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/636.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/636.png', '들비둘기포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(637, '0521', 'Unfezant', 488, 80, 115, 80, 65, 55, 93, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/unfezant', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/521.png', 'Males have plumage on their heads. They will never let themselves feel close to anyone other than their Trainers.', '켄호로우', '수컷은 머리의 장식을 흔들어서 상대를 위협한다. 암컷의 비행 능력은 수컷을 뛰어넘는다.', 'Normal', 'Flying', '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/637.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/521.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/637.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/637.png', '프라이드포켓몬', '15', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(638, '0522', 'Blitzle', 295, 45, 60, 32, 50, 32, 76, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/blitzle', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/522.png', 'Its mane shines when it discharges electricity. They use the frequency and rhythm of these flashes to communicate.', '줄뮤마', '번개 구름이 하늘을 뒤덮으면 나타난다. 갈기로 번개를 붙잡아 전기를 모은다.', 'Electric', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/638.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/522.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/638.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/638.png', '하전포켓몬', '3', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(639, '0523', 'Zebstrika', 497, 75, 100, 63, 80, 63, 116, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/zebstrika', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/523.png', 'They have lightning-like movements. When Zebstrika run at full speed, the sound of thunder reverberates.', '제브라이카', '격렬한 기질의 소유자. 날뛰면 갈기에서 번개를 사방팔방으로 방전한다.', 'Electric', NULL, '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/639.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/523.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/639.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/639.png', '뇌전포켓몬', '3', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(640, '0524', 'Roggenrola', 280, 55, 75, 85, 25, 25, 15, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/roggenrola', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/524.png', 'When it detects a noise, it starts to move. The energy core inside it makes this Pokémon slightly warm to the touch.', '단굴', '육각형 귀를 가지고 있다. 땅속 깊은 곳에서 압축된 몸은 철 못지않게 단단하다.', 'Rock', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/640.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/524.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/640.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/640.png', '맨틀포켓몬', '3', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(641, '0525', 'Boldore', 390, 70, 105, 105, 50, 40, 20, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/boldore', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/525.png', 'It relies on sound in order to monitor what’s in its vicinity. When angered, it will attack without ever changing the direction it’s facing.', '암트르', '체내에서 처리되지 못하고 빠져나온 에너지가 덩어리져서 주황색 결정이 되었다.', 'Rock', NULL, '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/641.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/525.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/641.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/641.png', '광석포켓몬', '3', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(642, '0526', 'Gigalith', 515, 85, 135, 130, 60, 80, 25, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/gigalith', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/526.png', 'Although its energy blasts can blow away a dump truck, they have a limitation— they can only be fired when the sun is out.', '기가이어스', '거두어들인 태양광선을 에너지 코어로 반응시켜 빛의 구슬로 쏘아낸다.', 'Rock', NULL, '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/642.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/526.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/642.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/642.png', '고압포켓몬', '3', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(643, '0527', 'Woobat', 323, 65, 45, 43, 55, 43, 72, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/woobat', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/527.png', 'It emits ultrasonic waves as it flutters about, searching for its prey—bug Pokémon.', '또르박쥐', '어두운 숲이나 동굴에서 산다. 콧구멍에서 초음파를 쏘아 주변의 모습을 살핀다.', 'Psychic', 'Flying', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/643.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/527.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/643.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/643.png', '박쥐포켓몬', '3', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(644, '0528', 'Swoobat', 425, 67, 57, 55, 77, 55, 114, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/swoobat', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/528.png', 'The auspicious shape of this Pokémon’s nose apparently led some regions to consider Swoobat a symbol of good luck.', '맘박쥐', '콘크리트도 부술 정도로 강한 초음파를 낼 때 꼬리가 심하게 흔들린다.', 'Psychic', 'Flying', '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/644.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/528.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/644.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/644.png', '구애포켓몬', '3', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(645, '0529', 'Drilbur', 328, 60, 85, 40, 30, 45, 68, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/drilbur', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/529.png', 'It’s a digger, using its claws to burrow through the ground. It causes damage to vegetable crops, so many farmers have little love for it.', '두더류', '양손의 손톱을 서로 겹치고 몸을 고속 회전시키면서 맹렬한 속도로 땅속을 헤쳐나간다.', 'Ground', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/645.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/529.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/645.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/645.png', '두더지포켓몬', '3', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(646, '0530', 'Excadrill', 508, 110, 135, 60, 50, 65, 88, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/excadrill', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/530.png', 'Known as the Drill King, this Pokémon can tunnel through the terrain at speeds of over 90 mph.', '몰드류', '강철로 진화한 드릴은 철판을 뚫는 파괴력을 가졌다. 터널 공사에서 크게 활약한다.', 'Ground', 'Steel', '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/646.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/530.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/646.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/646.png', '땅밑포켓몬', '3', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(647, '0531', 'Audino', 445, 103, 60, 86, 60, 86, 50, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/audino', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/531.png', 'This Pokémon has a kind heart. By touching with its feelers, Audino can gauge other creatures’ feelings and physical conditions.', '다부니', '귀의 더듬이로 상대의 컨디션이나 알에서 포켓몬이 언제 나올지도 알 수 있다.', 'Normal', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/647.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/531.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/647.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/647.png', '히어링포켓몬', '3', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(648, '0531', 'Audino (Mega Audino)', 545, 103, 60, 126, 80, 126, 50, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/audino', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/531.png', 'This Pokémon has a kind heart. By touching with its feelers, Audino can gauge other creatures’ feelings and physical conditions.', '메가다부니', '귀의 더듬이로 상대의 컨디션이나 알에서 포켓몬이 언제 나올지도 알 수 있다.', 'Normal', 'Fairy', '9', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/648.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/531.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/648.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/648.png', '히어링포켓몬', '3', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(649, '0532', 'Timburr', 305, 75, 80, 55, 25, 35, 35, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/timburr', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/532.png', 'Timburr that have started carrying logs that are about three times their size are nearly ready to evolve.', '으랏차', '항상 각목을 끼고 있다. 건설 현장에 나타나 공사를 도와주는 포켓몬이다.', 'Fighting', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/649.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/532.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/649.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/649.png', '근골포켓몬', '3', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(650, '0533', 'Gurdurr', 405, 85, 105, 85, 40, 50, 40, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/gurdurr', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/533.png', 'Gurdurr excels at demolition—construction is not its forte. In any case, there’s skill in the way this Pokémon wields its metal beam.', '토쇠골', '단련된 근육의 소유자. 철골을 능숙하게 조종하여 집을 해체해준다.', 'Fighting', NULL, '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/650.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/533.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/650.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/650.png', '근골포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(651, '0534', 'Conkeldurr', 505, 105, 140, 95, 55, 65, 45, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/conkeldurr', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/534.png', 'When going all out, this Pokémon throws aside its concrete pillars and leaps at opponents to pummel them with its fists.', '노보청', '콘크리트를 만드는 기술은 2000년 전에 노보청에게 배운 것이라고 여겨지고 있다.', 'Fighting', NULL, '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/651.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/534.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/651.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/651.png', '근골포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(652, '0535', 'Tympole', 294, 50, 50, 40, 50, 40, 64, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/tympole', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/535.png', 'It uses sound waves to communicate with others of its kind. People and other Pokémon species can’t hear its cries of warning.', '동챙이', '볼의 진동막을 떨어 사람에게는 들리지 않는 음파를 내어 동료에게 위험을 전달한다.', 'Water', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/652.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/535.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/652.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/652.png', '올챙이포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(653, '0536', 'Palpitoad', 384, 75, 65, 55, 65, 55, 69, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/palpitoad', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/536.png', 'On occasion, their cries are sublimely pleasing to the ear. Palpitoad with larger lumps on their bodies can sing with a wider range of sounds.', '두까비', '머리의 혹을 진동시키면 물속에 파동이 일어나며 땅마저 지진처럼 흔들린다.', 'Water', 'Ground', '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/653.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/536.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/653.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/653.png', '진동포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(654, '0537', 'Seismitoad', 509, 105, 95, 75, 85, 75, 74, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/seismitoad', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/537.png', 'This Pokémon is popular among the elderly, who say the vibrations of its lumps are great for massages.', '두빅굴', '주먹의 혹을 진동시켜 펀치의 위력을 배가시킨다. 일격에 큰 바위를 부스러뜨린다.', 'Water', 'Ground', '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/654.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/537.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/654.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/654.png', '진동포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(655, '0538', 'Throh', 465, 120, 100, 85, 30, 85, 45, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/throh', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/538.png', 'They train in groups of five. Any member that can’t keep up will discard its belt and leave the group.', '던지미', '끈을 매면 파워가 올라간다. 야생 던지미는 덩굴풀을 엮어 자신의 띠를 만든다.', 'Fighting', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/655.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/538.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/655.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/655.png', '유도포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(656, '0539', 'Sawk', 465, 75, 125, 75, 30, 75, 85, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/sawk', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/539.png', 'The karate chops of a Sawk that’s trained itself to the limit can cleave the ocean itself.', '타격귀', '최강의 태권당수를 목표로 산속에 틀어박혀 잠도 없이 수행한다.', 'Fighting', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/656.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/539.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/656.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/656.png', '태권도포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(657, '0540', 'Sewaddle', 310, 45, 53, 70, 40, 60, 42, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/sewaddle', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/540.png', 'Since this Pokémon makes its own clothes out of leaves, it is a popular mascot for fashion designers.', '두르보', '잎사귀를 물어뜯어 입에서 뱉어낸 점착실로 꿰맨다. 스스로 옷을 만드는 포켓몬이다.', 'Bug', 'Grass', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/657.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/540.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/657.png', NULL, '재봉포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(658, '0541', 'Swadloon', 380, 55, 63, 90, 50, 80, 42, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/swadloon', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/541.png', 'It protects itself from the cold by wrapping up in leaves. It stays on the move, eating leaves in forests.', '두르쿤', '두르쿤이 사는 숲은 초목이 잘 자란다. 두르쿤이 낙엽을 영양분으로 바꾸기 때문이다.', 'Bug', 'Grass', '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/658.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/541.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/658.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/658.png', '잎숨기포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(659, '0542', 'Leavanny', 500, 75, 103, 80, 70, 80, 92, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/leavanny', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/542.png', 'It keeps its eggs warm with heat from fermenting leaves. It also uses leaves to make warm wrappings for Sewaddle.', '모아머', '어린 포켓몬을 보면 입에서 내뿜는 점착실로 잎사귀의 옷을 지어 준다.', 'Bug', 'Grass', '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/659.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/542.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/659.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/659.png', '육아포켓몬', '255', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(660, '0543', 'Venipede', 260, 30, 45, 59, 30, 39, 57, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/venipede', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/543.png', 'Its fangs are highly venomous. If this Pokémon finds prey it thinks it can eat, it leaps for them without any thought of how things might turn out.', '마디네', '머리와 꼬리의 더듬이로 주변 상황을 살핀다. 성격이 매우 난폭하다.', 'Bug', 'Poison', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/660.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/543.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/660.png', NULL, '지네포켓몬', '127', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(661, '0544', 'Whirlipede', 360, 40, 55, 99, 40, 79, 47, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/whirlipede', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/544.png', 'Whirlipede protects itself with a sturdy shell and poisonous spikes while it stores up the energy it’ll need for evolution.', '휠구', '단단한 껍질로 보호되고 있다. 타이어처럼 회전하여 상대에게 격렬히 몸통박치기를 날린다.', 'Bug', 'Poison', '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/661.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/544.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/661.png', NULL, '눈썹지네포켓몬', '255', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(662, '0545', 'Scolipede', 485, 60, 100, 89, 55, 69, 112, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/scolipede', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/545.png', 'Scolipede engage in fierce territorial battles with Centiskorch. At the end of one of these battles, the victor makes a meal of the loser.', '펜드라', '먹이를 목의 가시에 끼워 넣어 움직이지 못하게 한 후 맹독을 퍼뜨려 마무리한다.', 'Bug', 'Poison', '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/662.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/545.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/662.png', NULL, '메가지네포켓몬', '120', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(663, '0546', 'Cottonee', 280, 40, 27, 60, 37, 50, 66, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/cottonee', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/546.png', 'Weaving together the cotton of both Cottonee and Eldegoss produces exquisite cloth that’s highly prized by many luxury brands.', '소미안', '공격당하면 몸에서 솜을 날린다. 상대가 솜을 소미안으로 착각하고 있는 동안 도망친다.', 'Grass', 'Fairy', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/663.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/546.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/663.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/663.png', '솜뭉치포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(664, '0547', 'Whimsicott', 480, 60, 67, 85, 77, 75, 116, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/whimsicott', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/547.png', 'As long as this Pokémon bathes in sunlight, its cotton keeps growing. If too much cotton fluff builds up, Whimsicott tears it off and scatters it.', '엘풍', '회오리바람과 함께 나타나 집 안의 가구를 움직이거나 솜을 남기는 장난을 친다.', 'Grass', 'Fairy', '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/664.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/547.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/664.png', NULL, '바람숨기포켓몬', '255', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(665, '0548', 'Petilil', 280, 45, 35, 50, 70, 50, 30, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/petilil', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/548.png', 'If the leaves on its head are pruned with regularity, this Pokémon can be grown into a fine plump shape.', '치릴리', '머리의 잎사귀를 갉아먹으면 매우 쓰지만 지친 몸을 회복시켜주는 효과가 있다.', 'Grass', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/665.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/548.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/665.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/665.png', '뿌리포켓몬', '120', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(666, '0549', 'Lilligant', 480, 70, 60, 75, 110, 75, 90, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/lilligant', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/549.png', 'No matter how much time and money is spent raising it, its flowers are the most beautiful when they bloom in the wild.', '드레디어', '머리에 있는 꽃 장식의 향기에는 긴장을 풀어 주는 효과가 있다. 자주 손질하지 않으면 시들어 버린다.', 'Grass', NULL, '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/666.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/549.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/666.png', NULL, '꽃장식포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(667, '0549', 'Lilligant (Hisuian Lilligant)', 480, 70, 105, 75, 50, 75, 105, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/lilligant', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/549.png', 'No matter how much time and money is spent raising it, its flowers are the most beautiful when they bloom in the wild.', '히스이 드레디어', '머리에 있는 꽃 장식의 향기에는 긴장을 풀어 주는 효과가 있다. 자주 손질하지 않으면 시들어 버린다.', 'Grass', 'Fighting', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/667.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/549.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/667.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/667.png', '꽃장식포켓몬', '220', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(668, '0550', 'Basculin (Red-Striped Form)', 460, 70, 92, 65, 80, 55, 98, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/basculin', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/550.png', 'Red and blue Basculin usually do not get along, but sometimes members of one school mingle with the other’s school.', '배쓰나이 적근', '무리 중에서 가장 커다란 불꽃 갈기를 지닌 수컷이 리더로서 동료들을 이끈다.', 'Water', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/668.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/550.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/668.png', NULL, '임금포켓몬', '65', 0, NULL, 120, 91, 104),
	(669, '0550', 'Basculin (Blue-Striped Form)', 460, 70, 92, 65, 80, 55, 98, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/basculin', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/10016.png', 'Red and blue Basculin usually do not get along, but sometimes members of one school mingle with the other’s school.', '배쓰나이 청근', '꽃의 숨겨진 힘을 끌어내어 자유자재로 조종한다. 플라베베가 지닌 꽃은 이미 몸의 일부다.', 'Water', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/669.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/550-blue-striped.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/669.png', NULL, '한송이포켓몬', '225', 0, NULL, 69, 91, 104),
	(670, '0550', 'Basculin (White-Striped Form)', 460, 70, 92, 65, 80, 55, 98, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/basculin', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/10247.png', 'Red and blue Basculin usually do not get along, but sometimes members of one school mingle with the other’s school.', '배쓰나이 화이트 백근', '꽃밭을 날아다니며 말라가는 꽃을 보살핀다. 꽃의 숨겨진 힘을 끌어내어 싸운다.', 'Water', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/670.ogg', NULL, 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/670.png', NULL, '한송이포켓몬', '120', 0, NULL, 155, 91, 104),
	(671, '0551', 'Sandile', 292, 50, 72, 35, 35, 35, 65, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/sandile', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/551.png', 'They live hidden under hot desert sands in order to keep their body temperature from dropping.', '깜눈크', '모래 속에 파고들어 눈과 코를 밖에 내놓고 이동한다. 검은 막이 눈을 보호한다.', 'Ground', 'Dark', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/671.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/551.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/671.png', NULL, '사막악어포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(672, '0552', 'Krokorok', 351, 60, 82, 45, 45, 45, 74, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/krokorok', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/552.png', 'Thanks to the special membrane covering its eyes, it can see its surroundings clearly, even in the middle of the night.', '악비르', '여러 마리가 무리를 짓는다. 안구를 감싼 막이 모래 폭풍으로부터 눈을 지켜준다.', 'Ground', 'Dark', '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/672.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/552.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/672.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/672.png', '사막악어포켓몬', '200', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(673, '0553', 'Krookodile', 519, 95, 117, 80, 65, 70, 92, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/krookodile', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/553.png', 'Its unique faculty of sight can detect small prey more than 30 miles away, even in the midst of a sandstorm.', '악비아르', '아주 난폭한 포켓몬. 눈앞에서 움직이는 것은 모두 덮쳐서 깨물어 부수려고 한다.', 'Ground', 'Dark', '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/673.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/553.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/673.png', NULL, '위협포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(674, '0554', 'Darumaka', 315, 70, 90, 45, 15, 45, 50, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/darumaka', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/554.png', 'This popular symbol of good fortune will never fall over in its sleep, no matter how it’s pushed or pulled.', '달막화', '달막화의 배설물은 뜨거워서 옛날 사람은 품에 넣고 몸을 따뜻하게 하는 데 사용했다.', 'Fire', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/674.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/554.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/674.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/674.png', '달마포켓몬', '220', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(675, '0554', 'Darumaka (Galarian Darumaka)', 315, 70, 90, 45, 15, 45, 50, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/darumaka', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/554.png', 'This popular symbol of good fortune will never fall over in its sleep, no matter how it’s pushed or pulled.', '가라르 달막화', '달막화의 배설물은 뜨거워서 옛날 사람은 품에 넣고 몸을 따뜻하게 하는 데 사용했다.', 'Ice', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/675.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/554.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/675.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/675.png', '달마포켓몬', '65', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(676, '0555', 'Darmanitan (Standard Mode)', 480, 105, 140, 55, 30, 55, 95, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/darmanitan', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/555.png', 'Its internal fire burns at 2,500 degrees Fahrenheit, making enough power that it can destroy a dump truck with one punch.', '불비달마 달마모드 아님', '복슬복슬한 털을 깎고 다듬으면 모습이 아름다워질 뿐만 아니라 몸의 움직임도 좋아진다.', 'Fire', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/676.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/555.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/676.png', NULL, '푸들포켓몬', '160', 0, NULL, 125, NULL, 161),
	(677, '0555', 'Darmanitan (Zen Mode)', 540, 105, 30, 105, 140, 105, 55, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/darmanitan', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/10017.png', 'Its internal fire burns at 2,500 degrees Fahrenheit, making enough power that it can destroy a dump truck with one punch.', '불비달마 달마모드', '강력한 사이코 파워가 새어 나가지 않도록 방출되는 기관을 귀로 막고 있다.', 'Fire', 'Psychic', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/677.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/555-zen.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/677.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/677.png', '자제포켓몬', '190', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(678, '0555', 'Darmanitan (Galarian Standard Mode)', 480, 105, 140, 55, 30, 55, 95, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/darmanitan', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/10177.png', 'Its internal fire burns at 2,500 degrees Fahrenheit, making enough power that it can destroy a dump truck with one punch.', '가라르 불비달마 달마모드 아님', '위험이 다가오면 귀를 들어 올리고 10톤 트럭을 눌러 부술 정도의 사이코 파워를 방출한다.', 'Ice', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/678.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/10177.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/678.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/678.png', '억제포켓몬', '75', 0, NULL, 255, NULL, 161),
	(679, '0555', 'Darmanitan (Galarian Zen Mode)', 540, 105, 160, 55, 30, 55, 135, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/darmanitan', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/10178.png', 'Its internal fire burns at 2,500 degrees Fahrenheit, making enough power that it can destroy a dump truck with one punch.', '가라르 불비달마 달마모드', '죽은 자의 혼이 고대의 검에 깃들어 태어났다고 한다. 사람에게 씌어 생명을 빨아들인다.', 'Ice', 'Fire', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/679.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/10178.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/679.png', NULL, '도검포켓몬', '180', 0, NULL, 255, NULL, 161),
	(680, '0556', 'Maractus', 461, 75, 86, 67, 106, 67, 60, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/maractus', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/556.png', 'Once each year, this Pokémon scatters its seeds. They’re jam-packed with nutrients, making them a precious food source out in the desert.', '마라카치', '템포가 빠른 춤과 소리로 꽃씨를 노리는 천적인 새포켓몬을 쫓아버린다.', 'Grass', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/680.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/556.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/680.png', NULL, '선인장포켓몬', '90', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(681, '0557', 'Dwebble', 325, 50, 65, 85, 35, 35, 55, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/dwebble', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/557.png', 'It first tries to find a rock to live in, but if there are no suitable rocks to be found, Dwebble may move in to the ports of a Hippowdon.', '돌살이', '적당한 돌을 찾아 구멍을 뚫어 살 곳을 만든다. 부서지면 대신할 돌을 찾을 때까지 불안해한다.', 'Bug', 'Rock', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/681.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/557.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/681.png', NULL, '돌집포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(682, '0558', 'Crustle', 485, 70, 105, 125, 65, 75, 45, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/crustle', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/558.png', 'Its thick claws are its greatest weapons. They’re mighty enough to crack Rhyperior’s carapace.', '암팰리스', '무거운 바위를 등에 지고 며칠이고 건조한 땅을 이동할 수 있는 다릿심을 가지고 있다.', 'Bug', 'Rock', '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/682.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/558.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/682.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/682.png', '바위집포켓몬', '200', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(683, '0559', 'Scraggy', 348, 50, 75, 70, 35, 70, 48, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/scraggy', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/559.png', 'It protects itself with its durable skin. It’s thought that this Pokémon will evolve once its skin has completely stretched out.', '곤율랭', '가죽을 목까지 늘려서 방어 자세를 취한다. 고무 같은 탄력을 이용해 데미지를 줄인다.', 'Dark', 'Fighting', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/683.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/559.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/683.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/683.png', '탈피포켓몬', '140', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(684, '0560', 'Scrafty', 488, 65, 90, 115, 45, 115, 58, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/scrafty', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/560.png', 'While mostly known for having the temperament of an aggressive ruffian, this Pokémon takes very good care of its family, friends, and territory.', '곤율거니', '탈피한 가죽을 끌어 올려 데미지를 줄이면서 킥! 볏이 클수록 거만하다.', 'Dark', 'Fighting', '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/684.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/560.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/684.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/684.png', '악당포켓몬', '200', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(685, '0561', 'Sigilyph', 490, 72, 58, 80, 103, 80, 97, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/sigilyph', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/561.png', 'A discovery was made in the desert where Sigilyph fly. The ruins of what may have been an ancient city were found beneath the sands.', '심보러', '고대 도시의 수호신이었다. 자기 영역을 침범한 상대를 사이코 파워로 공격한다.', 'Psychic', 'Flying', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/685.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/561.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/685.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/685.png', '흡사새포켓몬', '140', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(686, '0562', 'Yamask', 303, 38, 30, 85, 55, 65, 30, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/yamask', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/562.png', 'The spirit of a person from a bygone age became this Pokémon. It rambles through ruins, searching for someone who knows its face.', '데스마스', '무덤에 매장된 사람의 영혼이 포켓몬으로 변했다. 죽기 전 기억이 남아 있다.', 'Ghost', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/686.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/562.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/686.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/686.png', '영혼포켓몬', '190', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(687, '0562', 'Yamask (Galarian Yamask)', 303, 38, 55, 85, 30, 65, 30, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/yamask', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/562.png', 'The spirit of a person from a bygone age became this Pokémon. It rambles through ruins, searching for someone who knows its face.', '가라르 데스마스', '무덤에 매장된 사람의 영혼이 포켓몬으로 변했다. 죽기 전 기억이 남아 있다.', 'Ground', 'Ghost', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/687.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/562.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/687.png', NULL, '영혼포켓몬', '80', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(688, '0563', 'Cofagrigus', 483, 58, 50, 145, 95, 105, 30, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/cofagrigus', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/563.png', 'There are many depictions of Cofagrigus decorating ancient tombs. They’re symbols of the wealth that kings of bygone eras had.', '데스니칸', '황금으로 된 반짝거리는 몸. 자신이 인간이었다는 사실을 이제는 기억하지 못할 것이다.', 'Ghost', NULL, '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/688.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/563.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/688.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/688.png', '관포켓몬', '120', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(689, '0564', 'Tirtouga', 355, 54, 78, 103, 53, 45, 22, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/tirtouga', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/564.png', 'Tirtouga is considered to be the ancestor of many turtle Pokémon. It was restored to life from a fossil.', '프로토가', '약 1억 년 전 바다를 헤엄쳐 다녔다. 육지에 올라 먹이를 덮치는 일도 있다.', 'Water', 'Rock', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/689.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/564.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/689.png', NULL, '옛날거북포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(690, '0565', 'Carracosta', 495, 74, 108, 133, 83, 65, 32, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/carracosta', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/565.png', 'This Pokémon emerges from the water in search of prey despite the fact that it moves more slowly on land.', '늑골라', '바다와 육지에서 생활한다. 손바닥으로 쳐서 배 밑바닥에 구멍을 내는 파워의 소유자다.', 'Water', 'Rock', '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/690.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/565.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/690.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/690.png', '옛날거북포켓몬', '225', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(691, '0566', 'Archen', 401, 55, 112, 45, 74, 45, 70, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/archen', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/566.png', 'Archen is said to be the ancestor of bird Pokémon. It lived in treetops, eating berries and bug Pokémon.', '아켄', '화석에서 부활한 포켓몬이다. 모든 새포켓몬의 조상이라 여겨지고 있다.', 'Rock', 'Flying', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/691.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/566.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/691.png', NULL, '최초새포켓몬', '55', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(692, '0567', 'Archeops', 567, 75, 140, 65, 112, 65, 110, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/archeops', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/567.png', 'Though capable of flight, Archeops was apparently better at hunting on the ground.', '아케오스', '지상에서 도움닫기를 하여 날아오른다. 동료와 협력하여 먹이를 잡는 지능을 가졌다.', 'Rock', 'Flying', '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/692.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/567.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/692.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/692.png', '최초새포켓몬', '225', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(693, '0568', 'Trubbish', 329, 50, 50, 62, 40, 62, 65, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/trubbish', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/568.png', 'This Pokémon was born from a bag stuffed with trash. Galarian Weezing relish the fumes belched by Trubbish.', '깨봉이', '쓰레기 봉지가 산업 폐기물과 화학적 변화를 일으켜서 포켓몬으로 다시 태어났다.', 'Poison', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/693.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/568.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/693.png', NULL, '쓰레기봉투포켓몬', '55', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(694, '0569', 'Garbodor', 474, 80, 95, 82, 60, 82, 75, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/garbodor', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/569.png', 'The toxic liquid it launches from its right arm is so virulent that it can kill a weakened creature instantly.', '더스트나', '왼팔로 상대를 꼭 붙들고 입에서 악취가 나는 독가스를 토해내서 마무리한다.', 'Poison', NULL, '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/694.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/569.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/694.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/694.png', '쓰레기장포켓몬', '190', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(695, '0570', 'Zorua', 330, 40, 65, 40, 80, 40, 65, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/zorua', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/570.png', 'To protect themselves from danger, they hide their true identities by transforming into people and Pokémon.', '조로아', '상대와 똑 닮게 둔갑한 것처럼 보이게 하여 속이거나 놀라게 해서 그 틈에 도망가는 일이 많다.', 'Dark', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/695.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/570.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/695.png', NULL, '나쁜여우포켓몬', '75', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(696, '0570', 'Zorua (Hisuian Zorua)', 330, 35, 60, 40, 85, 40, 70, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/zorua', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/570.png', 'To protect themselves from danger, they hide their true identities by transforming into people and Pokémon.', '히스이 조로아', '상대와 똑 닮게 둔갑한 것처럼 보이게 하여 속이거나 놀라게 해서 그 틈에 도망가는 일이 많다.', 'Normal', 'Ghost', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/696.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/570.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/696.png', NULL, '나쁜여우포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(697, '0571', 'Zoroark', 510, 60, 105, 60, 120, 60, 105, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/zoroark', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/571.png', 'Each has the ability to fool a large group of people simultaneously. They protect their lair with illusory scenery.', '조로아크', '한 번에 많은 사람을 속이는 힘을 가졌다. 환영의 경치를 보여줘 거처를 지킨다.', 'Dark', NULL, '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/697.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/571.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/697.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/697.png', '요괴여우포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(698, '0571', 'Zoroark (Hisuian Zoroark)', 510, 55, 100, 60, 125, 60, 110, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/zoroark', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/571.png', 'Each has the ability to fool a large group of people simultaneously. They protect their lair with illusory scenery.', '히스이 조로아크', '한 번에 많은 사람을 속이는 힘을 가졌다. 환영의 경치를 보여줘 거처를 지킨다.', 'Normal', 'Ghost', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/698.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/571.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/698.png', NULL, '요괴여우포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(699, '0572', 'Minccino', 300, 55, 50, 40, 40, 40, 75, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/minccino', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/572.png', 'They pet each other with their tails as a form of greeting. Of the two, the one whose tail is fluffier is a bit more boastful.', '치라미', '서로의 꼬리로 상대를 철저히 깨끗하게 만드는 것이 치라미끼리의 인사다.', 'Normal', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/699.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/572.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/699.png', NULL, '친칠라포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(700, '0573', 'Cinccino', 470, 75, 95, 60, 65, 60, 115, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/cinccino', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/573.png', 'A special oil that seeps through their fur helps them avoid attacks. The oil fetches a high price at market.', '치라치노', '하얀 털은 감촉이 정말 좋다. 먼지나 정전기가 전혀 생기지 않는다.', 'Normal', NULL, '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/700.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/573.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/700.png', NULL, '스카프포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(701, '0574', 'Gothita', 290, 45, 30, 50, 55, 65, 45, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/gothita', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/574.png', 'Beware of touching the ribbon-shaped feelers that control its psychic power. Gothita will begin bawling if you do.', '고디탱', '리본 모양의 더듬이로 사이코 파워를 증폭시킨다. 무언가를 가만히 바라보고 있다.', 'Psychic', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/701.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/574.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/701.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/701.png', '응시포켓몬', '100', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(702, '0575', 'Gothorita', 390, 60, 45, 70, 75, 85, 55, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/gothorita', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/575.png', 'Using its psychic power, it arranges pebbles to form the shapes of constellations. Some people believe this Pokémon came from outer space.', '고디보미', '별빛이 힘의 원천이다. 밤이 되면 사이코 파워로 돌을 띄워 별의 배치를 표시한다.', 'Psychic', NULL, '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/702.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/575.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/702.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/702.png', '조작포켓몬', '180', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(703, '0576', 'Gothitelle', 490, 70, 55, 95, 95, 110, 65, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/gothitelle', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/576.png', 'It gazes at the stars to predict the future. It acts somewhat detached because it has seen the end of all existence.', '고디모아젤', '강력한 사이코 파워의 영향으로 고디모아젤 주변 공간이 비틀어져 몇만 광년이나 떨어진 하늘의 별이 비친다.', 'Psychic', NULL, '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/703.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/576.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/703.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/703.png', '천체포켓몬', '60', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(704, '0577', 'Solosis', 290, 45, 30, 40, 105, 50, 20, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/solosis', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/577.png', 'Many say that the special liquid covering this Pokémon’s body would allow it to survive in the vacuum of space.', '유니란 단독', '몸이 특수한 액체로 둘러싸여 있어 어떤 곤란한 상황이라도 문제없다.', 'Psychic', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/704.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/577.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/704.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/704.png', '세포포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(705, '0578', 'Duosion', 370, 65, 40, 50, 125, 60, 30, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/duosion', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/578.png', 'Its brain has split into two, and the two halves rarely think alike. Its actions are utterly unpredictable.', '듀란', '둘로 분열된 뇌를 가지고 있어서 갑자기 다른 행동을 취할 때가 있다.', 'Psychic', NULL, '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/705.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/578.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/705.png', NULL, '분할포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(706, '0579', 'Reuniclus', 490, 110, 65, 75, 125, 85, 30, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/reuniclus', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/579.png', 'It’s said that drinking the liquid surrounding Reuniclus grants wisdom. Problem is, the liquid is highly toxic to anything besides Reuniclus itself.', '란쿨루스', '발휘한 사이코 파워를 사용해 특수한 액체로 만들어진 팔을 조종해서 바위를 부순다.', 'Psychic', NULL, '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/706.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/579.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/706.png', NULL, '증폭포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(707, '0580', 'Ducklett', 305, 62, 44, 50, 44, 50, 55, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/ducklett', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/580.png', 'They are better at swimming than flying, and they happily eat their favorite food, peat moss, as they dive underwater.', '꼬지보리', '상대에게 공격당하면 전신의 깃털에서 물보라를 내뿜는다. 물안개에 숨어들어 도망친다.', 'Water', 'Flying', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/707.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/580.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/707.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/707.png', '물새포켓몬', '75', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(708, '0581', 'Swanna', 473, 75, 87, 63, 87, 63, 98, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/swanna', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/581.png', 'Swanna start to dance at dusk. The one dancing in the middle is the leader of the flock.', '스완나', '우아한 외모와 다르게 날개로 힘차게 날개 치며 수천 km를 계속 날 수 있다.', 'Water', 'Flying', '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/708.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/581.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/708.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/708.png', '백조포켓몬', '120', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(709, '0582', 'Vanillite', 305, 36, 50, 50, 65, 60, 44, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/vanillite', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/582.png', 'Supposedly, this Pokémon was born from an icicle. It spews out freezing air at −58 degrees Fahrenheit to make itself more comfortable.', '바닐프티', '마이너스 50도의 숨결을 내뱉는다. 눈 결정을 만들어 주변에 눈이 내리게 한다.', 'Ice', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/709.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/582.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/709.png', NULL, '신설포켓몬', '60', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(710, '0583', 'Vanillish', 395, 51, 65, 65, 80, 75, 59, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/vanillish', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/583.png', 'It blasts enemies with cold air reaching −148 degrees Fahrenheit, freezing them solid. But it spares their lives afterward—it’s a kind Pokémon.', '바닐리치', '주변 공기를 차갑게 해서 얼음 알갱이를 발생시켜서 상대의 몸을 얼려버린다.', 'Ice', NULL, '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/710.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/583.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/710.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/710.png', '빙설포켓몬', '120', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(711, '0584', 'Vanilluxe', 535, 71, 95, 85, 110, 95, 79, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/vanilluxe', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/584.png', 'People believe this Pokémon formed when two Vanillish stuck together. Its body temperature is roughly 21 degrees Fahrenheit.', '배바닐라', '두 개의 머리가 동시에 화를 내면 뿔에서 강한 눈보라가 뿜어져 나온다. 주변을 많은 눈으로 묻어 버린다.', 'Ice', NULL, '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/711.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/584.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/711.png', NULL, '블리자드포켓몬', '60', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(712, '0585', 'Deerling', 335, 60, 60, 50, 40, 50, 75, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/deerling', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/585.png', 'The turning of the seasons changes the color and scent of this Pokémon’s fur. People use it to mark the seasons.', '사철록', '계절이 바뀌었을 때뿐 아니라 기온이나 습도에 따라서도 몸의 색깔은 조금 변한다.', 'Normal', 'Grass', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/712.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/585.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/712.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/712.png', '계절포켓몬', '190', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(713, '0586', 'Sawsbuck', 475, 80, 100, 70, 60, 70, 95, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/sawsbuck', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/586.png', 'They migrate according to the seasons, so some people call Sawsbuck the harbingers of spring.', '바라철록', '계절에 따라 거처를 바꾼다. 사람들은 바라철록의 뿔에서 계절의 변화를 느낀다.', 'Normal', 'Grass', '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/713.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/586.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/713.png', NULL, '계절포켓몬', '55', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(714, '0587', 'Emolga', 428, 55, 75, 60, 75, 60, 103, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/emolga', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/587.png', 'This Pokémon absolutely loves sweet berries. Sometimes it stuffs its cheeks full of so much food that it can’t fly properly.', '에몽가', '숲의 나무 위에 산다. 망토 같은 막의 안쪽을 방전시키며 활공한다.', 'Electric', 'Flying', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/714.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/587.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/714.png', NULL, '하늘다람쥐포켓몬', '190', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(715, '0588', 'Karrablast', 315, 50, 75, 45, 40, 45, 60, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/karrablast', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/588.png', 'It spits a liquid from its mouth to melt through Shelmet’s shell. Karrablast doesn’t eat the shell— it eats only the contents.', '딱정곤', '쪼마리와 함께 있을 때 전기적인 자극을 받으면 진화하는 이상한 포켓몬이다.', 'Bug', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/715.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/588.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/715.png', NULL, '덥석물기포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(716, '0589', 'Escavalier', 495, 70, 135, 105, 60, 105, 20, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/escavalier', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/589.png', 'It charges its enemies, lances at the ready. An image of one of its duels is captured in a famous painting of Escavalier clashing with Sirfetch’d.', '슈바르고', '쪼마리에게서 뺏은 껍질로 몸을 에워싸 가드하면서 2개의 창으로 찔러온다.', 'Bug', 'Steel', '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/716.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/589.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/716.png', NULL, '기병포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(717, '0590', 'Foongus', 294, 69, 55, 45, 55, 55, 15, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/foongus', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/590.png', 'This Pokémon prefers damp places. It spurts out poison spores to repel approaching enemies.', '깜놀버슬', '몬스터볼을 닮은 무늬로 유인한 후 독 포자를 뿌려댄다. 왜 닮았는지는 불가사의다.', 'Grass', 'Poison', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/717.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/590.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/717.png', NULL, '버섯포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(718, '0591', 'Amoonguss', 464, 114, 85, 70, 85, 80, 30, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/amoonguss', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/591.png', 'Amoonguss mimics Poké Balls. It is not yet clear whether this mimicry is effective against other Pokémon.', '뽀록나', '몬스터볼 무늬의 삿갓을 보여주며 먹이를 유인하려 하지만 속아 넘어가는 포켓몬은 드물다.', 'Grass', 'Poison', '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/718.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/591.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/718.png', NULL, '버섯포켓몬', '3', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(719, '0592', 'Frillish', 335, 55, 40, 50, 65, 85, 40, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/frillish', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/592.png', 'Using the invisible poison spikes on its veillike arms and legs, it paralyzes its enemies and causes them to drown.', '탱그릴', '먹이를 독으로 마비시켜 8000m 심해에 있다는 거처로 데려간다.', 'Water', 'Ghost', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/719.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/592.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/719.png', NULL, '부유포켓몬', '3', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(720, '0593', 'Jellicent', 480, 100, 60, 70, 85, 105, 60, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/jellicent', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/593.png', 'Fishermen are terrified of Jellicent. It’s rumored to drag them into the sea and steal their lives away.', '탱탱겔', '몸 대부분이 해수다. 해저에는 탱탱겔이 가라앉힌 배로 만들어진 성이 있다고 한다.', 'Water', 'Ghost', '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/720.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/593.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/720.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/720.png', '부유포켓몬', '3', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(721, '0594', 'Alomomola', 470, 165, 75, 80, 40, 45, 65, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/alomomola', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/594.png', 'They float upon the open sea. Many water Pokémon gather in the area around Alomomola.', '맘복치', '넓은 바다를 떠돌아다니며 산다. 상처 입은 포켓몬을 발견하면 안고서 물가까지 옮긴다.', 'Water', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/721.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/594.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/721.png', NULL, '돌보기포켓몬', '3', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(722, '0595', 'Joltik', 319, 50, 47, 50, 57, 50, 65, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/joltik', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/595.png', 'Joltik latch on to other Pokémon and suck out static electricity. They’re often found sticking to Yamper’s hindquarters.', '파쪼옥', '스스로 전기를 만들 수 없어 다른 큰 포켓몬에 달라붙어 정전기를 흡수한다.', 'Bug', 'Electric', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/722.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/595.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/722.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/722.png', '들러붙기포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(723, '0596', 'Galvantula', 472, 70, 77, 60, 97, 60, 108, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/galvantula', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/596.png', 'It lays traps of electrified threads near the nests of bird Pokémon, aiming to snare chicks that are not yet good at flying.', '전툴라', '전기를 띤 실로 함정을 설치한다. 감전돼서 움직이지 못하는 먹이를 천천히 먹어치운다.', 'Bug', 'Electric', '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/723.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/596.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/723.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/723.png', '전기거미포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(724, '0597', 'Ferroseed', 305, 44, 50, 91, 24, 86, 10, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/ferroseed', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/597.png', 'Mossy caves are their preferred dwellings. Enzymes contained in mosses help Ferroseed’s spikes grow big and strong.', '철시드', '위험을 감지하면 가시를 일제히 발사하여 반격한다. 그 틈에 몸을 굴려 도망간다.', 'Grass', 'Steel', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/724.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/597.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/724.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/724.png', '가시열매포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(725, '0598', 'Ferrothorn', 489, 74, 94, 131, 54, 116, 20, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/ferrothorn', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/598.png', 'Its spikes are harder than steel. This Pokémon crawls across rock walls by stabbing the spikes on its feelers into the stone.', '너트령', '3개의 촉수를 세게 내리치고 거기에 가시를 날려 상대를 흔적도 없이 분쇄한다.', 'Grass', 'Steel', '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/725.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/598.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/725.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/725.png', '가시공포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(726, '0599', 'Klink', 300, 40, 55, 70, 45, 60, 30, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/klink', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/599.png', 'It’s suspected that Klink were the inspiration behind ancient people’s invention of the first gears.', '기어르', '두 개의 몸을 맞물려 회전시켜서 살아가기 위한 에너지를 만들고 있다.', 'Steel', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/726.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/599.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/726.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/726.png', '톱니바퀴포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(727, '0600', 'Klang', 440, 60, 80, 95, 70, 85, 50, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/klang', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/600.png', 'Many companies in the Galar region choose Klang as their logo. This Pokémon is considered the symbol of industrial technology.', '기기어르', '회전 방향을 바꿔서 동료에게 감정을 전한다. 화가 나면 회전이 빨라진다.', 'Steel', NULL, '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/727.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/600.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/727.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/727.png', '톱니바퀴포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(728, '0601', 'Klinklang', 520, 60, 100, 115, 70, 85, 90, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/klinklang', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/601.png', 'The three gears that compose this Pokémon spin at high speed. Its new spiked gear isn’t a living creature.', '기기기어르', '빨간 코어가 달린 기어를 고속 회전시켜서 에너지를 급속 충전한다.', 'Steel', NULL, '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/728.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/601.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/728.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/728.png', '톱니바퀴포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(729, '0602', 'Tynamo', 275, 35, 55, 40, 45, 40, 60, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/tynamo', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/602.png', 'These Pokémon move in schools. They have an electricity-generating organ, so they discharge electricity if in danger.', '저리어', '한 마리의 전력은 적지만 많은 저리어가 연결되면 번개와 같은 위력이 된다.', 'Electric', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/729.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/602.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/729.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/729.png', '전기물고기포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(730, '0603', 'Eelektrik', 405, 65, 85, 70, 75, 70, 40, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/eelektrik', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/603.png', 'These Pokémon have a big appetite. When they spot their prey, they attack it and paralyze it with electricity.', '저리릴', '상대를 휘감고 동그란 반점에서 전기를 흘려보내 마비시킨 뒤 통째로 문다.', 'Electric', NULL, '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/730.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/603.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/730.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/730.png', '전기물고기포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(731, '0604', 'Eelektross', 515, 85, 115, 80, 105, 80, 50, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/eelektross', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/604.png', 'It latches on to prey with its sucker mouth, sinking in its fangs and shocking the prey with powerful electricity.', '저리더프', '흡반 같은 입으로 먹이에 달라붙은 후 박아 넣은 이빨을 통해 전기를 흘려 감전시킨다.', 'Electric', NULL, '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/731.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/604.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/731.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/731.png', '전기물고기포켓몬', '255', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(732, '0605', 'Elgyem', 335, 55, 55, 55, 85, 55, 30, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/elgyem', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/605.png', 'This Pokémon was discovered about 50 years ago. Its highly developed brain enables it to exert its psychic powers.', '리그레', '강력한 사이코 파워를 다룬다. 사이코 파워로 상대의 뇌를 조여서 두통을 일으킨다.', 'Psychic', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/732.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/605.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/732.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/732.png', '브레인포켓몬', '120', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(733, '0606', 'Beheeyem', 485, 75, 75, 75, 125, 95, 40, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/beheeyem', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/606.png', 'Sometimes found drifting above wheat fields, this Pokémon can control the memories of its opponents.', '벰크', '손끝을 점멸시켜서 대화하는 듯하나 그 패턴은 아직 해독하지 못했다.', 'Psychic', NULL, '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/733.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/606.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/733.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/733.png', '브레인포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(734, '0607', 'Litwick', 275, 50, 30, 55, 65, 55, 20, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/litwick', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/607.png', 'The younger the life this Pokémon absorbs, the brighter and eerier the flame on its head burns.', '불켜미', '빛을 밝혀 길 안내를 하는 것처럼 가장하여 생명력을 빨아들이고 있다.', 'Ghost', 'Fire', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/734.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/607.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/734.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/734.png', '양초포켓몬', '255', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(735, '0608', 'Lampent', 370, 60, 40, 60, 95, 60, 55, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/lampent', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/608.png', 'It lurks in cities, pretending to be a lamp. Once it finds someone whose death is near, it will trail quietly after them.', '램프라', '영혼을 빨아들여 불을 밝힌다. 사람이 죽는 것을 기다리기 위해 병원을 서성거리게 되었다.', 'Ghost', 'Fire', '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/735.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/608.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/735.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/735.png', '램프포켓몬', '127', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(736, '0609', 'Chandelure', 520, 60, 55, 90, 145, 90, 80, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/chandelure', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/609.png', 'In homes illuminated by Chandelure instead of lights, funerals were a constant occurrence— or so it’s said.', '샹델라', '샹델라의 불꽃에 둘러싸이면 영혼이 빨려가 불타버린다. 빈 껍데기인 몸만 남는다.', 'Ghost', 'Fire', '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/736.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/609.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/736.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/736.png', '권유포켓몬', '255', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(737, '0610', 'Axew', 320, 46, 87, 60, 30, 40, 57, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/axew', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/610.png', 'If you see peculiar teeth marks on boulders or trees, it means an Axew is likely living nearby.', '터검니', '나무열매를 이빨로 깨물어 먹는다. 이빨이 몇 차례에 걸쳐 새로 나면 강하고 날카로워진다', 'Dragon', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/737.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/610.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/737.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/737.png', '이빨포켓몬', '120', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(738, '0611', 'Fraxure', 410, 66, 117, 70, 40, 50, 67, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/fraxure', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/611.png', 'Fraxure uses its thick tusks to neatly cut prey into two portions—one to eat now and one to save for later.', '액슨도', '큰 바위를 부수는 이빨을 가지고 있다. 액슨도들의 영역 싸움은 매우 격렬하다.', 'Dragon', NULL, '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/738.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/611.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/738.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/738.png', '도끼턱포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(739, '0612', 'Haxorus', 540, 76, 147, 90, 60, 70, 97, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/haxorus', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/612.png', 'It overwhelms enemies with its prized tusks, which are sharp enough to cut through a metal transmission tower in one strike.', '액스라이즈', '상냥한 성격이지만 영역을 어지럽히는 자는 용서하지 않는다. 철을 자르는 이빨로 덤벼든다.', 'Dragon', NULL, '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/739.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/612.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/739.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/739.png', '도끼턱포켓몬', '225', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(740, '0613', 'Cubchoo', 305, 55, 70, 40, 60, 40, 40, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/cubchoo', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/613.png', 'When Cubchoo starts sneezing, watch out! If it spatters you with its frosty snot, you’ll get frostbite.', '코고미', '언제나 콧물을 달고 다닌다. 콧물을 훌쩍거려 기술을 사용한다. 콧물이 기술의 재료인 셈이다.', 'Ice', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/740.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/613.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/740.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/740.png', '빙결포켓몬', '60', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(741, '0614', 'Beartic', 505, 95, 130, 80, 70, 80, 50, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/beartic', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/614.png', 'Feared as the Snow-White Demon in northern lands, Beartic uses its frosty claws and fangs to attack prey.', '툰베어', '북쪽의 차가운 바다를 좋아한다. 입에서 내뿜는 숨을 얼려 바다 위에 길을 만들어 걷는다.', 'Ice', NULL, '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/741.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/614.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/741.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/741.png', '동결포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(742, '0615', 'Cryogonal', 515, 80, 50, 50, 95, 135, 105, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/cryogonal', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/615.png', 'Cryogonal uses its chains of ice to constrict its opponents and then flash-freezes them where they stand.', '프리지오', '눈구름 속에서 태어났다. 얼음 결정으로 만들어진 사슬로 먹이를 잡는다.', 'Ice', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/742.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/615.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/742.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/742.png', '결정포켓몬', '190', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(743, '0616', 'Shelmet', 305, 50, 40, 85, 40, 65, 25, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/shelmet', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/616.png', 'It has a strange physiology that responds to electricity. When together with Karrablast, Shelmet evolves for some reason.', '쪼마리', '딱정곤과 함께 있을 때 전기적인 자극을 받으면 서로의 몸이 진화한다.', 'Bug', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/743.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/616.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/743.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/743.png', '달팽이포켓몬', '75', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(744, '0617', 'Accelgor', 495, 80, 70, 40, 100, 60, 145, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/accelgor', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/617.png', 'Discarding its shell made it nimble. To keep itself from dehydrating, it wraps its body in bands of membrane.', '어지리더', '무거운 껍데기를 벗었기 때문에 몸이 가벼워졌다. 마치 닌자 같은 몸놀림으로 싸운다.', 'Bug', NULL, '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/744.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/617.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/744.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/744.png', '탈껍질포켓몬', '190', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(745, '0618', 'Stunfisk', 471, 109, 66, 84, 81, 99, 32, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/stunfisk', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/618.png', 'For some reason, this Pokémon smiles slightly when it emits a strong electric current from the yellow markings on its body.', '메더', '피부가 단단해서 씨름꾼에게 밟혀도 아무렇지 않다. 전기를 흘려보낼 때 웃는 얼굴이 된다.', 'Ground', 'Electric', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/745.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/618.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/745.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/745.png', '트랩포켓몬', '90', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(746, '0618', 'Stunfisk (Galarian Stunfisk)', 471, 109, 81, 99, 66, 84, 32, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/stunfisk', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/618.png', 'For some reason, this Pokémon smiles slightly when it emits a strong electric current from the yellow markings on its body.', '가라르 메더', '피부가 단단해서 씨름꾼에게 밟혀도 아무렇지 않다. 전기를 흘려보낼 때 웃는 얼굴이 된다.', 'Ground', 'Steel', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/746.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/618.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/746.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/746.png', '트랩포켓몬', '60', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(747, '0619', 'Mienfoo', 350, 45, 85, 50, 55, 50, 65, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/mienfoo', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/619.png', 'Though small, Mienfoo’s temperament is fierce. Any creature that approaches Mienfoo carelessly will be greeted with a flurry of graceful attacks.', '비조푸', '기술을 내보내는 스피드가 자랑이다. 설령 파워는 낮더라도 많은 공격 횟수로 커버한다.', 'Fighting', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/747.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/619.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/747.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/747.png', '무술포켓몬', '190', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(748, '0620', 'Mienshao', 510, 65, 125, 60, 95, 60, 105, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/mienshao', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/620.png', 'Delivered at blinding speeds, kicks from this Pokémon can shatter massive boulders into tiny pieces.', '비조도', '팔에 있는 털을 채찍처럼 다룬다. 양팔로 펼치는 공격은 눈에 보이지 않을 만큼 빠르다.', 'Fighting', NULL, '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/748.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/620.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/748.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/748.png', '무술포켓몬', '75', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(749, '0621', 'Druddigon', 485, 77, 120, 90, 60, 90, 48, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/druddigon', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/621.png', 'Druddigon are vicious and cunning. They take up residence in nests dug out by other Pokémon, treating the stolen nests as their own lairs.', '크리만', '좁은 동굴을 뛰어다니며 날카로운 손톱으로 먹이를 잡는다. 얼굴 피부는 바위보다 단단하다.', 'Dragon', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/749.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/621.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/749.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/749.png', '동굴포켓몬', '190', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(750, '0622', 'Golett', 303, 59, 74, 50, 35, 50, 35, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/golett', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/622.png', 'This Pokémon was created from clay. It received orders from its master many thousands of years ago, and it still follows those orders to this day.', '골비람', '체내에서 불타는 에너지로 인해 활동하고 있지만 어떤 에너지인지는 불명이다.', 'Ground', 'Ghost', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/750.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/622.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/750.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/750.png', '골렘포켓몬', '60', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(751, '0623', 'Golurk', 483, 89, 124, 80, 55, 80, 55, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/golurk', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/623.png', 'There’s a theory that inside Golurk is a perpetual motion machine that produces limitless energy, but this belief hasn’t been proven.', '골루그', '골루그를 만든 고대인에게 사람과 포켓몬을 지키도록 명령받았다고 전해진다.', 'Ground', 'Ghost', '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/751.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/623.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/751.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/751.png', '골렘포켓몬', '200', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(752, '0624', 'Pawniard', 340, 45, 85, 70, 40, 40, 60, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/pawniard', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/624.png', 'Any chips in its blades would prove fatal for it. After each battle, it diligently maintains its blades using its favorite sharpening stone.', '자망칼', '전신이 칼날인 포켓몬이다. 싸움에서 칼의 이가 빠지면 강가의 돌로 칼을 간다.', 'Dark', 'Steel', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/752.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/624.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/752.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/752.png', '날붙이포켓몬', '100', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(753, '0625', 'Bisharp', 490, 65, 125, 100, 60, 70, 70, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/bisharp', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/625.png', 'Bisharp mercilessly cuts its opponents to pieces with the sharp blades covering its body. It will do anything to win.', '절각참', '몇 마리의 자망칼과 싸우게 해서 상처 입고 움직일 수 없게 된 먹이를 두 동강 내버리는 무서운 포켓몬.', 'Dark', 'Steel', '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/753.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/625.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/753.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/753.png', '도인포켓몬', '190', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(754, '0626', 'Bouffalant', 490, 95, 110, 95, 40, 95, 55, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/bouffalant', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/626.png', 'These Pokémon live in herds of about 20 individuals. Bouffalant that betray the herd will lose the hair on their heads for some reason.', '버프론', '무작정 돌진하여 박치기를 한다. 달리고 있는 열차를 탈선시킬 정도의 파괴력이다.', 'Normal', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/754.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/626.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/754.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/754.png', '박치기소포켓몬', '75', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(755, '0627', 'Rufflet', 350, 70, 83, 50, 37, 50, 60, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/rufflet', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/627.png', 'With its sharp claws, this Pokémon pierces its prey, and then it pecks at them. Although it also consumes berries, it’s a carnivore at heart.', '수리둥보', '다리 힘으로 나무열매를 으깬다. 아무리 강한 상대라도 용감히 맞서는 습성이 있다.', 'Normal', 'Flying', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/755.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/627.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/755.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/755.png', '새끼독수리포켓몬', '190', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(756, '0628', 'Braviary', 510, 100, 123, 75, 57, 75, 80, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/braviary', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/628.png', 'For the sake of its friends, this brave warrior of the sky will not stop battling, even if injured.', '워글', '동료를 위해서라면 아무리 상처를 입더라도 싸움을 관두지 않는 용감한 넓은 하늘의 전사.', 'Normal', 'Flying', '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/756.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/628.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/756.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/756.png', '용맹포켓몬', '75', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(757, '0628', 'Braviary (Hisuian Braviary)', 510, 110, 83, 70, 112, 70, 65, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/braviary', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/628.png', 'For the sake of its friends, this brave warrior of the sky will not stop battling, even if injured.', '히스이 워글', '동료를 위해서라면 아무리 상처를 입더라도 싸움을 관두지 않는 용감한 넓은 하늘의 전사.', 'Psychic', 'Flying', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/757.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/628.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/757.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/757.png', '용맹포켓몬', '120', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(758, '0629', 'Vullaby', 370, 70, 55, 75, 45, 65, 60, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/vullaby', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/629.png', 'Vullaby grow quickly. Bones that have gotten too small for older Vullaby to wear often get passed down to younger ones in the nest.', '벌차이', '날개가 작아서 날지 못한다. 진화가 가까워지면 자기 스스로 해골을 벗어버린다.', 'Dark', 'Flying', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/758.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/629.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/758.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/758.png', '기저귀포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(759, '0630', 'Mandibuzz', 510, 110, 65, 105, 55, 95, 80, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/mandibuzz', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/630.png', 'They adorn themselves with bones. There seem to be fashion trends among them, as different bones come into and fall out of popularity.', '버랜지나', '넓은 하늘에서 원을 그리며 날고 먹이를 발견하면 덮쳐서 둥지까지 가뿐히 나른다.', 'Dark', 'Flying', '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/759.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/630.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/759.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/759.png', '뼈독수리포켓몬', '140', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(760, '0631', 'Heatmor', 484, 85, 97, 66, 105, 66, 65, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/heatmor', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/631.png', 'A flame serves as its tongue, melting through the hard shell of Durant so that Heatmor can devour their insides.', '앤티골', '뜨겁게 타오르는 불꽃의 혀로 아이앤트의 강철 몸을 녹여서 알맹이를 먹어치운다.', 'Fire', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/760.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/631.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/760.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/760.png', '개미핥기포켓몬', '70', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(761, '0632', 'Durant', 484, 58, 109, 112, 48, 48, 109, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/durant', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/632.png', 'With their large mandibles, these Pokémon can crunch their way through rock. They work together to protect their eggs from Sandaconda.', '아이앤트', '천적인 앤티골에 대해서 모두와 역할 분담을 하면서 반격해 둥지에서 쫓아낸다.', 'Bug', 'Steel', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/761.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/632.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/761.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/761.png', '철개미포켓몬', '235', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(762, '0633', 'Deino', 300, 52, 65, 50, 45, 50, 38, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/deino', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/633.png', 'It nests deep inside a cave. Food there is scarce, so Deino will sink its teeth into anything that moves and attempt to eat it.', '모노두', '눈이 보이지 않아서 몸통박치기나 물기로 주변을 살핀다. 몸에 상처가 끊이지 않는다.', 'Dark', 'Dragon', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/762.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/633.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/762.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/762.png', '폭거포켓몬', '120', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(763, '0634', 'Zweilous', 420, 72, 85, 70, 65, 70, 58, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/zweilous', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/634.png', 'The two heads have different likes and dislikes. Because the heads fight with each other, Zweilous gets stronger without needing to rely on others.', '디헤드', '2개의 머리는 사이가 나빠서 상대보다 많이 먹는 것으로 주도권을 잡으려고 한다.', 'Dark', 'Dragon', '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/763.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/634.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/763.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/763.png', '흉포포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(764, '0635', 'Hydreigon', 600, 92, 105, 90, 125, 90, 98, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/hydreigon', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/635.png', 'It’s said that Hydreigon grew ferocious because people in times long past loathed it, considering it to be evil incarnate and attacking it relentlessly.', '삼삼드래', '양팔에 있는 머리에는 뇌가 없다. 3개의 머리로 모든 것을 먹어치워 파괴해 버린다.', 'Dark', 'Dragon', '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/764.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/635.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/764.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/764.png', '난폭포켓몬', '60', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(765, '0636', 'Larvesta', 360, 55, 85, 55, 50, 55, 60, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/larvesta', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/636.png', 'In ancient times, Larvesta was worshiped as the emissary of the sun. However, it was also viewed as a burden since it often caused forest fires.', '활화르바', '태양에서 태어났다고 전해진다. 진화할 때 뿔에서 뿜어져 나온 불꽃으로 전신을 감싼다.', 'Bug', 'Fire', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/765.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/636.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/765.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/765.png', '횃불포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(766, '0637', 'Volcarona', 550, 85, 60, 65, 135, 105, 100, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/volcarona', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/637.png', 'This Pokémon scatters burning scales. Most of the danger of these scales is not in their heat—it’s in the way they rob the surrounding air of oxygen.', '불카모스', '싸울 때는 6개의 날개에서 불꽃 가루를 흩뿌려서 주변 일대를 불바다로 만든다.', 'Bug', 'Fire', '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/766.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/637.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/766.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/766.png', '태양포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(767, '0638', 'Cobalion', 580, 91, 90, 129, 90, 72, 108, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/cobalion', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/638.png', 'From the moment it’s born, this Pokémon radiates the air of a leader. Its presence will calm even vicious foes.', '코바르온', '강철의 몸과 마음을 지녔다. 째려보기만 해도 난폭한 포켓몬마저도 따르게 된다.', 'Steel', 'Fighting', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/767.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/638.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/767.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/767.png', '철심포켓몬', '90', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(768, '0639', 'Terrakion', 580, 91, 129, 90, 72, 90, 108, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/terrakion', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/639.png', 'In Unovan legend, Terrakion battled against humans in an effort to protect other Pokémon.', '테라키온', '거대한 성벽을 일격에 돌파할 만한 돌진력을 가졌다. 전설로 전해지는 포켓몬이다.', 'Rock', 'Fighting', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/768.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/639.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/768.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/768.png', '암굴포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(769, '0640', 'Virizion', 580, 91, 90, 72, 90, 129, 108, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/virizion', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/640.png', 'It darts around opponents with a flurry of quick movements, slicing them up with its horns.', '비리디온', '머리의 뿔은 날카로운 칼날이다. 회오리바람과 같은 움직임으로 상대를 농락하여 재빠르게 벤다.', 'Grass', 'Fighting', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/769.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/640.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/769.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/769.png', '초원포켓몬', '140', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(770, '0641', 'Tornadus (Incarnate Forme)', 580, 79, 115, 70, 125, 80, 111, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/tornadus', 'https://img.pokemondb.net/sprites/scarlet-violet/icon/tornadus-incarnate.png', 'This storm-stirring Pokémon is said to cause the seasons to turn by whipping up the air. I suspect its humanlike form to be a false one.', '모래성이당', '사람을 조종하여 모래언덕을 모래성으로까지 진화시켰다. 저주의 힘도 깊어졌다.', 'Flying', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/770.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/770.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/770.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/770.png', '모래성포켓몬', '60', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(771, '0641', 'Tornadus (Therian Forme)', 580, 79, 100, 80, 110, 90, 121, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/tornadus', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/10019.png', 'This storm-stirring Pokémon is said to cause the seasons to turn by whipping up the air. I suspect its humanlike form to be a false one.', '토네로스 영물폼', '해변 등 얕은 바다에 산다. 몸에서 체내기관을 꺼내서 먹이를 잡거나 적과 싸운다.', 'Flying', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/771.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/641-therian.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/771.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/771.png', '해삼포켓몬', '60', 0, NULL, 144, NULL, NULL),
	(772, '0642', 'Thundurus (Incarnate Forme)', 580, 79, 115, 70, 125, 80, 111, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/thundurus', 'https://img.pokemondb.net/sprites/scarlet-violet/icon/thundurus-incarnate.png', 'They say this wielder of electricity has waged war with its nemesis, Tornadus, since time immemorial. The lightning bolts it hurls pierce the very earth and enrich the soil.', '타입:널', '무거운 제어마스크를 쓰고 있어 본래의 능력을 발휘할 수 없다. 특별한 힘을 숨기고 있다.', 'Electric', 'Flying', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/772.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/772.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/772.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/772.png', '인공포켓몬', '3', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(773, '0642', 'Thundurus (Therian Forme)', 580, 79, 105, 70, 145, 80, 101, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/thundurus', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/10020.png', 'They say this wielder of electricity has waged war with its nemesis, Tornadus, since time immemorial. The lightning bolts it hurls pierce the very earth and enrich the soil.', '볼트로스 영물폼', '파트너와의 신뢰로 각성한다. 자유자재로 타입을 바꾸는 능력을 발휘하며 싸운다.', 'Electric', 'Flying', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/773.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/642-therian.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/773.png', NULL, '인공포켓몬', '3', 0, NULL, 10, NULL, NULL),
	(774, '0643', 'Reshiram', 680, 100, 120, 100, 150, 120, 90, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/reshiram', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/643.png', 'According to myth, if people ignore truth and let themselves become consumed by greed, Reshiram will arrive to burn their kingdoms down.', '레시라무', '불꽃으로 세상을 태워버릴 수 있는 전설의 포켓몬. 진실의 세계를 구축하는 사람을 도와준다.', 'Dragon', 'Fire', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/774.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/643.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/774.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/774.png', '백양포켓몬', '30', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(775, '0644', 'Zekrom', 680, 100, 150, 120, 120, 100, 90, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/zekrom', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/644.png', 'Mythology tells us that if people lose the righteousness in their hearts, their kingdoms will be razed by Zekrom’s lightning.', '제크로무', '번개로 세상을 태워버릴 수 있는 전설의 포켓몬. 이상의 세계를 구축하는 사람을 보좌한다.', 'Dragon', 'Electric', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/775.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/644.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/775.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/775.png', '흑음포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(776, '0645', 'Landorus (Incarnate Forme)', 600, 89, 125, 90, 115, 80, 101, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/landorus', 'https://img.pokemondb.net/sprites/scarlet-violet/icon/landorus-incarnate.png', 'When the incarnations of wind and of lightning clash, Landorus arrives to quell the conflict. After the tempests and thunderbolts abate, the land is sure to be blessed with bountiful harvests.', '폭거북스', '등의 등껍질은 폭발물이다. 실수로 때리면 대폭발한다. 배의 구멍이 약점이다.', 'Ground', 'Flying', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/776.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/776.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/776.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/776.png', '폭발거북포켓몬', '70', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
