	(780, '0646', 'Kyurem (Black Kyurem)', 700, 125, 170, 100, 120, 90, 95, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/kyurem', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/646.png', 'It appears that this Pokémon uses its powers over ice to freeze its own body in order to stabilize its cellular structure.', '큐레무 블랙', '잃어버린 몸을 진실과 이상으로 채워줄 영웅을 기다리는 얼음의 전설 포켓몬.', 'Dragon', 'Ice', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/780.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/646.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/780.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/780.png', '경계포켓몬', '70', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(781, '0647', 'Keldeo (Ordinary Form)', 580, 91, 72, 90, 129, 90, 108, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/keldeo', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/647.png', 'When it is resolute, its body fills with power and it becomes swifter. Its jumps are then too fast to follow.', '케르디오', '큰 닻을 빙빙 휘둘러 고래왕조차 일격에 KO 시킨다. 녹색의 해초가 본체다.', 'Water', 'Fighting', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/781.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/647.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/781.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/781.png', '해초조각포켓몬', '25', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(782, '0647', 'Keldeo (Resolute Form)', 580, 91, 72, 90, 129, 90, 108, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/keldeo', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/10024.png', 'When it is resolute, its body fills with power and it becomes swifter. Its jumps are then too fast to follow.', '케르디오', '비늘을 때려 마음을 전달한다. 짜랑꼬가 사는 고산에서는 금속음이 메아리친다.', 'Water', 'Fighting', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/782.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/647-resolute.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/782.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/782.png', '비늘포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(783, '0648', 'Meloetta (Aria Forme)', 600, 100, 77, 77, 128, 128, 90, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/meloetta', 'https://img.pokemondb.net/sprites/scarlet-violet/icon/meloetta-aria.png', 'Its melodies are sung with a special vocalization method that can control the feelings of those who hear it.', '짜랑고우', '기합을 외치며 먹이에게 달려든다. 비늘의 펀치는 상대를 갈기갈기 찢는다.', 'Normal', 'Psychic', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/783.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/783.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/783.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/783.png', '비늘포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
