	(785, '0649', 'Genesect', 600, 71, 120, 95, 120, 95, 99, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/genesect', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/649.png', 'This Pokémon existed 300 million years ago. Team Plasma altered it and attached a cannon to its back.', '게노세크트', '플라스마단에게 개조당한 고대의 벌레포켓몬이다. 등에 있는 대포의 파워가 올라갔다.', 'Bug', 'Steel', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/785.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/649.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/785.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/785.png', '고생대포켓몬', '3', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(786, '0650', 'Chespin', 313, 56, 61, 65, 48, 45, 38, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/chespin', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/650.png', 'Such a thick shell of wood covers its head and back that even a direct hit from a truck wouldn’t faze it.', '도치마론', '머리의 가시는 평소에는 부드럽지만 힘을 주면 뾰족하고 날카로워지며 바위를 뚫어 버릴 정도로 단단해진다.', 'Grass', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/786.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/650.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/786.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/786.png', '밤송이포켓몬', '3', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(787, '0651', 'Quilladin', 405, 61, 78, 95, 56, 58, 57, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/quilladin', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/651.png', 'They strengthen their lower bodies by running into one another. They are very kind and won’t start fights.', '도치보구', '몸을 둘러싼 단단한 껍질이 적의 공격을 튕겨내고 날카로운 가시로 반격한다.', 'Grass', NULL, '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/787.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/651.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/787.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/787.png', '가시갑옷포켓몬', '3', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(788, '0652', 'Chesnaught', 530, 88, 107, 122, 74, 75, 64, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/chesnaught', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/652.png', 'When it takes a defensive posture with its fists guarding its face, it could withstand a bomb blast.', '브리가론', '몸통박치기로 50톤 전차를 뒤집는 파워를 지녔다. 자신이 방패가 되어 동료를 지킨다.', 'Grass', 'Fighting', '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/788.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/652.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/788.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/788.png', '가시갑옷포켓몬', '3', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(789, '0653', 'Fennekin', 307, 40, 45, 40, 62, 60, 60, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/fennekin', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/653.png', 'As it walks, it munches on a twig in place of a snack. It intimidates opponents by puffing hot air out of its ears.', '푸호꼬', '잔가지를 먹으면 힘이 나서 섭씨 200도가 넘는 열기를 커다란 귀에서 내뿜는다.', 'Fire', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/789.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/653.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/789.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/789.png', '여우포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(790, '0654', 'Braixen', 409, 59, 59, 58, 90, 70, 73, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/braixen', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/654.png', 'When the twig is plucked from its tail, friction sets the twig alight. The flame is used to send signals to its allies.', '테르나', '나뭇가지를 꼬리에 꽂고 있다. 꼬리털의 마찰열로 가지에 불을 붙여 싸운다.', 'Fire', NULL, '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/790.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/654.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/790.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/790.png', '여우포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(791, '0655', 'Delphox', 534, 75, 69, 72, 114, 100, 104, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/delphox', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/655.png', 'Using psychic power, it generates a fiery vortex of 5,400 degrees Fahrenheit, incinerating foes swept into this whirl of flame.', '마폭시', '지팡이 끝의 타오르는 불꽃을 바라보며 정신을 통일하면 미래에 일어날 일을 내다볼 수 있다.', 'Fire', 'Psychic', '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/791.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/655.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/791.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/791.png', '여우포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(792, '0656', 'Froakie', 314, 41, 56, 40, 62, 44, 71, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/froakie', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/656.png', 'It protects its skin by covering its body in delicate bubbles. Beneath its happy-go-lucky air, it keeps a watchful eye on its surroundings.', '개구마르', '가슴과 등에서 거품을 내뿜는다. 탄력 있는 거품으로 공격을 막아내고 데미지를 줄인다.', 'Water', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/792.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/656.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/792.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/792.png', '거품개구리포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(793, '0657', 'Frogadier', 405, 54, 63, 52, 83, 56, 97, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/frogadier', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/657.png', 'Its swiftness is unparalleled. It can scale a tower of more than 2,000 feet in a minute’s time.', '개굴반장', '거품으로 싸인 돌멩이를 던지는 기술을 쓴다. 30m 앞에 있는 빈 캔을 맞출 정도로 컨트롤이 좋다.', 'Water', NULL, '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/793.ogg', NULL, 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/793.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/793.png', '거품개구리포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(794, '0658', 'Greninja', 530, 72, 95, 67, 103, 71, 122, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/greninja', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/658.png', 'It appears and vanishes with a ninja’s grace. It toys with its enemies using swift movements, while slicing them with throwing stars of sharpest water.', '개굴닌자', '물을 압축시켜 수리검을 만들어 낸다. 고속으로 회전시키며 던지면 금속도 두 동강이 난다.', 'Water', 'Dark', '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/794.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/658.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/794.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/794.png', '시노비포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(795, '0658', 'Greninja (Ash-Greninja)', 640, 72, 145, 67, 153, 71, 132, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/greninja', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/658.png', 'It appears and vanishes with a ninja’s grace. It toys with its enemies using swift movements, while slicing them with throwing stars of sharpest water.', '개굴닌자', '물을 압축시켜 수리검을 만들어 낸다. 고속으로 회전시키며 던지면 금속도 두 동강이 난다.', 'Water', 'Dark', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/795.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/658.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/795.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/795.png', '시노비포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(796, '0659', 'Bunnelby', 237, 38, 36, 38, 32, 36, 57, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/bunnelby', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/659.png', 'It’s very sensitive to danger. The sound of Corviknight’s flapping will have Bunnelby digging a hole to hide underground in moments.', '파르빗', '커다란 귀로 땅을 파고 보금자리를 만든다. 하룻밤 동안 쉬지 않고 계속 팔 수 있다.', 'Normal', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/796.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/659.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/796.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/796.png', '땅구멍파기포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(797, '0660', 'Diggersby', 423, 85, 56, 77, 50, 77, 78, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/diggersby', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/660.png', 'The fur on its belly retains heat exceptionally well. People used to make heavy winter clothing from fur shed by this Pokémon.', '파르토', '커다란 귀에는 무게가 1톤을 넘는 바위를 가뿐히 들어 올릴 만한 파워가 있다. 공사 현장에서 대활약한다.', 'Normal', 'Ground', '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/797.ogg', NULL, 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/797.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/797.png', '땅구멍파기포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(798, '0661', 'Fletchling', 278, 45, 50, 43, 40, 38, 62, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/fletchling', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/661.png', 'Fletchling can be found in both rural and urban areas. They once had a huge territorial dispute with Squawkabilly. Fights broke out all over town.', '화살꼬빈', '흥분하면 체온이 2배까지 올라 체내의 호르몬이 활발해진다.', 'Normal', 'Flying', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/798.ogg', NULL, 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/798.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/798.png', '울새포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(799, '0662', 'Fletchinder', 382, 62, 73, 55, 56, 52, 84, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/fletchinder', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/662.png', 'Its territory has a radius of just over a mile. If any bird Pokémon should enter, it will show them no mercy.', '불화살빈', '부리에서 불꽃을 뿜어 풀숲을 태우고 놀라서 뛰쳐나온 사냥감을 잡는다.', 'Fire', 'Flying', '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/799.ogg', NULL, 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/799.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/799.png', '불티포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(800, '0663', 'Talonflame', 499, 78, 81, 71, 74, 69, 126, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/talonflame', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/663.png', 'When it gets excited, it vents sparks from the gaps between its feathers. These unburnable feathers are used as a fireproof material.', '파이어로', '격렬한 싸움으로 흥분하게 되면 온몸의 깃털 사이에서 불꽃을 뿜어내며 비행한다.', 'Fire', 'Flying', '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/800.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/663.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/800.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/800.png', '열화포켓몬', '255', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(801, '0664', 'Scatterbug', 200, 38, 35, 40, 27, 25, 35, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/scatterbug', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/664.png', 'This Pokémon scatters poisonous powder to repel enemies. It will eat different plants depending on where it lives.', '분이벌레', '새포켓몬에게 습격당하면 검은 가루를 흩뿌린다. 만지면 마비되는 독가루다.', 'Bug', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/801.ogg', NULL, 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/801.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/801.png', '가루뿜기포켓몬', '3', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(802, '0665', 'Spewpa', 213, 45, 22, 60, 27, 30, 29, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/spewpa', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/665.png', 'Spewpa doesn’t live in a fixed location. It roams where it pleases across the fields and mountains, building up the energy it needs to evolve.', '분떠도리', '수풀의 그늘에 숨어 산다. 적에게 공격당하면 몸의 털을 뾰족하게 곤두세우며 위협한다.', 'Bug', NULL, '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/802.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/665.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/802.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/802.png', '가루뿜기포켓몬', '3', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(803, '0666', 'Vivillon', 411, 80, 52, 50, 90, 50, 89, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/vivillon', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/666.png', 'The patterns on this Pokémon’s wings depend on the climate and topography of its habitat. It scatters colorful scales.', '비비용', '세계에는 다양한 무늬의 날개를 가진 비비용이 있다. 살고 있는 곳의 기후에 영향을 받는 것 같다.', 'Bug', 'Flying', '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/803.ogg', NULL, 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/803.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/803.png', '인분포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(804, '0667', 'Litleo', 369, 62, 50, 58, 73, 54, 72, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/litleo', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/667.png', 'The more a Litleo trains its body and spirit by battling mighty enemies, the hotter its mane will grow.', '레오꼬', '강한 상대에게 맞설 때일수록 갈기의 온도가 높아지고 전신에 힘이 넘쳐난다.', 'Fire', 'Normal', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/804.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/667.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/804.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/804.png', '어린사자포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(805, '0668', 'Pyroar', 507, 86, 68, 72, 109, 66, 106, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/pyroar', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/668.png', 'The mane of a male Pyroar heats up to over 3,600 degrees Fahrenheit during battle. Merely approaching it will cause severe burns.', '화염레오', '무리 중에서 가장 커다란 불꽃 갈기를 지닌 수컷이 리더로서 동료들을 이끈다.', 'Fire', 'Normal', '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/805.ogg', NULL, 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/805.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/805.png', '임금포켓몬', '30', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(806, '0669', 'Flabébé', 303, 44, 38, 39, 61, 79, 42, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/flabebe', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/669.png', 'Flabébé wears a crown made from pollen it’s collected from its flower. The crown has hidden healing properties.', '플라베베', '꿈틀거리며 사람에게 다가오다 느닷없이 머리를 폭발시킨다. 울트라비스트의 일종인 듯하다.', 'Fairy', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/806.ogg', NULL, 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/806.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/806.png', '한송이포켓몬', '30', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(807, '0670', 'Floette', 371, 54, 45, 47, 75, 98, 52, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/floette', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/670.png', 'It gives its own power to flowers, pouring its heart into caring for them. Floette never forgives anyone who messes up a flower bed.', '플라엣테', '꽃밭을 날아다니며 말라가는 꽃을 보살핀다. 꽃의 숨겨진 힘을 끌어내어 싸운다.', 'Fairy', NULL, '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/807.ogg', NULL, 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/807.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/807.png', '한송이포켓몬', '3', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(808, '0671', 'Florges', 552, 78, 65, 68, 112, 154, 75, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/florges', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/671.png', 'Its life can span several hundred years. It’s said to devote its entire life to protecting gardens.', '플라제스', '멋진 화원이 영역이다. 화초가 내보내는 에너지를 쬐어 자신의 파워로 삼는다.', 'Fairy', NULL, '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/808.ogg', NULL, 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/808.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/808.png', '가든포켓몬', '3', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(809, '0672', 'Skiddo', 350, 66, 65, 48, 62, 57, 52, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/skiddo', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/672.png', 'As long as it has sunlight and water, Skiddo can make energy with the leaves on its body, allowing it to live on rocky mountains barren of food.', '메이클', '사람과 살기 시작한 최초의 포켓몬이라고 한다. 온화한 성격의 포켓몬이다.', 'Grass', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/809.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/672.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/809.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/809.png', '라이드포켓몬', '3', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(810, '0673', 'Gogoat', 531, 123, 100, 62, 97, 81, 68, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/gogoat', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/673.png', 'These Pokémon live in herds in mountainous places. The victor in their contests of clashing horns will become the leader of the herd.', '고고트', '뿔을 잡을 때 느껴지는 작은 차이로 트레이너의 마음을 읽어낼 수 있기에 하나가 되어 달릴 수 있는 것이다.', 'Grass', NULL, '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/810.ogg', NULL, 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/810.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/810.png', '라이드포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(811, '0674', 'Pancham', 348, 67, 82, 62, 46, 48, 43, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/pancham', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/674.png', 'Wanting to make sure it’s taken seriously, Pancham’s always giving others a glare. But if it’s not focusing, it ends up smiling.', '판짱', '적이 얕잡아 보지 못하도록 열심히 노려보지만, 효과가 약하다. 물고 있는 잎사귀가 트레이드마크다.', 'Fighting', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/811.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/674.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/811.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/811.png', '개구쟁이포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(812, '0675', 'Pangoro', 495, 95, 124, 78, 69, 71, 58, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/pangoro', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/675.png', 'Using its leaf, Pangoro can predict the moves of its opponents. It strikes with punches that can turn a dump truck into scrap with just one hit.', '부란다', '성질이 거칠어 툭하면 싸우려 들지만 약자를 괴롭히는 일은 용서하지 않는다. 잎사귀로 적의 움직임을 읽는다.', 'Fighting', 'Dark', '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/812.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/675.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/812.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/812.png', '무서운얼굴포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(813, '0676', 'Furfrou', 472, 75, 80, 60, 65, 90, 102, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/furfrou', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/676.png', 'Left alone, its fur will grow longer and longer, but it will only allow someone it trusts to cut it.', '트리미앙', '복슬복슬한 털을 깎고 다듬으면 모습이 아름다워질 뿐만 아니라 몸의 움직임도 좋아진다.', 'Normal', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/813.ogg', NULL, 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/813.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/813.png', '푸들포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(814, '0677', 'Espurr', 355, 62, 48, 54, 63, 60, 68, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/espurr', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/677.png', 'There’s enough psychic power in Espurr to send a wrestler flying, but because this power can’t be controlled, Espurr finds it troublesome.', '냐스퍼', '강력한 사이코 파워가 새어 나가지 않도록 방출되는 기관을 귀로 막고 있다.', 'Psychic', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/814.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/677.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/814.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/814.png', '자제포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(815, '0678', 'Meowstic (Male)', 466, 74, 48, 76, 83, 81, 104, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/meowstic', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/678.png', 'The eyeball patterns on the interior of its ears emit psychic energy. It keeps the patterns tightly covered because that power is too immense.', '냐오닉스', '위험이 다가오면 귀를 들어 올리고 10톤 트럭을 눌러 부술 정도의 사이코 파워를 방출한다.', 'Psychic', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/815.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/678.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/815.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/815.png', '억제포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(816, '0678', 'Meowstic (Female)', 466, 74, 48, 76, 83, 81, 104, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/meowstic', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/10025.png', 'The eyeball patterns on the interior of its ears emit psychic energy. It keeps the patterns tightly covered because that power is too immense.', '냐오닉스', '위험이 다가오면 귀를 들어 올리고 10톤 트럭을 눌러 부술 정도의 사이코 파워를 방출한다.', 'Psychic', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/816.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/10025.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/816.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/816.png', '억제포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(817, '0679', 'Honedge', 325, 45, 80, 100, 35, 37, 28, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/honedge', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/679.png', 'The blue eye on the sword’s handguard is the true body of Honedge. With its old cloth, it drains people’s lives away.', '단칼빙', '죽은 자의 혼이 고대의 검에 깃들어 태어났다고 한다. 사람에게 씌어 생명을 빨아들인다.', 'Steel', 'Ghost', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/817.ogg', NULL, 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/817.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/817.png', '도검포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(818, '0680', 'Doublade', 448, 59, 110, 150, 45, 49, 35, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/doublade', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/680.png', 'The two swords employ a strategy of rapidly alternating between offense and defense to bring down their prey.', '쌍검킬', '진화하여 2자루로 분열되었다. 텔레파시로 서로 대화하며 연계 공격으로 적을 조각낸다.', 'Steel', 'Ghost', '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/818.ogg', NULL, 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/818.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/818.png', '도검포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(819, '0681', 'Aegislash (Shield Forme)', 500, 60, 50, 140, 50, 140, 60, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/aegislash', 'https://img.pokemondb.net/sprites/scarlet-violet/icon/aegislash-shield.png', 'Apparently, it can detect the innate qualities of leadership. According to legend, whoever it recognizes is destined to become king.', '탐리스', '가라르의 여기저기에 있다. 양쪽 볼에 나무열매를 비축해두지 않으면 불안해한다.', 'Steel', 'Ghost', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/819.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/819.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/819.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/819.png', '볼가득포켓몬', '255', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(820, '0681', 'Aegislash (Blade Forme)', 500, 60, 140, 50, 140, 50, 60, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/aegislash', 'https://img.pokemondb.net/sprites/scarlet-violet/icon/aegislash-blade.png', 'Apparently, it can detect the innate qualities of leadership. According to legend, whoever it recognizes is destined to become king.', '요씽리스', '꼬리에 나무열매를 모아둔다. 너무 많이 모아둬서 툭툭 흘리지만 둔감해서 눈치채지 못한다.', 'Steel', 'Ghost', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/820.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/820.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/820.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/820.png', '욕심쟁이포켓몬', '90', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(821, '0682', 'Spritzee', 341, 78, 52, 60, 63, 65, 23, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/spritzee', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/682.png', 'The scent its body gives off enraptures those who smell it. Noble ladies had no shortage of love for Spritzee.', '슈쁘', '냄새를 맡은 자를 황홀하게 만드는 향기를 몸에서 풍긴다. 먹은 먹이에 따라 향기가 달라진다.', 'Fairy', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/821.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/682.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/821.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/821.png', '향수포켓몬', '255', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(822, '0683', 'Aromatisse', 462, 101, 72, 72, 99, 89, 29, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/aromatisse', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/683.png', 'The scents Aromatisse can produce range from sweet smells that bolster allies to foul smells that sap an opponent’s will to fight.', '프레프티르', '여러 가지 향기를 만들어 낸다. 상대가 싫어하는 냄새를 내보내 싸움을 유리하게 이끌어 나간다.', 'Fairy', NULL, '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/822.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/683.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/822.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/822.png', '방향포켓몬', '120', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(823, '0684', 'Swirlix', 341, 62, 48, 66, 59, 57, 49, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/swirlix', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/684.png', 'The sweet smell of cotton candy perfumes Swirlix’s fluffy fur. This Pokémon spits out sticky string to tangle up its enemies.', '나룸퍼프', '솜사탕 같은 달고 끈적끈적한 하얀 실을 내뿜어 상대를 휘감고 움직이지 못하게 한다.', 'Fairy', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/823.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/684.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/823.png', NULL, '솜사탕포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(824, '0685', 'Slurpuff', 480, 82, 80, 86, 85, 75, 72, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/slurpuff', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/685.png', 'Slurpuff’s fur contains a lot of air, making it soft to the touch and lighter than it looks.', '나루림', '아주 약간의 냄새도 구별할 수 있는 민감한 후각을 살려 파티시에를 돕고 있다.', 'Fairy', NULL, '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/824.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/685.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/824.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/824.png', '휩포켓몬', '255', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(825, '0686', 'Inkay', 288, 53, 54, 53, 37, 46, 45, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/inkay', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/686.png', 'By exposing foes to the blinking of its luminescent spots, Inkay demoralizes them, and then it seizes the chance to flee.', '오케이징', '깜빡이는 발광체를 바라본 상대는 눈앞이 어두컴컴해져 전의를 상실해버리고 만다.', 'Dark', 'Psychic', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/825.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/686.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/825.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/825.png', '회전포켓몬', '120', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(826, '0687', 'Malamar', 482, 86, 92, 88, 68, 75, 73, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/malamar', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/687.png', 'It’s said that Malamar’s hypnotic powers played a role in certain history-changing events.', '칼라마네로', '포켓몬 중에서 가장 강력한 최면술을 쓴다. 상대를 자기 마음대로 조종해버린다.', 'Dark', 'Psychic', '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/826.ogg', NULL, 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/826.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/826.png', '역전포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(827, '0687', 'Malamar (Mega Malamar)', 582, 86, 102, 88, 98, 120, 88, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/malamar', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/687.png', 'It’s said that Malamar’s hypnotic powers played a role in certain history-changing events.', '메가칼라마네로', '포켓몬 중에서 가장 강력한 최면술을 쓴다. 상대를 자기 마음대로 조종해버린다.', 'Dark', 'Psychic', '9', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/827.ogg', NULL, 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/827.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/827.png', '역전포켓몬', '255', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(828, '0688', 'Binacle', 306, 42, 52, 67, 39, 56, 50, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/binacle', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/688.png', 'If the two don’t work well together, both their offense and defense fall apart. Without good teamwork, they won’t survive.', '거북손손', '2마리의 거북손손이 하나의 바위에서 산다. 서로 싸우면 한쪽이 다른 바위로 옮겨 간다.', 'Rock', 'Water', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/828.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/688.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/828.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/828.png', '두손포켓몬', '127', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(829, '0689', 'Barbaracle', 500, 72, 105, 115, 54, 86, 68, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/barbaracle', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/689.png', 'Having an eye on each palm allows it to keep watch in all directions. In a pinch, its limbs start to act on their own to ensure the enemy’s defeat.', '거북손데스', '진화할 때 2마리의 거북손손이 7마리로 분열된 포켓몬이다. 7마리분의 파워로 싸운다.', 'Rock', 'Water', '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/829.ogg', NULL, 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/829.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/829.png', '집합포켓몬', '190', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(830, '0690', 'Skrelp', 320, 50, 60, 60, 60, 60, 30, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/skrelp', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/690.png', 'This Pokémon is a poor swimmer. If it’s caught in a fierce storm, it will sometimes get washed far away and become unable to return to its home.', '수레기', '썩은 해조로 위장한다. 눈치채지 못하고 가까이 다가온 사냥감에 독액을 끼얹어 잡는다.', 'Poison', 'Water', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/830.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/690.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/830.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/830.png', '풀모방포켓몬', '75', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(831, '0691', 'Dragalge', 494, 65, 75, 90, 97, 123, 44, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/dragalge', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/691.png', 'Since Finizen is the better swimmer, Dragalge will approach it under the cover of seaweed, then immobilize it with a poisonous attack.', '드래캄', '유조선의 선체를 썩게 할 정도의 맹독을 영역 안에 들어 온 것에 무턱대고 끼얹는다', 'Poison', 'Dragon', '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/831.ogg', NULL, 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/831.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/831.png', '풀모방포켓몬', '255', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(832, '0692', 'Clauncher', 330, 50, 53, 62, 58, 63, 44, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/clauncher', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/692.png', 'Clauncher’s claws will regrow if they fall off. The meat inside the claws is edible, but it has a distinct flavor that doesn’t appeal to all tastes.', '완철포', '커다란 집게발로 압축한 물을 권총처럼 쏘아 날고 있는 사냥감을 떨어뜨린다.', 'Water', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/832.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/692.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/832.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/832.png', '물대포포켓몬', '127', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(833, '0693', 'Clawitzer', 500, 71, 73, 88, 120, 89, 59, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/clawitzer', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/693.png', 'The cannonballs of seawater that Clawitzer launches from its claw are powerful enough to punch through tanker hulls.', '블로스터', '물 포탄을 발사하는 거대한 집게발을 지녔다. 유조선의 선체를 뚫어 버린다.', 'Water', NULL, '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/833.ogg', NULL, 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/833.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/833.png', '런처포켓몬', '255', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(834, '0694', 'Helioptile', 289, 44, 38, 33, 61, 43, 70, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/helioptile', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/694.png', 'The sun powers this Pokémon’s electricity generation. Interruption of that process stresses Helioptile to the point of weakness.', '목도리키텔', '사막에서 생활한다. 태양의 빛을 쬐고 발전하면 먹이를 먹지 않아도 괜찮다.', 'Electric', 'Normal', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/834.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/694.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/834.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/834.png', '발전포켓몬', '75', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(835, '0695', 'Heliolisk', 481, 62, 55, 52, 109, 94, 109, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/heliolisk', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/695.png', 'One Heliolisk basking in the sun with its frill outspread is all it would take to produce enough electricity to power a city.', '일레도리자드', '목의 깃을 펼쳐 발전한다. 일레도리자드 1마리로 고층 빌딩에 필요한 전기를 만들어 낼 수 있다.', 'Electric', 'Normal', '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/835.ogg', NULL, 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/835.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/835.png', '발전포켓몬', '255', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(836, '0696', 'Tyrunt', 362, 58, 89, 77, 45, 45, 48, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/tyrunt', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/696.png', 'This Pokémon is selfish and likes to be pampered. It can also inflict grievous wounds on its Trainer just by playing around.', '티고라스', '화석에서 부활한 포켓몬이다. 마음에 들지 않는 일이 있으면 짜증을 내며 난동을 부린다.', 'Rock', 'Dragon', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/836.ogg', NULL, 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/836.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/836.png', '유군포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(837, '0697', 'Tyrantrum', 521, 82, 121, 119, 69, 59, 71, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/tyrantrum', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/697.png', 'A single bite of Tyrantrum’s massive jaws will demolish a car. This Pokémon was the king of the ancient world.', '견고라스', '두꺼운 철판을 종잇장처럼 물어뜯는 커다란 턱 덕분에 고대 세계에서는 무적이었다.', 'Rock', 'Dragon', '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/837.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/697.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/837.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/837.png', '폭군포켓몬', '255', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(838, '0698', 'Amaura', 362, 77, 59, 50, 67, 63, 46, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/amaura', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/698.png', 'Amaura is an ancient Pokémon that has gone extinct. Specimens of this species can sometimes be found frozen in ice.', '아마루스', '1억 년 전부터 빙하로 뒤덮여 있던 몸의 일부에서 부활한 고대의 포켓몬이다.', 'Rock', 'Ice', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/838.ogg', NULL, 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/838.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/838.png', '툰드라포켓몬', '120', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(839, '0699', 'Aurorus', 521, 123, 77, 72, 99, 92, 58, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/aurorus', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/699.png', 'When gripped by rage, Aurorus will emanate freezing air, covering everything around it in ice.', '아마루르가', '마이너스 150도의 냉기를 마름모꼴의 결정에서 내뿜어 적을 감싸 얼어붙게 한다.', 'Rock', 'Ice', '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/839.ogg', NULL, 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/839.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/839.png', '툰드라포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(840, '0700', 'Sylveon', 525, 95, 65, 65, 110, 130, 60, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/sylveon', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/700.png', 'Sylveon cuts an elegant figure as it dances lightly around, feelers fluttering, but its piercing moves aim straight for its opponents’ weak spots.', '님피아', '리본 모양의 더듬이에서 마음을 온화하게 하는 파동을 보내 싸움을 그만두게 한다.', 'Fairy', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/840.ogg', NULL, 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/840.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/840.png', '연결포켓몬', '255', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(841, '0701', 'Hawlucha', 500, 78, 92, 75, 74, 63, 118, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/hawlucha', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/701.png', 'Hawlucha live quietly without flocking together. They fight constantly with their natural enemies: noisy groups of Primeape.', '루차불', '체격은 작지만 괴력몬이나 하리뭉 등의 커다란 포켓몬과 막상막하로 싸우는 테크니션이다.', 'Fighting', 'Flying', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/841.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/701.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/841.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/841.png', '레슬링포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(842, '0701', 'Hawlucha (Mega Hawlucha)', 600, 78, 137, 100, 74, 93, 118, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/hawlucha', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/701.png', 'Hawlucha live quietly without flocking together. They fight constantly with their natural enemies: noisy groups of Primeape.', '메가루차불', '체격은 작지만 괴력몬이나 하리뭉 등의 커다란 포켓몬과 막상막하로 싸우는 테크니션이다.', 'Fighting', 'Flying', '9', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/842.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/701.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/842.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/842.png', '레슬링포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(843, '0702', 'Dedenne', 431, 67, 58, 57, 81, 67, 101, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/dedenne', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/702.png', 'Dedenne emit electrical waves from the whiskers on their cheeks to communicate with each other. When low on electricity, they curl up and sleep.', '데덴네', '수염이 안테나의 역할을 한다. 전파를 송수신해서 멀리 떨어진 동료와 서로 연락하는 것이다.', 'Electric', 'Fairy', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/843.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/702.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/843.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/843.png', '안테나포켓몬', '255', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(844, '0703', 'Carbink', 500, 50, 50, 150, 50, 150, 50, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/carbink', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/703.png', 'It’s said that somewhere in the world, there’s a mineral vein housing a large pack of slumbering Carbink. It’s also said that this pack has a queen.', '멜리시', '지하 깊은 곳에 있는 고온, 고압의 환경에서 태어났다. 머리의 돌에서 에너지를 방출한다.', 'Rock', 'Fairy', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/844.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/703.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/844.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/844.png', '보석포켓몬', '120', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(845, '0704', 'Goomy', 300, 45, 50, 35, 55, 75, 40, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/goomy', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/704.png', 'Goomy’s horns are excellent sensory organs that cover all five of Goomy’s senses. Goomy picks up on danger from the movement of the air.', '미끄메라', '가장 약한 드래곤포켓몬이다. 미끌미끌한 몸이 마르지 않도록 축축한 그늘에서 산다.', 'Dragon', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/845.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/704.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/845.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/845.png', '연체포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(846, '0705', 'Sliggoo', 452, 68, 75, 53, 83, 113, 60, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/sliggoo', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/705.png', 'When Sliggoo senses danger, the mucus coating its entire body becomes more concentrated—it’ll dissolve anything.', '미끄네일', '무엇이든 녹여버리는 점액을 분비해 적을 격퇴한다. 눈은 퇴화하여 보이지 않는다.', 'Dragon', NULL, '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/846.ogg', NULL, 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/846.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/846.png', '연체포켓몬', '255', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(847, '0705', 'Sliggoo (Hisuian Sliggoo)', 452, 58, 75, 83, 83, 113, 40, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/sliggoo', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/705.png', 'When Sliggoo senses danger, the mucus coating its entire body becomes more concentrated—it’ll dissolve anything.', '히스이 미끄네일', '무엇이든 녹여버리는 점액을 분비해 적을 격퇴한다. 눈은 퇴화하여 보이지 않는다.', 'Steel', 'Dragon', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/847.ogg', NULL, 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/847.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/847.png', '연체포켓몬', '60', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(848, '0706', 'Goodra', 600, 90, 100, 70, 110, 150, 80, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/goodra', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/706.png', 'This Pokémon is uncontrollable when enraged. It rampages on and on, lashing its tail with enough power to send a dump truck flying.', '미끄래곤', '사람을 잘 따르는 드래곤포켓몬이다. 좋아하는 트레이너에게 달려들어 미끈미끈한 점액투성이로 만들어 버린다.', 'Dragon', NULL, '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/848.ogg', NULL, 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/848.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/848.png', '드래곤포켓몬', '75', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(849, '0706', 'Goodra (Hisuian Goodra)', 600, 80, 100, 100, 110, 150, 60, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/goodra', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/706.png', 'This Pokémon is uncontrollable when enraged. It rampages on and on, lashing its tail with enough power to send a dump truck flying.', '히스이 미끄래곤', '사람을 잘 따르는 드래곤포켓몬이다. 좋아하는 트레이너에게 달려들어 미끈미끈한 점액투성이로 만들어 버린다.', 'Steel', 'Dragon', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/849.ogg', NULL, 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/849.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/849.png', '드래곤포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(850, '0707', 'Klefki', 470, 57, 80, 91, 80, 87, 75, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/klefki', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/707.png', 'In the past, noble families entrusted their vault keys to a Klefki. They passed the Klefki down through the generations, taking good care of it.', '클레피', '열쇠를 모으는 습성이 있다. 적에게 습격당하면 열쇠로 짤랑짤랑 소리를 내어 위협한다.', 'Steel', 'Fairy', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/850.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/707.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/850.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/850.png', '열쇠꾸러미포켓몬', '190', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(851, '0708', 'Phantump', 309, 43, 70, 48, 50, 60, 38, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/phantump', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/708.png', 'With a voice like a human child’s, it cries out to lure adults deep into the forest, getting them lost among the trees.', '나목령', '썩은 그루터기에 혼이 깃들어 포켓몬이 되었다. 사람이 가까이 가지 않는 숲에 산다.', 'Ghost', 'Grass', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/851.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/708.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/851.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/851.png', '그루터기포켓몬', '75', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(852, '0709', 'Trevenant', 474, 85, 110, 76, 65, 82, 56, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/trevenant', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/709.png', 'Small roots that extend from the tips of this Pokémon’s feet can tie into the trees of the forest and give Trevenant control over them.', '대로트', '다른 나무들을 자유자재로 조종한다. 숲을 어지럽히는 인간은 죽을 때까지 숲에서 벗어나지 못하게 한다.', 'Ghost', 'Grass', '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/852.ogg', NULL, 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/852.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/852.png', '고목포켓몬', '180', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(853, '0710', 'Pumpkaboo (Average Size)', 335, 49, 66, 70, 44, 55, 51, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/pumpkaboo', 'https://img.pokemondb.net/sprites/scarlet-violet/icon/pumpkaboo-average.png', 'It is said to carry wandering spirits to the place where they belong so they can move on.', '케오퍼스', '온몸이 근육덩어리다. 촉수를 사용해서 펼치는 조르기 기술의 위력은 무시무시하다.', 'Ghost', 'Grass', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/853.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/853.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/853.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/853.png', '유술포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(854, '0710', 'Pumpkaboo (Small Size)', 335, 44, 66, 70, 44, 55, 56, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/pumpkaboo', 'https://img.pokemondb.net/sprites/scarlet-violet/icon/pumpkaboo-small.png', 'It is said to carry wandering spirits to the place where they belong so they can move on.', '데인차', '차게 식은 남은 홍차에 외로움을 타는 영혼이 깃들어 포켓몬이 되었다고 전해진다.', 'Ghost', 'Grass', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/854.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/854.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/854.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/854.png', '홍차포켓몬', '120', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(855, '0710', 'Pumpkaboo (Large Size)', 335, 54, 66, 70, 44, 55, 46, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/pumpkaboo', 'https://img.pokemondb.net/sprites/scarlet-violet/icon/pumpkaboo-large.png', 'It is said to carry wandering spirits to the place where they belong so they can move on.', '포트데스', '앤티크한 찻주전자에 산다. 대부분 위작이지만 매우 드물게 진품이 발견되기도 한다.', 'Ghost', 'Grass', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/855.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/855.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/855.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/855.png', '홍차포켓몬', '60', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(856, '0710', 'Pumpkaboo (Super Size)', 335, 59, 66, 70, 44, 55, 41, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/pumpkaboo', 'https://img.pokemondb.net/sprites/scarlet-violet/icon/pumpkaboo-super.png', 'It is said to carry wandering spirits to the place where they belong so they can move on.', '몸지브림', '머리의 돌기로 생물의 기분을 감지한다. 온화한 자에게만 마음을 연다.', 'Ghost', 'Grass', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/856.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/856.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/856.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/856.png', '차분포켓몬', '235', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(857, '0711', 'Gourgeist (Average Size)', 494, 65, 90, 122, 58, 75, 84, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/gourgeist', 'https://img.pokemondb.net/sprites/scarlet-violet/icon/gourgeist-average.png', 'It enwraps its prey in its hairlike arms. It sings joyfully as it observes the suffering of its prey.', '손지브림', '강한 감정을 품은 자라면 누가 됐든 조용하게 만드는데 그 수단이 매우 난폭하다.', 'Ghost', 'Grass', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/857.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/857.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/857.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/857.png', '정숙포켓몬', '120', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(858, '0711', 'Gourgeist (Small Size)', 494, 55, 85, 122, 58, 75, 99, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/gourgeist', 'https://img.pokemondb.net/sprites/scarlet-violet/icon/gourgeist-small.png', 'It enwraps its prey in its hairlike arms. It sings joyfully as it observes the suffering of its prey.', '브리무음', '두통이 생길 정도의 사이코 파워를 주위에 발산해서 다른 생물이 접근하지 못하게 한다.', 'Ghost', 'Grass', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/858.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/858.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/858.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/858.png', '정적포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(859, '0711', 'Gourgeist (Large Size)', 494, 75, 95, 122, 58, 75, 69, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/gourgeist', 'https://img.pokemondb.net/sprites/scarlet-violet/icon/gourgeist-large.png', 'It enwraps its prey in its hairlike arms. It sings joyfully as it observes the suffering of its prey.', '메롱꿍', '사람이나 포켓몬이 싫어하는 감정을 가질 때 발생시키는 마이너스 에너지를 코로 빨아들여서 건강해진다.', 'Ghost', 'Grass', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/859.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/859.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/859.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/859.png', '꾀부리기포켓몬', '255', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(860, '0711', 'Gourgeist (Super Size)', 494, 85, 100, 122, 58, 75, 54, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/gourgeist', 'https://img.pokemondb.net/sprites/scarlet-violet/icon/gourgeist-super.png', 'It enwraps its prey in its hairlike arms. It sings joyfully as it observes the suffering of its prey.', '쏘겨모', '납작 엎드려서 사과하는 척하다가 창처럼 뾰족한 뒷머리로 찌르는 전법을 구사한다.', 'Ghost', 'Grass', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/860.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/860.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/860.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/860.png', '성악포켓몬', '120', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(861, '0712', 'Bergmite', 304, 55, 69, 85, 32, 35, 28, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/bergmite', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/712.png', 'Bergmite protects itself by coating its body in ice formed by frigid air of −148 degrees Fahrenheit. It fights with Frigibax whenever they meet.', '꽁어름', '몸을 둘러싼 얼음이 적의 공격을 막는다. 깨져도 냉기로 재빨리 얼음을 얼린다.', 'Ice', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/861.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/712.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/861.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/861.png', '얼음덩이포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(862, '0713', 'Avalugg', 514, 95, 117, 184, 44, 46, 28, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/avalugg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/713.png', 'This Pokémon uses its massive icy body to flatten anything that gets in its way. When it’s floating out on the ocean, it looks exactly like drift ice.', '크레베이스', '얼어붙은 몸은 강철처럼 단단하다. 앞을 가로막는 것을 커다란 몸으로 파괴하며 이동한다.', 'Ice', NULL, '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/862.ogg', NULL, 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/862.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/862.png', '빙산포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(863, '0713', 'Avalugg (Hisuian Avalugg)', 514, 95, 127, 184, 34, 36, 38, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/avalugg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/713.png', 'This Pokémon uses its massive icy body to flatten anything that gets in its way. When it’s floating out on the ocean, it looks exactly like drift ice.', '히스이 크레베이스', '얼어붙은 몸은 강철처럼 단단하다. 앞을 가로막는 것을 커다란 몸으로 파괴하며 이동한다.', 'Ice', 'Rock', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/863.ogg', NULL, 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/863.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/863.png', '빙산포켓몬', '90', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(864, '0714', 'Noibat', 245, 40, 30, 35, 45, 40, 55, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/noibat', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/714.png', 'Noibat can change the frequency of its sound waves at will, and it generates ultrasonic waves of up to 200,000 hertz.', '음뱃', '캄캄한 동굴에서 산다. 20만Hz의 초음파를 커다란 귀에서 발사한다.', 'Flying', 'Dragon', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/864.ogg', NULL, 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/864.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/864.png', '음파포켓몬', '30', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(865, '0715', 'Noivern', 535, 85, 70, 80, 97, 80, 123, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/noivern', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/715.png', 'In the dark, even Hydreigon are terrified of this Pokémon. But in the light, Noivern is the one that avoids battle.', '음번', '귀에서 발생하는 초음파로 거대한 바위도 분쇄한다. 어둠을 틈타 공격한다.', 'Flying', 'Dragon', '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/865.ogg', NULL, 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/865.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/865.png', '음파포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(866, '0716', 'Xerneas', 680, 126, 131, 95, 131, 98, 99, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/xerneas', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/716.png', 'When the horns on its head shine in seven colors, it is said to be sharing everlasting life.', '제르네아스', '영원한 생명을 나누어 준다고 한다. 수목의 모습으로 1000년 동안 잠들고 부활한다.', 'Fairy', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/866.ogg', NULL, 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/866.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/866.png', '생명포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(867, '0717', 'Yveltal', 680, 126, 131, 95, 131, 98, 99, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/yveltal', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/717.png', 'When its life comes to an end, it absorbs the life energy of every living thing and turns into a cocoon once more.', '이벨타르', '날개와 꼬리를 펼치고 빨갛게 빛날 때 살아 있는 생명을 빨아들이는 전설의 포켓몬.', 'Dark', 'Flying', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/867.ogg', NULL, 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/867.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/867.png', '파괴포켓몬', '90', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(868, '0718', 'Zygarde (50% Forme)', 600, 108, 100, 121, 81, 95, 95, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/zygarde', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/718.png', 'Some say it can change to an even more powerful form when battling those who threaten the ecosystem.', '지가르데', '크림으로 이루어진 몸을 가졌다. 공기 중을 떠도는 달콤한 향기의 성분이 모여서 태어났다.', 'Dragon', 'Ground', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/868.ogg', NULL, 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/868.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/868.png', '크림포켓몬', '200', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(869, '0718', 'Zygarde (10% Forme)', 486, 54, 100, 71, 61, 85, 115, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/zygarde', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/10181.png', 'Some say it can change to an even more powerful form when battling those who threaten the ecosystem.', '지가르데', '믿을 수 있는 트레이너에게는 크림으로 데코레이션한 나무열매를 대접한다.', 'Dragon', 'Ground', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/869.ogg', NULL, 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/869.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/869.png', '크림포켓몬', '100', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(870, '0718', 'Zygarde (Complete Forme)', 708, 216, 100, 121, 91, 95, 85, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/zygarde', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/10120.png', 'Some say it can change to an even more powerful form when battling those who threaten the ecosystem.', '지가르데', '리더라고 불리는 1마리와 멤버라고 불리는 5마리로 이루어져 있다. 리더의 명령은 절대적이다.', 'Dragon', 'Ground', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/870.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/10120.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/870.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/870.png', '진형포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(871, '0719', 'Diancie', 600, 50, 100, 150, 100, 150, 50, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/diancie', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/719.png', 'It can instantly create many diamonds by compressing the carbon in the air between its hands.', '디안시', '멜리시의 돌연변이다. 분홍빛으로 빛나는 몸은 세계에서 가장 아름답다고 일컬어진다.', 'Rock', 'Fairy', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/871.ogg', NULL, 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/871.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/871.png', '보석포켓몬', '75', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(872, '0719', 'Diancie (Mega Diancie)', 700, 50, 160, 110, 160, 110, 110, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/diancie', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/719.png', 'It can instantly create many diamonds by compressing the carbon in the air between its hands.', '메가디안시', '멜리시의 돌연변이다. 분홍빛으로 빛나는 몸은 세계에서 가장 아름답다고 일컬어진다.', 'Rock', 'Fairy', '9', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/872.ogg', NULL, 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/872.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/872.png', '보석포켓몬', '190', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(873, '0720', 'Hoopa (Hoopa Confined)', 600, 80, 110, 60, 150, 130, 70, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/hoopa', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/720.png', 'It is said to be able to seize anything it desires with its six rings and six huge arms. With its power sealed, it is transformed into a much smaller form.', '후파', '공간을 뒤트는 링으로 모든 것을 멀리 떨어진 곳으로 날려버리고 마는 트러블메이커다.', 'Psychic', 'Ghost', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/873.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/720.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/873.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/873.png', '장난포켓몬', '75', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(874, '0720', 'Hoopa (Hoopa Unbound)', 680, 80, 160, 60, 170, 130, 80, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/hoopa', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/720.png', 'It is said to be able to seize anything it desires with its six rings and six huge arms. With its power sealed, it is transformed into a much smaller form.', '후파', '공간을 뒤트는 링으로 모든 것을 멀리 떨어진 곳으로 날려버리고 마는 트러블메이커다.', 'Psychic', 'Dark', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/874.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/720.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/874.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/874.png', '장난포켓몬', '60', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(875, '0721', 'Volcanion', 600, 80, 110, 120, 130, 90, 70, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/volcanion', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/721.png', 'It expels its internal steam from the arms on its back. It has enough power to blow away a mountain.', '볼케니온', '수증기를 뿜어내어 자신의 모습을 짙은 안개 속에 숨긴다. 사람이 오지 않는 산에 산다고 한다.', 'Fire', 'Water', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/875.ogg', NULL, 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/875.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/875.png', '스팀포켓몬', '60', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(876, '0722', 'Rowlet', 320, 68, 55, 55, 50, 50, 42, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/rowlet', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/722.png', 'Flies noiselessly on delicate wings. It has mastered the art of deftly launching dagger-sharp feathers from those same wings.', '나몰빼미', '경계심이 강하다. 낮에는 광합성으로 힘을 비축하고 밤이 되면 활동을 개시한다.', 'Grass', 'Flying', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/876.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/722.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/876.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/876.png', '풀깃포켓몬', '30', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(877, '0723', 'Dartrix', 420, 78, 75, 75, 70, 70, 52, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/dartrix', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/723.png', 'Regularly basks in sunlight to gather power—presumably due to the frigid climate. Nonetheless, the edges of the blade quills set into its wings are keen as ever.', '빼미스로우', '젠체하고 틈만 나면 날개의 손질을 한다. 깃털의 얼룩이 신경 쓰여 싸우지 못할 때도 있다.', 'Grass', 'Flying', '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/877.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/723.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/877.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/877.png', '칼날깃포켓몬', '180', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(878, '0724', 'Decidueye', 530, 78, 107, 75, 100, 100, 70, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/decidueye', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/724.png', 'In a tenth of a second, it can nock and fire an arrow quill, piercing an opponent’s weak point before they notice what’s happening.', '모크나이퍼', '날개에 숨겨진 살깃을 시위에 메겨서 날린다. 100m 앞의 작은 돌도 관통하는 정밀함이다.', 'Grass', 'Ghost', '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/878.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/724.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/878.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/878.png', '화살깃포켓몬', '190', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(879, '0724', 'Decidueye (Hisuian Decidueye)', 530, 88, 112, 80, 95, 95, 60, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/decidueye', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/724.png', 'In a tenth of a second, it can nock and fire an arrow quill, piercing an opponent’s weak point before they notice what’s happening.', '히스이 모크나이퍼', '날개에 숨겨진 살깃을 시위에 메겨서 날린다. 100m 앞의 작은 돌도 관통하는 정밀함이다.', 'Grass', 'Fighting', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/879.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/724.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/879.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/879.png', '화살깃포켓몬', '90', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(880, '0725', 'Litten', 320, 45, 65, 40, 60, 40, 70, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/litten', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/725.png', 'Trying to pet Litten before it trusts you will result in a nasty scratch from its sharp claws. Be careful.', '냐오불', '혀로 털을 정리하면서 배에 쌓인 빠진 털을 태워서 불을 뿜는다. 털을 뱉어내는 방법에 따라 불꽃도 변한다.', 'Fire', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/880.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/725.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/880.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/880.png', '불고양이포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(881, '0726', 'Torracat', 420, 65, 85, 50, 80, 50, 90, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/torracat', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/726.png', 'When facing a powerful enemy, Torracat’s fighting spirit gets pumped up, and its fire bell blazes hotter.', '냐오히트', '목 주변에 불꽃의 방울이 있다. 불꽃을 뿜어낼 때 딸랑딸랑 높은 소리가 난다.', 'Fire', NULL, '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/881.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/726.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/881.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/881.png', '불고양이포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(882, '0727', 'Incineroar', 530, 95, 115, 90, 80, 90, 60, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/incineroar', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/727.png', 'Incineroar’s rough and aggressive behavior is its most notable trait, but the way it helps out small Pokémon shows that it has a kind side as well.', '어흥염', '거칠고 제멋대로인 성격이다. 기분이 내키지 않으면 트레이너의 명령도 아무렇지 않게 무시한다.', 'Fire', 'Dark', '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/882.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/727.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/882.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/882.png', '힐포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(883, '0728', 'Popplio', 320, 50, 54, 54, 66, 56, 40, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/popplio', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/728.png', 'If Popplio want to create big, powerful balloons, they must be persistent. It takes daily practice for these Pokémon to develop their skills.', '누리공', '노력하는 성질로 유명하다. 체액을 코로 부풀린 풍선을 적에게 부딪힌다.', 'Water', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/883.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/728.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/883.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/883.png', '강치포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(884, '0729', 'Brionne', 420, 60, 69, 69, 91, 81, 50, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/brionne', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/729.png', 'On nights when the sea is calm, Brionne dance with one another to the singing of the Primarina that’s leading them.', '키요공', '댄스가 특기이며 춤추면서 계속해서 물의 풍선을 만들어 적에게 부딪힌다.', 'Water', NULL, '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/884.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/729.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/884.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/884.png', '아이돌포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(885, '0730', 'Primarina', 530, 80, 74, 74, 126, 116, 60, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/primarina', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/730.png', 'For Primarina, every battle’s a stage. Its singing and the dancing of its balloons will mesmerize the audience.', '누리레느', '물의 풍선을 노래로 컨트롤한다. 그 멜로디는 동료에게 배우며 대대로 무리에 전해진다.', 'Water', 'Fairy', '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/885.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/730.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/885.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/885.png', '솔리스트포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(886, '0731', 'Pikipek', 265, 35, 75, 30, 30, 30, 65, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/pikipek', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/731.png', 'It may look spindly, but its neck muscles are heavy-duty. It can peck at a tree 16 times per second!', '콕코구리', '1초당 16번 나무를 쪼아서 구멍을 낸다. 낸 구멍은 먹이를 넣어두는 저장고나 둥지로 쓴다.', 'Normal', 'Flying', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/886.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/731.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/886.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/886.png', '딱따구리포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(887, '0732', 'Trumbeak', 355, 55, 85, 50, 40, 50, 75, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/trumbeak', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/732.png', 'From its mouth, it fires the seeds of berries it has eaten. The scattered seeds give rise to new plants.', '크라파', '먹은 나무열매 씨앗을 부리에 저장한다. 적이나 먹이와 마주치면 한 번에 발사한다.', 'Normal', 'Flying', '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/887.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/732.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/887.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/887.png', '나팔입포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(888, '0733', 'Toucannon', 485, 80, 120, 75, 75, 75, 60, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/toucannon', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/733.png', 'Known for forming harmonious couples, this Pokémon is brought to wedding ceremonies as a good luck charm.', '왕큰부리', '부리를 발열시켜 싸운다. 그 온도는 100도를 훨씬 넘어 쪼이기만 해도 큰 화상을 입는다.', 'Normal', 'Flying', '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/888.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/733.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/888.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/888.png', '대포포켓몬', '10', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(889, '0734', 'Yungoos', 253, 48, 70, 30, 30, 30, 45, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/yungoos', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/734.png', 'It spends its waking hours searching endlessly for food. When Yungoos is hungry, its ferocity gains a certain edge.', '영구스', '날카로운 이빨로 아무거나 물어버린다. 원래 알로라에 서식하지 않고 다른 지방에서 데리고 왔다.', 'Normal', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/889.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/734.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/889.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/889.png', '순회포켓몬', '10', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(890, '0735', 'Gumshoos', 418, 88, 110, 60, 55, 60, 45, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/gumshoos', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/735.png', 'Gumshoos specializes in relentlessly tracking down prey. The simple-minded Skwovet doesn’t seem to provide Gumshoos enough challenge.', '형사구스', '먹이의 흔적을 찾으면 끈질기게 그 자리에 잠복하지만 날이 저물면 꾸벅꾸벅 존다.', 'Normal', NULL, '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/890.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/735.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/890.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/890.png', '잠복포켓몬', '255', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(891, '0736', 'Grubbin', 300, 47, 62, 45, 55, 45, 46, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/grubbin', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/736.png', 'It uses its big jaws to dig nests into the forest floor, and it loves to feed on sweet tree sap.', '턱지충이', '튼튼한 턱으로 나무를 갉아서 수액을 마신다. 평소에는 땅속에서 산다.', 'Bug', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/891.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/736.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/891.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/891.png', '유충포켓몬', '3', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(892, '0737', 'Charjabug', 400, 57, 82, 95, 55, 75, 36, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/charjabug', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/737.png', 'Its digestive processes convert the leaves it eats into electricity. An electric sac in its belly stores the electricity for later use.', '전지충이', '체내에 축전 기능을 갖추고 있다. 캠핑할 때 1마리 있으면 아주 고마운 포켓몬이다.', 'Bug', 'Electric', '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/892.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/737.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/892.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/892.png', '배터리포켓몬', '3', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(893, '0738', 'Vikavolt', 500, 77, 70, 90, 145, 75, 43, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/vikavolt', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/738.png', 'If it carries a Charjabug to use as a spare battery, a flying Vikavolt can rapidly fire high-powered beams of electricity.', '투구뿌논', '날아다니며 틈을 노린다. 전기 에너지를 큰 턱으로 모아서 적에게 발사한다.', 'Bug', 'Electric', '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/893.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/738.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/893.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/893.png', '뿔집게포켓몬', '3', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(894, '0739', 'Crabrawler', 338, 47, 82, 57, 42, 47, 63, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/crabrawler', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/739.png', 'If it loses its pincers, they’ll quickly regrow. The pincers are popular ingredients in paella since their shells produce a tasty soup stock.', '오기지게', '가위로 약점을 가드 하면서 틈을 노려 펀치를 날린다. 진 쪽은 거품을 물고 다운된다.', 'Fighting', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/894.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/739.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/894.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/894.png', '권투포켓몬', '3', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(895, '0740', 'Crabominable', 478, 97, 132, 77, 62, 67, 43, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/crabominable', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/740.png', 'Though its punches are powerful, this Pokémon’s movements are sluggish. It blows icy bubbles from its mouth to immobilize its opponents.', '모단단게', '톱을 노리려다 설산에서 헤매게 되고 추위를 견디던 중에 털이 생겨서 진화했다.', 'Fighting', 'Ice', '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/895.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/740.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/895.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/895.png', '털게포켓몬', '3', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(896, '0741', 'Oricorio (Baile Style)', 476, 75, 70, 70, 98, 70, 93, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/oricorio', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/741.png', 'This form of Oricorio has sipped red nectar. It whips up blazing flames as it moves to the steps of its passionate dance.', '춤추새 이글이글', '발굽에서 강력한 냉기를 발산한다. 원하는 것은 무엇이든 힘으로 빼앗는 폭군.', 'Fire', 'Flying', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/896.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/741.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/896.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/896.png', '사나운말포켓몬', '3', 0, NULL, 216, NULL, NULL),
	(897, '0741', 'Oricorio (Pom-Pom Style)', 476, 75, 70, 70, 98, 70, 93, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/oricorio', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/10123.png', 'This form of Oricorio has sipped red nectar. It whips up blazing flames as it moves to the steps of its passionate dance.', '춤추새 파칙파칙', '시각 이외의 오감을 사용해서 동태를 살핀다. 발에 차인 자는 영혼이 빠져나가 버린다고 한다.', 'Electric', 'Flying', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/897.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/10123.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/897.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/897.png', '빠른말포켓몬', '3', 0, NULL, 216, NULL, NULL),
	(898, '0741', 'Oricorio (Pa\'u Style)', 476, 75, 70, 70, 98, 70, 93, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/oricorio', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/10124.png', 'This form of Oricorio has sipped red nectar. It whips up blazing flames as it moves to the steps of its passionate dance.', '춤추새', '치유와 은총의 힘을 가진 자애로운 포켓몬. 먼 옛날 가라르에 군림했었다.', 'Psychic', 'Flying', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/898.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/10124.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/898.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/shiny/898.png', '킹포켓몬', '3', 0, NULL, 216, NULL, NULL),
