	(900, '0742', 'Cutiefly', 304, 40, 45, 40, 55, 40, 84, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/cutiefly', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/742.png', 'An opponent’s aura can tell Cutiefly what that opponent’s next move will be. Then Cutiefly can glide around the attack and strike back.', '에블리', '꽃의 꿀이나 꽃가루가 먹이다. 오라를 느끼는 힘을 지니고 있어 필 것 같은 꽃을 구별한다.', 'Bug', 'Fairy', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/900.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/742.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/900.png', NULL, '재니등에포켓몬', '115', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(901, '0743', 'Ribombee', 464, 60, 55, 60, 95, 70, 124, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/ribombee', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/743.png', 'Ribombee absolutely hate getting wet or rained on. In the cloudy Galar region, they are very seldom seen.', '에리본', '꽃가루를 뭉쳐서 경단을 만든다. 식용부터 전투용까지 많은 종류가 있다.', 'Bug', 'Fairy', '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/901.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/743.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/901.png', NULL, '재니등에포켓몬', '75', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(902, '0744', 'Rockruff', 280, 45, 65, 40, 30, 40, 60, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/rockruff', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/744.png', 'This Pokémon travels in a pack with others until it grows up. When its mood turns sour, it starts striking the ground with the rocks on its neck.', '암멍이', '잘 따르기 때문에 초보자에게 추천하는 포켓몬으로 불리지만 크면 기질이 거칠어진다.', 'Rock', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/902.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/744.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/902.png', NULL, '강아지포켓몬', '135', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(903, '0744', 'Rockruff (Own Tempo Rockruff)', 280, 45, 65, 40, 30, 40, 60, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/rockruff', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/744.png', 'This Pokémon travels in a pack with others until it grows up. When its mood turns sour, it starts striking the ground with the rocks on its neck.', '암멍이', '잘 따르기 때문에 초보자에게 추천하는 포켓몬으로 불리지만 크면 기질이 거칠어진다.', 'Rock', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/903.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/744.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/903.png', NULL, '강아지포켓몬', '135', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(904, '0745', 'Lycanroc (Midday Form)', 487, 75, 115, 65, 55, 65, 112, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/lycanroc', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/745.png', 'It has a calm and collected demeanor. It swiftly closes in on its prey, then slices them with the rocks in its mane.', '루가루암 한낮', NULL, 'Rock', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/904.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/745.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/904.png', NULL, '침붕포켓몬몬', '135', 0, NULL, 51, 146, 80),
