	(906, '0745', 'Lycanroc (Dusk Form)', 487, 75, 117, 65, 55, 65, 110, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/lycanroc', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/10152.png', 'It has a calm and collected demeanor. It swiftly closes in on its prey, then slices them with the rocks in its mane.', '루가루암 황혼의', NULL, 'Rock', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/906.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/10152.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/906.png', NULL, '풀고양이포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, 181, NULL, NULL),
	(907, '0746', 'Wishiwashi (Solo Form)', 175, 45, 20, 20, 25, 25, 40, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/wishiwashi', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/746.png', 'When it senses danger, its eyes tear up. The sparkle of its tears signals other Wishiwashi to gather.', '약어리 단독', NULL, 'Water', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/907.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/746.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/907.png', NULL, '풀고양이포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, 208, NULL, NULL),
	(908, '0746', 'Wishiwashi (School Form)', 620, 45, 140, 130, 140, 135, 30, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/wishiwashi', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/10127.png', 'When it senses danger, its eyes tear up. The sparkle of its tears signals other Wishiwashi to gather.', '약어리 군집', NULL, 'Water', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/908.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/10127.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/908.png', NULL, '매지션포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, 208, NULL, NULL),
	(909, '0747', 'Mareanie', 305, 50, 53, 62, 43, 52, 45, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/mareanie', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/747.png', 'It has excellent regenerative capabilities. Legs that a Mareanie has lost have a very bitter, astringent flavor—they’re not suitable as food.', '시마사리', '머리에 있는 독 가시로 먹이를 찌른다. 약해졌을 때 10개의 촉수로 잡아서 마무리한다.', 'Poison', 'Water', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/909.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/747.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/909.png', NULL, '깨비사리포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(910, '0748', 'Toxapex', 495, 50, 63, 152, 53, 142, 35, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/toxapex', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/748.png', 'Toxapex gets into fierce battles with Bruxish over areas where warm ocean currents flow, but the odds are always against it.', '더시마사리', '12개의 다리로 해저를 기어 다닌다. 더시마사리가 기어 다닌 자리에는 코산호의 찌꺼기가 흩어져있다.', 'Poison', 'Water', '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/910.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/748.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/910.png', NULL, '깨비사리포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(911, '0749', 'Mudbray', 385, 70, 100, 70, 45, 55, 45, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/mudbray', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/749.png', 'Though a slow walker, Mudbray is plenty strong. Its pace doesn’t change even when it’s loaded with 50 times its own body weight.', '머드나기', '다리에 달라붙은 진흙이 다리를 튼튼히 받들어 힘차게 달려나갈 수 있다.', 'Ground', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/911.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/749.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/911.png', NULL, '당나귀포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(912, '0750', 'Mudsdale', 500, 100, 125, 100, 55, 85, 35, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/mudsdale', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/750.png', 'Its legs are fortified with mud and harder than stone, and they can reduce a large truck to scrap with one kick.', '만마드', '입에서 뱉어내는 진흙이 굳으면 비바람에도 끄떡없어 옛날 집의 벽에는 자주 발려 있었다.', 'Ground', NULL, '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/912.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/750.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/912.png', NULL, '만마포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(913, '0751', 'Dewpider', 269, 38, 40, 52, 40, 72, 27, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/dewpider', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/751.png', 'Dewpider normally lives underwater. When it comes onto land in search of food, it takes water with it in the form of a bubble on its head.', '물거미', '먹이를 찾아서 지상으로 올라온다. 수포를 뒤집어쓴 것은 호흡과 부드러운 머리를 보호하기 위해서다.', 'Water', 'Bug', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/913.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/751.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/913.png', NULL, '수포포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(914, '0752', 'Araquanid', 454, 68, 70, 92, 50, 132, 42, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/araquanid', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/752.png', 'It acts as a caretaker for Dewpider, putting them inside its bubble and letting them eat any leftover food.', '깨비물거미', '두부의 수포로 박치기한다. 작은 포켓몬이라면 그대로 수포에 싸여 익사한다.', 'Water', 'Bug', '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/914.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/752.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/914.png', NULL, '수포포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(915, '0753', 'Fomantis', 250, 40, 55, 35, 50, 35, 35, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/fomantis', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/753.png', 'Many Trainers give their Fomantis their own flowerpots so they can sunbathe in peace and quiet.', '짜랑랑', '낮에는 빛을 쐬어 자고 밤이 되면 더욱 안전한 잠자리를 찾아 걸어 다닌다.', 'Grass', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/915.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/753.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/915.png', NULL, '풀사마귀포켓몬', '255', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(916, '0754', 'Lurantis', 480, 70, 105, 90, 80, 90, 45, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/lurantis', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/754.png', 'A lot of time and effort is required to maintain the vivid colors of its petals. This Pokémon puts its Trainer’s attentiveness to the test.', '라란티스', '선명한 몸의 색을 유지하기 위해서 굉장히 손이 가지만 그것을 취미로 하는 유별난 사람도 있다.', 'Grass', NULL, '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/916.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/754.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/916.png', NULL, '꽃사마귀포켓몬', '100', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(917, '0755', 'Morelull', 285, 40, 35, 55, 65, 75, 15, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/morelull', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/755.png', 'Morelull live in forests that stay dark even during the day. They scatter flickering spores that put enemies to sleep.', '자마슈', '깜빡이면서 빛나는 포자를 주변에 뿌린다. 그 빛을 본 자는 깊은 잠에 빠진다.', 'Grass', 'Fairy', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/917.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/755.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/917.png', NULL, '발광포켓몬', '255', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(918, '0756', 'Shiinotic', 405, 60, 45, 80, 90, 100, 30, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/shiinotic', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/756.png', 'If you see a light deep in a forest at night, don’t go near. Shiinotic will make you fall fast asleep.', '마셰이드', '한밤중에 마셰이드가 사는 숲에 가는 것은 위험하다. 이상한빛에 유인되어 다시는 돌아올 수 없게 된다.', 'Grass', 'Fairy', '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/918.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/756.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/918.png', NULL, '발광포켓몬', '120', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(919, '0757', 'Salandit', 320, 48, 44, 40, 71, 40, 77, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/salandit', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/757.png', 'Only female Salandit can produce gas laden with pheromones. Males entranced by this gas will do whatever the females tell them.', '야도뇽 랜드폼', '체액을 태워 독가스를 피운다. 가스를 들이마신 적이 휘청거리면 덮친다.', 'Poison', 'Fire', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/919.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/757.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/919.png', NULL, '독도마뱀포켓몬', '190', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(920, '0758', 'Salazzle', 480, 68, 64, 60, 111, 60, 117, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/salazzle', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/758.png', 'When two Salazzle meet, they will use their pheromone gas to fight over the males in each other’s group.', '염뉴트', '어찌 된 영문인지 암컷만 발견되고 있다. 야도뇽의 수컷을 거느리며 역하렘을 만들어서 산다.', 'Poison', 'Fire', '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/920.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/758.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/920.png', NULL, '독도마뱀포켓몬', '30', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(921, '0759', 'Stufful', 340, 70, 75, 50, 45, 50, 50, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/stufful', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/759.png', 'The way it protects itself by flailing its arms may be an adorable sight, but stay well away. This is flailing that can snap thick tree trunks.', '포곰곰', '사랑스러운 외모지만 화가 나서 버둥거리는 손발에 부딪히면 프로레슬러라도 날아가 버린다.', 'Normal', 'Fighting', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/921.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/759.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/921.png', NULL, '바둥바둥포켓몬', '190', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(922, '0760', 'Bewear', 500, 120, 125, 80, 55, 60, 60, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/bewear', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/760.png', 'The moves it uses to take down its prey would make a martial artist jealous. It tucks subdued prey under its arms to carry them to its nest.', '이븐곰', '압도적인 근력을 가지는 아주 위험한 포켓몬이다. 서식지는 기본 출입금지다.', 'Normal', 'Fighting', '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/922.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/760.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/922.png', NULL, '강한완력포켓몬', '80', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(923, '0761', 'Bounsweet', 210, 42, 30, 38, 30, 38, 32, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/bounsweet', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/761.png', 'A Greedent drawn in by the sweet scent of these Pokémon will tuck the Bounsweet in among the berries in its tail and carry them all away.', '달콤아', '맛있는 냄새가 몸에서 풍긴다. 냄새를 맡고 다가온 왕큰부리에게 통째로 먹힌다.', 'Grass', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/923.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/761.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/923.png', NULL, '후르츠포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(924, '0762', 'Steenee', 290, 52, 40, 48, 40, 48, 62, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/steenee', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/762.png', 'Steenee bounces energetically through forests. If the rind that peels off its body is pulverized, it can be used to treat stomach pains.', '달무리나', '몸을 지키기 위해 꼭지가 발달했다. 상당히 단단해서 새포켓몬이 쪼아도 전혀 문제없다.', 'Grass', NULL, '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/924.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/762.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/924.png', NULL, '후르츠포켓몬', '150', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(925, '0763', 'Tsareena', 510, 72, 120, 98, 50, 98, 72, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/tsareena', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/763.png', 'This Pokémon launches fierce yet elegant kicks with its long, slender legs. It views Quaquaval as its rival.', '달코퀸', '다리를 활용한 발차기가 특기다. 쓰러뜨린 상대를 걷어차며 큰 웃음으로 승리를 어필한다.', 'Grass', NULL, '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/925.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/763.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/925.png', NULL, '후르츠포켓몬', '75', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(926, '0764', 'Comfey', 485, 51, 52, 90, 82, 110, 100, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/comfey', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/764.png', 'These Pokémon smell very nice. All Comfey wear different flowers, so each of these Pokémon has its own individual scent.', '큐아링', '영양 만점의 줄기에 꽃을 붙인다. 꽃이 활성화해서 향기로운 아로마가 풍긴다.', 'Fairy', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/926.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/764.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/926.png', NULL, '꽃따기포켓몬', '190', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(927, '0765', 'Oranguru', 490, 90, 60, 80, 90, 110, 60, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/oranguru', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/765.png', 'This Pokémon lives quietly in the depths of the forest. The purple, cape-like fur gets longer and longer as Oranguru ages.', '하랑우탄', '굉장히 똑똑한 것으로 유명하다. 미숙한 트레이너를 깔보기 때문에 베테랑에게 맞는 포켓몬이다.', 'Normal', 'Psychic', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/927.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/765.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/927.png', NULL, '현자포켓몬', '90', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(928, '0766', 'Passimian', 490, 100, 120, 90, 40, 60, 80, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/passimian', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/766.png', 'The boss chooses 10 members of the group to go out hunting. The hunting party will evenly split the food they find with the rest of the group.', '내던숭이', '20마리 전후의 그룹을 만든다. 그 결속은 상당히 강하며 절대 동료를 버리지 않는다.', 'Fighting', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/928.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/766.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/928.png', NULL, '연계포켓몬', '255', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(929, '0767', 'Wimpod', 230, 25, 35, 40, 20, 30, 80, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/wimpod', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/767.png', 'Wimpod gather in swarms, constantly on the lookout for danger. They scatter the moment they detect an enemy’s presence.', '꼬시레', '겁이 많아서 많은 다리를 버둥거리며 필사적으로 도망친다. 도망간 자리는 반짝반짝 깨끗하다.', 'Bug', 'Water', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/929.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/767.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/929.png', NULL, '주행포켓몬', '120', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(930, '0768', 'Golisopod', 530, 75, 125, 140, 60, 90, 40, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/golisopod', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/768.png', 'They live in sunken ships or in holes in the seabed. When Golisopod and Grapploct battle, the loser becomes the winner’s meal.', '갑주무사', '날카롭고 거대한 발톱으로 공격한다. 공기나 해수마저 두 동강 낼 정도의 실력이다.', 'Bug', 'Water', '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/930.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/768.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/930.png', NULL, '장갑포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(931, '0769', 'Sandygast', 320, 55, 55, 80, 70, 45, 15, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/sandygast', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/769.png', 'It flings sand into the eyes of its prey and tries to close in on them while they’re blinded, but since Sandygast is so slow, the prey tends to escape.', '모래꿍 모래땅도롱', '객사한 자의 원통함이 아이가 만든 모래언덕에 깃들어 탄생했다.', 'Ghost', 'Ground', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/931.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/769.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/931.png', NULL, '모래산포켓몬', '190', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(932, '0770', 'Palossand', 480, 85, 75, 110, 100, 75, 35, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/palossand', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/770.png', 'From the hollows in its arms, it fires the bones of its victims, which are all dried up after being drained of their vitality.', '모래성이당', '사람을 조종하여 모래언덕을 모래성으로까지 진화시켰다. 저주의 힘도 깊어졌다.', 'Ghost', 'Ground', '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/932.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/770.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/932.png', NULL, '모래성포켓몬', '255', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(933, '0771', 'Pyukumuku', 410, 55, 60, 130, 30, 130, 5, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/pyukumuku', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/771.png', 'It’s covered in a slime that keeps its skin moist, allowing it to stay on land for days without drying up.', '해무기', '해변 등 얕은 바다에 산다. 몸에서 체내기관을 꺼내서 먹이를 잡거나 적과 싸운다.', 'Water', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/933.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/771.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/933.png', NULL, '해삼포켓몬', '120', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(934, '0772', 'Type: Null', 534, 95, 95, 95, 95, 95, 59, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/type-null', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/772.png', 'It was modeled after a mighty Pokémon of myth. The mask placed upon it limits its power in order to keep it under control.', '타입:널', NULL, 'Normal', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/934.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/772.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/934.png', NULL, '인공포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, 4, NULL, NULL),
	(935, '0773', 'Silvally', 570, 95, 95, 95, 95, 95, 95, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/silvally', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/773.png', 'The final factor needed to release this Pokémon’s true power was a strong bond with a Trainer it trusts.', '실버디', '파트너와의 신뢰로 각성한다. 자유자재로 타입을 바꾸는 능력을 발휘하며 싸운다.', 'Normal', NULL, '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/935.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/773.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/935.png', NULL, '인공포켓몬', '90', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(936, '0774', 'Minior (Meteor Form)', 440, 60, 60, 100, 60, 100, 60, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/minior', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/774.png', 'Although its outer shell is uncommonly durable, the shock of falling to the ground smashes the shell to smithereens.', '메테노 메테오', NULL, 'Rock', 'Flying', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/936.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/774.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/936.png', NULL, '불의전사포켓몬', '25', 0, NULL, 197, NULL, NULL),
	(937, '0774', 'Minior (Core Form)', 500, 60, 100, 60, 100, 60, 120, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/minior', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/10136.png', 'Although its outer shell is uncommonly durable, the shock of falling to the ground smashes the shell to smithereens.', '메테노 코어', NULL, 'Rock', 'Flying', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/937.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/10136.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/937.png', NULL, '불의검사포켓몬', '25', 0, NULL, 197, NULL, NULL),
	(938, '0775', 'Komala', 480, 65, 115, 65, 75, 95, 65, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/komala', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/775.png', 'A potent anesthetic can be made by diluting Komala’s drool. This anesthetic was used for surgeries in the past.', '자말라', '잔 채 태어나고 잔 채 죽는다. 모든 행동은 꾸고 있는 꿈에 의한 잠버릇인 것 같다.', 'Normal', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/938.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/775.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/938.png', NULL, '꿈결포켓몬', '190', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(939, '0776', 'Turtonator', 485, 60, 78, 135, 91, 85, 36, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/turtonator', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/776.png', 'Eating sulfur in its volcanic habitat is what causes explosive compounds to develop in its shell. Its droppings are also dangerously explosive.', '폭거북스', '등의 등껍질은 폭발물이다. 실수로 때리면 대폭발한다. 배의 구멍이 약점이다.', 'Fire', 'Dragon', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/939.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/776.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/939.png', NULL, '폭발거북포켓몬', '50', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(940, '0777', 'Togedemaru', 435, 65, 98, 63, 40, 73, 96, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/togedemaru', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/777.png', 'When it’s in trouble, it curls up into a ball, makes its fur spikes stand on end, and then discharges electricity indiscriminately.', '토게데마루', '등의 가시 털은 평소에 누워 있다가 흥분하면 곤두서 덮쳐오는 적을 찌른다.', 'Electric', 'Steel', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/940.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/777.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/940.png', NULL, '동글동글포켓몬', '180', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(941, '0778', 'Mimikyu', 476, 55, 90, 80, 50, 105, 96, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/mimikyu', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/778.png', 'It has taken damage and can no longer hold the head of its cloth disguise upright. For as long as it lives, Mimikyu will never forget its attacker.', '따라큐', NULL, 'Ghost', 'Fairy', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/941.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/778.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/941.png', NULL, '탈포켓몬', '90', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(942, '0779', 'Bruxish', 475, 68, 105, 70, 70, 70, 92, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/bruxish', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/779.png', 'When sunlight reflects on the ripples created by a Bruxish grinding its teeth, the water all around sparkles brilliantly.', '치갈기', '머리의 돌기에서 사이코 파워를 발산할 때 아주 귀에 거슬리는 이가는 소리가 주변에 울려 퍼진다.', 'Water', 'Psychic', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/942.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/779.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/942.png', NULL, '이갈기포켓몬', '150', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(943, '0780', 'Drampa', 485, 78, 60, 85, 135, 91, 36, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/drampa', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/780.png', 'Drampa is a kind and friendly Pokémon—up until it’s angered. When that happens, it stirs up a gale and flattens everything around.', '할비롱', '마음이 따뜻하고 착하다. 하지만 한번 화에 사로잡히면 거친 숨결로 주변을 파괴해 버린다.', 'Normal', 'Dragon', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/943.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/780.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/943.png', NULL, '느긋누긋포켓몬', '75', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(944, '0781', 'Dhelmise', 517, 70, 131, 100, 86, 90, 40, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/dhelmise', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/781.png', 'After lowering its anchor, it waits for its prey. It catches large Wailord and drains their life-force.', '타타륜', '큰 닻을 빙빙 휘둘러 고래왕조차 일격에 KO 시킨다. 녹색의 해초가 본체다.', 'Ghost', 'Grass', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/944.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/781.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/944.png', NULL, '해초조각포켓몬', '190', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(945, '0782', 'Jangmo-o', 300, 45, 55, 65, 45, 45, 45, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/jangmo-o', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/782.png', 'Jangmo-o strikes its scales to communicate with others of its kind. Its scales are actually fur that’s become as hard as metal.', '짜랑꼬', '비늘을 때려 마음을 전달한다. 짜랑꼬가 사는 고산에서는 금속음이 메아리친다.', 'Dragon', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/945.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/782.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/945.png', NULL, '비늘포켓몬', '90', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(946, '0783', 'Hakamo-o', 420, 55, 75, 90, 65, 70, 65, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/hakamo-o', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/783.png', 'Before attacking its enemies, it clashes its scales together and roars. Its sharp claws shred the opposition.', '짜랑고우', '기합을 외치며 먹이에게 달려든다. 비늘의 펀치는 상대를 갈기갈기 찢는다.', 'Dragon', 'Fighting', '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/946.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/783.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/946.png', NULL, '비늘포켓몬', '190', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(947, '0784', 'Kommo-o', 600, 75, 110, 125, 100, 105, 85, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/kommo-o', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/784.png', 'Certain ruins have paintings of ancient warriors wearing armor made of Kommo-o scales.', '짜랑고우거', '적을 보면 꼬리의 비늘을 짤랑짤랑 소리를 내며 위협한다. 약한 자는 허둥대며 도망간다.', 'Dragon', 'Fighting', '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/947.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/784.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/947.png', NULL, '비늘포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(948, '0785', 'Tapu Koko', 570, 70, 115, 85, 95, 75, 130, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/tapu-koko', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/785.png', 'The lightning-wielding guardian deity of Melemele, Tapu Koko is brimming with curiosity and appears before people from time to time.', '카푸꼬꼬꼭', '호기심 왕성한 멜레멜레의 수호신이다. 번개 구름을 불러 우레를 몸에 비축한다.', 'Electric', 'Fairy', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/948.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/785.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/948.png', NULL, '토속신포켓몬', '190', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(949, '0786', 'Tapu Lele', 570, 70, 85, 75, 130, 115, 95, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/tapu-lele', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/786.png', 'Although called a guardian deity, Tapu Lele is devoid of guilt about its cruel disposition and can be described as nature incarnate.', '카푸나비나', '천진난만하고 잔혹한 아칼라의 수호신이다. 향기로운 꽃향기가 에너지의 근원이다.', 'Psychic', 'Fairy', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/949.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/786.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/949.png', NULL, '토속신포켓몬', '90', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(950, '0787', 'Tapu Bulu', 570, 70, 130, 115, 85, 95, 75, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/tapu-bulu', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/787.png', 'It makes ringing sounds with its tail to let others know where it is, avoiding unneeded conflicts. This guardian deity of Ula’ula controls plants.', '카푸브루루', '큰 나무를 뽑아서 빙빙 휘두른다. 초목을 무성하게 만들어 그 에너지를 흡수한다.', 'Grass', 'Fairy', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/950.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/787.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/950.png', NULL, '토속신포켓몬', '120', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(951, '0788', 'Tapu Fini', 570, 70, 75, 115, 95, 130, 85, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/tapu-fini', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/788.png', 'Although it’s called a guardian deity, terrible calamities sometimes befall those who recklessly approach Tapu Fini.', '카푸느지느', '짙은 안개로 적을 혼란시켜 자멸하게 만드는 무서움을 지녔다. 해류가 에너지의 근원이다.', 'Water', 'Fairy', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/951.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/788.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/951.png', NULL, '토속신포켓몬', '190', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(952, '0789', 'Cosmog', 200, 43, 29, 31, 29, 31, 37, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/cosmog', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/789.png', 'Cosmog is very curious but not very cautious, often placing itself in danger. If things start to look dicey, it teleports away.', '코스모그', '연약한 가스 상태의 몸이다. 대기의 먼지를 모으며 천천히 성장한다.', 'Psychic', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/952.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/789.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/952.png', NULL, '성운포켓몬', '75', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(953, '0790', 'Cosmoem', 400, 43, 29, 131, 29, 131, 37, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/cosmoem', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/790.png', 'It sucks in dust from the air at an astounding rate, frantically building up energy within its core as preparation for evolution.', '코스모움', '죽은 것처럼 전혀 움직이지 않지만 만지면 어렴풋이 따뜻하다. 아주 옛날에는 달의 고치로 불렸다.', 'Psychic', NULL, '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/953.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/790.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/953.png', NULL, '원시성포켓몬', '190', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(954, '0791', 'Solgaleo', 680, 137, 137, 107, 113, 89, 97, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/solgaleo', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/791.png', 'Solgaleo was once known as the Beast That Devours the Sun. Energy in the form of light radiates boundlessly from it.', '솔가레오', '다른 세계에 산다고 전해진다. 온몸에서 격렬한 빛을 내뿜어 깜깜한 밤도 한낮처럼 비춘다.', 'Psychic', 'Steel', '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/954.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/791.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/954.png', NULL, '일륜포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(955, '0792', 'Lunala', 680, 137, 113, 89, 137, 107, 97, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/lunala', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/792.png', 'It steals the light from its surroundings and then becomes the full moon, showering its own light across the night sky.', '루나아라', '코스모그가 진화한 암컷이라고 전해진다. 제3의 눈이 떠오를 때 다른 세계로 날아간다.', 'Psychic', 'Ghost', '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/955.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/792.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/955.png', NULL, '월륜포켓몬', '120', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(956, '0793', 'Nihilego', 570, 109, 53, 47, 127, 131, 103, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/nihilego', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/793.png', 'It appeared in this world from an Ultra Wormhole. Nihilego appears to be a parasite that lives by feeding on people and Pokémon.', '텅비드', '수수께끼에 싸인 UB의 일종. 길을 가던 사람이 기생 당해 난폭해지는 모습이 목격되었다.', 'Rock', 'Poison', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/956.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/793.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/956.png', NULL, '기생포켓몬', '60', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(957, '0794', 'Buzzwole', 570, 107, 139, 139, 53, 53, 79, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/buzzwole', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/794.png', 'Buzzwole goes around showing off its abnormally swollen muscles. It is one kind of Ultra Beast.', '매시붕', '다른 세계에서 나타난 UB이다. 스스로 몸을 보여주는 행동이 자랑인지 위협인지 알 수 없다.', 'Bug', 'Fighting', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/957.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/794.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/957.png', NULL, '팽창포켓몬', '190', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(958, '0795', 'Pheromosa', 570, 71, 137, 37, 137, 37, 151, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/pheromosa', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/795.png', 'Although it’s alien to this world and a danger here, it’s apparently a common organism in the world where it normally lives.', '페로코체 마이티', '위험한 UB 중 1마리이다. 굉장한 속도로 대지를 질주하는 모습이 목격되었다.', 'Bug', 'Fighting', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/958.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/795.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/958.png', NULL, '염미포켓몬', '90', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(959, '0796', 'Xurkitree', 570, 83, 89, 71, 173, 71, 83, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/xurkitree', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/796.png', 'They’ve been dubbed Ultra Beasts. Some of them stand unmoving, like trees, with their arms and legs stuck into the ground.', '전수목', '온몸에서 엄청난 전격을 내뿜는 광경이 목격되었다. 수수께끼의 생물 UB 중 하나다.', 'Electric', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/959.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/796.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/959.png', NULL, '전기장식포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(960, '0797', 'Celesteela', 570, 97, 101, 103, 107, 101, 61, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/celesteela', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/797.png', 'Although it’s alien to this world and a danger here, it’s apparently a common organism in the world where it normally lives.', '철화구야', '울트라홀에서 나타났다. 고속으로 하늘을 나는 모습이 목격된 울트라비스트다.', 'Steel', 'Flying', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/960.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/797.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/960.png', NULL, '쏴올리기포켓몬', '255', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(961, '0798', 'Kartana', 570, 59, 181, 131, 59, 31, 109, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/kartana', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/798.png', 'Although it’s alien to this world and a danger here, it’s apparently a common organism in the world where it normally lives.', '종이신도', '울트라홀에서 나타난 UB이다. 스스로 적을 덮치진 않지만 온몸이 날카로운 흉기다.', 'Grass', 'Steel', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/961.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/798.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/961.png', NULL, '발도포켓몬', '50', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(962, '0799', 'Guzzlord', 570, 223, 101, 53, 97, 53, 43, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/guzzlord', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/799.png', 'An unknown life-form called a UB. It may be constantly hungry—it is certainly always devouring something.', '악식킹', '산을 깎아 먹고 빌딩을 삼키는 모습이 보고되었다. 울트라비스트 중 하나이다.', 'Dark', 'Dragon', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/962.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/799.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/962.png', NULL, '악식성포켓몬', '25', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(963, '0800', 'Necrozma', 600, 97, 107, 101, 127, 89, 79, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/necrozma', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/800.png', 'It needs light to survive, and it goes on a rampage seeking it out. Its laser beams will cut anything to pieces.', '네크로즈마', '지하에서 잠들어 있던 것 같다. 태고의 다른 세계에서 왔다고 추측되는 UB같은 생물이다.', 'Psychic', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/963.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/800.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/963.png', NULL, '프리즘포켓몬', '200', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(964, '0800', 'Necrozma (Dusk Mane Necrozma)', 680, 97, 157, 127, 113, 109, 77, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/necrozma', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/800.png', 'It needs light to survive, and it goes on a rampage seeking it out. Its laser beams will cut anything to pieces.', '네크로즈마 황혼의', '지하에서 잠들어 있던 것 같다. 태고의 다른 세계에서 왔다고 추측되는 UB같은 생물이다.', 'Psychic', 'Steel', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/964.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/800.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/964.png', NULL, '프리즘포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(965, '0800', 'Necrozma (Dawn Wings Necrozma)', 680, 97, 113, 109, 157, 127, 77, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/necrozma', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/800.png', 'It needs light to survive, and it goes on a rampage seeking it out. Its laser beams will cut anything to pieces.', '네크로즈마 새벽의', '지하에서 잠들어 있던 것 같다. 태고의 다른 세계에서 왔다고 추측되는 UB같은 생물이다.', 'Psychic', 'Ghost', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/965.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/800.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/965.png', NULL, '프리즘포켓몬', '190', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(966, '0800', 'Necrozma (Ultra Necrozma)', 754, 97, 167, 97, 167, 97, 129, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/necrozma', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/10157.png', 'It needs light to survive, and it goes on a rampage seeking it out. Its laser beams will cut anything to pieces.', '울트라네크로즈마', '지하에서 잠들어 있던 것 같다. 태고의 다른 세계에서 왔다고 추측되는 UB같은 생물이다.', 'Psychic', 'Dragon', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/966.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/10157.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/966.png', NULL, '프리즘포켓몬', '75', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(967, '0801', 'Magearna', 600, 80, 95, 115, 130, 115, 65, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/magearna', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/801.png', 'Built roughly 500 years ago by a scientist, the part called the Soul-Heart is the actual life-form.', '마기아나', '500년 이상 전에 만들어진 인조포켓몬이다. 사람의 말을 이해하지만 말은 못 한다.', 'Steel', 'Fairy', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/967.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/801.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/967.png', NULL, '인조포켓몬', '190', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(968, '0802', 'Marshadow', 600, 90, 125, 80, 90, 90, 125, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/marshadow', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/802.png', 'This Pokémon can conceal itself in any shadow, so it went undiscovered for a long time.', '마샤도', '그림자 안에 숨어 들을 수 있어 사람들 앞에 모습을 보이지 않아 그 존재는 환상이었다.', 'Fighting', 'Ghost', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/968.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/802.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/968.png', NULL, '그림자살이포켓몬', '25', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(969, '0803', 'Poipole', 420, 67, 73, 67, 73, 67, 73, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/poipole', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/803.png', 'An Ultra Beast that lives in a different world, it cackles wildly as it sprays its opponents with poison from the needles on its head.', '베베놈', '다른 세계에서는 여행 파트너로 삼을 정도로 친근한 울트라비스트다.', 'Poison', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/969.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/803.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/969.png', NULL, '독침포켓몬', '70', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(970, '0804', 'Naganadel', 540, 73, 73, 73, 127, 73, 121, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/naganadel', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/804.png', 'One kind of Ultra Beast, it fires a glowing, venomous liquid from its needles. This liquid is also immensely adhesive.', '아고용', '체내에 수백 리터의 독액을 갖고 있다. UB라고 불리는 생물의 일종이다.', 'Poison', 'Dragon', '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/970.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/804.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/970.png', NULL, '독침포켓몬', '25', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(971, '0805', 'Stakataka', 570, 61, 131, 211, 53, 101, 13, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/stakataka', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/805.png', 'When stone walls started moving and attacking, the brute’s true identity was this mysterious life-form, which brings to mind an Ultra Beast.', '차곡차곡', '울트라홀에서 출현했다. 여러 개의 생명이 쌓여 1마리를 형성하고 있는 듯하다.', 'Rock', 'Steel', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/971.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/805.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/971.png', NULL, '돌담포켓몬', '120', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(972, '0806', 'Blacephalon', 570, 53, 127, 53, 151, 79, 107, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/blacephalon', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/806.png', 'A UB that appeared from an Ultra Wormhole, it causes explosions, then takes advantage of opponents’ surprise to rob them of their vitality.', '두파팡', '꿈틀거리며 사람에게 다가오다 느닷없이 머리를 폭발시킨다. 울트라비스트의 일종인 듯하다.', 'Fire', 'Ghost', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/972.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/806.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/972.png', NULL, '불꽃놀이포켓몬', '60', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(973, '0807', 'Zeraora', 600, 88, 112, 75, 102, 80, 143, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/zeraora', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/807.png', 'Electricity sparks from the pads on its limbs. Wherever Zeraora runs, lightning flashes and thunder echoes.', '제라오라', '양 손발톱에 전기를 머금어 상대를 갈가리 찢는다. 피하더라도 흩날리는 전격으로 감전시킨다.', 'Electric', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/973.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/807.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/973.png', NULL, '신뢰포켓몬', '100', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(974, '0808', 'Meltan', 300, 46, 65, 65, 55, 35, 34, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/meltan', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/808.png', 'They live as a group, but when the time comes, one strong Meltan will absorb all the others and evolve.', '멜탄', '걸쭉하게 녹은 강철의 몸을 가졌다. 땅속의 철분이나 금속을 녹여서 흡수한다.', 'Steel', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/974.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/808.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/974.png', NULL, '너트포켓몬', '150', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(975, '0809', 'Melmetal', 600, 135, 143, 143, 80, 65, 34, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/melmetal', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/809.png', 'Centrifugal force is behind the punches of Melmetal’s heavy hex-nut arms. Melmetal is said to deliver the strongest punches of all Pokémon.', '멜메탈', '철을 만들어내는 힘을 가졌다고 추앙받았었다. 모종의 이유로 3000년의 세월이 흘러 되살아났다.', 'Steel', NULL, '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/975.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/809.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/975.png', NULL, '너트포켓몬', '50', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(976, '0810', 'Grookey', 310, 50, 65, 50, 40, 40, 65, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/grookey', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/810.png', 'It attacks with rapid beats of its stick. As it strikes with amazing speed, it gets more and more pumped.', '흥나숭', '특별한 스틱으로 리듬을 타면 화초를 생생하게 만드는 힘이 음파가 되어 퍼진다.', 'Grass', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/976.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/810.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/976.png', NULL, '꼬마원숭이포켓몬', '100', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(977, '0811', 'Thwackey', 420, 70, 85, 70, 55, 60, 80, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/thwackey', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/811.png', 'When it’s drumming out rapid beats in battle, it gets so caught up in the rhythm that it won’t even notice that it’s already knocked out its opponent.', '채키몽', '2개의 스틱으로 격렬한 비트를 만드는 채키몽일수록 동료들에게 존경받는다.', 'Grass', NULL, '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/977.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/811.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/977.png', NULL, '비트포켓몬', '25', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(978, '0812', 'Rillaboom', 530, 100, 125, 90, 60, 70, 85, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/rillaboom', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/812.png', 'The one with the best drumming techniques becomes the boss of the troop. It has a gentle disposition and values harmony among its group.', '고릴타', '특별한 그루터기의 파워를 드럼 연주로 컨트롤한다. 뿌리를 조종해서 싸운다.', 'Grass', NULL, '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/978.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/812.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/978.png', NULL, '드러머포켓몬', '100', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(979, '0813', 'Scorbunny', 310, 50, 71, 40, 40, 40, 69, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/scorbunny', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/813.png', 'It has special pads on the backs of its feet, and one on its nose. Once it’s raring to fight, these pads radiate tremendous heat.', '염버니', '뛰어다니며 체온을 높이면 불꽃 에너지가 몸 안에 맴돌아 본래의 힘을 발휘할 수 있다.', 'Fire', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/979.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/813.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/979.png', NULL, '토끼포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(980, '0814', 'Raboot', 420, 65, 86, 60, 55, 60, 94, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/raboot', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/814.png', 'It kicks berries right off the branches of trees and then juggles them with its feet, practicing its footwork.', '래비풋', '푹신푹신한 털 덕분에 추위에 강해지고 더 높은 온도의 불꽃 기술도 쓸 수 있게 되었다.', 'Fire', NULL, '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/980.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/814.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/980.png', NULL, '토끼포켓몬', '90', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(981, '0815', 'Cinderace', 530, 80, 116, 75, 65, 75, 119, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/cinderace', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/815.png', 'It’s skilled at both offense and defense, and it gets pumped up when cheered on. But if it starts showboating, it could put itself in a tough spot.', '에이스번', '작은 돌을 리프팅해서 불꽃의 축구공을 만들고 날카로운 슛으로 상대를 태워버린다.', 'Fire', NULL, '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/981.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/815.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/981.png', NULL, '스트라이커포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(982, '0816', 'Sobble', 310, 50, 40, 40, 70, 40, 70, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/sobble', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/816.png', 'When it gets wet, its skin changes color, and this Pokémon becomes invisible as if it were camouflaged.', '울머기', '겁을 먹으면 양파 100개와 맞먹는 최루 성분의 눈물을 흘려서 상대도 덩달아 울게 만든다.', 'Water', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/982.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/816.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/982.png', NULL, '물도마뱀포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(983, '0817', 'Drizzile', 420, 65, 60, 55, 95, 55, 90, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/drizzile', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/817.png', 'Highly intelligent but also very lazy, it keeps enemies out of its territory by laying traps everywhere.', '누겔레온', '손바닥에서 나오는 수분을 빚어서 만든 물구슬로 두뇌 싸움을 펼친다.', 'Water', NULL, '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/983.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/817.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/983.png', NULL, '물도마뱀포켓몬', '25', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(984, '0818', 'Inteleon', 530, 70, 85, 65, 125, 65, 120, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/inteleon', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/818.png', 'Its nictitating membranes let it pick out foes’ weak points so it can precisely blast them with water that shoots from its fingertips at Mach 3.', '인텔리레온', '다채로운 기능을 숨기고 있다. 손끝에서 물을 분사하고 등에 있는 피막으로 바람을 탄다.', 'Water', NULL, '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/984.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/818.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/984.png', NULL, '에이전트포켓몬', '30', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(985, '0819', 'Skwovet', 275, 70, 55, 55, 35, 35, 25, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/skwovet', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/819.png', 'No matter how much it stuffs its belly with food, it is always anxious about getting hungry again. So, it stashes berries in its cheeks and tail.', '탐리스', '가라르의 여기저기에 있다. 양쪽 볼에 나무열매를 비축해두지 않으면 불안해한다.', 'Normal', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/985.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/819.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/985.png', NULL, '볼가득포켓몬', '50', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(986, '0820', 'Greedent', 460, 120, 95, 95, 55, 75, 20, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/greedent', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/820.png', 'This Pokémon makes off with heaps of fallen berries by wrapping them in its tail, which is roughly twice the length of its body.', '요씽리스', '꼬리에 나무열매를 모아둔다. 너무 많이 모아둬서 툭툭 흘리지만 둔감해서 눈치채지 못한다.', 'Normal', NULL, '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/986.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/820.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/986.png', NULL, '욕심쟁이포켓몬', '50', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(987, '0821', 'Rookidee', 245, 38, 47, 35, 33, 35, 57, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/rookidee', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/821.png', 'The females are fussier than the males. If another creature dirties a female Rookidee’s wings, it’ll peck the offender relentlessly in a burning rage.', '파라꼬', '아무리 강한 상대라도 덤벼드는 용감한 성격을 가졌다. 도리어 당하면서도 점점 단련되어 간다.', 'Flying', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/987.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/821.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/987.png', NULL, '아기새포켓몬', '30', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(988, '0822', 'Corvisquire', 365, 68, 67, 55, 43, 55, 77, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/corvisquire', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/822.png', 'This intelligent Pokémon will quickly learn how to use any tool it can hold in its beak or its talons.', '파크로우', '발로 돌멩이를 쥐어서 던지거나 로프를 상대에게 휘감는 등 도구를 다루는 지혜를 가졌다.', 'Flying', NULL, '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/988.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/822.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/988.png', NULL, '까마귀포켓몬', '30', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(989, '0823', 'Corviknight', 495, 98, 87, 105, 53, 85, 67, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/corviknight', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/823.png', 'Although its wings have partly turned to steel and become heavy as a result, this Pokémon flies through the skies with ease.', '아머까오', '가라르지방의 하늘에는 적수가 없다. 검고 윤이 나는 강철의 자태는 상대에게 위압감을 주어 겁먹게 만든다.', 'Flying', 'Steel', '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/989.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/823.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/989.png', NULL, '까마귀포켓몬', '30', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(990, '0824', 'Blipbug', 180, 25, 20, 20, 25, 45, 45, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/blipbug', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/824.png', 'Often found in gardens, this Pokémon has hairs on its body that it uses to assess its surroundings.', '두루지벌레', '언제나 부지런히 정보를 모으기 때문에 똑똑하다. 단, 힘은 그저 그렇다.', 'Bug', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/990.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/824.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/990.png', NULL, '유충포켓몬', '30', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(991, '0825', 'Dottler', 335, 50, 35, 80, 50, 90, 30, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/dottler', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/825.png', 'As it grows inside its shell, it uses its psychic abilities to monitor the outside world and prepare for evolution.', '레돔벌레', '거의 움직이지 않지만 살아 있다. 식음을 전폐하고 껍질에 은둔하는 동안 초능력에 눈을 뜬 모양이다.', 'Bug', 'Psychic', '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/991.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/825.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/991.png', NULL, '레이돔포켓몬', '50', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(992, '0826', 'Orbeetle', 505, 60, 45, 110, 80, 120, 90, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/orbeetle', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/826.png', 'It emits psychic energy to observe and study what’s around it—and what’s around it can include things over six miles away.', '이올브', '똑똑한 포켓몬으로 유명하다. 커다란 두뇌는 강력한 사이코 파워를 가졌다는 증거다.', 'Bug', 'Psychic', '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/992.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/826.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/992.png', NULL, '칠성포켓몬', '50', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(993, '0827', 'Nickit', 245, 40, 28, 28, 47, 52, 50, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/nickit', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/827.png', 'Cunning and cautious, this Pokémon survives by stealing food from others. It erases its tracks with swipes of its tail as it makes off with its plunder.', '훔처우', '다른 포켓몬이 발견한 먹이를 훔치며 산다. 푹신푹신한 볼록살 덕분에 발소리가 나지 않는다.', 'Dark', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/993.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/827.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/993.png', NULL, '여우포켓몬', '30', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(994, '0828', 'Thievul', 455, 70, 58, 58, 87, 92, 90, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/thievul', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/828.png', 'With a lithe body and sharp claws, it goes around stealing food and eggs. Boltund is its natural enemy.', '폭슬라이', '목표로 한 먹잇감에 슬쩍 마킹을 해둔다. 냄새를 따라가다 먹이의 주인이 방심하고 있을 때 훔치려 든다.', 'Dark', NULL, '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/994.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/828.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/994.png', NULL, '여우포켓몬', '30', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(995, '0829', 'Gossifleur', 250, 40, 40, 60, 40, 60, 10, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/gossifleur', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/829.png', 'It whirls around in the wind while singing a joyous song. This delightful display has charmed many into raising this Pokémon.', '꼬모카', '다리 하나를 땅에 꽂은 채 햇빛을 잔뜩 받으면 꽃잎이 선명한 색을 띠게 된다.', 'Grass', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/995.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/829.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/995.png', NULL, '꽃장식포켓몬', '30', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(996, '0830', 'Eldegoss', 460, 60, 50, 90, 80, 120, 60, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/eldegoss', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/830.png', 'The cotton on the head of this Pokémon can be spun into a glossy, gorgeous yarn—a Galar regional specialty.', '백솜모카', '솜털이 붙은 씨는 영양 만점이다. 씨를 바람에 날려서 초목과 포켓몬들을 건강하게 만든다.', 'Grass', NULL, '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/996.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/830.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/996.png', NULL, '솜장식포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(997, '0831', 'Wooloo', 270, 42, 40, 55, 40, 45, 48, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/wooloo', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/831.png', 'If its fleece grows too long, Wooloo won’t be able to move. Cloth made with the wool of this Pokémon is surprisingly strong.', '우르', '곱슬곱슬한 털은 훌륭한 쿠션 역할을 한다. 절벽에서 떨어져도 아무렇지도 않다.', 'Normal', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/997.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/831.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/997.png', NULL, '양포켓몬', '25', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(998, '0832', 'Dubwool', 490, 72, 80, 100, 60, 90, 88, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/dubwool', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/832.png', 'Its majestic horns are meant only to impress the opposite gender. They never see use in battle.', '배우르', '탄력 있는 털로 짜낸 카펫은 트램펄린 같아서 올라가면 통통 튀어 오르게 된다.', 'Normal', NULL, '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/998.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/832.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/998.png', NULL, '양포켓몬', '10', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(999, '0833', 'Chewtle', 284, 50, 64, 50, 38, 38, 44, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/chewtle', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/833.png', 'A popular game among children is to lift up sticks that Chewtle have bitten onto to see whose Chewtle can hang on the longest.', '깨물부기', '눈앞에 있는 것은 바로 물어버리는 습성을 가졌다. 나고 있는 앞니가 근질거려서 물게 된다는 듯하다.', 'Water', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/999.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/833.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/999.png', NULL, '물고늘어지기포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(1000, '0834', 'Drednaw', 485, 90, 115, 90, 48, 68, 74, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/drednaw', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/834.png', 'Drednaw lurks along the shoreline. When prey come to drink water, Drednaw stretches its neck out and chomps down on them.', '갈가부기', '흉포한 성질을 가졌다. 철봉을 물어뜯어 버릴 정도의 턱 힘으로 먹이를 덥석 물어버린다.', 'Water', 'Rock', '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/1000.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/834.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/1000.png', NULL, '물어뜯기포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(1001, '0835', 'Yamper', 270, 59, 45, 50, 40, 50, 26, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/yamper', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/835.png', 'This gluttonous Pokémon only assists people with their work because it wants treats. As it runs, it crackles with electricity.', '멍파치', '달릴 때 꼬리가 시작되는 부분에서 전기를 만들어 낸다. 가라르에서는 양치기로 인기가 많다.', 'Electric', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/1001.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/835.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/1001.png', NULL, '강아지포켓몬', '6', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(1002, '0836', 'Boltund', 490, 69, 90, 60, 90, 60, 121, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/boltund', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/836.png', 'It sends electricity through its legs to boost their strength. Running at top speed, it easily breaks 50 mph.', '펄스멍', '만든 전기를 다리로 보내서 달리는 것을 돕는다. 삼 일 밤낮을 쉬지 않고 달릴 수 있다.', 'Electric', NULL, '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/1002.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/836.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/1002.png', NULL, '개포켓몬', '6', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(1003, '0837', 'Rolycoly', 240, 30, 40, 50, 40, 50, 30, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/rolycoly', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/837.png', 'Chunks of the surface of this Pokémon’s body that have grown old and flaked off have long been used for fuel as an alternative to coal.', '탄동', '약 400년 전에 탄광에서 발견되었다. 몸의 대부분이 석탄과 같은 성분이다.', 'Rock', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/1003.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/837.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/1003.png', NULL, '석탄포켓몬', '6', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(1004, '0838', 'Carkol', 410, 80, 60, 90, 60, 70, 50, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/carkol', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/838.png', 'Due to the coal tar created inside it, the heap of coal on Carkol’s back never falls apart, even when the Pokémon rolls around at high speeds.', '탄차곤', '체내에서 석탄을 만들어 낸다. 과거의 가라르에서는 떨어뜨린 석탄을 생활에 이용했다.', 'Rock', 'Fire', '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/1004.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/838.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/1004.png', NULL, '석탄포켓몬', '6', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(1005, '0839', 'Coalossal', 510, 110, 80, 120, 80, 90, 30, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/coalossal', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/839.png', 'It’s gentle usually but fearsome when angered. With a body that burns at over 2,700 degrees Fahrenheit, it crushes foes and turns them to ash.', '석탄산', '평소에는 온화하지만 인간이 광산을 훼손시키면 격분해서 1500도의 불꽃으로 태워버린다.', 'Rock', 'Fire', '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/1005.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/839.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/1005.png', NULL, '석탄포켓몬', '10', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(1006, '0840', 'Applin', 260, 40, 40, 80, 40, 40, 20, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/applin', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/840.png', 'Applin lives inside an apple. When an Applin is separated from its apple, its body loses moisture and the Pokémon grows weak.', '과사삭벌레', '평생을 사과 속에서 지내며 천적인 새포켓몬과 마주치면 사과인 척을 해서 몸을 지킨다.', 'Grass', 'Dragon', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/1006.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/840.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/1006.png', NULL, '사과살이포켓몬', '10', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(1007, '0841', 'Flapple', 485, 70, 110, 80, 95, 60, 70, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/flapple', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/841.png', 'It uses its own body fluid to repair its apple. Strong Flapple that have won many battles have apples that are clay colored all over.', '애프룡', '사과 껍질로 된 날개로 날며 강산성의 타액을 뱉는다. 사과의 형태로 변형한다.', 'Grass', 'Dragon', '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/1007.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/841.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/1007.png', NULL, '사과날개포켓몬', '3', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(1008, '0842', 'Appletun', 485, 110, 85, 80, 100, 80, 30, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/appletun', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/842.png', 'When some Lechonk come along to lick the sweet nectar on Appletun’s back, Appletun will spew sticky nectar at them to drive them away.', '단지래플', '달콤한 사과를 먹고 진화했다. 몸에서 달콤한 향기를 내보내서 먹이인 벌레포켓몬을 유인한다.', 'Grass', 'Dragon', '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/1008.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/842.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/1008.png', NULL, '사과즙포켓몬', '3', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(1009, '0843', 'Silicobra', 315, 52, 57, 75, 35, 50, 46, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/silicobra', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/843.png', 'Silicobra’s large nostrils are specialized for spraying sand, so this Pokémon is not very good at telling apart different smells.', '모래뱀', '굴을 파면서 먹은 모래를 목에 있는 주머니에 저장하는데 8kg이나 되는 모래가 들어간다.', 'Ground', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/1009.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/843.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/1009.png', NULL, '모래뱀포켓몬', '5', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(1010, '0844', 'Sandaconda', 510, 72, 107, 125, 65, 70, 71, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/sandaconda', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/844.png', 'The sand it spews contains sharp, pointy gravel, which is actually just sand that Sandaconda’s saliva has hardened into irregular shapes.', '사다이사', '온몸을 수축시킨 뒤 100kg의 모래를 콧구멍으로 내뿜는다. 모래가 없으면 무기력해진다.', 'Ground', NULL, '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/1010.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/844.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/1010.png', NULL, '모래뱀포켓몬', '5', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(1011, '0845', 'Cramorant', 475, 70, 85, 55, 85, 95, 85, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/cramorant', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/845.png', 'This hungry Pokémon swallows Arrokuda whole. Occasionally, it makes a mistake and tries to swallow a Pokémon other than its preferred prey.', '윽우지', '상대를 일격에 쓰러뜨릴 정도로 파워풀하지만 건망증이 심해서 싸우고 있는 상대를 잊어버린다.', 'Flying', 'Water', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/1011.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/845.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/1011.png', NULL, '그대로삼키기포켓몬', '45', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(1012, '0846', 'Arrokuda', 280, 41, 63, 40, 40, 30, 66, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/arrokuda', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/846.png', 'It takes down prey by charging into them with its hard, pointed jaw. But Arrokuda’s eyesight is poor, so this tactic has a low success rate.', '찌로꼬치', '날카롭고 뾰족한 턱을 자랑한다. 조금이라도 움직이는 것을 발견하면 일직선으로 돌격한다.', 'Water', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/1012.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/846.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/1012.png', NULL, '돌격포켓몬', '120', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(1013, '0847', 'Barraskewda', 490, 61, 123, 60, 60, 50, 136, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/barraskewda', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/847.png', 'It swims at speeds of over 100 knots and battles fiercely with pods of Finizen over prey.', '꼬치조', '창처럼 뾰족한 턱은 강철과 같은 단단함을 자랑한다. 살코기는 깜짝 놀랄 정도로 맛있다는 듯하다.', 'Water', NULL, '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/1013.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/847.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/1013.png', NULL, '꼬치포켓몬', '60', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(1014, '0848', 'Toxel', 242, 40, 38, 35, 54, 35, 40, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/toxel', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/848.png', 'This selfish, attention-seeking Pokémon stores poison and electricity in two different sacs inside its body.', '일레즌', '체내의 독주머니에 저장하고 있는 독소를 피부를 통해 분비한다. 건드리면 찌릿하고 마비된다.', 'Electric', 'Poison', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/1014.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/848.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/1014.png', NULL, '젖먹이포켓몬', '3', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(1015, '0849', 'Toxtricity (Amped Form)', 502, 75, 98, 70, 114, 70, 75, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/toxtricity', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/849.png', 'The jolts of electricity it launches by violently strumming the protrusions on its chest easily exceed 15,000 volts.', '스트린더', NULL, 'Electric', 'Poison', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/1015.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/849.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/1015.png', NULL, '수하포켓몬', '3', 0, NULL, 244, 57, 101),
	(1016, '0849', 'Toxtricity (Low Key Form)', 502, 75, 98, 70, 114, 70, 75, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/toxtricity', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/10184.png', 'The jolts of electricity it launches by violently strumming the protrusions on its chest easily exceed 15,000 volts.', '스트린더', NULL, 'Electric', 'Poison', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/1016.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/10184.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/1016.png', NULL, '수하포켓몬', '3', 0, NULL, 244, 58, 101),
	(1017, '0850', 'Sizzlipede', 305, 50, 65, 45, 50, 50, 45, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/sizzlipede', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/850.png', 'It wraps prey up with its heated body, cooking them in its coils. Once they’re well-done, it will voraciously nibble them down to the last morsel.', '태우지네', '몸속에 모아둔 가연성 가스로 열을 낸다. 특히 배 쪽의 노란 부분이 뜨겁다.', 'Fire', 'Bug', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/1017.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/850.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/1017.png', NULL, '발열포켓몬', '5', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(1018, '0851', 'Centiskorch', 525, 100, 115, 65, 90, 90, 65, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/centiskorch', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/851.png', 'While its burning body is already dangerous on its own, this excessively hostile Pokémon also has large and very sharp fangs.', '다태우지네', '발열 시의 체온은 약 800도. 몸을 채찍처럼 휘면서 덤벼든다.', 'Fire', 'Bug', '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/1018.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/851.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/1018.png', NULL, '발열포켓몬', '10', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(1019, '0852', 'Clobbopus', 310, 50, 68, 60, 50, 50, 32, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/clobbopus', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/852.png', 'Its tentacles tear off easily, but it isn’t alarmed when that happens—it knows they’ll grow back. It’s about as smart as a three-year-old.', '때때무노', '먹이를 찾아 지상으로 올라온다. 호기심이 왕성해서 눈에 들어오는 것은 일단 촉수로 때리고 본다.', 'Fighting', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/1019.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/852.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/1019.png', NULL, '떼쟁이포켓몬', '10', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(1020, '0853', 'Grapploct', 480, 80, 118, 90, 70, 80, 42, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/grapploct', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/853.png', 'Searching for an opponent to test its skills against, it emerges onto land. Once the battle is over, it returns to the sea.', '케오퍼스', '온몸이 근육덩어리다. 촉수를 사용해서 펼치는 조르기 기술의 위력은 무시무시하다.', 'Fighting', NULL, '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/1020.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/853.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/1020.png', NULL, '유술포켓몬', '10', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(1021, '0854', 'Sinistea', 308, 40, 45, 45, 74, 54, 50, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/sinistea', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/854.png', 'This Sinistea lives in an antique teacup. As valuable as this Pokémon is, its awful taste remains unchanged.', '데인차', '차게 식은 남은 홍차에 외로움을 타는 영혼이 깃들어 포켓몬이 되었다고 전해진다.', 'Ghost', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/1021.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/854.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/1021.png', NULL, '홍차포켓몬', '10', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(1022, '0855', 'Polteageist', 508, 60, 65, 65, 134, 114, 70, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/polteageist', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/855.png', 'Though risky to drink, this Pokémon’s tea tastes delicious. Gourmets who have no fear of danger drink Polteageist tea day after day.', '포트데스', '앤티크한 찻주전자에 산다. 대부분 위작이지만 매우 드물게 진품이 발견되기도 한다.', 'Ghost', NULL, '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/1022.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/855.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/1022.png', NULL, '홍차포켓몬', '10', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(1023, '0856', 'Hatenna', 265, 42, 30, 45, 56, 53, 39, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/hatenna', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/856.png', 'It senses the feelings of other living creatures. Be careful not to expose it to strong emotions for too long, or it will end up exhausted.', '몸지브림', '머리의 돌기로 생물의 기분을 감지한다. 온화한 자에게만 마음을 연다.', 'Psychic', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/1023.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/856.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/1023.png', NULL, '차분포켓몬', '10', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(1024, '0857', 'Hattrem', 370, 57, 40, 65, 86, 73, 49, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/hattrem', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/857.png', 'The moment this Pokémon finds someone who’s emitting strong emotions, it will pummel them senseless with its braids to silence them.', '손지브림', '강한 감정을 품은 자라면 누가 됐든 조용하게 만드는데 그 수단이 매우 난폭하다.', 'Psychic', NULL, '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/1024.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/857.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/1024.png', NULL, '정숙포켓몬', '255', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(1025, '0858', 'Hatterene', 510, 57, 90, 95, 136, 103, 29, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/hatterene', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/858.png', 'Beware of forests that show no signs of living creatures within. You may have wandered into Hatterene’s territory.', '브리무음', '두통이 생길 정도의 사이코 파워를 주위에 발산해서 다른 생물이 접근하지 못하게 한다.', 'Psychic', 'Fairy', '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/1025.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/858.png', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/shiny/1025.png', NULL, '정적포켓몬', '3', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(1026, '0859', 'Impidimp', 265, 45, 45, 30, 55, 40, 50, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/impidimp', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/859.png', 'They live in groups, pestering and playing pranks on each other to polish their troublemaking skills.', '메롱꿍', '사람이나 포켓몬이 싫어하는 감정을 가질 때 발생시키는 마이너스 에너지를 코로 빨아들여서 건강해진다.', 'Dark', 'Fairy', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/1026.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/859.png', NULL, NULL, '꾀부리기포켓몬', NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(1027, '0860', 'Morgrem', 370, 65, 60, 45, 75, 55, 70, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/morgrem', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/860.png', 'This Pokémon absorbs negative emotions and turns them into energy. It’s popular with people who tend to think gloomy thoughts.', '쏘겨모', '납작 엎드려서 사과하는 척하다가 창처럼 뾰족한 뒷머리로 찌르는 전법을 구사한다.', 'Dark', 'Fairy', '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/1027.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/860.png', NULL, NULL, '성악포켓몬', NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(1028, '0861', 'Grimmsnarl', 510, 95, 120, 65, 95, 75, 60, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/grimmsnarl', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/861.png', 'It lives deep within the forest. Even after evolving into this splendid form, it hasn’t given up on its petty misdeeds and pranks.', '오롱털', '머리카락을 전신에 휘감아 근력이 올랐다. 괴력몬을 압도하는 파워를 발휘한다.', 'Dark', 'Fairy', '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/1028.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/861.png', NULL, NULL, '벌크업포켓몬', NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(1029, '0862', 'Obstagoon', 520, 93, 90, 101, 60, 81, 95, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/obstagoon', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/862.png', 'It evolved after experiencing numerous fights. While crossing its arms, it lets out a shout that would make any opponent flinch.', '가로막구리', '엄청난 성량을 가졌다. 샤우팅하며 위협하는 모습은 블로킹이라 불린다.', 'Dark', 'Normal', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/1029.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/862.png', NULL, NULL, '정지포켓몬', NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(1030, '0863', 'Perrserker', 440, 70, 110, 100, 50, 60, 50, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/perrserker', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/863.png', 'After many battles, it evolved dangerous claws that come together to form daggers when extended.', '나이킹', '머리의 털이 단단해져서 철로 된 헬멧처럼 되었다. 매우 호전적인 성질을 가졌다.', 'Steel', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/1030.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/863.png', NULL, NULL, '바이킹포켓몬', NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(1031, '0864', 'Cursola', 510, 60, 95, 50, 145, 130, 30, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/cursola', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/864.png', 'Be cautious of the ectoplasmic body surrounding its soul. You’ll become stiff as stone if you touch it.', '산호르곤', '영력이 높아져서 껍질에서 해방되었다. 영체로 핵이 되는 영혼을 지킨다.', 'Ghost', NULL, '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/1031.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/864.png', NULL, NULL, '산호포켓몬', NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(1032, '0865', 'Sirfetch\'d', 507, 62, 135, 95, 68, 82, 65, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/sirfetchd', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/865.png', 'After deflecting attacks with its hard leaf shield, it strikes back with its sharp leek stalk. The leek stalk is both weapon and food.', '창파나이트', NULL, 'Fighting', NULL, '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/1032.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/865.png', NULL, NULL, '청둥오리포켓몬', NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(1033, '0866', 'Mr. Rime', 520, 80, 85, 75, 110, 100, 70, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/mr-rime', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/866.png', 'Its amusing movements make it very popular. It releases its psychic power from the pattern on its belly.', '마임꽁꽁', NULL, 'Ice', 'Psychic', '2', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/1033.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/866.png', NULL, NULL, '코미디언포켓몬', NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(1034, '0867', 'Runerigus', 483, 58, 95, 145, 50, 105, 30, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/runerigus', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/867.png', 'Never touch its shadowlike body, or you’ll be shown the horrific memories behind the picture carved into it.', '데스판', '강한 저주를 담아 그린 고대의 그림이 데스마스의 영혼을 흡수해서 움직이기 시작했다.', 'Ground', 'Ghost', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/1034.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/867.png', NULL, NULL, '원념포켓몬', NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(1035, '0868', 'Milcery', 270, 45, 40, 40, 50, 61, 34, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/milcery', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/868.png', 'They say that any patisserie visited by Milcery is guaranteed success and good fortune.', '마빌크', '크림으로 이루어진 몸을 가졌다. 공기 중을 떠도는 달콤한 향기의 성분이 모여서 태어났다.', 'Fairy', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/1035.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/868.png', NULL, NULL, '크림포켓몬', NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(1036, '0869', 'Alcremie', 495, 65, 60, 75, 110, 121, 64, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/alcremie', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/869.png', 'The cells that compose its cream fluctuated suddenly during evolution, giving the cream a bitter flavor.', '마휘핑', '믿을 수 있는 트레이너에게는 크림으로 데코레이션한 나무열매를 대접한다.', 'Fairy', NULL, '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/1036.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/869.png', NULL, NULL, '크림포켓몬', NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(1037, '0870', 'Falinks', 470, 65, 100, 100, 70, 60, 75, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/falinks', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/870.png', 'The leader, known as the brass, uses its extendible horn to issue orders to the others when it’s time to change formation.', '대여르', '리더라고 불리는 1마리와 멤버라고 불리는 5마리로 이루어져 있다. 리더의 명령은 절대적이다.', 'Fighting', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/1037.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/870.png', NULL, NULL, '진형포켓몬', NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(1038, '0871', 'Pincurchin', 435, 48, 101, 95, 91, 85, 15, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/pincurchin', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/871.png', 'This Pokémon is so timid that even brushing against seaweed will make it discharge electricity in surprise. Its lips do not conduct electricity.', '찌르성게', '가시 끝에서 전기를 발산한다. 날카로운 이빨로 바위에 붙은 해초를 갉아 먹는다.', 'Electric', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/1038.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/871.png', NULL, NULL, '성게포켓몬', NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(1039, '0872', 'Snom', 185, 30, 25, 35, 45, 30, 20, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/snom', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/872.png', 'Within its internal organs, Snom amplifies the frigid air it gets from eating snow and then uses this amplified air to create icicle-like spikes.', '누니머기', '냉기가 서린 실을 뿜는다. 실로 몸을 가지에 휘감아서 고드름인 척하고 잠든다.', 'Ice', 'Bug', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/1039.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/872.png', NULL, NULL, '애벌레포켓몬', NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(1040, '0873', 'Frosmoth', 475, 70, 65, 60, 125, 90, 65, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/frosmoth', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/873.png', 'It causes blizzards as it flies around with its huge, chill-emanating wings. Clean meltwater is its favorite thing to drink.', '모스노우', '날개의 온도는 영하 180도. 냉기가 담긴 인분을 눈처럼 흩뿌리며 산과 들을 날아다닌다.', 'Ice', 'Bug', '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/1040.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/873.png', NULL, NULL, '얼음나방포켓몬', NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(1041, '0874', 'Stonjourner', 470, 100, 125, 135, 20, 20, 70, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/stonjourner', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/874.png', 'This Pokémon spends its life gazing at the setting sun. It strides leisurely across grassy plains on legs of rock that weigh over 400 pounds each.', '돌헨진', '넓은 초원 한복판에 우뚝 서서 해가 기우는 것을 바라보며 지낸다. 다이내믹한 발차기 기술이 특기다.', 'Rock', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/1041.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/874.png', NULL, NULL, '거석포켓몬', NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(1042, '0875', 'Eiscue (Ice Face)', 470, 75, 80, 110, 65, 90, 50, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/eiscue', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/875.png', 'If you lick the ice covering its face, you’ll find it has a faintly salty taste. This species rode here on ocean currents from a cold, faraway land.', '빙큐보 아이스', NULL, 'Ice', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/1042.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/875.png', NULL, NULL, '펭귄포켓몬', NULL, 0, NULL, 248, NULL, NULL),
	(1043, '0875', 'Eiscue (Noice Face)', 470, 75, 80, 70, 65, 50, 130, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/eiscue', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/10185.png', 'If you lick the ice covering its face, you’ll find it has a faintly salty taste. This species rode here on ocean currents from a cold, faraway land.', '빙큐보 아이스 나이스', NULL, 'Ice', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/1043.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/10185.png', NULL, NULL, '펭귄포켓몬', NULL, 0, NULL, 248, NULL, NULL),
	(1044, '0876', 'Indeedee (Male)', 475, 60, 65, 55, 105, 95, 95, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/indeedee', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/876.png', 'This Pokémon never leaves its Trainer’s side. It predicts their actions with its psychic power and takes care of their day-to-day needs.', '에써르', '머리에 달린 뿔로 상대의 기분을 감지한다. 수컷은 집사처럼 주인의 곁에서 시중을 든다.', 'Psychic', 'Normal', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/1044.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/876.png', NULL, NULL, '감정포켓몬', NULL, 0, NULL, 39, 28, 227),
	(1045, '0876', 'Indeedee (Female)', 475, 70, 55, 65, 95, 105, 85, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/indeedee', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/10186.png', 'This Pokémon never leaves its Trainer’s side. It predicts their actions with its psychic power and takes care of their day-to-day needs.', '에써르', '머리에 달린 뿔로 상대의 기분을 감지한다. 수컷은 집사처럼 주인의 곁에서 시중을 든다.', 'Psychic', 'Normal', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/1045.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/10186.png', NULL, NULL, '감정포켓몬', NULL, 0, NULL, 20, 28, 227),
	(1046, '0877', 'Morpeko (Full Belly Mode)', 436, 58, 95, 58, 70, 58, 97, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/morpeko', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/877.png', 'It carries electrically roasted seeds with it as if they’re precious treasures. No matter how much it eats, it always gets hungry again in short order.', '모르페코 가득찬', NULL, 'Electric', 'Dark', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/1046.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/877.png', NULL, NULL, '양면포켓몬', NULL, 0, NULL, 258, NULL, NULL),
	(1047, '0877', 'Morpeko (Hangry Mode)', 436, 58, 95, 58, 70, 58, 97, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/morpeko', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/10187.png', 'It carries electrically roasted seeds with it as if they’re precious treasures. No matter how much it eats, it always gets hungry again in short order.', '모르페코 배고픈', NULL, 'Electric', 'Dark', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/1047.ogg', NULL, NULL, NULL, '양면포켓몬', NULL, 0, NULL, 258, NULL, NULL),
	(1048, '0878', 'Cufant', 330, 72, 80, 49, 40, 49, 40, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/cufant', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/878.png', 'Cufant can lift loads weighing five tons. In the mornings, it heads into caves with its herd, in search of the ore on which these Pokémon feed.', '끼리동', '5톤의 짐을 실어도 문제없는 힘이 장사인 포켓몬. 코를 이용해서 땅을 판다.', 'Steel', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/1048.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/878.png', NULL, NULL, '동상포켓몬', NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(1049, '0879', 'Copperajah', 500, 122, 130, 69, 80, 69, 30, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/copperajah', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/879.png', 'Copperajah are prideful, cantankerous Pokémon. Specimens with vibrant green skin command the respect of others of their kind.', '대왕끼리동', '녹색 피부는 물에도 강하다. 오래전에 다른 지방에서 오게 되어 사람과 함께 일했다.', 'Steel', NULL, '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/1049.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/879.png', NULL, NULL, '동상포켓몬', NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(1050, '0880', 'Dracozolt', 505, 90, 100, 90, 80, 70, 75, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/dracozolt', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/880.png', 'The powerful muscles in its tail generate its electricity. Compared to its lower body, its upper half is entirely too small.', '파치래곤', '고대에는 튼튼한 하반신 덕분에 무적이었으나 먹이인 식물을 모두 먹어버려서 멸종했다.', 'Electric', 'Dragon', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/1050.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/880.png', NULL, NULL, '화석포켓몬', NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(1051, '0881', 'Arctozolt', 505, 90, 100, 90, 90, 80, 55, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/arctozolt', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/881.png', 'This Pokémon lived on prehistoric seashores and was able to preserve food with the ice on its body. It went extinct because it moved so slowly.', '파치르돈', '꽁꽁 언 상반신이 진동하면 전기가 만들어진다. 걷는 것이 매우 서툴다.', 'Electric', 'Ice', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/1051.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/881.png', NULL, NULL, '화석포켓몬', NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(1052, '0882', 'Dracovish', 505, 90, 90, 100, 70, 80, 75, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/dracovish', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/882.png', 'Its mighty legs are capable of running at speeds exceeding 40 mph, but this Pokémon can’t breathe unless it’s underwater.', '어래곤', '뛰어난 다리와 턱의 힘 덕분에 고대에는 무적이었으나 먹이를 모두 잡아먹어버려서 멸종했다.', 'Water', 'Dragon', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/1052.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/882.png', NULL, NULL, '화석포켓몬', NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(1053, '0883', 'Arctovish', 505, 90, 90, 100, 80, 90, 55, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/arctovish', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/883.png', 'The skin on its face is impervious to attack, but breathing difficulties made this Pokémon go extinct anyway.', '어치르돈', '주변을 꽁꽁 얼려서 먹이를 잡지만 입이 머리 윗부분에 있어서 먹기 힘들다.', 'Water', 'Ice', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/1053.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/883.png', NULL, NULL, '화석포켓몬', NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(1054, '0884', 'Duraludon', 535, 70, 95, 115, 120, 50, 85, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/duraludon', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/884.png', 'The special metal that composes its body is very light, so this Pokémon has considerable agility. It lives in caves because it dislikes the rain.', '두랄루돈', '윤이 나는 금속과도 같은 몸은 가벼우면서도 튼튼하지만 녹슬기 쉽다는 것이 흠이다.', 'Steel', 'Dragon', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/1054.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/884.png', NULL, NULL, '합금포켓몬', NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(1055, '0885', 'Dreepy', 270, 28, 60, 30, 40, 30, 82, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/dreepy', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/885.png', 'It has a habit of biting at Clauncher even though it doesn’t feed on them. This is said to be vestigial behavior from when Dreepy was alive.', '드라꼰', '고대의 바다에 살았다. 고스트포켓몬으로 되살아나 과거의 보금자리를 떠돌고 있다.', 'Dragon', 'Ghost', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/1055.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/885.png', NULL, NULL, '원망포켓몬', NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(1056, '0886', 'Drakloak', 410, 68, 80, 50, 60, 50, 102, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/drakloak', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/886.png', 'This Pokémon stores up energy in its lungs, then shoots it out. It takes care of Dreepy and battles alongside them until they’re all grown up.', '드래런치', '비행 속도는 시속 200km. 드라꼰과 함께 싸우며 무사히 진화할 때까지 돌본다.', 'Dragon', 'Ghost', '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/1056.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/886.png', NULL, NULL, '돌보미포켓몬', NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(1057, '0887', 'Dragapult', 600, 88, 120, 75, 100, 75, 142, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/dragapult', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/887.png', 'The fastest Dragapult of the group is always surrounded by Dreepy that want to fly at sonic speed.', '드래펄트', '뿔에 있는 구멍에 드라꼰을 넣고 지낸다. 싸움이 시작되면 마하의 스피드로 드라꼰을 날린다.', 'Dragon', 'Ghost', '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/1057.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/887.png', NULL, NULL, '스텔스포켓몬', NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(1058, '0888', 'Zacian (Hero of Many Battles)', 660, 92, 120, 115, 80, 115, 138, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/zacian', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/888.png', 'This Pokémon has slumbered for many years. Some say it’s Zamazenta’s elder sister—others say the two Pokémon are rivals.', '자시안 마이티', '전설의 영웅이라고 불리는 포켓몬. 금속을 흡수한 뒤 무기로 변화시켜서 싸운다.', 'Fairy', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/1058.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/888.png', NULL, NULL, '강자포켓몬', NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(1059, '0888', 'Zacian (Crowned Sword)', 700, 92, 150, 115, 80, 115, 148, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/zacian', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/888.png', 'This Pokémon has slumbered for many years. Some say it’s Zamazenta’s elder sister—others say the two Pokémon are rivals.', '자시안', '전설의 영웅이라고 불리는 포켓몬. 금속을 흡수한 뒤 무기로 변화시켜서 싸운다.', 'Fairy', 'Steel', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/1059.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/888.png', NULL, NULL, '강자포켓몬', NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(1060, '0889', 'Zamazenta (Hero of Many Battles)', 660, 92, 120, 115, 80, 115, 138, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/zamazenta', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/889.png', 'This Pokémon slept for aeons while in the form of a statue. It was asleep for so long, people forgot that it ever existed.', '자마젠타 달마모드 마이티', '인간의 왕과 힘을 합쳐 가라르를 구한 포켓몬. 금속을 흡수해서 싸운다.', 'Fighting', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/1060.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/889.png', NULL, NULL, '강자포켓몬', NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
