	(1062, '0890', 'Eternatus', 690, 140, 85, 95, 145, 95, 130, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/eternatus', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/890.png', 'It was inside a meteorite that fell 20,000 years ago. There seems to be a connection between this Pokémon and the Dynamax phenomenon.', '무한다이노', '가슴의 코어가 가라르지방의 대지에서 솟아나는 에너지를 흡수해서 활동한다.', 'Poison', 'Dragon', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/1062.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/890.png', NULL, NULL, '거대포켓몬', NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
