	(1067, '0893', 'Zarude', 600, 105, 120, 105, 70, 95, 105, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/zarude', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/893.png', 'Once the vines on Zarude’s body tear off, they become nutrients in the soil. This helps the plants of the forest grow.', '자루도', '무리 지어 밀림에 산다. 매우 공격적이라 숲에 사는 포켓몬들에게는 두려움의 대상이다.', 'Dark', 'Grass', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/1067.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/893.png', NULL, NULL, '나쁜원숭이포켓몬', NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(1068, '0894', 'Regieleki', 580, 80, 100, 50, 100, 50, 200, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/regieleki', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/894.png', 'Its entire body is made up of a single organ that generates electrical energy. Regieleki is capable of creating all Galar’s electricity.', '레지에레키', '전기 에너지 덩어리다. 몸에 있는 링을 해제하면 숨겨진 힘이 해방된다고 한다.', 'Electric', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/1068.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/894.png', NULL, NULL, '일렉트론포켓몬', NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(1069, '0895', 'Regidrago', 580, 200, 100, 50, 100, 50, 80, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/regidrago', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/895.png', 'Its body is composed of crystallized dragon energy. Regidrago is said to have the powers of every dragon Pokémon.', '레지드래고', '팔의 형태가 고대 드래곤포켓몬의 머리라는 학설도 있지만 증명된 바는 없다.', 'Dragon', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/1069.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/895.png', NULL, NULL, '용옥포켓몬', NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(1070, '0896', 'Glastrier', 580, 100, 145, 130, 65, 110, 30, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/glastrier', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/896.png', 'Glastrier has tremendous physical strength, and the mask of ice covering its face is 100 times harder than diamond.', '블리자포스', '발굽에서 강력한 냉기를 발산한다. 원하는 것은 무엇이든 힘으로 빼앗는 폭군.', 'Ice', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/1070.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/896.png', NULL, NULL, '사나운말포켓몬', NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
