	(1072, '0898', 'Calyrex', 500, 100, 80, 80, 80, 80, 80, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/calyrex', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/898.png', 'Calyrex is known in legend as a king that ruled over Galar in ancient times. It has the power to cause hearts to mend and plants to spring forth.', '버드렉스', '치유와 은총의 힘을 가진 자애로운 포켓몬. 먼 옛날 가라르에 군림했었다.', 'Psychic', 'Grass', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/1072.ogg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/898.png', NULL, NULL, '킹포켓몬', NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
