	(1124, '0940', 'Wattrel', 280, 40, 40, 35, 55, 40, 70, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/wattrel', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/940.png', 'These Pokémon make their nests on coastal cliffs. The nests have a strange, crackling texture, and they’re a popular delicacy.', '찌리비', NULL, 'Electric', 'Flying', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/1124.ogg', NULL, NULL, NULL, '바다제비포켓몬', NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(1125, '0941', 'Kilowattrel', 490, 70, 70, 60, 105, 60, 125, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/kilowattrel', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/941.png', 'It uses its throat sac to store electricity generated by its wings. There’s hardly any oil in its feathers, so it is a poor swimmer.', '찌리비크', NULL, 'Electric', 'Flying', '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/1125.ogg', NULL, NULL, NULL, '군함조포켓몬', NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(1126, '0942', 'Maschiff', 340, 60, 78, 60, 40, 51, 51, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/maschiff', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/942.png', 'Its well-developed jaw and fangs are strong enough to crunch through boulders, and its thick fat makes for an excellent defense.', '오라티프', NULL, 'Dark', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/1126.ogg', NULL, NULL, NULL, '애송이포켓몬', NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(1127, '0943', 'Mabosstiff', 505, 80, 120, 90, 60, 70, 85, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/mabosstiff', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/943.png', 'Mabosstiff loves playing with children. Though usually gentle, it takes on an intimidating look when protecting its family.', '마피티프', NULL, 'Dark', NULL, '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/1127.ogg', NULL, NULL, NULL, '두목포켓몬', NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(1128, '0944', 'Shroodle', 290, 40, 65, 35, 40, 35, 75, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/shroodle', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/944.png', 'To keep enemies away from its territory, it paints markings around its nest using a poisonous liquid that has an acrid odor.', '땃쭈르', NULL, 'Poison', 'Normal', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/1128.ogg', NULL, NULL, NULL, '독쥐포켓몬', NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(1129, '0945', 'Grafaiai', 485, 63, 95, 65, 80, 72, 110, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/grafaiai', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/945.png', 'Each Grafaiai paints its own individual pattern, and it will paint that same pattern over and over again throughout its life.', '태깅구르', NULL, 'Poison', 'Normal', '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/1129.ogg', NULL, NULL, NULL, '독원숭이포켓몬', NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(1130, '0946', 'Bramblin', 275, 40, 65, 30, 45, 35, 60, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/bramblin', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/946.png', 'Not even Bramblin knows where it is headed as it tumbles across the wilderness, blown by the wind. It loathes getting wet.', '그푸리', NULL, 'Grass', 'Ghost', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/1130.ogg', NULL, NULL, NULL, '회전초포켓몬', NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(1131, '0947', 'Brambleghast', 480, 55, 115, 70, 80, 70, 90, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/brambleghast', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/947.png', 'Brambleghast wanders around arid regions. On rare occasions, mass outbreaks of these Pokémon will bury an entire town.', '공푸리', NULL, 'Grass', 'Ghost', '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/1131.ogg', NULL, NULL, NULL, '회전초포켓몬', NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(1132, '0948', 'Toedscool', 335, 40, 40, 35, 50, 100, 70, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/toedscool', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/948.png', 'Though it looks like Tentacool, Toedscool is a completely different species. Its legs may be thin, but it can run at a speed of 30 mph.', '들눈해', NULL, 'Ground', 'Grass', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/1132.ogg', NULL, NULL, NULL, '목이버섯포켓몬', NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(1133, '0949', 'Toedscruel', 515, 80, 70, 65, 80, 120, 100, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/toedscruel', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/949.png', 'It coils its 10 tentacles around prey and sucks out their nutrients, causing the prey pain. The folds along the rim of its head are a popular delicacy.', '육파리', NULL, 'Ground', 'Grass', '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/1133.ogg', NULL, NULL, NULL, '목이버섯포켓몬', NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(1134, '0950', 'Klawf', 450, 70, 100, 115, 35, 55, 75, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/klawf', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/950.png', 'This Pokémon lives on sheer cliffs. It sidesteps opponents’ attacks, then lunges for their weak spots with its claws.', '절벼게', NULL, 'Rock', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/1134.ogg', NULL, NULL, NULL, '매복포켓몬', NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(1135, '0951', 'Capsakid', 304, 50, 62, 40, 62, 40, 50, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/capsakid', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/951.png', 'Traditional Paldean dishes can be extremely spicy because they include the shed front teeth of Capsakid among their ingredients.', '캡싸이', NULL, 'Grass', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/1135.ogg', NULL, NULL, NULL, '하바네로포켓몬', NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(1136, '0952', 'Scovillain', 486, 65, 108, 65, 108, 65, 75, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/scovillain', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/952.png', 'The green head has turned vicious due to the spicy chemicals stimulating its brain. Once it goes on a rampage, there is no stopping it.', '스코빌런', NULL, 'Grass', 'Fire', '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/1136.ogg', NULL, NULL, NULL, '하바네로포켓몬', NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(1137, '0953', 'Rellor', 270, 41, 50, 60, 31, 58, 30, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/rellor', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/953.png', 'It rolls its mud ball around while the energy it needs for evolution matures. Eventually the time comes for it to evolve.', '구르데', NULL, 'Bug', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/1137.ogg', NULL, NULL, NULL, '굴리기포켓몬', NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(1138, '0954', 'Rabsca', 470, 75, 50, 85, 115, 100, 45, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/rabsca', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/954.png', 'An infant sleeps inside the ball. Rabsca rolls the ball soothingly with its legs to ensure the infant sleeps comfortably.', '베라카스', NULL, 'Bug', 'Psychic', '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/1138.ogg', NULL, NULL, NULL, '굴리기포켓몬', NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL);
INSERT IGNORE INTO `pokemon_full_info` (`id`, `dex_num`, `name_en`, `total`, `hp`, `attack`, `defense`, `sp_attack`, `sp_defense`, `speed`, `detail_url`, `image_url`, `flavor_text`, `name_ko`, `flavor_text_ko`, `type1`, `type2`, `evolution_stage`, `cry_url`, `back_default_url`, `shiny_front_url`, `shiny_back_url`, `genus`, `capture_rate`, `is_custom`, `creator_id`, `ability1_id`, `ability2_id`, `hidden_ability_id`) VALUES
	(1139, '0955', 'Flittle', 255, 30, 35, 30, 55, 30, 75, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/flittle', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/955.png', 'It spends its time running around wastelands. If anyone steals its beloved berries, it will chase them down and exact its revenge.', '하느라기', NULL, 'Psychic', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/1139.ogg', NULL, NULL, NULL, '프릴포켓몬', NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(1140, '0956', 'Espathra', 481, 95, 60, 60, 101, 60, 105, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/espathra', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/956.png', 'It emits psychic power from the gaps between its multicolored frills and sprints at speeds greater than 120 mph.', '클레스퍼트라', NULL, 'Psychic', NULL, '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/1140.ogg', NULL, NULL, NULL, '타조포켓몬', NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(1141, '0957', 'Tinkatink', 297, 50, 45, 45, 35, 64, 58, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/tinkatink', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/957.png', 'This Pokémon pounds iron scraps together to make a hammer. It will remake the hammer again and again until it’s satisfied with the result.', '어리짱', NULL, 'Fairy', 'Steel', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/1141.ogg', NULL, NULL, NULL, '대장장이포켓몬', NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(1142, '0958', 'Tinkatuff', 380, 65, 55, 55, 45, 82, 78, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/tinkatuff', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/958.png', 'These Pokémon make their homes in piles of scrap metal. They test the strength of each other’s hammers by smashing them together.', '벼리짱', NULL, 'Fairy', 'Steel', '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/1142.ogg', NULL, NULL, NULL, '해머포켓몬', NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(1143, '0959', 'Tinkaton', 506, 85, 75, 77, 70, 105, 94, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/tinkaton', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/959.png', 'The hammer tops 220 pounds, yet it gets swung around easily by Tinkaton as it steals whatever it pleases and carries its plunder back home.', '두드리짱', NULL, 'Fairy', 'Steel', '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/1143.ogg', NULL, NULL, NULL, '해머포켓몬', NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(1144, '0960', 'Wiglett', 245, 10, 55, 25, 35, 25, 95, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/wiglett', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/960.png', 'Though it looks like Diglett, Wiglett is an entirely different species. The resemblance seems to be a coincidental result of environmental adaptation.', '바다그다', NULL, 'Water', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/1144.ogg', NULL, NULL, NULL, '정원장어포켓몬', NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(1145, '0961', 'Wugtrio', 425, 35, 100, 50, 50, 70, 120, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/wugtrio', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/961.png', 'A variety of fish Pokémon, Wugtrio was once considered to be a regional form of Dugtrio.', '바닥트리오', NULL, 'Water', NULL, '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/1145.ogg', NULL, NULL, NULL, '정원장어포켓몬', NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(1146, '0962', 'Bombirdier', 485, 70, 103, 85, 60, 85, 82, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/bombirdier', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/962.png', 'Bombirdier uses the apron on its chest to bundle up food, which it carries back to its nest. It enjoys dropping things that make loud noises.', '떨구새', NULL, 'Flying', 'Dark', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/1146.ogg', NULL, NULL, NULL, '낙하물포켓몬', NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(1147, '0963', 'Finizen', 315, 70, 45, 40, 45, 40, 75, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/finizen', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/963.png', 'Its water ring is made from seawater mixed with a sticky fluid that Finizen secretes from its blowhole.', '맨돌핀 달마모드', NULL, 'Water', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/1147.ogg', NULL, NULL, NULL, '돌고래포켓몬', NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(1148, '0964', 'Palafin (Zero Form)', 457, 100, 70, 72, 53, 62, 100, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/palafin', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/964.png', 'Its physical capabilities are no different than a Finizen’s, but when its allies are in danger, it transforms and powers itself up.', '돌핀맨 나이브', NULL, 'Water', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/1148.ogg', NULL, NULL, NULL, '돌고래포켓몬', NULL, 0, NULL, 278, NULL, 278),
	(1149, '0964', 'Palafin (Hero Form)', 650, 100, 160, 97, 106, 87, 100, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/palafin', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/10256.png', 'Its physical capabilities are no different than a Finizen’s, but when its allies are in danger, it transforms and powers itself up.', '돌핀맨 마이티', NULL, 'Water', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/1149.ogg', NULL, NULL, NULL, '돌고래포켓몬', NULL, 0, NULL, 278, NULL, 278),
	(1150, '0965', 'Varoom', 300, 45, 70, 63, 30, 45, 47, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/varoom', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/965.png', 'The steel section is Varoom’s actual body. This Pokémon clings to rocks and converts the minerals within into energy to fuel its activities.', '부르롱', NULL, 'Steel', 'Poison', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/1150.ogg', NULL, NULL, NULL, '단기통포켓몬', NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(1151, '0966', 'Revavroom', 500, 80, 119, 90, 54, 67, 90, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/revavroom', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/966.png', 'Revavroom viciously threatens others with the sound of its exhaust. It sticks its tongue out from its cylindrical mouth and sprays toxic fluids.', '부르르룸', NULL, 'Steel', 'Poison', '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/1151.ogg', NULL, NULL, NULL, '다기통포켓몬', NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(1152, '0967', 'Cyclizar', 501, 70, 95, 65, 85, 65, 121, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/cyclizar', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/967.png', 'It can sprint at over 70 mph while carrying a human. The rider’s body heat warms Cyclizar’s back and lifts the Pokémon’s spirit.', '모토마', NULL, 'Dragon', 'Normal', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/1152.ogg', NULL, NULL, NULL, '라이드포켓몬', NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(1153, '0968', 'Orthworm', 480, 70, 85, 145, 60, 55, 65, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/orthworm', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/968.png', 'This Pokémon lives in arid deserts. It maintains its metal body by consuming iron from the soil.', '꿈트렁', NULL, 'Steel', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/1153.ogg', NULL, NULL, NULL, '지렁이포켓몬', NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(1154, '0969', 'Glimmet', 350, 48, 35, 42, 105, 60, 60, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/glimmet', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/969.png', 'Glimmet’s toxic mineral crystals look just like flower petals. This Pokémon scatters poisonous powder like pollen to protect itself.', '초롱순', NULL, 'Rock', 'Poison', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/1154.ogg', NULL, NULL, NULL, '광석포켓몬', NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(1155, '0970', 'Glimmora', 525, 83, 55, 90, 130, 81, 86, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/glimmora', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/970.png', 'Glimmora’s petals are made of crystallized poison energy. It has recently become evident that these petals resemble Tera Jewels.', '킬라플로르', NULL, 'Rock', 'Poison', '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/1155.ogg', NULL, NULL, NULL, '광석포켓몬', NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(1156, '0971', 'Greavard', 290, 50, 61, 60, 30, 55, 34, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/greavard', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/971.png', 'This friendly Pokémon doesn’t like being alone. Pay it even the slightest bit of attention, and it will follow you forever.', '망망이', NULL, 'Ghost', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/1156.ogg', NULL, NULL, NULL, '유령개포켓몬', NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(1157, '0972', 'Houndstone', 488, 72, 101, 100, 50, 97, 68, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/houndstone', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/972.png', 'A lovingly mourned Pokémon was reborn as Houndstone. It doesn’t like anyone touching the protuberance atop its head.', '묘두기', NULL, 'Ghost', NULL, '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/1157.ogg', NULL, NULL, NULL, '유령개포켓몬', NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(1158, '0973', 'Flamigo', 500, 82, 115, 74, 75, 64, 90, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/flamigo', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/973.png', 'Thanks to a behavior of theirs known as “synchronizing,” an entire flock of these Pokémon can attack simultaneously in perfect harmony.', '꼬이밍고', NULL, 'Flying', 'Fighting', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/1158.ogg', NULL, NULL, NULL, '싱크로포켓몬', NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(1159, '0974', 'Cetoddle', 334, 108, 68, 45, 30, 40, 43, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/cetoddle', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/974.png', 'It lives in frigid regions in pods of five or so individuals. It loves the minerals found in snow and ice.', '터벅고래', NULL, 'Ice', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/1159.ogg', NULL, NULL, NULL, '육지고래포켓몬', NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(1160, '0975', 'Cetitan', 521, 170, 113, 65, 45, 55, 73, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/cetitan', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/975.png', 'Ice energy builds up in the horn on its upper jaw, causing the horn to reach cryogenic temperatures that freeze its surroundings.', '우락고래', NULL, 'Ice', NULL, '1', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/1160.ogg', NULL, NULL, NULL, '육지고래포켓몬', NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(1161, '0976', 'Veluza', 478, 90, 102, 73, 78, 65, 70, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/veluza', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/976.png', 'Veluza has excellent regenerative capabilities. It sheds spare flesh from its body to boost its agility, then charges at its prey.', '가비루사', NULL, 'Water', 'Psychic', '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/1161.ogg', NULL, NULL, NULL, '분리포켓몬', NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(1162, '0977', 'Dondozo', 530, 150, 100, 115, 65, 65, 35, 'https://pokemondb.net/pokedex/dondozo', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/977.png', 'It treats Tatsugiri like its boss and follows it loyally. Though powerful, Dondozo is apparently not very smart.', '어써러셔', NULL, 'Water', NULL, '0', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/1162.ogg', NULL, NULL, NULL, '큰메기포켓몬', NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
